#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-compliance-as-code.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Compliance as Code"
msgstr "ການປະຕິບັດຕາມຂໍ້ກຳນົດໃນຮູບແບບ Code (Compliance as Code)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-compliance-as-code.adoc:2
msgid ""
"This document provides insight on running compliance as code remediation "
"using an Ansible Playbook."
msgstr "ເອກະສານນີ້ໃຫ້ຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບການລັນການແກ້ໄຂການປະຕິບັດຕາມຂໍ້ກຳນົດ (compliance remediation) ໂດຍໃຊ້ Ansible Playbook."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-compliance-as-code.adoc:3
msgid ""
"For more infomation about running compliance as code remediation using a "
"bash script, see xref:administration:openscap.adoc#remediation[Remediation]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການລັນການແກ້ໄຂການປະຕິບັດຕາມຂໍ້ກຳນົດໂດຍໃຊ້ bash script, ເບິ່ງ xref:administration:openscap.adoc#remediation[Remediation]."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-compliance-as-code.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Remediation Using an Ansible Playbook"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂໂດຍໃຊ້ Ansible Playbook"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-compliance-as-code.adoc:5
msgid ""
"An Ansible control node is required.  For more information, see "
"xref:administration:ansible-setup-control-node.adoc[]."
msgstr "ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີ Ansible control node. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງ xref:administration:ansible-setup-control-node.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-compliance-as-code.adoc:6
msgid ""
"The following procedure will guide you through running remediation using an "
"Ansible playbook."
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ຈະແນະນຳທ່ານໃນການລັນການແກ້ໄຂໂດຍໃຊ້ Ansible playbook."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-compliance-as-code.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Run Remediation Using an Ansible Playbook"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ລັນການແກ້ໄຂໂດຍໃຊ້ Ansible Playbook"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-compliance-as-code.adoc:8
msgid "From the control node system menu select menu:Ansible[Control Node]."
msgstr "ຈາກເມນູລະບົບຂອງ control node ໃຫ້ເລືອກ menu:Ansible[Control Node]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-compliance-as-code.adoc:9
msgid ""
"In [guimenu]``Add a Playbook directory`` field, enter the path to the "
"OpenSCAP playbooks, for example:"
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Add a Playbook directory``, ໃຫ້ໃສ່ເສັ້ນທາງ (path) ໄປຫາ OpenSCAP playbooks, ຕົວຢ່າງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-compliance-as-code.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "/usr/share/scap-security-guide/ansible\n"
msgstr "/usr/share/scap-security-guide/ansible\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-compliance-as-code.adoc:11
msgid "Confirm with btn:[Save]."
msgstr "ຢືນຢັນດ້ວຍ btn:[Save]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-compliance-as-code.adoc:12
msgid ""
"Navigate Go menu:Ansible[Playbooks], expand the folder you just declared, "
"and click a playbook, for example:"
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ menu:Ansible[Playbooks], ຂະຫຍາຍໂຟນເດີທີ່ທ່ານຫາກໍລະບຸໄວ້, ແລ້ວຄລິກເລືອກ playbook, ຕົວຢ່າງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-compliance-as-code.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "sle15-playbook-stig.yml\n"
msgstr "sle15-playbook-stig.yml\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-compliance-as-code.adoc:14
msgid ""
"To run the playbook, select the [guimenu]``Inventory Path`` for the clients, "
"for example:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອລັນ playbook, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ [guimenu]``Inventory Path`` ສຳລັບໄຄລແອນ, ຕົວຢ່າງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-compliance-as-code.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "/etc/ansible/sles15\n"
msgstr "/etc/ansible/sles15\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-compliance-as-code.adoc:16
#: modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:96
#: modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:103
msgid "Click btn:[Schedule]."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Schedule]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-compliance-as-code.adoc:17
msgid "Check the status of the scheduled event under the [guimenu]``Events`` tab."
msgstr "ກວດເບິ່ງສະຖານະຂອງເຫດການທີ່ກຳນົດເວລາໄວ້ພາຍໃຕ້ແທັບ [guimenu]``Events``."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Ansible Integration"
msgstr "ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບ Ansible"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Ansible is a tool to manage computer client systems.  For more information, "
"see https://www.ansible.com."
msgstr "Ansible ແມ່ນເຄື່ອງມືສຳລັບຈັດການລະບົບໄຄລແອນຄອມພິວເຕີ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງ https://www.ansible.com."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:3
msgid ""
"{productname} supports managing Ansible control nodes.  For more "
"information, see "
"xref:administration:ansible-setup-control-node.adoc#at.ansible.overview[]."
msgstr "{productname} ຮອງຮັບການຈັດການ Ansible control nodes. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງ xref:administration:ansible-setup-control-node.adoc#at.ansible.overview[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Currently, the supported version of Ansible is 2.9 (LTS) shipped in SUSE "
"Linux Enterprise 15 Client Tools channels.  The supported OS version for the "
"Ansible Control Node is {sles} 15 SP3, or later.  Ansible software is also "
"available for {productname} Proxy and {productname} {smr} Branch Server.  "
"For Control Nodes running operating systems other than {sle}, use Ansible "
"shipped together with your distribution."
msgstr "ໃນປັດຈຸບັນ, ເວີຊັນຂອງ Ansible ທີ່ຮອງຮັບແມ່ນ 2.9 (LTS) ທີ່ມາພ້ອມກັບຊ່ອງທາງ SUSE Linux Enterprise 15 Client Tools. ເວີຊັນຂອງລະບົບປະຕິບັດການທີ່ຮອງຮັບສຳລັບ Ansible Control Node ແມ່ນ {sles} 15 SP3 ຫຼື ໃໝ່ກວ່າ. ຊອບແວ Ansible ຍັງມີໃຫ້ສຳລັບ {productname} Proxy ແລະ {productname} {smr} Branch Server. ສຳລັບ Control Node ທີ່ລັນລະບົບປະຕິບັດການອື່ນໆ ທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນ {sle}, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ Ansible ທີ່ມາພ້ອມກັບລະບົບປະຕິບັດການນັ້ນ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Feature Overview"
msgstr "ພາບລວມຂອງຟີເຈີ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:6
msgid ""
"{productname} enables system administrators to operate their Ansible Control "
"Nodes.  Supported features are:"
msgstr "{productname} ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບສາມາດໃຊ້ງານ Ansible Control Nodes ຂອງພວກເຂົາໄດ້. ຟີເຈີທີ່ຮອງຮັບຄື:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:7
msgid "inspection of inventory files"
msgstr "ການກວດສອບໄຟລ໌ inventory"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:8
msgid "discovery of playbooks"
msgstr "ການຄົ້ນຫາ playbooks"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:9
msgid "execution of playbooks"
msgstr "ການລັນ playbooks"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:10
msgid "For more information:"
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:11
msgid ""
"The inventory is a sorted list of managed Ansible nodes.  For more "
"information about organizing an inventory, see "
"https://docs.ansible.com/ansible/latest/inventory_guide/intro_inventory.html."
msgstr "Inventory ແມ່ນລາຍການທີ່ຈັດລຳດັບຂອງ Ansible nodes ທີ່ຖືກຈັດການ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການຈັດການ inventory, ເບິ່ງ https://docs.ansible.com/ansible/latest/inventory_guide/intro_inventory.html."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:12
msgid ""
"Playbooks are a way to describe how the inventory is to be managed.  For "
"more information about playbooks, see "
"https://docs.ansible.com/ansible/latest/playbook_guide/playbooks_intro.html."
msgstr "Playbooks ແມ່ນວິທີການອະທິບາຍວ່າຈະຈັດການ inventory ແນວໃດ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ playbooks, ເບິ່ງ https://docs.ansible.com/ansible/latest/playbook_guide/playbooks_intro.html."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "Requirements and Basic Configuration"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ກຳນົດ ແລະ ການຕັ້ງຄ່າເບື້ອງຕົ້ນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:14
msgid ""
"To use Ansible features, you need to register the already existing Ansible "
"Control Node to the {productname} Server.  In the {webui}, on the "
"menu:System Details[Properties] page of the registered system, you must "
"enable the ``Ansible Control Node`` system type of the [guimenu]``Add-on "
"System Types`` list."
msgstr "ເພື່ອໃຊ້ຟີເຈີ Ansible, ທ່ານຕ້ອງລົງທະບຽນ Ansible Control Node ທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວເຂົ້າກັບ {productname} Server. ໃນ {webui}, ຢູ່ໜ້າ menu:System Details[Properties] ຂອງລະບົບທີ່ລົງທະບຽນແລ້ວ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງເປີດໃຊ້ງານປະເພດລະບົບ ``Ansible Control Node`` ໃນລາຍການ [guimenu]``Add-on System Types``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:15
msgid ""
"Enabling the ``Ansible Control Node`` system type ensures that the "
"[package]``ansible`` package is installed on the system by adding it in the "
"highstate and activates the Ansible features under the menu:System "
"Details[Ansible] tab."
msgstr "ການເປີດໃຊ້ງານປະເພດລະບົບ ``Ansible Control Node`` ຈະຮັບປະກັນວ່າແພັກເກດ [package]``ansible`` ຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງໃນລະບົບໂດຍການເພີ່ມມັນເຂົ້າໃນ highstate ແລະ ເປີດໃຊ້ງານຟີເຈີ Ansible ພາຍໃຕ້ແທັບ menu:System Details[Ansible]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:16
msgid ""
"As the next step, configure the paths to your Ansible playbook directories "
"and inventory files on the menu:System Details[Ansible > Control Node] "
"page.  As an inventory path, you can use the standard Ansible inventory path "
"[literal]``/etc/ansible/hosts``.  As a playbook directory, you can use any "
"directory on the control node, where your playbook files are stored.  A "
"playbook directory either contains [literal]``.yml`` files or subdirectories "
"with [literal]``.yml`` files."
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນຕໍ່ໄປ, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າເສັ້ນທາງ (paths) ໄປຍັງໄດເລັກທໍຣີ Ansible playbook ແລະ ໄຟລ໌ inventory ຂອງທ່ານໃນໜ້າ menu:System Details[Ansible > Control Node]. ສຳລັບ inventory path, ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ path ມາດຕະຖານຂອງ Ansible ຄື [literal]``/etc/ansible/hosts``. ສຳລັບ playbook directory, ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດເລັກທໍຣີໃດກໍໄດ້ໃນ control node ບ່ອນທີ່ໄຟລ໌ playbook ຂອງທ່ານຖືກເກັບໄວ້. playbook directory ອາດຈະມີໄຟລ໌ [literal]``.yml`` ຫຼື ໄດເລັກທໍຣີຍ່ອຍທີ່ມີໄຟລ໌ [literal]``.yml``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:17
msgid ""
"For installing and setting up an Ansible Control Node, see "
"xref:administration:ansible-setup-control-node.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງ ແລະ ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ Ansible Control Node, ເບິ່ງ xref:administration:ansible-setup-control-node.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "Inventory Inspection"
msgstr "ການກວດສອບ Inventory"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:19
msgid ""
"After defining an inventory path, you can use {productname} to inspect its "
"contents."
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກກຳນົດ inventory path ແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ {productname} ເພື່ອກວດສອບເນື້ອຫາພາຍໃນນັ້ນໄດ້."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Inspecting an Inventory from the {webui}"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການກວດສອບ Inventory ຈາກ {webui}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:21
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:System Details[Ansible > "
"Inventories]"
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໄປທີ່ menu:System Details[Ansible > Inventories]"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:22
msgid ""
"Click an inventory path to execute the inventory inspection on the Control "
"Node in real-time."
msgstr "ຄລິກທີ່ inventory path ເພື່ອປະຕິບັດການກວດສອບ inventory ໃນ Control Node ແບບຮຽລທາມ (real-time)."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid "Playbook Discovery"
msgstr "ການຄົ້ນຫາ Playbook"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:24
msgid ""
"After defining a playbook directory, you can discover playbooks on the "
"menu:System Details[Ansible > Playbooks] page."
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກກຳນົດ playbook directory ແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດຄົ້ນຫາ playbooks ໄດ້ໃນໜ້າ menu:System Details[Ansible > Playbooks]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:25
msgid ""
"As with the inventory inspection, the playbook discovery operations run on "
"the Control Node in real-time."
msgstr "ເຊັ່ນດຽວກັນກັບການກວດສອບ inventory, ການຄົ້ນຫາ playbook ຈະລັນໃນ Control Node ແບບຮຽລທາມ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid "Playbook Execution"
msgstr "ການລັນ Playbook"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:27
msgid ""
"You can schedule a playbook execution from the menu:System Details[Ansible > "
"Playbooks] page.  After selecting the playbook you wish to execute, you can "
"select the inventory file for the execution from the [guimenu]``Inventory "
"Path`` drop-down menu of the [guimenu]``Schedule Playbook Execution`` "
"dialog.  If you do not select any item, the default inventory configured in "
"your Control Node will be used.  The drop-down menu is populated with the "
"inventories you defined in your Inventory paths and with inventories that "
"have been locally discovered in your playbook directories.  These are "
"displayed as [guimenu]``Custom Inventory`` items in the playbook details.  "
"You can also enter an arbitrary inventory path."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດກຳນົດເວລາການລັນ playbook ໄດ້ຈາກໜ້າ menu:System Details[Ansible > Playbooks]. ຫຼັງຈາກເລືອກ playbook ທີ່ຕ້ອງການລັນແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດເລືອກໄຟລ໌ inventory ໄດ້ຈາກເມນູ [guimenu]``Inventory Path`` ໃນໜ້າຕ່າງ [guimenu]``Schedule Playbook Execution``. ຫາກທ່ານບໍ່ເລືອກລາຍການໃດໆ, ລະບົບຈະໃຊ້ inventory ມາດຕະຖານທີ່ຕັ້ງຄ່າໄວ້ໃນ Control Node ຂອງທ່ານ. ລາຍການໃນເມນູຈະລວມເອົາ inventory ທີ່ທ່ານກຳນົດໄວ້ໃນ Inventory paths ແລະ inventory ທີ່ຄົ້ນຫາພົບພາຍໃນ playbook directories. ລາຍການເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະສະແດງເປັນ [guimenu]``Custom Inventory`` ໃນລາຍລະອຽດຂອງ playbook. ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດປ້ອນ inventory path ໃດກໍໄດ້ຕາມຕ້ອງການ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:28
msgid ""
"Afterwards, you choose the time of the playbook execution or select an "
"action chain.  Eventually, {productname} executes the playbook as an action "
"on the Control Node.  You can see the result of the operation on the action "
"details page."
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນ, ໃຫ້ເລືອກເວລາໃນການລັນ playbook ຫຼື ເລືອກ action chain. ໃນທີ່ສຸດ, {productname} ຈະລັນ playbook ເປັນການດຳເນີນການໜຶ່ງໃນ Control Node. ທ່ານສາມາດເບິ່ງຜົນຂອງການປະຕິບັດການໄດ້ໃນໜ້າລາຍລະອຽດການດຳເນີນການ (action details)."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Setup Ansible Control Node"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ Ansible Control Node"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:2
msgid ""
"To set up an Ansible control node, execute the following steps from the "
"{productname} {webui}."
msgstr "ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າ Ansible control node, ໃຫ້ເຮັດຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ຈາກ {productname} {webui}."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:3
msgid ""
"To configure a client as the Ansible Control Node, the Ansible package must "
"be installed on that system.  Usually, the Ansible package should be "
"obtained from the operating system vendor's official repositories.  For "
"example, on {sle} 15 SP6 and SP7, Ansible is available through the "
"[literal]``Systems Management Module.``"
msgstr "ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າໄຄລແອນເປັນ Ansible Control Node, ຕ້ອງມີການຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດ Ansible ໃນລະບົບນັ້ນ. ໂດຍປົກກະຕິ, ແພັກເກດ Ansible ຄວນຕິດຕັ້ງຈາກຄັງເກັບຂໍ້ມູນທາງການຂອງຜູ້ຜະລິດລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ. ຕົວຢ່າງ, ໃນ {sle} 15 SP6 ແລະ SP7, Ansible ມີໃຫ້ຜ່ານ [literal]``Systems Management Module.``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Only for older {sle} 15 clients, Ansible is available through SLES 15 Client "
"tools but there it will be dropped in the future."
msgstr "ສຳລັບໄຄລແອນ {sle} 15 ເວີຊັນເກົ່າ, Ansible ມີໃຫ້ຜ່ານ SLES 15 Client tools ແຕ່ຈະຖືກຍົກເລີກໃນອະນາຄົດ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Setting up Ansible Control Node on a {sle} 15 SP6 or SP7 system"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ Ansible Control Node ເທິງລະບົບ {sle} 15 SP6 ຫຼື SP7"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:6
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Admin[Setup Wizard > "
"Products], verify that [literal]``SUSE Linux Enterprise Server 15 SP6 "
"x86_64`` (or later) with the [literal]``Systems Management Module`` and the "
"required [literal]``Python 3 Module`` are selected and synchronized."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໄປທີ່ menu:Admin[Setup Wizard > Products], ກວດສອບວ່າ [literal]``SUSE Linux Enterprise Server 15 SP6 x86_64`` (ຫຼື ເວີຊັນໃໝ່ກວ່າ) ພ້ອມກັບ [literal]``Systems Management Module`` ແລະ [literal]``Python 3 Module`` ທີ່ຈຳເປັນ ຖືກເລືອກ ແລະ ຊິງຄ໌ຂໍ້ມູນແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:7
msgid "Deploy a {sle} 15 SP6 (or later) client."
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງ (Deploy) ໄຄລແອນ {sle} 15 SP6 (ຫຼື ເວີຊັນໃໝ່ກວ່າ)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:8
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to the menu:Systems[Overview] page of "
"the client.  Select menu:Software[Software Channels] and subscribe the "
"client to the [literal]``SUSE Linux Enterprise Server 15 SP6 x86_64`` (or "
"later SP), [literal]``Systems Management Module`` and [literal]``Python 3 "
"Module`` channels."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໄປທີ່ໜ້າ menu:Systems[Overview] ຂອງໄຄລແອນ. ເລືອກ menu:Software[Software Channels] ແລະ ໃຫ້ໄຄລແອນສະໝັກໃຊ້ຊ່ອງທາງ [literal]``SUSE Linux Enterprise Server 15 SP6 x86_64`` (ຫຼື SP ທີ່ໃໝ່ກວ່າ), [literal]``Systems Management Module`` ແລະ [literal]``Python 3 Module``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Select menu:Details[Properties] of your client.  From the [literal]``Add-On "
"System Types`` list enable [guimenu]``Ansible Control Node`` and click "
"btn:[Update Properties]."
msgstr "ເລືອກ menu:Details[Properties] ຂອງໄຄລແອນ. ຈາກລາຍການ [literal]``Add-On System Types`` ໃຫ້ເປີດໃຊ້ງານ [guimenu]``Ansible Control Node`` ແລະ ຄລິກ btn:[Update Properties]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:10
msgid ""
"Navigate to the client overview page, select menu:State[Highstate], and "
"click btn:[Apply Highstate]."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ໜ້າພາບລວມຂອງໄຄລແອນ (client overview), ເລືອກ menu:State[Highstate], ແລະ ຄລິກ btn:[Apply Highstate]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:11
msgid "Select the menu:Events[] tab and verify the status of the highstate."
msgstr "ເລືອກແທັບ menu:Events[] ແລະ ກວດສອບສະຖານະຂອງ highstate."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:12
msgid ""
"If you want to install a newer Ansible on a {sle} 15 SP4 or SP5 client, you "
"must enable the [literal]``Python 3 Module``."
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງການຕິດຕັ້ງ Ansible ເວີຊັນໃໝ່ກວ່າໃນໄຄລແອນ {sle} 15 SP4 ຫຼື SP5, ທ່ານຕ້ອງເປີດໃຊ້ງານ [literal]``Python 3 Module``."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:13
msgid ""
"Newer versions of Ansible no longer support managing nodes with outdated "
"Python versions.  If a managed node still defaults to an older Python "
"version, you may encounter connection errors or failures during playbook "
"runs.  To address this, user should upgrade Python on the managed node, if "
"possible and set the correct Python interpreter in the Ansible inventory or "
"configuration."
msgstr "Ansible ເວີຊັນໃໝ່ໆ ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບການຈັດການ node ທີ່ມີເວີຊັນ Python ທີ່ເກົ່າເກີນໄປ. ຫາກ node ທີ່ຖືກຈັດການຍັງໃຊ້ Python ເວີຊັນເກົ່າເປັນມາດຕະຖານ, ທ່ານອາດພົບບັນຫາການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ ຫຼື ການລັນ playbook ຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ. ເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂບັນຫານີ້, ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຄວນອັບເກຣດ Python ໃນ node ທີ່ຖືກຈັດການ (ຫາກເປັນໄປໄດ້) ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າ Python interpreter ໃຫ້ຖືກຕ້ອງໃນ Ansible inventory ຫຼື ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create Ansible Inventory Files"
msgstr "ສ້າງໄຟລ໌ Ansible Inventory"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:15
msgid ""
"Ansible Integration tools deploy a playbook as an inventory file.  Create "
"one inventory file for each operating system listed in _Table 1_."
msgstr "ເຄື່ອງມື Ansible Integration ຈະໃຊ້ playbook ເປັນໄຟລ໌ inventory. ໃຫ້ສ້າງໄຟລ໌ inventory ໜຶ່ງໄຟລ໌ສຳລັບແຕ່ລະລະບົບປະຕິບັດການທີ່ລະບຸໃນ _ຕາຕະລາງ 1_."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating Ansible Inventory Files"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງໄຟລ໌ Ansible Inventory"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:17
msgid ""
"Create and add your hosts to an inventory file to be managed by Ansible.  "
"The default path for an Ansible inventory is [path]``/etc/ansible/hosts``."
msgstr "ສ້າງ ແລະ ເພີ່ມ hosts ຂອງທ່ານເຂົ້າໃນໄຟລ໌ inventory ເພື່ອຈັດການໂດຍ Ansible. ເສັ້ນທາງມາດຕະຖານສຳລັບ Ansible inventory ແມ່ນ [path]``/etc/ansible/hosts``."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "Inventory Example"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ Inventory"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"client240.mgr.example.org\n"
"client241.mgr.example.org\n"
"client242.mgr.example.org\n"
"client243.mgr.example.org "
"ansible_ssh_private_key_file=/etc/ansible/some_ssh_key\n"
msgstr ""
"client240.mgr.example.org\n"
"client241.mgr.example.org\n"
"client242.mgr.example.org\n"
"client243.mgr.example.org ansible_ssh_private_key_file=/etc/ansible/some_ssh_key\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[mygroup1]\n"
"client241.mgr.example.org\n"
"client242.mgr.example.org\n"
msgstr ""
"[mygroup1]\n"
"client241.mgr.example.org\n"
"client242.mgr.example.org\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[mygroup2]\n"
"client243.mgr.example.org\n"
msgstr ""
"[mygroup2]\n"
"client243.mgr.example.org\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[all:vars]\n"
"ansible_ssh_private_key_file=/etc/ansible/my_ansible_private_key\n"
msgstr ""
"[all:vars]\n"
"ansible_ssh_private_key_file=/etc/ansible/my_ansible_private_key\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:23
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, from the [guimenu]``Ansible`` tab navigate to "
"menu:Ansible[Control Node] to add inventory files to the control node."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ຈາກແທັບ [guimenu]``Ansible`` ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ menu:Ansible[Control Node] ເພື່ອເພີ່ມໄຟລ໌ inventory ໃສ່ control node."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:24
msgid ""
"Under the [literal]``Playbook Directories`` section add "
"[literal]``/usr/share/scap-security-guide/ansible`` to the [literal]``Add a "
"Playbook Directories`` field and click btn:[Save]."
msgstr "ພາຍໃຕ້ພາກສ່ວນ [literal]``Playbook Directories`` ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມ [literal]``/usr/share/scap-security-guide/ansible`` ໃສ່ໃນຊ່ອງ [literal]``Add a Playbook Directories`` ແລະ ຄລິກ btn:[Save]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:25
msgid ""
"Under [literal]``Inventory Files`` add your inventory file locations to the "
"[literal]``Add an Inventory file`` field and click btn:[Save]."
msgstr "ພາຍໃຕ້ [literal]``Inventory Files`` ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມຕຳແໜ່ງໄຟລ໌ inventory ຂອງທ່ານໃສ່ໃນຊ່ອງ [literal]``Add an Inventory file`` ແລະ ຄລິກ btn:[Save]."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid "Examples"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:27
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"/etc/ansible/sles15\n"
"/etc/ansible/sles12\n"
"/etc/ansible/centos7\n"
msgstr ""
"/etc/ansible/sles15\n"
"/etc/ansible/sles12\n"
"/etc/ansible/centos7\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:28
msgid ""
"For additional playbook examples, see "
"https://github.com/ansible/ansible-examples."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຕົວຢ່າງ playbook ເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງ https://github.com/ansible/ansible-examples."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid "Establish Communication with Ansible Nodes"
msgstr "ສ້າງການສື່ສານກັບ Ansible Nodes"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:30
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Establishing Communication with Ansible Nodes"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງການສື່ສານກັບ Ansible Nodes"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:31
msgid "Create the SSH keys that you are using in your inventory."
msgstr "ສ້າງ SSH keys ທີ່ທ່ານກຳລັງໃຊ້ໃນ inventory ຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:32
#, no-wrap
msgid "ssh-keygen -f /etc/ansible/my_ansible_private_key\n"
msgstr "ssh-keygen -f /etc/ansible/my_ansible_private_key\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:33
msgid "Copy the generated SSH keys to the Ansible managed clients.  Example:"
msgstr "ສຳເນົາ SSH keys ທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນໄປຍັງໄຄລແອນທີ່ຈັດການໂດຍ Ansible. ຕົວຢ່າງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:34
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"ssh-copy-id -i /etc/ansible/my_ansible_private_key "
"root@client240.mgr.example.org\n"
msgstr "ssh-copy-id -i /etc/ansible/my_ansible_private_key root@client240.mgr.example.org\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:35
msgid "Declare the private key in [path]``/etc/ansible/ansible.cfg`` as follows:"
msgstr "ປະກາດ private key ໃນ [path]``/etc/ansible/ansible.cfg`` ດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:36
#, no-wrap
msgid "private_key_file = /etc/ansible/my_ansible_private_key\n"
msgstr "private_key_file = /etc/ansible/my_ansible_private_key\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:37
msgid ""
"Replace [path]``my_ansible_private_key`` with the name of the file "
"containing the private key."
msgstr "ປ່ຽນ [path]``my_ansible_private_key`` ເປັນຊື່ໄຟລ໌ທີ່ມີ private key ຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:38
msgid ""
"Test that Ansible is working by executing the following commands from the "
"control node:"
msgstr "ທົດສອບວ່າ Ansible ເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ຫຼືບໍ່ ໂດຍການລັນຄຳສັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ຈາກ control node:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:39
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"ansible all -m ping\n"
"ansible mygroup1 -m ping\n"
"ansible client240.mgr.example.org -m ping\n"
msgstr ""
"ansible all -m ping\n"
"ansible mygroup1 -m ping\n"
"ansible client240.mgr.example.org -m ping\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:40
msgid ""
"You may now run remediations.  For more information, see "
"xref:administration:ansible-compliance-as-code.adoc[]."
msgstr "ຕອນນີ້ທ່ານສາມາດລັນການແກ້ໄຂ (remediations) ໄດ້ແລ້ວ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງ xref:administration:ansible-compliance-as-code.adoc[]."

#.  bsc#1213077 #9
#.  section on how to create playbooks, and how to schedule their execution.
#.  Add a description of the "Playbooks" tab, in general context.
#.  There is a very summarized descriptions in next section "Compliance as code", but we // need a description of the playbooks tab that is independent of usage with openscap.
#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Auditing"
msgstr "ການກວດສອບ (Auditing)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:2
msgid ""
"In {productname}, you can keep track of your clients through a series of "
"auditing tasks.  You can check that your clients are up to date with all "
"public security patches (CVEs), perform subscription matching, and use "
"OpenSCAP to check for specification compliance."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname}, ທ່ານສາມາດຕິດຕາມໄຄລແອນຂອງທ່ານຜ່ານຊຸດວຽກງານການກວດສອບ. ທ່ານສາມາດກວດສອບໄດ້ວ່າໄຄລແອນຂອງທ່ານໄດ້ອັບເດດແພັດຊ໌ຄວາມປອດໄພ (CVEs) ທັງໝົດແລ້ວຫຼືບໍ່, ເຮັດການຈັບຄູ່ການສະໝັກໃຊ້ (subscription matching), ແລະ ໃຊ້ OpenSCAP ເພື່ອກວດສອບການປະຕິບັດຕາມຂໍ້ກຳນົດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:3
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to [guimenu]``Audit`` to perform "
"auditing tasks."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໄປທີ່ [guimenu]``Audit`` ເພື່ອປະຕິບັດວຽກງານການກວດສອບ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "CVE Audits"
msgstr "ການກວດສອບ CVE"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:5
msgid ""
"A CVE (Common Vulnerabilities and Exposures) is a fix for a publicly known "
"security vulnerability."
msgstr "CVE (Common Vulnerabilities and Exposures) ແມ່ນການແກ້ໄຂສຳລັບຊ່ອງໂຫວ່ດ້ານຄວາມປອດໄພທີ່ຖືກເປີດເຜີຍຕໍ່ສາທາລະນະ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:6
msgid "You must apply CVEs to your clients as soon as they become available."
msgstr "ທ່ານຕ້ອງນຳໃຊ້ CVEs ກັບໄຄລແອນຂອງທ່ານທັນທີທີ່ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:7
msgid ""
"Each CVE contains an identification number, a description of the "
"vulnerability, and links to further information.  CVE identification numbers "
"use the form ``CVE-YEAR-XXXX``."
msgstr "ແຕ່ລະ CVE ປະກອບມີໝາຍເລກລະບຸ, ລາຍລະອຽດຂອງຊ່ອງໂຫວ່, ແລະ ລິ້ງໄປຫາຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ. ໝາຍເລກລະບຸ CVE ຈະຢູ່ໃນຮູບແບບ ``CVE-YEAR-XXXX``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:8
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Audit[CVE Audit] to see a "
"list of all clients and their current patch status."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໄປທີ່ menu:Audit[CVE Audit] ເພື່ອເບິ່ງລາຍການໄຄລແອນທັງໝົດ ແລະ ສະຖານະແພັດຊ໌ໃນປະຈຸບັນຂອງພວກເຂົາ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:9
msgid ""
"By default, the patch data is updated at 23:00 every day.  We recommend that "
"before you begin a CVE audit you refresh the data to ensure you have the "
"latest patches."
msgstr "ໂດຍປົກກະຕິ, ຂໍ້ມູນແພັດຊ໌ຈະຖືກອັບເດດເວລາ 23:00 ຂອງທຸກໆວັນ. ພວກເຮົາແນະນຳວ່າກ່ອນທີ່ທ່ານຈະເລີ່ມການກວດສອບ CVE ໃຫ້ທ່ານທຳການຣີເຟຣຊຂໍ້ມູນເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າທ່ານມີແພັດຊ໌ຫຼ້າສຸດ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Updating Patch Data"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການອັບເດດຂໍ້ມູນແພັດຊ໌"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:11
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Admin[Task Schedules] and "
"select the ``cve-server-channels-default`` schedule."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໄປທີ່ menu:Admin[Task Schedules] ແລະ ເລືອກກຳນົດເວລາ ``cve-server-channels-default``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:12
msgid "Click btn:[cve-server-channels-bunch]."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[cve-server-channels-bunch]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:13
msgid ""
"Click btn:[Single Run Schedule] to schedule the task.  Allow the task to "
"complete before continuing with the CVE audit."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Single Run Schedule] ເພື່ອກຳນົດເວລາວຽກ. ປ່ອຍໃຫ້ວຽກເຮັດສຳເລັດກ່ອນທີ່ຈະດຳເນີນການກວດສອບ CVE ຕໍ່ໄປ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Verifying Patch Status"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການກວດສອບສະຖານະແພັດຊ໌"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:15
msgid "In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Audit[CVE Audit]."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໄປທີ່ menu:Audit[CVE Audit]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:16
msgid ""
"To check the patch status for a particular CVE, type the CVE identifier in "
"the [guimenu]``CVE Number`` field."
msgstr "ເພື່ອຕວດສອບສະຖານະແພັດຊ໌ສຳລັບ CVE ໃດໜຶ່ງ, ໃຫ້ພິມໝາຍເລກ CVE ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``CVE Number``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:17
msgid ""
"Select the patch statuses you want to look for, or leave all statuses "
"checked to look for all."
msgstr "ເລືອກສະຖານະແພັດຊ໌ທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການຄົ້ນຫາ, ຫຼື ໝາຍເລືອກທຸກສະຖານະເພື່ອຄົ້ນຫາທັງໝົດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:18
msgid ""
"Click btn:[Audit Servers] to check all systems, or click btn:[Audit Images] "
"to check all images."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Audit Servers] ເພື່ອກວດສອບທຸກລະບົບ, ຫຼື ຄລິກ btn:[Audit Images] ເພື່ອກວດສອບທຸກ Image."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:19
msgid ""
"For more information about the patch status icons used on this page, see "
"xref:reference:audit/audit-cve-audit.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບໄອຄອນສະຖານະແພັດຊ໌ທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນໜ້ານີ້, ເບິ່ງ xref:reference:audit/audit-cve-audit.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:20
msgid ""
"For each system, the [guimenu]``Actions`` column provides information about "
"what you need to do to address vulnerabilities.  If applicable, a list of "
"candidate channels or patches is also given.  You can also assign systems to "
"a [guimenu]``System Set`` for further batch processing."
msgstr "ສຳລັບແຕ່ລະລະບົບ, ຄໍລຳ [guimenu]``Actions`` ຈະໃຫ້ຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບສິ່ງທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງເຮັດເພື່ອຈັດການກັບຊ່ອງໂຫວ່. ຫາກມີຂໍ້ມູນ, ຈະມີລາຍການຊ່ອງທາງ ຫຼື ແພັດຊ໌ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງສະແດງໃຫ້ເຫັນ. ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດກຳນົດລະບົບໄປຍັງ [guimenu]``System Set`` ເພື່ອປະມວນຜົນແບບກຸ່ມ (batch) ຕໍ່ໄປ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:21
msgid ""
"You can use the {productname} API to verify the patch status of your "
"clients.  Use the ``audit.listSystemsByPatchStatus`` API method.  For more "
"information about this method, see the {productname} API Guide."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ {productname} API ເພື່ອກວດສອບສະຖານະແພັດຊ໌ຂອງໄຄລແອນ. ໃຊ້ເມທອດ API ``audit.listSystemsByPatchStatus``. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບເມທອດນີ້, ເບິ່ງ {productname} API Guide."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid "OVAL"
msgstr "OVAL"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:23
msgid ""
"In addition to retrieving CVE information from channel data, {productname} "
"now includes an experimental feature that fetches CVE details from OVAL "
"files.  This functionality is currently considered a *Technology Preview*."
msgstr "ນອກເໜືອຈາກການດຶງຂໍ້ມູນ CVE ຈາກຂໍ້ມູນຊ່ອງທາງ (channel data) ແລ້ວ, ປະຈຸບັນ {productname} ຍັງມີຟີເຈີທົດລອງທີ່ດຶງລາຍລະອຽດ CVE ຈາກໄຟລ໌ OVAL. ຟັງຊັນນີ້ຖືວ່າເປັນ *Technology Preview* ໃນປະຈຸບັນ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:24
msgid ""
"Users are encouraged to experiment with this feature and share feedback.  "
"However, it is not yet recommended for production use without thorough "
"testing in a test environment."
msgstr "ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສາມາດທົດລອງໃຊ້ຟີເຈີນີ້ ແລະ ແບ່ງປັນຄຳຄິດເຫັນໄດ້. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ຍັງບໍ່ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໃນລະບົບຈິງ (production) ໂດຍທີ່ຍັງບໍ່ໄດ້ຜ່ານການທົດສອບຢ່າງລະອຽດໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທົດສອບ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:25
msgid ""
"The CVE Audit operation relies on two primary data sources: channels and "
"OVAL (Open Vulnerability and Assessment Language).  These two sources "
"provide the metadata for conducting CVE audits, each serving a distinct "
"purpose."
msgstr "ການປະຕິບັດການກວດສອບ CVE ແມ່ນອີງໃສ່ແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນຫຼັກສອງແຫຼ່ງຄື: ຊ່ອງທາງ (channels) ແລະ OVAL (Open Vulnerability and Assessment Language). ແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນທັງສອງນີ້ໃຫ້ຂໍ້ມູນເມຕາສຳລັບການກວດສອບ CVE, ໂດຍແຕ່ລະແຫຼ່ງມີຈຸດປະສົງທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:26
#: modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:109
#: modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:121
#: modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:131
#: modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:141
#, no-wrap
msgid "Channels"
msgstr "ຊ່ອງທາງ (Channels)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:27
msgid ""
"Channels include the updated software packages, including the patches, and "
"provide insights into the essential patches required to address "
"vulnerabilities."
msgstr "ຊ່ອງທາງປະກອບມີແພັກເກດຊອບແວທີ່ອັບເດດແລ້ວ, ລວມທັງແພັດຊ໌, ແລະ ໃຫ້ຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບແພັດຊ໌ທີ່ຈຳເປັນເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂຊ່ອງໂຫວ່."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "OVAL (Technology Preview)"
msgstr "OVAL (Technology Preview)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:29
msgid ""
"In contrast, OVAL data supply the information about vulnerabilities "
"themselves, and packages that render a system vulnerable to a CVE."
msgstr "ໃນທາງກົງກັນຂ້າມ, ຂໍ້ມູນ OVAL ຈະໃຫ້ຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບຊ່ອງໂຫວ່ເອງ, ແລະ ແພັກເກດທີ່ເຮັດໃຫ້ລະບົບສ່ຽງຕໍ່ CVE ນັ້ນໆ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:30
msgid ""
"While it is possible to conduct CVE audits using only channels data, "
"synchronizing OVAL data enhances the accuracy of the results, particularly "
"in cases involving zero-day vulnerabilities or partially patched "
"vulnerabilities."
msgstr "ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຈະສາມາດກວດສອບ CVE ໂດຍໃຊ້ພຽງແຕ່ຂໍ້ມູນຊ່ອງທາງໄດ້, ແຕ່ການຊິງຄ໌ຂໍ້ມູນ OVAL ຈະຊ່ວຍເພີ່ມຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງຂອງຜົນໄດ້ຮັບ, ໂດຍສະເພາະໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບຊ່ອງໂຫວ່ zero-day ຫຼື ຊ່ອງໂຫວ່ທີ່ຖືກແກ້ໄຂພຽງບາງສ່ວນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:31
msgid ""
"OVAL data is much more lightweight than channels data.  For example, OVAL "
"data for {opensuse} Leap 15.4 is around 50{nbsp}MB."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນ OVAL ມີຂະໜາດເບົາບາງກວ່າຂໍ້ມູນຊ່ອງທາງຫຼາຍ. ຕົວຢ່າງ, ຂໍ້ມູນ OVAL ສຳລັບ {opensuse} Leap 15.4 ມີຂະໜາດປະມານ 50{nbsp}MB."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:32
msgid ""
"Having synced OVAL data only, you can already perform CVE audits and check "
"if your systems are vulnerable or not to a CVE, but you can't apply patches "
"since they come from channels."
msgstr "ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຈະຊິງຄ໌ພຽງແຕ່ຂໍ້ມູນ OVAL, ທ່ານກໍສາມາດກວດສອບ CVE ແລະ ເບິ່ງວ່າລະບົບຂອງທ່ານມີຊ່ອງໂຫວ່ຫຼືບໍ່ໄດ້ແລ້ວ, ແຕ່ທ່ານຈະບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ແພັດຊ໌ໄດ້ ເພາະແພັດຊ໌ເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນມາຈາກຊ່ອງທາງ (channels)."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:33
msgid "Key characteristics of the OVAL feature include:"
msgstr "ຄຸນລັກສະນະທີ່ສຳຄັນຂອງຟີເຈີ OVAL ລວມມີ:"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:34
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"*Disabled by default*: The feature is turned off by default and must be "
"explicitly enabled by the user by updating the configuration file "
"[litaral]``rhn.conf`` and restarting relevant services.\n"
msgstr "*ປິດໃຊ້ງານໂດຍມາດຕະຖານ*: ຟີເຈີນີ້ຖືກປິດຕັ້ງແຕ່ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ແລະ ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຕ້ອງເປີດໃຊ້ງານເອງໂດຍການອັບເດດໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ [litaral]``rhn.conf`` ແລະ ເລີ່ມການເຮັດວຽກຂອງບໍລິການທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງຄືນໃໝ່.\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:35
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"*Reversible*: If any issues arise, users can revert back to the standard "
"channel-based CVE audit.\n"
msgstr "*ສາມາດຍ້ອນກັບໄດ້*: ຫາກເກີດບັນຫາໃດໆ, ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສາມາດກັບໄປໃຊ້ການກວດສອບ CVE ຜ່ານຊ່ອງທາງແບບມາດຕະຖານໄດ້.\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:36
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"*Performance considerations*: While initial testing has been conducted, "
"there are still concerns regarding performance, and further optimizations "
"may be needed.\n"
msgstr "*ການພິຈາລະນາດ້ານປະສິດທິພາບ*: ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຈະມີການທົດສອບເບື້ອງຕົ້ນແລ້ວ, ແຕ່ຍັງມີຄວາມກັງວົນກ່ຽວກັບປະສິດທິພາບ, ແລະ ອາດຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີການປັບແຕ່ງເພີ່ມເຕີມ.\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:37
msgid ""
"OVAL data is updated at 23:00 every day by default.  We recommend that "
"before you begin a CVE audit you refresh the data to ensure you have the "
"latest vulnerabilities metadata."
msgstr "ໂດຍປົກກະຕິ, ຂໍ້ມູນ OVAL ຈະຖືກອັບເດດເວລາ 23:00 ຂອງທຸກໆວັນ. ພວກເຮົາແນະນຳວ່າກ່ອນທີ່ທ່ານຈະເລີ່ມການກວດສອບ CVE ໃຫ້ທ່ານຣີເຟຣຊຂໍ້ມູນເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າທ່ານມີຂໍ້ມູນເມຕາຂອງຊ່ອງໂຫວ່ຫຼ້າສຸດ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:38
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Enabling OVAL Data Support"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການເປີດໃຊ້ງານການຮອງຮັບຂໍ້ມູນ OVAL"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:39
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:45
msgid "Add or modify the following setting in [literal]``rhn.conf``:"
msgstr "ເພີ່ມ ຫຼື ແກ້ໄຂການຕັ້ງຄ່າຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ໃນ [literal]``rhn.conf``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:40
#, no-wrap
msgid "java.cve_audit.enable_oval_metadata=true\n"
msgstr "java.cve_audit.enable_oval_metadata=true\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:41
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:47
msgid "Restart the Tomcat and Taskomatic services:"
msgstr "ເລີ່ມການເຮັດວຽກຂອງບໍລິການ Tomcat ແລະ Taskomatic ຄືນໃໝ່:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:42
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:48
#, no-wrap
msgid "systemctl restart tomcat taskomatic\n"
msgstr "systemctl restart tomcat taskomatic\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:43
msgid ""
"If you encounter issues and need to revert to the default behavior, disable "
"the feature by setting:"
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານພົບບັນຫາ ແລະ ຕ້ອງການກັບໄປໃຊ້ຮູບແບບມາດຕະຖານ, ໃຫ້ປິດຟີເຈີນີ້ໂດຍການຕັ້ງຄ່າ:"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:44
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Disabling OVAL Data Support"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການປິດໃຊ້ງານການຮອງຮັບຂໍ້ມູນ OVAL"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:46
#, no-wrap
msgid "java.cve_audit.enable_oval_metadata=false\n"
msgstr "java.cve_audit.enable_oval_metadata=false\n"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:49
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Updating OVAL Data"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການອັບເດດຂໍ້ມູນ OVAL"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:50
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Admin[Task Schedules] and "
"select the ``oval-data-sync-default`` schedule."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໄປທີ່ menu:Admin[Task Schedules] ແລະ ເລືອກກຳນົດເວລາ ``oval-data-sync-default``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:51
msgid "Click btn:[oval-data-sync-bunch]."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[oval-data-sync-bunch]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:52
msgid "Click btn:[Single Run Schedule] to schedule the task."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Single Run Schedule] ເພື່ອກຳນົດເວລາວຽກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:53
msgid "Allow the task to complete before continuing with the CVE audit."
msgstr "ປ່ອຍໃຫ້ວຽກເຮັດສຳເລັດກ່ອນທີ່ຈະດຳເນີນການກວດສອບ CVE ຕໍ່ໄປ."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:54
#, no-wrap
msgid "Collect CPE"
msgstr "ການເກັບກຳ CPE"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:55
msgid ""
"To be able to accurately identify what vulnerabilities apply to a certain "
"client, we need to identify the operating system product that client "
"uses. To do that, we collect the CPE (Common Platform Enumeration) of the "
"client as a salt grain, then we save it to the database."
msgstr "ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສາມາດລະບຸໄດ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງວ່າຊ່ອງໂຫວ່ໃດທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບໄຄລແອນໃດໜຶ່ງ, ພວກເຮົາຕ້ອງລະບຸຜະລິດຕະພັນລະບົບປະຕິບັດການທີ່ໄຄລແອນນັ້ນໃຊ້. ເພື່ອເຮັດແນວນັ້ນ, ພວກເຮົາຈະເກັບກຳ CPE (Common Platform Enumeration) ຂອງໄຄລແອນເປັນ salt grain, ແລ້ວບັນທຶກມັນລົງໃນຖານຂໍ້ມູນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:56
msgid ""
"The CPE of newly registered clients will be automatically collected and "
"saved to the database.  However, for existing clients, it is necessary to "
"execute the ``Update Packages List`` action at least once."
msgstr "CPE ຂອງໄຄລແອນທີ່ລົງທະບຽນໃໝ່ຈະຖືກເກັບກຳ ແລະ ບັນທຶກລົງຖານຂໍ້ມູນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ສຳລັບໄຄລແອນທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ, ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງລັນການດຳເນີນການ ``Update Packages List`` ຢ່າງໜ້ອຍໜຶ່ງຄັ້ງ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:57
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Update Packages List"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ອັບເດດລາຍການແພັກເກດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:58
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[System List > All] "
"and select a client."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໄປທີ່ menu:Systems[System List > All] ແລະ ເລືອກໄຄລແອນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:59
msgid ""
"Then go to the [guimenu]``Software`` tab and select the "
"[guimenu]``Packages`` sub-tab."
msgstr "ຈາກນັ້ນໄປທີ່ແທັບ [guimenu]``Software`` ແລະ ເລືອກແທັບຍ່ອຍ [guimenu]``Packages``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:60
msgid ""
"Click btn:[Update Packages List] to update packages and collect the CPE of "
"client."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Update Packages List] ເພື່ອອັບເດດແພັກເກດ ແລະ ເກັບກຳ CPE ຂອງໄຄລແອນ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:61
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:63
#, no-wrap
msgid "OVAL Sources"
msgstr "ແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນ OVAL"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:62
msgid ""
"To ensure the integrity and currency of the OVAL data, {productname} "
"exclusively consumes OVAL data from the official maintainers of every "
"product. Below, you can find the list of OVAL data sources."
msgstr "ເພື່ອຮັບປະກັນຄວາມສົມບູນ ແລະ ຄວາມທັນສະໄໝຂອງຂໍ້ມູນ OVAL, {productname} ຈະດຶງຂໍ້ມູນ OVAL ຈາກຜູ້ດູແລຢ່າງເປັນທາງການຂອງແຕ່ລະຜະລິດຕະພັນເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ທ່ານສາມາດເບິ່ງລາຍການແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນ OVAL ໄດ້ລຸ່ມນີ້."

#. type: Table
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:64
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Product | Source URL\n"
"| openSUSE Leap .5+.^| https://ftp.suse.com/pub/projects/security/oval\n"
"| openSUSE Leap Micro\n"
"| SUSE Linux Enterprise Server\n"
"| SUSE Linux Enterprise Desktop\n"
"| SUSE Linux Enterprise Micro\n"
"| RedHat Enterprise Linux | https://www.redhat.com/security/data/oval/v2\n"
"| Debian | https://www.debian.org/security/oval\n"
"| Ubuntu | https://security-metadata.canonical.com/oval\n"
msgstr ""
"| ຜະລິດຕະພັນ | URL ແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນ\n"
"| openSUSE Leap .5+.^| https://ftp.suse.com/pub/projects/security/oval\n"
"| openSUSE Leap Micro\n"
"| SUSE Linux Enterprise Server\n"
"| SUSE Linux Enterprise Desktop\n"
"| SUSE Linux Enterprise Micro\n"
"| RedHat Enterprise Linux | https://www.redhat.com/security/data/oval/v2\n"
"| Debian | https://www.debian.org/security/oval\n"
"| Ubuntu | https://security-metadata.canonical.com/oval\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:65
msgid ""
"OVAL metadata is used in CVE auditing for only a subset of clients, namely, "
"clients that use openSUSE Leap, SUSE enterprise products, RHEL, Debian or "
"Ubuntu. This is due to the absence of OVAL vulnerability definitions "
"metadata for the other products."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນເມຕາ OVAL ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໃນການກວດສອບ CVE ສຳລັບໄຄລແອນບາງສ່ວນເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ຄື ໄຄລແອນທີ່ໃຊ້ openSUSE Leap, ຜະລິດຕະພັນລະດັບອົງກອນຂອງ SUSE, RHEL, Debian ຫຼື Ubuntu. ນີ້ກໍຍ້ອນວ່າບໍ່ມີຂໍ້ມູນເມຕາຄຳນິຍາມຊ່ອງໂຫວ່ OVAL ສຳລັບຜະລິດຕະພັນອື່ນໆ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:66
#, no-wrap
msgid "CVE Status"
msgstr "ສະຖານະ CVE"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:67
msgid ""
"The CVE status of clients is usually either ``affected``, ``not affected``, "
"or ``patched``.  These statuses are based only on the information that is "
"available to {productname}."
msgstr "ສະຖານະ CVE ຂອງໄຄລແອນ ໂດຍປົກກະຕິຈະເປັນ ``affected`` (ໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບ), ``not affected`` (ບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບ), ຫຼື ``patched`` (ແກ້ໄຂແລ້ວ). ສະຖານະເຫຼົ່ານີ້ແມ່ນອີງໃສ່ຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນ {productname} ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:68
msgid "Within {productname}, these definitions apply:"
msgstr "ພາຍໃນ {productname}, ຈະໃຊ້ຄຳນິຍາມເຫຼົ່ານີ້:"

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:69
#, no-wrap
msgid "System affected by a certain vulnerability"
msgstr "ລະບົບທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບຈາກຊ່ອງໂຫວ່ໃດໜຶ່ງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:70
msgid ""
"A system which has an installed package with version lower than the version "
"of the same package in a relevant patch marked for the vulnerability."
msgstr "ລະບົບທີ່ມີການຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດທີ່ມີເວີຊັນຕ່ຳກວ່າເວີຊັນຂອງແພັກເກດດຽວກັນໃນແພັດຊ໌ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງເຊິ່ງລະບຸໄວ້ສຳລັບຊ່ອງໂຫວ່ນັ້ນ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:71
#, no-wrap
msgid "System not affected by a certain vulnerability"
msgstr "ລະບົບທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບຈາກຊ່ອງໂຫວ່ໃດໜຶ່ງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:72
msgid ""
"A system which has no installed package that is also in a relevant patch "
"marked for the vulnerability."
msgstr "ລະບົບທີ່ບໍ່ມີການຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ໃນແພັດຊ໌ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງສຳລັບຊ່ອງໂຫວ່ນັ້ນ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:73
#, no-wrap
msgid "System patched for a certain vulnerability"
msgstr "ລະບົບທີ່ຖືກແກ້ໄຂແລ້ວສຳລັບຊ່ອງໂຫວ່ໃດໜຶ່ງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:74
msgid ""
"A system which has an installed package with version equal to or greater "
"than the version of the same package in a relevant patch marked for the "
"vulnerability."
msgstr "ລະບົບທີ່ມີການຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດທີ່ມີເວີຊັນເທົ່າກັບ ຫຼື ສູງກວ່າເວີຊັນຂອງແພັກເກດດຽວກັນໃນແພັດຊ໌ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງເຊິ່ງລະບຸໄວ້ສຳລັບຊ່ອງໂຫວ່ນັ້ນ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:75
#, no-wrap
msgid "Relevant patch"
msgstr "ແພັດຊ໌ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:76
msgid "A patch known by {productname} in a relevant channel."
msgstr "ແພັດຊ໌ທີ່ {productname} ຮູ້ຈັກໃນຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:77
#, no-wrap
msgid "Relevant channel"
msgstr "ຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:78
msgid ""
"A channel managed by {productname}, which is either assigned to the system, "
"the original of a cloned channel which is assigned to the system, a channel "
"linked to a product which is installed on the system or a past or future "
"service pack channel for the system."
msgstr "ຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ຈັດການໂດຍ {productname}, ເຊິ່ງອາດຈະເປັນຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ລະບົບ, ຊ່ອງທາງຕົ້ນສະບັບຂອງຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ຖືກສຳເນົາມາເຊິ່ງກຳນົດໃຫ້ລະບົບ, ຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ເຊື່ອມໂຍງກັບຜະລິດຕະພັນທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງໃນລະບົບ ຫຼື ຊ່ອງທາງ service pack ໃນອະດີດ ຫຼື ອະນາຄົດສຳລັບລະບົບນັ້ນ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:79
msgid ""
"Because of the definitions used within {productname}, CVE audit results "
"might be incorrect in some circumstances.  For example, unmanaged channels, "
"unmanaged packages, or non-compliant systems might report incorrectly."
msgstr "ເນື່ອງຈາກຄຳນິຍາມທີ່ໃຊ້ພາຍໃນ {productname}, ຜົນການກວດສອບ CVE ອາດຈະບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງໃນບາງສະຖານະການ. ຕົວຢ່າງ, ຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກຈັດການ, ແພັກເກດທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກຈັດການ, ຫຼື ລະບົບທີ່ບໍ່ປະຕິບັດຕາມຂໍ້ກຳນົດ ອາດຈະລາຍງານຜົນທີ່ຜິດພາດ."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Authentication With PAM"
msgstr "ການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນດ້ວຍ PAM"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:2
msgid ""
"{productname} supports network-based authentication systems using pluggable "
"authentication modules (PAM) using SSSD.  PAM is a suite of libraries that "
"allows you to integrate {productname} with a centralized authentication "
"mechanism, eliminating the need to remember multiple passwords.  "
"{productname} supports LDAP, Kerberos, and other network-based "
"authentication protocols."
msgstr "{productname} ຮອງຮັບລະບົບການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນຜ່ານເຄືອຂ່າຍໂດຍໃຊ້ pluggable authentication modules (PAM) ຜ່ານ SSSD. PAM ແມ່ນຊຸດຂອງໄຮບຣາຣີທີ່ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ {productname} ເຂົ້າກັບກົນໄກການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນແບບລວມສູນ, ເຮັດໃຫ້ບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຈື່ລະຫັດຜ່ານຫຼາຍອັນ. {productname} ຮອງຮັບ LDAP, Kerberos, ແລະ ໂປຣໂຕຄໍການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນຜ່ານເຄືອຂ່າຍອື່ນໆ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "SSSD Configuration"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ SSSD"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Configuring SSSD"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ SSSD"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:5
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Users[Create User] and enable "
"a new or existing user to authenticate with PAM."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໄປທີ່ menu:Users[Create User] ແລະ ເປີດໃຊ້ງານຜູ້ໃຊ້ໃໝ່ ຫຼື ຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວເພື່ອຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນດ້ວຍ PAM."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:6
msgid ""
"In usernames, additionally to alphanumeric characters, [literal]``-``, "
"[literal]``_``, [literal]``.``, and [literal]``@`` are allowed."
msgstr "ໃນຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້, ນອກຈາກຕົວອັກສອນ ແລະ ຕົວເລກແລ້ວ, ຍັງອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [literal]``-``, [literal]``_``, [literal]``.``, ແລະ [literal]``@``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:7
msgid "Check the [guimenu]``Pluggable Authentication Modules (PAM)`` checkbox."
msgstr "ໝາຍເລືອກຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Pluggable Authentication Modules (PAM)``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:8
msgid ""
"Configure SSSD in the server container.  At the command prompt of the "
"{productname} container host, as root, enter the server container:"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ SSSD ໃນ server container. ທີ່ໜ້າຕ່າງຄຳສັ່ງຂອງ {productname} container host, ໃນນາມ root, ໃຫ້ເຂົ້າໄປໃນ server container:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:9
#: modules/administration/pages/iss_v2.adoc:10
#: modules/administration/pages/iss_v2.adoc:19
#: modules/administration/pages/iss_v2.adoc:26
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-bootstrap-repo-for-eol-products.adoc:6
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-logintimeout.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgrctl term\n"
msgstr "mgrctl term\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:10
#: modules/administration/pages/iss_v2.adoc:11
#: modules/administration/pages/iss_v2.adoc:20
#: modules/administration/pages/iss_v2.adoc:27
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-bootstrap-repo-for-eol-products.adoc:7
msgid "Inside the container, execute the following steps:"
msgstr "ພາຍໃນ container, ໃຫ້ເຮັດຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:11
msgid ""
"Edit [path]``/etc/sssd/sssd.conf`` according to your configuration.  For an "
"example, see "
"xref:administration:auth-methods-pam.adoc#auth-methods-pam-ad[]."
msgstr "ແກ້ໄຂ [path]``/etc/sssd/sssd.conf`` ຕາມການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງທ່ານ. ສຳລັບຕົວຢ່າງ, ເບິ່ງ xref:administration:auth-methods-pam.adoc#auth-methods-pam-ad[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:12
msgid "When done, exit the container:"
msgstr "ເມື່ອສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ອອກຈາກ container:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "exit\n"
msgstr "exit\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:14
msgid "Restart {productname} using:"
msgstr "ເລີ່ມການເຮັດວຽກຂອງ {productname} ໃໝ່ດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:15
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:43
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:29
#: modules/administration/pages/mirror-sources.adoc:9
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:34
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-salt-clients-down-and-dns.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm restart\n"
msgstr "mgradm restart\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:16
msgid ""
"Changing the password in the {productname} {webui} changes only the local "
"password on the {productname} Server.  If PAM is enabled for that user, the "
"local password might not be used at all.  In the above example, for "
"instance, the Kerberos password is not changed.  Use the password change "
"mechanism of your network service to change the password for these users."
msgstr "ການປ່ຽນລະຫັດຜ່ານໃນ {productname} {webui} ຈະປ່ຽນແປງພຽງແຕ່ລະຫັດຜ່ານພາຍໃນ (local) ໃນ {productname} Server ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ຫາກມີການເປີດໃຊ້ PAM ສຳລັບຜູ້ໃຊ້ນັ້ນ, ລະຫັດຜ່ານພາຍໃນອາດຈະບໍ່ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ເລີຍ. ຕົວຢ່າງຂ້າງເທິງ, ລະຫັດຜ່ານ Kerberos ຈະບໍ່ຖືກປ່ຽນແປງ. ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ກົນໄກການປ່ຽນລະຫັດຜ່ານຂອງບໍລິການເຄືອຂ່າຍຂອງທ່ານເພື່ອປ່ຽນລະຫັດຜ່ານສຳລັບຜູ້ໃຊ້ເຫຼົ່ານີ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:17
msgid ""
"For more information about PAM configuration, see the {sles} Security "
"Guide. The Security Guide contains a generic example that also works for "
"other network-based authentication methods.  It also describes how to "
"configure an Active Directory (AD) service.  For more information, see "
"{sles-base-os-documentation}/part-auth.html."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ PAM, ເບິ່ງ {sles} Security Guide. ໃນຄູ່ມືຄວາມປອດໄພຈະມີຕົວຢ່າງທົ່ວໄປທີ່ໃຊ້ໄດ້ກັບວິທີການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນຜ່ານເຄືອຂ່າຍອື່ນໆ. ມັນຍັງອະທິບາຍວິທີການຕັ້ງຄ່າບໍລິການ Active Directory (AD). ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງ {sles-base-os-documentation}/part-auth.html."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "LDAP Integration with Active Directory Example"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ LDAP ກັບ Active Directory"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:19
msgid ""
"For LDAP integration with Active Directory, you can use the following "
"example."
msgstr "ສຳລັບການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ LDAP ກັບ Active Directory, ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ຕົວຢ່າງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:20
msgid ""
"In the code snippet, change the following placeholders according to your "
"environment:"
msgstr "ໃນສ່ວນຂອງ Code, ໃຫ້ປ່ຽນຕົວແທນ (placeholders) ຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ຕາມສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຂອງທ່ານ:"

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "[literal]``$domain``"
msgstr "[literal]``$domain``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:22
msgid "Your domain name"
msgstr "ຊື່ໂດເມນຂອງທ່ານ"

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid "[literal]``$ad_server``"
msgstr "[literal]``$ad_server``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:24
msgid ""
"FQDN of the AD server if it is not auto-detected from the "
"[literal]``$domain`` [literal]``$uyuni-hostname``: The name of the machine "
"this AD client is supposed to be known.  If not set, it will be "
"[literal]``uyuni-server.mgr.internal``."
msgstr "FQDN ຂອງ AD server ຫາກລະບົບບໍ່ໄດ້ກວດພົບໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດຈາກ [literal]``$domain`` [literal]``$uyuni-hostname``: ຊື່ຂອງເຄື່ອງທີ່ໄຄລແອນ AD ນີ້ຈະຖືກຮູ້ຈັກ. ຫາກບໍ່ໄດ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າ, ມັນຈະເປັນ [literal]``uyuni-server.mgr.internal``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:25
msgid "Example snippet for [path]``/etc/sssd/sssd.conf``:"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ Code ສຳລັບ [path]``/etc/sssd/sssd.conf``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[sssd]\n"
"config_file_version = 2\n"
"services = nss, pam\n"
"domains = $domain\n"
msgstr ""
"[sssd]\n"
"config_file_version = 2\n"
"services = nss, pam\n"
"domains = $domain\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:27
#, no-wrap
msgid "[nss]\n"
msgstr "[nss]\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "[pam]\n"
msgstr "[pam]\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[domain/$domain]\n"
"id_provider = ad\n"
"chpass_provider = ad\n"
"access_provider = ad\n"
"auth_provider = ad\n"
msgstr ""
"[domain/$domain]\n"
"id_provider = ad\n"
"chpass_provider = ad\n"
"access_provider = ad\n"
"auth_provider = ad\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:30
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"ad_domain = $domain\n"
"ad_server = $ad_server\n"
"ad_hostname = $uyuni-hostname\n"
msgstr ""
"ad_domain = $domain\n"
"ad_server = $ad_server\n"
"ad_hostname = $uyuni-hostname\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:31
#, no-wrap
msgid "ad_gpo_map_network = +susemanager\n"
msgstr "ad_gpo_map_network = +susemanager\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:32
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"krb5_keytab = FILE:/etc/rhn/krb5.conf.d/krb5.keytab\n"
"krb5_ccname_template = FILE:/tmp/krb5cc_%{uid}\n"
msgstr ""
"krb5_keytab = FILE:/etc/rhn/krb5.conf.d/krb5.keytab\n"
"krb5_ccname_template = FILE:/tmp/krb5cc_%{uid}\n"

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example SSO Implementation"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງການຕິດຕັ້ງ SSO"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:2
msgid ""
"In this example, SSO is implemented by exposing three endpoints with "
"{productname}, and using Keycloak 21.0.1 or later as the identity service "
"provider (IdP)."
msgstr "ໃນຕົວຢ່າງນີ້, SSO ຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງໂດຍການເປີດ endpoint ສາມແຫ່ງດ້ວຍ {productname}, ແລະ ໃຊ້ Keycloak 21.0.1 ຫຼື ໃໝ່ກວ່າເປັນຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ (IdP)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Start by installing the Keycloak IdP, then setting up the {productname} "
"Server.  Then you can add the endpoints as Keycloak clients, and create "
"users."
msgstr "ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນດ້ວຍການຕິດຕັ້ງ Keycloak IdP, ຈາກນັ້ນຕັ້ງຄ່າ {productname} Server. ຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນທ່ານສາມາດເພີ່ມ endpoint ເປັນ Keycloak clients, ແລະ ສ້າງຜູ້ໃຊ້."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:4
msgid ""
"This example is provided for illustrative purposes only.  {suse} does not "
"recommend or support third-party identity service providers, and is not "
"affiliated with Keycloak.  For Keycloak support, see "
"https://www.keycloak.org/."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງນີ້ມີໄວ້ເພື່ອເປັນຕົວຢ່າງເທົ່ານັ້ນ. {suse} ບໍ່ໄດ້ແນະນຳ ຫຼື ຮອງຮັບຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນຈາກພາກສ່ວນທີສາມ, ແລະ ບໍ່ໄດ້ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບ Keycloak. ສຳລັບການສະໜັບສະໜູນ Keycloak, ເບິ່ງ https://www.keycloak.org/."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:5
msgid ""
"You can install Keycloak directly on your machine, or run it in a "
"container.  In this example, we run Keycloak in a Podman container.  For "
"more information about installing Keycloak, see the Keycloak documentation "
"at https://www.keycloak.org/guides#getting-started."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງ Keycloak ໂດຍກົງໃນເຄື່ອງຂອງທ່ານ, ຫຼື ລັນມັນໃນ container. ໃນຕົວຢ່າງນີ້, ພວກເຮົາລັນ Keycloak ໃນ Podman container. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການຕິດຕັ້ງ Keycloak, ເບິ່ງເອກະສານຂອງ Keycloak ທີ່ https://www.keycloak.org/guides#getting-started."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Setting Up the Identity Service Provider"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ (Identity Service Provider)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:7
msgid ""
"Install Keycloak in a Podman container, according to the Keycloak "
"documentation."
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງ Keycloak ໃນ Podman container ຕາມເອກະສານຂອງ Keycloak."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:8
msgid ""
"Run the container using the ``-td`` argument to ensure the process remains "
"running:"
msgstr "ລັນ container ໂດຍໃຊ້ argument ``-td`` ເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໂປຣເຊສຈະເຮັດວຽກຕໍ່ໄປ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"podman run -td --name keycloak -p 8080:8080 -e KEYCLOAK_USER=admin -e "
"KEYCLOAK_PASSWORD=admin quay.io/keycloak/keycloak:21.0.1\n"
msgstr "podman run -td --name keycloak -p 8080:8080 -e KEYCLOAK_USER=admin -e KEYCLOAK_PASSWORD=admin quay.io/keycloak/keycloak:21.0.1\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:10
msgid ""
"Sign in the Keycloak {webui} as the ``admin`` user, and create an "
"authentication realm using these details:"
msgstr "ເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ Keycloak {webui} ໃນນາມຜູ້ໃຊ້ ``admin``, ແລະ ສ້າງ authentication realm ໂດຍໃຊ້ລາຍລະອຽດເຫຼົ່ານີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:11
msgid "In the ``Name`` field, enter a name for the realm."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ ``Name``, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນຊື່ສຳລັບ realm."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:12
msgid "For example, ``SUMA``."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ, ``SUMA``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:13
msgid ""
"In the ``Endpoints`` field, click the ``SAML 2.0 Identity Provider "
"Metadata`` link."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ ``Endpoints``, ໃຫ້ຄລິກລິ້ງ ``SAML 2.0 Identity Provider Metadata``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:14
msgid ""
"This will lead you to a page where you will see the endpoints and "
"certificate to copy into the {productname} configuration file."
msgstr "ອັນນີ້ຈະນຳທ່ານໄປຫາໜ້າທີ່ທ່ານຈະເຫັນ endpoint ແລະ ໃບຮັບຮອງເພື່ອສຳເນົາລົງໃນໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງ {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:15
msgid ""
"When you have installed Keycloak and created the realm, you can prepare the "
"{productname} Server."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານຕິດຕັ້ງ Keycloak ແລະ ສ້າງ realm ແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດກຽມ {productname} Server ໄດ້."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Setting Up the {productname} Server"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ {productname} Server"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:17
msgid ""
"On the {productname} Server, open the [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`` "
"configuration file and edit these parameters."
msgstr "ທີ່ {productname} Server, ໃຫ້ເປີດໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`` ແລະ ແກ້ໄຂພາຣາມິເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:18
msgid ""
"Replace ``<FQDN_SUMA>`` with the fully qualified domain name of your "
"{productname} installation:"
msgstr "ປ່ຽນ ``<FQDN_SUMA>`` ດ້ວຍ fully qualified domain name ຂອງການຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} ຂອງທ່ານ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.sp.entityid                       = "
"https://<FQDN_SUMA>/rhn/manager/sso/metadata\n"
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.sp.assertion_consumer_service.url = "
"https://<FQDN_SUMA>/rhn/manager/sso/acs\n"
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.sp.single_logout_service.url      = "
"https://<FQDN_SUMA>/rhn/manager/sso/sls\n"
msgstr ""
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.sp.entityid                       = https://<FQDN_SUMA>/rhn/manager/sso/metadata\n"
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.sp.assertion_consumer_service.url = https://<FQDN_SUMA>/rhn/manager/sso/acs\n"
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.sp.single_logout_service.url      = https://<FQDN_SUMA>/rhn/manager/sso/sls\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:20
msgid ""
"In the configuration file, replace ``<FQDN_IDP>`` with the fully qualified "
"domain name of your Keycloak server."
msgstr "ໃນໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ, ໃຫ້ປ່ຽນ ``<FQDN_IDP>`` ເປັນຊື່ໂດເມນ (FQDN) ຂອງເຊີເວີ Keycloak ຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:21
msgid "Replace ``<REALM>`` with your authentication realm, for example ``SUMA``:"
msgstr "ປ່ຽນ ``<REALM>`` ດ້ວຍ authentication realm ຂອງທ່ານ, ຕົວຢ່າງ ``SUMA``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.idp.entityid                   = "
"http://<FQDN_IDP>:8080/realms/<REALM>\n"
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.idp.single_sign_on_service.url = "
"http://<FQDN_IDP>:8080/realms/<REALM>/protocol/saml\n"
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.idp.single_logout_service.url  = "
"http://<FQDN_IDP>:8080/realms/<REALM>/protocol/saml\n"
msgstr ""
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.idp.entityid                   = http://<FQDN_IDP>:8080/realms/<REALM>\n"
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.idp.single_sign_on_service.url = http://<FQDN_IDP>:8080/realms/<REALM>/protocol/saml\n"
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.idp.single_logout_service.url  = http://<FQDN_IDP>:8080/realms/<REALM>/protocol/saml\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:23
msgid "In the IdP metadata, locate the public x509 certificate."
msgstr "ໃນ IdP metadata, ໃຫ້ຊອກຫາໃບຮັບຮອງສາທາລະນະ x509."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:24
msgid ""
"It uses this format: "
"``http://<FQDN_IDP>:8080/realms/<REALM>/protocol/saml/descriptor``.  In the "
"configuration file, specify the public x509 certificate of the IdP:"
msgstr "ມັນໃຊ້ຮູບແບບນີ້: ``http://<FQDN_IDP>:8080/realms/<REALM>/protocol/saml/descriptor``. ໃນໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ, ໃຫ້ລະບຸໃບຮັບຮອງສາທາລະນະ x509 ຂອງ IdP:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.idp.x509cert = -----BEGIN CERTIFICATE----- "
"<CERTIFICATE>  -----END CERTIFICATE-----\n"
msgstr "java.sso.onelogin.saml2.idp.x509cert = -----BEGIN CERTIFICATE----- <CERTIFICATE>  -----END CERTIFICATE-----\n"

#. +
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:26
msgid ""
"Here is an example of [path]``rhn.conf`` on {productname} after enabling "
"SSO:"
msgstr "ນີ້ແມ່ນຕົວຢ່າງຂອງ [path]``rhn.conf`` ໃນ {productname} ຫຼັງຈາກເປີດໃຊ້ SSO:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:27
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:35
#, no-wrap
msgid "java.sso = true\n"
msgstr "java.sso = true\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# This is the configuration file for Single Sign-On (SSO) via SAMLv2 "
"protocol\n"
"# To enable SSO, set java.sso = true in /etc/rhn/rhn.conf\n"
"#\n"
"# Mandatory changes: search this file for:\n"
"# - YOUR-PRODUCT\n"
"# - YOUR-IDP-ENTITY\n"
"#\n"
"# See product documentation and the comments inline in this file for more\n"
"# information about every parameter.\n"
"#\n"
"#\n"
"#\n"
"#\n"
"# If 'strict' is True, then the Java Toolkit will reject unsigned\n"
"# or unencrypted messages if it expects them signed or encrypted\n"
"# Also will reject the messages if not strictly follow the SAML\n"
"#\n"
"# WARNING: In production, this parameter setting parameter MUST be set as "
"\"true\".\n"
"# Otherwise your environment is not secure and will be exposed to attacks.\n"
"# Enable debug mode (to print errors)\n"
"# Identifier of the SP entity (must be a URI)\n"
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.sp.entityid = "
"https://sumaserver.example.org/rhn/manager/sso/metadata\n"
msgstr ""
"# ນີ້ແມ່ນໄຟລ໌ກຳນົດຄ່າສຳລັບ Single Sign-On (SSO) ຜ່ານໂປຣໂຕຄໍ SAMLv2\n"
"# ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ SSO, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າ java.sso = true ໃນ /etc/rhn/rhn.conf\n"
"#\n"
"# ການປ່ຽນແປງທີ່ຈຳເປັນ: ຄົ້ນຫາໄຟລ໌ນີ້ສຳລັບ:\n"
"# - YOUR-PRODUCT\n"
"# - YOUR-IDP-ENTITY\n"
"#\n"
"# ເບິ່ງເອກະສານຜະລິດຕະພັນ ແລະ ຄຳເຫັນພາຍໃນໄຟລ໌ນີ້ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ\n"
"# ກ່ຽວກັບແຕ່ລະພາຣາມິເຕີ.\n"
"#\n"
"#\n"
"#\n"
"#\n"
"# ຖ້າ 'strict' ເປັນ True, Java Toolkit ຈະປະຕິເສດຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ເຊັນ\n"
"# ຫຼື ບໍ່ໄດ້ເຂົ້າລະຫັດ ຖ້າມັນຄາດຫວັງໃຫ້ມີການເຊັນ ຫຼື ເຂົ້າລະຫັດ\n"
"# ແລະ ຈະປະຕິເສດຂໍ້ຄວາມຖ້າບໍ່ປະຕິບັດຕາມ SAML ຢ່າງເຄັ່ງຄັດ\n"
"#\n"
"# ຄຳເຕືອນ: ໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມການໃຊ້ງານຈິງ, ພາຣາມິເຕີນີ້ຕ້ອງຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າເປັນ \"true\".\n"
"# ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ ສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຂອງທ່ານຈະບໍ່ປອດໄພ ແລະ ສ່ຽງຕໍ່ການຖືກໂຈມຕີ.\n"
"# ເປີດໂໝດ debug (ເພື່ອສະແດງຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ)\n"
"# ຕົວລະບຸຂອງ SP entity (ຕ້ອງເປັນ URI)\n"
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.sp.entityid = https://sumaserver.example.org/rhn/manager/sso/metadata\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# Specifies info about where and how the <AuthnResponse> message MUST be\n"
"# returned to the requester, in this case our SP.\n"
"# URL Location where the <Response> from the IdP will be returned\n"
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.sp.assertion_consumer_service.url = "
"https://sumaserver.example.org/rhn/manager/sso/acs\n"
msgstr ""
"# ລະບຸຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບບ່ອນໃດ ແລະ ວິທີການທີ່ຂໍ້ຄວາມ <AuthnResponse> ຕ້ອງຖືກ\n"
"# ສົ່ງກັບຄືນໄປຫາຜູ້ຮ້ອງຂໍ, ໃນກໍລະນີນີ້ແມ່ນ SP ຂອງພວກເຮົາ.\n"
"# ຕຳແໜ່ງ URL ບ່ອນທີ່ <Response> ຈາກ IdP ຈະຖືກສົ່ງກັບຄືນມາ\n"
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.sp.assertion_consumer_service.url = https://sumaserver.example.org/rhn/manager/sso/acs\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:30
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# Specifies info about where and how the <Logout Response> message MUST be\n"
"# returned to the requester, in this case our SP.\n"
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.sp.single_logout_service.url = "
"https://sumaserver.example.org/rhn/manager/sso/sls\n"
msgstr ""
"# ລະບຸຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບບ່ອນໃດ ແລະ ວິທີການທີ່ຂໍ້ຄວາມ <Logout Response> ຕ້ອງຖືກ\n"
"# ສົ່ງກັບຄືນໄປຫາຜູ້ຮ້ອງຂໍ, ໃນກໍລະນີນີ້ແມ່ນ SP ຂອງພວກເຮົາ.\n"
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.sp.single_logout_service.url = https://sumaserver.example.org/rhn/manager/sso/sls\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:31
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# Identifier of the IdP entity (must be a URI)\n"
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.idp.entityid = "
"http://idp.example.org:8080/realms/SUMA\n"
msgstr ""
"# ຕົວລະບຸຂອງ IdP entity (ຕ້ອງເປັນ URI)\n"
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.idp.entityid = http://idp.example.org:8080/realms/SUMA\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:32
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# SSO endpoint info of the IdP. (Authentication Request protocol)\n"
"# URL Target of the IdP where the SP will send the Authentication Request "
"Message\n"
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.idp.single_sign_on_service.url = "
"http://idp.example.org:8080/realms/SUMA/protocol/saml\n"
msgstr ""
"# ຂໍ້ມູນ SSO endpoint ຂອງ IdP. (ໂປຣໂຕຄໍການຮ້ອງຂໍຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ)\n"
"# URL ເປົ້າໝາຍຂອງ IdP ບ່ອນທີ່ SP ຈະສົ່ງຂໍ້ຄວາມຮ້ອງຂໍການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນໄປໃຫ້\n"
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.idp.single_sign_on_service.url = http://idp.example.org:8080/realms/SUMA/protocol/saml\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:33
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# SLO endpoint info of the IdP.\n"
"# URL Location of the IdP where the SP will send the SLO Request\n"
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.idp.single_logout_service.url = "
"http://idp.example.org:8080/realms/SUMA/protocol/saml\n"
msgstr ""
"# ຂໍ້ມູນ SLO endpoint ຂອງ IdP.\n"
"# ຕຳແໜ່ງ URL ຂອງ IdP ບ່ອນທີ່ SP ຈະສົ່ງ SLO Request ໄປໃຫ້\n"
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.idp.single_logout_service.url = http://idp.example.org:8080/realms/SUMA/protocol/saml\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:34
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# Public x509 certificate of the IdP\n"
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.idp.x509cert = -----BEGIN CERTIFICATE----- "
"MIIClzCCAX8CBgGC+tPbVjANBgkqhkiG9w0BAQsFADAPMQ0wCwYDVQQDDARTVU1BMB4XDTIyMDkwMTIwNTEwNFoXDTMyMDkwMTIwNTI0NFowDzENMAsG\n"
"A1UEAwwEU1VNQTCCASIwDQYJKoZIhvcNAQEBBQADggEPADCCAQoCggEBAMNSWJAalB5mShTkMBO5mrsOosyheEL8/A37WvuqDPwwEfm4x0cG7gmMHvONxYXZk+LRyzoQl2sBrNFrbMuwu5dnah5ZSMxQyUu697S280m4vIiegGaFdbgH+g4FGBu\n"
"eSis1ssMzTcES+NUuI7pLkMLNmSQtncESnoL9q2SyeQSwYtr5dz1ydl6IzjwtaWeyQ9EGJNtJtLk3U4+arLPCpHAwqFAnLO9NeYcRDNUKhNBs1v5mHP+L066PZu1/DkE0mSgy/+qXaS0CgZVKqz8qB+bvHVuAq9W60g1CjqZKbwvPu72p/7+d8z\n"
"9DxXPIZ1uxdqn19q/kLEP2TYLtgQobSHECAwEAATANBgkqhkiG9w0BAQsFAAOCAQEAga+raLMJDo/P/yN1Z6SGGocK227WFqovBiE/mLYlp5Ff0+0jS1US1plSppJ94xOr8j0m7HW0Wu5xCz6oOhzXTEtnfIbeRyr1Rms3BWdxyXgQ9bWUeZMWZ\n"
"HfDkTbhgRRmjDEwSSfEXRKQNvw41CpnlB36I0++ejgGnjDvH7BbkCaoW55JF5j6DT/WYR0n7MkEl2Ova9CH0e9X7Gny8iOAg26oziy06uy3P/lx9Z9RmHnvpvN/Q34SGEq9z/HlQVuP12UPj//iT21Jc17OOZFsZQXlGFTG6bXKmO42W8FdUDJU\n"
"ONoXZgjMb3eC7U691YyeowoqTY7mJKxNPprYY/lL0w== -----END CERTIFICATE-----\n"
msgstr ""
"# Public x509 certificate ຂອງ IdP\n"
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.idp.x509cert = -----BEGIN CERTIFICATE----- MIIClzCCAX8CBgGC+tPbVjANBgkqhkiG9w0BAQsFADAPMQ0wCwYDVQQDDARTVU1BMB4XDTIyMDkwMTIwNTEwNFoXDTMyMDkwMTIwNTI0NFowDzENMAsG\n"
" -----END CERTIFICATE-----\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:35
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# Organization\n"
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.organization.name = SUSE Manager admin\n"
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.organization.displayname = SUSE Manager admin\n"
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.organization.url = https://sumaserver.example.org\n"
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.organization.lang =\n"
msgstr ""
"# ອົງກອນ\n"
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.organization.name = SUSE Manager admin\n"
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.organization.displayname = SUSE Manager admin\n"
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.organization.url = https://sumaserver.example.org\n"
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.organization.lang =\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:36
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# Contacts\n"
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.contacts.technical.given_name = SUSE Manager admin\n"
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.contacts.technical.email_address = "
"suma@example.org\n"
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.contacts.support.given_name = SUSE Manager admin\n"
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.contacts.support.email_address = suma@example.org\n"
msgstr ""
"# ຜູ້ຕິດຕໍ່\n"
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.contacts.technical.given_name = SUSE Manager admin\n"
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.contacts.technical.email_address = suma@example.org\n"
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.contacts.support.given_name = SUSE Manager admin\n"
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.contacts.support.email_address = suma@example.org\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:37
msgid ""
"You can add the {productname} endpoints to Keycloak.  Keycloak refers to "
"endpoints as clients."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດເພີ່ມ {productname} endpoints ເຂົ້າໃນ Keycloak. Keycloak ເອີ້ນ endpoint ວ່າ clients."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:38
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Adding Endpoints as Clients"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການເພີ່ມ Endpoints ເປັນ Clients"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:39
msgid "In the Keycloak {webui}, create a new client using these details:"
msgstr "ໃນ Keycloak {webui}, ໃຫ້ສ້າງ client ໃໝ່ໂດຍໃຊ້ລາຍລະອຽດເຫຼົ່ານີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:40
msgid "In the ``Client type`` field, select ``SAML``."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ ``Client type``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ ``SAML``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:41
msgid ""
"In the ``Client ID`` field, enter the endpoint specified in the server "
"configuration file as ``java.sso.onelogin.saml2.idp.entityid``."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ ``Client ID``, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນ endpoint ທີ່ລະບຸໃນໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າເຊີເວີເປັນ ``java.sso.onelogin.saml2.idp.entityid``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:42
msgid "For example, ``https://<FQDN_SUMA>/rhn/manager/sso/metadata``."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ, ``https://<FQDN_SUMA>/rhn/manager/sso/metadata``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:43
msgid "In the ``Settings`` tab, fine-tune the client using these details:"
msgstr "ໃນແທັບ ``Settings``, ໃຫ້ປັບແຕ່ງ client ໂດຍໃຊ້ລາຍລະອຽດເຫຼົ່ານີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:44
msgid "Toggle the ``Sign assertions`` switch to ``On``."
msgstr "ເປີດສະວິດ ``Sign assertions`` ເປັນ ``On``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:45
msgid "In the ``Signature algorithm`` field, select ``RSA_SHA1``."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ ``Signature algorithm``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ ``RSA_SHA1``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:46
msgid "In the ``SAML Signature Key Name`` field, select ``Key ID``."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ ``SAML Signature Key Name``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ ``Key ID``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:47
msgid "In the ``Keys`` tab:"
msgstr "ໃນແທັບ ``Keys``:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:48
msgid "Set ``Client signature required`` to ``Off``."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ ``Client signature required`` ເປັນ ``Off``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:49
msgid ""
"In the ``Advanced`` tab, in the ``Fine Grain SAML Endpoint Configuration`` "
"section, add the two endpoints using these details:"
msgstr "ໃນແທັບ ``Advanced``, ໃນພາກສ່ວນ ``Fine Grain SAML Endpoint Configuration``, ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມສອງ endpoint ໂດຍໃຊ້ລາຍລະອຽດເຫຼົ່ານີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:50
msgid ""
"In both the ``Assertion Consumer Service`` fields, enter the endpoint "
"specified in the server configuration file as "
"``java.sso.onelogin.saml2.sp.assertion_consumer_service.url``."
msgstr "ໃນທັງສອງຊ່ອງ ``Assertion Consumer Service``, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນ endpoint ທີ່ລະບຸໃນໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າເຊີເວີເປັນ ``java.sso.onelogin.saml2.sp.assertion_consumer_service.url``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:51
msgid "For example, ``https://<FQDN_SUMA>/rhn/manager/sso/acs``."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ, ``https://<FQDN_SUMA>/rhn/manager/sso/acs``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:52
msgid ""
"In both the ``Logout Service`` fields, enter the endpoint specified in the "
"server configuration file as "
"``java.sso.onelogin.saml2.sp.single_logout_service.url``."
msgstr "ໃນທັງສອງຊ່ອງ ``Logout Service``, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນ endpoint ທີ່ລະບຸໃນໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າເຊີເວີເປັນ ``java.sso.onelogin.saml2.sp.single_logout_service.url``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:53
msgid "For example, ``https://<FQDN_SUMA>/rhn/manager/sso/sls``."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ, ``https://<FQDN_SUMA>/rhn/manager/sso/sls``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:54
msgid ""
"When you have added the endpoints as clients, you can configure the client "
"scope, and map the users between Keycloak and {productname}."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານເພີ່ມ endpoint ເປັນ client ແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າ client scope, ແລະ ຈັບຄູ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ລະຫວ່າງ Keycloak ແລະ {productname}."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:55
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Configuring Client Scope and Mappers"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ Client Scope ແລະ Mappers"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:56
msgid ""
"In the Keycloak {webui}, navigate to the menu:Clients[Client scopes] tab and "
"assign ``role_list`` as the default client scope."
msgstr "ໃນ Keycloak {webui}, ໄປທີ່ແທັບ menu:Clients[Client scopes] ແລະ ກຳນົດ ``role_list`` ເປັນ client scope ມາດຕະຖານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:57
msgid ""
"Navigate to the menu:Client_scopes[Mappers] tab and add a mapper for user "
"attribute ``uid``, using the default values."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ແທັບ menu:Client_scopes[Mappers] ແລະ ເເພີ່ມ mapper ສຳລັບ attribute ຜູ້ໃຊ້ ``uid``, ໂດຍໃຊ້ຄ່າມາດຕະຖານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:58
msgid "This SAML attribute is expected by {productname}."
msgstr "attribute SAML ນີ້ແມ່ນສິ່ງທີ່ {productname} ຕ້ອງການ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:59
msgid ""
"Navigate to the menu:Client_scopes[Mappers] and click on ``role_list`` "
"mapper. Set ``Single Role Attribute`` to ``On``."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ menu:Client_scopes[Mappers] ແລະ ຄລິກໃສ່ mapper ``role_list``. ຕັ້ງຄ່າ ``Single Role Attribute`` ເປັນ ``On``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:60
msgid "Navigate to the menu:Users[Admin] section and create an administrative user."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ພາກສ່ວນ menu:Users[Admin] ແລະ ສ້າງຜູ້ໃຊ້ລະດັບຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:61
msgid "This user does not need to match the {productname} administrative user."
msgstr "ຜູ້ໃຊ້ນີ້ບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງກົງກັບຜູ້ໃຊ້ລະດັບຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບຂອງ {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:62
msgid ""
"Navigate to the menu:Users[Role mappings] tab, add an attribute named "
"``uid`` with a value that matches the username of the {productname} "
"administrative user."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ແທັບ menu:Users[Role mappings], ເພີ່ມ attribute ຊື່ວ່າ ``uid`` ໂດຍມີຄ່າທີ່ກົງກັບຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ (username) ຂອງຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບ {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:63
msgid ""
"Navigate to the menu:Users[Credentials] tab, and set the same password as "
"used by the {productname} administrative user."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ແທັບ menu:Users[Credentials], ແລະ ຕັ້ງລະຫັດຜ່ານອັນດຽວກັນກັບທີ່ຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບ {productname} ໃຊ້."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:64
#, no-wrap
msgid " Save your changes."
msgstr " ບັນທຶກການປ່ຽນແປງຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:65
msgid ""
"When you have completed the configuration, you can test that the "
"installation is working as expected.  Restart the {productname} Server to "
"pick up your changes, and navigate to the {productname} {webui}.  If your "
"installation is working correctly, you are redirected to the Keycloak SSO "
"page, where you can authenticate successfully."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານຕັ້ງຄ່າສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດທົດສອບໄດ້ວ່າການຕິດຕັ້ງເຮັດວຽກຕາມທີ່ຄາດໄວ້ຫຼືບໍ່. ໃຫ້ເລີ່ມການເຮັດວຽກຂອງ {productname} Server ໃໝ່ເພື່ອໃຫ້ການປ່ຽນແປງມີຜົນ, ແລະ ໄປທີ່ {productname} {webui}. ຫາກການຕິດຕັ້ງຂອງທ່ານຖືກຕ້ອງ, ທ່ານຈະຖືກປ່ຽນເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາໜ້າ Keycloak SSO, ເຊິ່ງທ່ານສາມາດຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນໄດ້ສຳເລັດ."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Authentication With Single Sign-On (SSO)"
msgstr "ການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນດ້ວຍ Single Sign-On (SSO)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:2
msgid ""
"{productname} supports single sign-on (SSO) by implementing the Security "
"Assertion Markup Language (SAML){nbsp}2 protocol."
msgstr "{productname} ຮອງຮັບ Single Sign-On (SSO) ໂດຍການຕິດຕັ້ງໂປຣໂຕຄໍ Security Assertion Markup Language (SAML){nbsp}2."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Single sign-on is an authentication process that allows a user to access "
"multiple applications with one set of credentials.  SAML is an XML-based "
"standard for exchanging authentication and authorization data.  A SAML "
"identity service provider (IdP) provides authentication and authorization "
"services to service providers (SP), such as {productname}.  {productname} "
"exposes three endpoints which must be enabled for single sign-on."
msgstr "ການລົງຊື່ເຂົ້າໃຊ້ຄັ້ງດຽວ (Single sign-on) ແມ່ນຂະບວນການກວດສອບສິດທີ່ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ເຂົ້າເຖິງຫຼາຍແອັບພລິເຄຊັນດ້ວຍຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວຊຸດດຽວ. SAML ແມ່ນມາດຕະຖານທີ່ອີງໃສ່ XML ສຳລັບການແລກປ່ຽນຂໍ້ມູນການກວດສອບສິດ ແລະ ການອະນຸຍາດ. ຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການລະບຸຕົວຕົນ SAML (IdP) ໃຫ້ບໍລິການກວດສອບສິດ ແລະ ການອະນຸຍາດແກ່ຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການ (SP) ເຊັ່ນ {productname}. {productname} ເປີດເຜີຍສາມຈຸດເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ (endpoints) ເຊິ່ງຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການເປີດນຳໃຊ້ສຳລັບການລົງຊື່ເຂົ້າໃຊ້ຄັ້ງດຽວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:4
msgid "SSO in {productname} supports:"
msgstr "SSO ໃນ {productname} ຮອງຮັບ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:5
msgid "Log in with SSO."
msgstr "ເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບດ້ວຍ SSO."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:6
msgid ""
"Log out with service provider-initiated single logout (SLO), and Identity "
"service provider single logout service (SLS)."
msgstr "ອອກຈາກລະບົບດ້ວຍການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຈາກຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການ (SLO) ແລະ ບໍລິການອອກຈາກລະບົບຄັ້ງດຽວ (SLS) ຂອງຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການລະບຸຕົວຕົນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:7
msgid "Assertion and nameId encryption."
msgstr "ການເຂົ້າລະຫັດ Assertion ແລະ nameId."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:8
msgid "Assertion signatures."
msgstr "ລາຍເຊັນ Assertion."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:9
msgid "Message signatures with AuthNRequest, LogoutRequest, and LogoutResponses."
msgstr "ລາຍເຊັນຂໍ້ຄວາມດ້ວຍ AuthNRequest, LogoutRequest, ແລະ LogoutResponses."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:10
msgid "Enable an Assertion consumer service endpoint."
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ຈຸດເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ (endpoint) ຂອງບໍລິການ Assertion consumer."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:11
msgid "Enable a single logout service endpoint."
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ຈຸດເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ (endpoint) ຂອງບໍລິການອອກຈາກລະບົບຄັ້ງດຽວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:12
msgid "Publish the SP metadata (which can be signed)."
msgstr "ເຜີຍແຜ່ຂໍ້ມູນ Metadata ຂອງ SP (ເຊິ່ງສາມາດເຊັນກຳກັບໄດ້)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:13
msgid "SSO in {productname} does not support:"
msgstr "SSO ໃນ {productname} ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:14
msgid "Product choosing and implementation for the identity service provider (IdP)."
msgstr "ການເລືອກຜະລິດຕະພັນ ແລະ ການຕິດຕັ້ງສຳລັບຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການລະບຸຕົວຕົນ (IdP)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:15
msgid ""
"SAML support for other products (check with the respective product "
"documentation)."
msgstr "ການຮອງຮັບ SAML ສຳລັບຜະລິດຕະພັນອື່ນໆ (ກະລຸນາກວດເບິ່ງເອກະສານຂອງຜະລິດຕະພັນນັ້ນໆ)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:16
msgid ""
"For an example implementation of SSO, see "
"xref:administration:auth-methods-sso-example.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຕົວຢ່າງການຕິດຕັ້ງ SSO, ເບິ່ງ xref:administration:auth-methods-sso-example.adoc[]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:17
msgid ""
"If you change from the default authentication method to single sign-on, the "
"new SSO credentials apply only to the {webui}.  Client tools such as "
"``mgr-sync`` or ``spacecmd`` continue to work with the default "
"authentication method only."
msgstr "ຫາກເຈົ້າປ່ຽນຈາກວິທີການກວດສອບສິດແບບເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໄປເປັນການລົງຊື່ເຂົ້າໃຊ້ຄັ້ງດຽວ, ຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວ SSO ໃໝ່ຈະນຳໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະກັບ {webui} ເທົັ້ນັ້ນ. ເຄື່ອງມືຝັ່ງລູກຂ່າຍ ເຊັ່ນ ``mgr-sync`` ຫຼື ``spacecmd`` ຈະຍັງຄົງເຮັດວຽກກັບວິທີການກວດສອບສິດແບບເລີ່ມຕົ້ນເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr "ເງື່ອນໄຂເບື້ອງຕົ້ນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:19
msgid ""
"Before you begin, you need to have configured an external identity service "
"provider with these parameters.  Check your IdP documentation for "
"instructions."
msgstr "ກ່ອນທີ່ເຈົ້າຈະເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງໄດ້ກຳນົດຄ່າຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການລະບຸຕົວຕົນພາຍນອກດ້ວຍພາຣາມິເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້. ກວດເບິ່ງເອກະສານ IdP ຂອງເຈົ້າສຳລັບຄຳແນະນຳ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:20
msgid ""
"The mapping between the IdP user and the {productname} user is specified in "
"a SAML:Attribute.  The SAML:Attribute must be configured in the IdP and must "
"be passed to {productname} in the SAML authentication.  The attribute must "
"be named ``uid`` and must contain the {productname} user mapped to it after "
"login.  The {productname} must be created before you activate single "
"sign-on."
msgstr "ການຈັບຄູ່ລະຫວ່າງຜູ້ໃຊ້ IdP ແລະ ຜູ້ໃຊ້ {productname} ແມ່ນຖືກລະບຸໄວ້ໃນ SAML:Attribute. SAML:Attribute ຕ້ອງຖືກກຳນົດຄ່າໃນ IdP ແລະ ຕ້ອງຖືກສົ່ງໄປຍັງ {productname} ໃນການກວດສອບສິດ SAML. ຄຸນລັກສະນະ (attribute) ຕ້ອງມີຊື່ວ່າ ``uid`` ແລະ ຕ້ອງມີຜູ້ໃຊ້ {productname} ທີ່ຖືກຈັບຄູ່ໄວ້ຫຼັງຈາກເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ. ຕ້ອງສ້າງຜູ້ໃຊ້ໃນ {productname} ກ່ອນທີ່ເຈົ້າຈະເປີດໃຊ້ການລົງຊື່ເຂົ້າໃຊ້ຄັ້ງດຽວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:21
msgid "You need these endpoints:"
msgstr "ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການຈຸດເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ (endpoints) ເຫຼົ່ານີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:22
msgid ""
"Assertion consumer service (or ACS): an endpoint to accept SAML messages to "
"establish a session into the Service Provider."
msgstr "Assertion consumer service (ຫຼື ACS): ຈຸດເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ເພື່ອຮັບຂໍ້ຄວາມ SAML ເພື່ອສ້າງເຊດຊັນເຂົ້າໃນຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:23
msgid ""
"The endpoint for ACS in {productname} is: "
"https://server.example.com/rhn/manager/sso/acs"
msgstr "ຈຸດເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ສຳລັບ ACS ໃນ {productname} ແມ່ນ: https://server.example.com/rhn/manager/sso/acs"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:24
msgid ""
"Single logout service (or SLS): an endpoint to initiate a logout request "
"from the IdP."
msgstr "ບໍລິການອອກຈາກລະບົບຄັ້ງດຽວ (ຫຼື SLS): ຈຸດເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ເພື່ອເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຄຳຮ້ອງຂໍອອກຈາກລະບົບຈາກ IdP."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:25
msgid ""
"The endpoint for SLS in {productname} is: "
"https://server.example.com/rhn/manager/sso/sls"
msgstr "ຈຸດເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ສຳລັບ SLS ໃນ {productname} ແມ່ນ: https://server.example.com/rhn/manager/sso/sls"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:26
msgid "Metadata: an endpoint to retrieve {productname} metadata for SAML."
msgstr "Metadata: ຈຸດເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ເພື່ອດຶງຂໍ້ມູນ metadata ຂອງ {productname} ສຳລັບ SAML."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:27
msgid ""
"The endpoint for metadata in {productname} is: "
"https://server.example.com/rhn/manager/sso/metadata"
msgstr "ຈຸດເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ສຳລັບ metadata ໃນ {productname} ແມ່ນ: https://server.example.com/rhn/manager/sso/metadata"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:28
msgid ""
"After the authentication with the IdP using the user ``orgadmin`` is "
"successful, you are logged in to {productname} as the ``orgadmin`` user, "
"provided that the ``orgadmin`` user exists in {productname}."
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກການກວດສອບສິດກັບ IdP ໂດຍໃຊ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ ``orgadmin`` ສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ເຈົ້າຈະຖືກເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ {productname} ໃນຖານະຜູ້ໃຊ້ ``orgadmin``, ໂດຍມີເງື່ອນໄຂວ່າຜູ້ໃຊ້ ``orgadmin`` ຕ້ອງມີຢູ່ໃນ {productname} ແລ້ວ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid "Enable SSO"
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ SSO"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:30
msgid ""
"Using SSO is mutually exclusive with other types of authentication: it is "
"either enabled or disabled.  SSO is disabled by default."
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ SSO ແມ່ນບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບການກວດສອບສິດປະເພດອື່ນໄດ້: ມັນຈະຖືກເປີດ ຫຼື ປິດຢ່າງໃດຢ່າງໜຶ່ງ. ໂດຍປົກກະຕິ SSO ແມ່ນຖືກປິດໄວ້."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:31
#: modules/administration/pages/iss_v2.adoc:7
#: modules/administration/pages/mirror-sources.adoc:4
#: modules/administration/pages/reports.adoc:5
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-delclients.adoc:2
#: modules/administration/pages/tuning-changelogs.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Use [literal]``mgrctl term`` before running steps inside the server "
"container."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ [literal]``mgrctl term`` ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະດຳເນີນຂັ້ນຕອນຕ່າງໆ ພາຍໃນຄອນເທນເນີຂອງເຊີເວີ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:32
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Enabling SSO"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການເປີດໃຊ້ SSO"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:33
msgid "If your users do not yet exist in {productname}, create them first."
msgstr "ຫາກຜູ້ໃຊ້ຂອງເຈົ້າຍັງບໍ່ມີຢູ່ໃນ {productname}, ໃຫ້ສ້າງພວກເຂົາກ່ອນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:34
msgid "Edit [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`` and add this line at the end of the file:"
msgstr "ແກ້ໄຂ [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`` ແລະ ເພີ່ມແຖວນີ້ໃສ່ທ້າຍໄຟລ໌:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:36
msgid ""
"Find the parameters you want to customize in "
"[path]``/usr/share/rhn/config-defaults/rhn_java_sso.conf``."
msgstr "ຄົ້ນຫາພາຣາມິເຕີທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການປັບແຕ່ງໃນ [path]``/usr/share/rhn/config-defaults/rhn_java_sso.conf``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:37
msgid ""
"Insert the parameters you want to customize into [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`` "
"and prefix them with [literal]``java.sso``.  For example, in "
"[path]``/usr/share/rhn/config-defaults/rhn_java_sso.conf`` find:"
msgstr "ໃສ່ພາຣາມິເຕີທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການປັບແຕ່ງລົງໃນ [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`` ແລະ ຕື່ມໜ້າດ້ວຍ [literal]``java.sso``. ຕົວຢ່າງ, ໃນ [path]``/usr/share/rhn/config-defaults/rhn_java_sso.conf`` ຄົ້ນຫາ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:38
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"onelogin.saml2.sp.assertion_consumer_service.url = "
"https://YOUR-PRODUCT-HOSTNAME-OR-IP/rhn/manager/sso/acs\n"
msgstr "onelogin.saml2.sp.assertion_consumer_service.url = https://YOUR-PRODUCT-HOSTNAME-OR-IP/rhn/manager/sso/acs\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:39
msgid ""
"To customize it, create the corresponding option in "
"[path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`` by prefixing the option name with ``java.sso.``:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອປັບແຕ່ງມັນ, ໃຫ້ສ້າງຕົວເລືອກທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງໃນ [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`` ໂດຍການຕື່ມໜ້າຊື່ຕົວເລືອກດ້ວຍ ``java.sso.``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:40
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.sp.assertion_consumer_service.url = "
"https://YOUR-PRODUCT-HOSTNAME-OR-IP/rhn/manager/sso/acs\n"
msgstr "java.sso.onelogin.saml2.sp.assertion_consumer_service.url = https://YOUR-PRODUCT-HOSTNAME-OR-IP/rhn/manager/sso/acs\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:41
msgid ""
"To find all the occurrences you need to change, search in the file for the "
"placeholders [literal]``YOUR-PRODUCT`` and [literal]``YOUR-IDP-ENTITY``.  "
"Every parameter comes with a brief explanation of what it is meant for."
msgstr "ເພື່ອຄົ້ນຫາຈຸດທັງໝົດທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງປ່ຽນ, ໃຫ້ຄົ້ນຫາໃນໄຟລ໌ສຳລັບຕົວແທນ [literal]``YOUR-PRODUCT`` ແລະ [literal]``YOUR-IDP-ENTITY``. ທຸກໆພາຣາມິເຕີຈະມາພ້ອມກັບຄຳອະທິບາຍສັ້ນໆ ກ່ຽວກັບຈຸດປະສົງຂອງມັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:42
msgid "Restart the spacewalk service to pick up the changes:"
msgstr "ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນການບໍລິການ spacewalk ໃໝ່ເພື່ອໃຫ້ການປ່ຽນແປງມີຜົນ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:44
msgid ""
"When you visit the {productname} URL, you are redirected to the IdP for SSO "
"where you are requested to authenticate.  Upon successful authentication, "
"you are redirected to the {productname} {webui}, logged in as the "
"authenticated user.  If you encounter problems with logging in using SSO, "
"check the {productname} logs for more information."
msgstr "ເມື່ອເຈົ້າເຂົ້າໄປທີ່ URL ຂອງ {productname}, ເຈົ້າຈະຖືກປ່ຽນເສັ້ນທາງໄປຍັງ IdP ສຳລັບ SSO ເພື່ອກວດສອບສິດ. ເມື່ອກວດສອບສິດສຳເລັດ, ເຈົ້າຈະຖືກປ່ຽນເສັ້ນທາງກັບຄືນໄປຍັງ {productname} {webui} ໃນຖານະຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບການກວດສອບແລ້ວ. ຫາກເຈົ້າພົບບັນຫາໃນການເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບດ້ວຍ SSO, ໃຫ້ກວດເບິ່ງ log ຂອງ {productname} ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Authentication Methods"
msgstr "ວິທີການກວດສອບສິດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods.adoc:2
msgid ""
"{productname} supports several different authentication methods.  This "
"section discusses pluggable authentication modules (PAM) and single sign-on "
"(SSO)."
msgstr "{productname} ຮອງຮັບວິທີການກວດສອບສິດທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນຫຼາຍວິທີ. ສ່ວນນີ້ຈະເວົ້າເຖິງ pluggable authentication modules (PAM) ແລະ ການລົງຊື່ເຂົ້າໃຊ້ຄັ້ງດຽວ (SSO)."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Backup and Restore"
msgstr "ການສຳຮອງ ແລະ ກູ້ຄືນຂໍ້ມູນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:2
msgid ""
"This chapter contains information on the files you need to back up.  With "
"the built-in backup and restore solution ([command]``mgradm backup``) you "
"create {productname} backups.  Information about restoring from your backups "
"in the case of a system failure completes this chapter."
msgstr "ບົດນີ້ປະກອບດ້ວຍຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບໄຟລ໌ທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນ. ດ້ວຍວິທີການສຳຮອງ ແລະ ກູ້ຄືນຂໍ້ມູນໃນຕົວ ([command]``mgradm backup``), ເຈົ້າສາມາດສ້າງການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນ {productname} ໄດ້. ຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບການກູ້ຄືນຈາກການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ລະບົບເຮັດວຽກຜິດພາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ບົດນີ້ສົມບູນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Because {productname} relies on a database as well as the installed program "
"and configurations, it is important to back up all components of your "
"installation."
msgstr "ເນື່ອງຈາກ {productname} ຂຶ້ນກັບຖານຂໍ້ມູນ ລວມທັງໂປຣແກຣມທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງ ແລະ ການກຳນົດຄ່າຕ່າງໆ, ມັນຈຶ່ງສຳຄັນທີ່ຈະຕ້ອງສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນທຸກພາກສ່ວນຂອງການຕິດຕັ້ງຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Back up your {productname} installation regularly to prevent data loss and "
"enable quick recovery."
msgstr "ສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນການຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} ຂອງທ່ານເປັນປະຈຳເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນຂໍ້ມູນສູນຫາຍ ແລະ ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ກູ້ຄືນໄດ້ໄວ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:5
msgid ""
"Regardless of the backup method you use, you must have available at least "
"three times the amount of space your current installation uses.  Running out "
"of space can result in backups failing, so check this often."
msgstr "ບໍ່ວ່າເຈົ້າຈະໃຊ້ວິທີການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນແບບໃດ, ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງມີພື້ນທີ່ຫວ່າງຢ່າງໜ້ອຍສາມເທົ່າຂອງພື້ນທີ່ທີ່ການຕິດຕັ້ງປັດຈຸບັນຂອງເຈົ້າໃຊ້ຢູ່. ພື້ນທີ່ຫວ່າງບໍ່ພໍອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນຄວນກວດເບິ່ງເລື້ອຍໆ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Disable old method with smdba"
msgstr "ປິດວິທີການເກົ່າດ້ວຍ smdba"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:7
msgid ""
"Skip this section if you installed {productname} {productnumber} from "
"scratch."
msgstr "ຂ້າມສ່ວນນີ້ໄປຫາກເຈົ້າຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} {productnumber} ໃໝ່ທັງໝົດ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:8
msgid ""
"With the advent of the built-in solution, the old method with the "
"[command]``smdba`` backup tool is deprecated.  If you migrated from an old "
"system with [command]``smdba`` to the new solution, you must disable the old "
"funtionality and remove the old backup archives."
msgstr "ດ້ວຍການມາຮອດຂອງວິທີການແກ້ໄຂໃນຕົວ, ວິທີການເກົ່າທີ່ໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມື [command]``smdba`` ແມ່ນຖືກຍົກເລີກແລ້ວ. ຫາກເຈົ້າໄດ້ຍ້າຍຈາກລະບົບເກົ່າດ້ວຍ [command]``smdba`` ມາຍັງວິທີການໃໝ່, ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງປິດການເຮັດວຽກແບບເກົ່າ ແລະ ລຶບໄຟລ໌ສຳຮອງເກົ່າອອກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Either disable [command]``smdba`` before migrating (recommended) or later on "
"the migrated {productname} {productnumber} system."
msgstr "ປິດການໃຊ້ງານ [command]``smdba`` ກ່ອນການຍ້າຍລະບົບ (ແນະນຳ) ຫຼື ປິດພາຍຫຼັງໃນລະບົບ {productname} {productnumber} ທີ່ຍ້າຍມາແລ້ວ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Disabling old method with installed smdba before migration"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການປິດວິທີການເກົ່າດ້ວຍ smdba ທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງໄວ້ກ່ອນການຍ້າຍລະບົບ"

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:11
msgid "This procedure only works when smdba is still installed."
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້ໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະເມື່ອຍັງມີ smdba ຕິດຕັ້ງຢູ່ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:12
msgid ""
"Commands are different on SUSE Manager 4.3 (non-containerized installation) "
"or SUSE Manager 5.0 (containerized installation)  present (so 5.0 or on 4.3 "
"before migration):"
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງຈະແຕກຕ່າງກັນໃນ SUSE Manager 4.3 (ການຕິດຕັ້ງແບບບໍ່ໃຊ້ຄອນເທນເນີ) ຫຼື SUSE Manager 5.0 (ການຕິດຕັ້ງແບບໃຊ້ຄອນເທນເນີ):"

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "SUSE Manager 4.3"
msgstr "SUSE Manager 4.3"

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:14
msgid "On the command line, as root, execute:"
msgstr "ທີ່ຄຳສັ່ງຄອມມານໄລ (command line), ໃນຖານະ root, ໃຫ້ລັນຄຳສັ່ງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "smdba backup-hot --enable=off\n"
msgstr "smdba backup-hot --enable=off\n"

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "SUSE Manager 5.0"
msgstr "SUSE Manager 5.0"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:17
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:19
msgid "On the command line of the container host, as root, execute:"
msgstr "ທີ່ຄຳສັ່ງຄອມມານໄລຂອງໂຮສຄອນເທນເນີ, ໃນຖານະ root, ໃຫ້ລັນຄຳສັ່ງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:18
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgrctl exec -- smdba backup-hot --enable=off\n"
msgstr "mgrctl exec -- smdba backup-hot --enable=off\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:21
msgid ""
"This will change [option]``archive_command`` in "
"[path]``/var/lib/pgsql/data/postgresql.conf`` as follows:"
msgstr "ນີ້ຈະປ່ຽນ [option]``archive_command`` ໃນ [path]``/var/lib/pgsql/data/postgresql.conf`` ດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid "archive_command = '/bin/true'\n"
msgstr "archive_command = '/bin/true'\n"

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:23
msgid ""
"Now your old system is ready to be migrated to {productname} "
"{productnumber}."
msgstr "ຕອນນີ້ລະບົບເກົ່າຂອງເຈົ້າພ້ອມທີ່ຈະຖືກຍ້າຍໄປຍັງ {productname} {productnumber} ແລ້ວ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Procedure: Disabling old method on {productname} {productnumber} after "
"migration"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການປິດວິທີການເກົ່າໃນ {productname} {productnumber} ຫຼັງຈາກການຍ້າຍລະບົບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:25
msgid "Use this procedure after migration, when smdba is no longer available."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້ຫຼັງຈາກການຍ້າຍລະບົບ, ເມື່ອ smdba ບໍ່ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:26
msgid ""
"On the container host, as root, edit "
"[path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/var-pgsql/_data/postgresql.conf`` "
"and set these options:"
msgstr "ທີ່ໂຮສຄອນເທນເນີ, ໃນຖານະ root, ໃຫ້ແກ້ໄຂ [path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/var-pgsql/_data/postgresql.conf`` ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າຕົວເລືອກເຫຼົ່ານີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:27
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"archive_mode = off\n"
"archive_command = '/bin/true'\n"
msgstr ""
"archive_mode = off\n"
"archive_command = '/bin/true'\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:28
msgid "Restart the container:"
msgstr "ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຄອນເທນເນີໃໝ່:"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:30
#, no-wrap
msgid "Back up {productname}"
msgstr "ສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນ {productname}"

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:31
msgid ""
"The most comprehensive method for backing up your {productname} installation "
"is to use [command]``mgradm backup create`` command.  This can save you time "
"in administering your backup, and can be faster to reinstall and "
"re-synchronize in the case of failure.  However, this method requires "
"significant disk space and could take a long time to perform the backup."
msgstr "ວິທີທີ່ຄອບຄຸມທີ່ສຸດໃນການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນການຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} ຂອງເຈົ້າແມ່ນການໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``mgradm backup create``. ນີ້ສາມາດຊ່ວຍປະຢັດເວລາໃນການຈັດການການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນ, ແລະ ສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງໃໝ່ ຫຼື ຊິງໂຄຣໄນຄືນໄດ້ໄວຂຶ້ນໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ. ຢ່າງໃດກໍຕາມ, ວິທີນີ້ຕ້ອງໃຊ້ພື້ນທີ່ດິດຫຼາຍ ແລະ ອາດໃຊ້ເວລາດົນໃນການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:32
msgid ""
"[command]``mgradm backup create`` command performs backup to a directory.  "
"This directory can be both local or mounted remote storage."
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``mgradm backup create`` ຈະສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນໄປຍັງໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ. ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີນີ້ສາມາດເປັນທັງບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນພາຍໃນ ຫຼື ບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນໄລຍະໄກທີ່ຖືກເມົາທ໌ (mounted) ໄວ້."

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:33
msgid ""
"[command]``mgradm backup create`` command allows various customizations of "
"the content of the backup.  For all available options, see [command]``mgradm "
"backup create --help``."
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``mgradm backup create`` ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ປັບແຕ່ງເນື້ອຫາຂອງການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນໄດ້ຫຼາຍຢ່າງ. ສຳລັບຕົວເລືອກທັງໝົດທີ່ມີ, ເບິ່ງ [command]``mgradm backup create --help``."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:34
#, no-wrap
msgid "Full Backup of {productname}"
msgstr "ການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນແບບເຕັມຂອງ {productname}"

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:35
msgid ""
"A full backup of the {productname} consists of backing up the following "
"components:"
msgstr "ການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນແບບເຕັມຂອງ {productname} ປະກອບດ້ວຍການສຳຮອງສ່ວນປະກອບດັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:36
msgid "{productname} volumes"
msgstr "ວໍລຸມ (volumes) ຂອງ {productname}"

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:37
msgid "database volumes"
msgstr "ວໍລຸມ (volumes) ຂອງຖານຂໍ້ມູນ"

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:38
msgid "podman network configuration"
msgstr "ການກຳນົດຄ່າເຄືອຂ່າຍ podman"

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:39
msgid "podman secrets"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນລັບ (secrets) ຂອງ podman"

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:40
msgid "{productname} systemd services"
msgstr "ບໍລິການ systemd ຂອງ {productname}"

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:41
msgid "{productname} container images"
msgstr "ອິມເມຈຄອນເທນເນີ (container images) ຂອງ {productname}"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:42
msgid ""
"The {productname} service is automatically stopped during creation of a full "
"backup."
msgstr "ບໍລິການ {productname} ຈະຖືກຢຸດໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດໃນລະຫວ່າງການສ້າງການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນແບບເຕັມ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:43
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating Full Backup with [command]``mgradm backup create``"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນແບບເຕັມດ້ວຍ [command]``mgradm backup create``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:44
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:52
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:56
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:64
msgid "On the container host, as root, create backup with:"
msgstr "ທີ່ໂຮສຄອນເທນເນີ, ໃນຖານະ root, ໃຫ້ສ້າງການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນດ້ວຍ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:45
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm backup create $path\n"
msgstr "mgradm backup create $path\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:46
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:54
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:58
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:66
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:81
msgid "Replace [literal]``$path`` by the path to the backup location."
msgstr "ແທນບ່ອນ [literal]``$path`` ດ້ວຍເສັ້ນທາງ (path) ໄປຍັງບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນສຳຮອງ."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:47
#, no-wrap
msgid "Partial Backup of {productname}"
msgstr "ການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນບາງສ່ວນຂອງ {productname}"

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:48
msgid ""
"[command]``mgradm backup create`` tool allows creating partial backups.  It "
"is possible to skip individual or all volumes, skip database backup and "
"images."
msgstr "ເຄື່ອງມື [command]``mgradm backup create`` ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ສ້າງການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນບາງສ່ວນໄດ້. ມັນເປັນໄປໄດ້ທີ່ຈະຂ້າມບາງວໍລຸມ ຫຼື ທັງໝົດ, ຂ້າມການສຳຮອງຖານຂໍ້ມູນ ແລະ ອິມເມຈ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:49
msgid ""
"Particularly when database backup is skipped, backup is created without "
"stopping {productname} services and can act as a one phase in two phase "
"backup procedure."
msgstr "ໂດຍສະເພາະເມື່ອຂ້າມການສຳຮອງຖານຂໍ້ມູນ, ການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງຢຸດບໍລິການ {productname} ແລະ ສາມາດເຮັດໜ້າທີ່ເປັນຂັ້ນຕອນໜຶ່ງໃນຂະບວນການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນແບບສອງຂັ້ນຕອນ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:50
msgid "Partial backup cannot guarantee backup/restore consistency."
msgstr "ການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນບາງສ່ວນບໍ່ສາມາດຮັບປະກັນຄວາມສອດຄ່ອງ (consistency) ຂອງການສຳຮອງ/ກູ້ຄືນໄດ້."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:51
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating partial backup by skipping database backup"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນບາງສ່ວນໂດຍຂ້າມການສຳຮອງຖານຂໍ້ມູນ"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:53
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm backup create --skipdatabase $path\n"
msgstr "mgradm backup create --skipdatabase $path\n"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:55
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating partial backup by skipping a volume"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນບາງສ່ວນໂດຍຂ້າມວໍລຸມ (volume)"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:57
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm backup create --skipvolumes $volumes $path\n"
msgstr "mgradm backup create --skipvolumes $volumes $path\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:59
msgid ""
"Replace [literal]``$volumes`` by the name of the volume name to be excluded "
"from the backup, or by a comma separated list of volumes to be excluded."
msgstr "ແທນບ່ອນ [literal]``$volumes`` ດ້ວຍຊື່ຂອງວໍລຸມທີ່ຈະຍົກເວັ້ນຈາກການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນ, ຫຼື ດ້ວຍລາຍຊື່ຂອງວໍລຸມທີ່ແຍກດ້ວຍຈຸດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:60
msgid "Use [literal]``all`` to skip all volumes, except database volumes."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ [literal]``all`` ເພື່ອຂ້າມທຸກວໍລຸມ, ຍົກເວັ້ນວໍລຸມຂອງຖານຂໍ້ມູນ."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:61
#, no-wrap
msgid "Backing up extra volumes"
msgstr "ການສຳຮອງວໍລຸມເພີ່ມເຕີມ"

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:62
msgid ""
"[command]``mgradm backup`` command uses internal list of {productname} "
"volumes.  If additional volumes were configured during the installation, or "
"additional volumes should be added to the backup, they need to be specified "
"using [command]``--extravolumes $volumes``."
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``mgradm backup`` ໃຊ້ລາຍຊື່ວໍລຸມພາຍໃນຂອງ {productname}. ຫາກມີການກຳນົດຄ່າວໍລຸມເພີ່ມເຕີມໃນລະຫວ່າງການຕິດຕັ້ງ, ຫຼື ຕ້ອງການເພີ່ມວໍລຸມເຂົ້າໃນການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນ, ພວກມັນຕ້ອງຖືກລະບຸໂດຍໃຊ້ [command]``--extravolumes $volumes``."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:63
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating backup with additional custom volume"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນດ້ວຍວໍລຸມທີ່ກຳນົດເອງເພີ່ມເຕີມ"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:65
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm backup create --extravolumes $volume $path\n"
msgstr "mgradm backup create --extravolumes $volume $path\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:67
msgid ""
"Replace [literal]``$volumes`` by the name of the volume name to be included "
"in the backup. or by a comma separated list of volumes to be included."
msgstr "ແທນບ່ອນ [literal]``$volumes`` ດ້ວຍຊື່ຂອງວໍລຸມທີ່ຈະລວມເຂົ້າໃນການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນ ຫຼື ດ້ວຍລາຍຊື່ຂອງວໍລຸມທີ່ແຍກດ້ວຍຈຸດ."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:68
#, no-wrap
msgid "Perform a manual database backup"
msgstr "ດຳເນີນການສຳຮອງຖານຂໍ້ມູນດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:69
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Performing a manual database backup"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການດຳເນີນການສຳຮອງຖານຂໍ້ມູນດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:70
msgid "Allocate permanent storage space for your backup."
msgstr "ຈັດສັນພື້ນທີ່ເກັບຂໍ້ມູນແບບຖາວອນສຳລັບການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນຂອງເຈົ້າ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:71
msgid "At the command prompt of the {productname} container host, as root, use:"
msgstr "ທີ່ຄຳສັ່ງຄອມມານຂອງໂຮສຄອນເທນເນີ {productname}, ໃນຖານະ root, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:72
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm backup create --skipvolumes all --skipconfig --skipimages $path\n"
msgstr "mgradm backup create --skipvolumes all --skipconfig --skipimages $path\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:73
#, no-wrap
msgid "Restore {productname} from the existing backup"
msgstr "ກູ້ຄືນ {productname} ຈາກການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ມີຢູ່"

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:74
msgid ""
"Restoring {productname} from the existing backup will enumerate backup for "
"volumes, images and configuration to restore. Unlike in backup create "
"scenario, restore operation is not using an internal volume list, but "
"automatically detect every volume or image present in the backup."
msgstr "ການກູ້ຄືນ {productname} ຈາກການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ມີຢູ່ຈະໄລ່ລຽງການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນສຳລັບວໍລຸມ, ອິມເມຈ ແລະ ການກຳນົດຄ່າເພື່ອການກູ້ຄືນ. ຕ່າງຈາກກໍລະນີການສ້າງການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນ, ການດຳເນີນການກູ້ຄືນຈະບໍ່ໃຊ້ລາຍຊື່ວໍລຸມພາຍໃນ, ແຕ່ຈະກວດຫາທຸກໆ ວໍລຸມ ຫຼື ອິມເມຈທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:75
msgid ""
"After the list of items to restore is gathered, presence and integrity check "
"is performed. Presence check ensures backup restore will not accidentally "
"overwrite existing volumes, image or configurations. Integrity check is done "
"by computing backup items checksums."
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກທີ່ຮວບຮວມລາຍການທີ່ຈະກູ້ຄືນແລ້ວ, ຈະມີການກວດສອບການມີຢູ່ ແລະ ຄວາມສົມບູນ. ການກວດສອບການມີຢູ່ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າການກູ້ຄືນຈະບໍ່ຂຽນທັບວໍລຸມ, ອິມເມຈ ຫຼື ການກຳນົດຄ່າທີ່ມີຢູ່ໂດຍບັງເອີນ. ການກວດສອບຄວາມສົມບູນແມ່ນເຮັດໂດຍການຄິດໄລ່ checksum ຂອງລາຍການສຳຮອງ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:76
msgid "After both checks are successful, actual backup restore is performed."
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກການກວດສອບທັງສອງຢ່າງສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ການກູ້ຄືນຂໍ້ມູນຕົວຈິງຈະຖືກດຳເນີນການ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:77
msgid ""
"{productname} services are not automatically started after backup restore is "
"finished."
msgstr "ບໍລິການ {productname} ຈະບໍ່ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດຫຼັງຈາກການກູ້ຄືນສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນສຳເລັດ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:78
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Restoring from an existing backup"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການກູ້ຄືນຈາກການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ມີຢູ່"

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:79
msgid "On the container host, as root, re-deploy the {productname} Server with:"
msgstr "ທີ່ໂຮສຄອນເທນເນີ, ໃນຖານະ root, ໃຫ້ຕິດຕັ້ງ (re-deploy) ເຊີເວີ {productname} ໃໝ່ດ້ວຍ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:80
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgradm backup restore $path\n"
"mgradm start\n"
msgstr ""
"mgradm backup restore $path\n"
"mgradm start\n"

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:82
msgid ""
"Verification of the backup can be a time-consuming operation.  If backup "
"integrity is ensured by other means, verification can be skipped by using "
"[command]``--skipverify`` option."
msgstr "ການກວດສອບຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງຂອງການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນອາດໃຊ້ເວລາດົນ. ຖ້າຄວາມສົມບູນຂອງການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນຖືກຮັບປະກັນດ້ວຍວິທີອື່ນແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດຂ້າມການກວດສອບໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກ [command]``--skipverify``."

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:83
msgid ""
"If for some reason it is needed to skip restoring a volume present in the "
"backup, [command]``--skipvolumes $volumes`` option can be used."
msgstr "ຫາກມີເຫດຜົນບາງຢ່າງທີ່ຕ້ອງຂ້າມການກູ້ຄືນວໍລຸມທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນ, ສາມາດໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກ [command]``--skipvolumes $volumes`` ໄດ້."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:84
#, no-wrap
msgid "Recommended steps after restoring a backup"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນທີ່ແນະນຳຫຼັງຈາກກູ້ຄືນການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນ"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:85
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Recommended steps after {productname} restore"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ຂັ້ນຕອນທີ່ແນະນຳຫຼັງຈາກກູ້ຄືນ {productname}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:86
msgid ""
"Re-synchronize your {productname} repositories using either the "
"{productname} {webui}, or with the [command]``mgr-sync`` tool at the command "
"prompt in the container.  You can choose to re-register your product, or "
"skip the registration and SSL certificate generation sections."
msgstr "ຊິງໂຄຣໄນຄັງເກັບຊອບແວ (repositories) ຂອງ {productname} ໃໝ່ ໂດຍໃຊ້ {webui} ຂອງ {productname} ຫຼື ດ້ວຍເຄື່ອງມື [command]``mgr-sync`` ທີ່ຄຳສັ່ງຄອມມານໃນຄອນເທນເນີ. ເຈົ້າສາມາດເລືອກລົງທະບຽນຜະລິດຕະພັນໃໝ່ ຫຼື ຂ້າມສ່ວນການລົງທະບຽນ ແລະ ການສ້າງໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ SSL ໄປກໍໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:87
msgid ""
"On the container host, check whether you need to restore "
"[path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/var-spacewalk/_data/packages/``.  "
"If "
"[path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/var-spacewalk/_data/packages/`` "
"was not in your backup, you need to restore it.  If the source repository is "
"available, you can restore "
"[path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/var-spacewalk/_data/packages/`` "
"with a complete channel synchronization:"
msgstr "ທີ່ໂຮສຄອນເທນເນີ, ໃຫ້ກວດເບິ່ງວ່າເຈົ້າຕ້ອງກູ້ຄືນ [path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/var-spacewalk/_data/packages/`` ຫຼື ບໍ່. ຫາກມັນບໍ່ມີຢູ່ໃນການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນ, ເຈົ້າຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງກູ້ຄືນມັນ. ຫາກຄັງເກັບຊອບແວຕົ້ນທາງຍັງມີຢູ່, ເຈົ້າສາມາດກູ້ຄືນມັນໄດ້ດ້ວຍການຊິງໂຄຣໄນຊ່ອງທາງ (channel) ແບບສົມບູນ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:88
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgrctl exec -ti -- mgr-sync refresh --refresh-channels\n"
msgstr "mgrctl exec -ti -- mgr-sync refresh --refresh-channels\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:89
msgid ""
"Schedule the re-creation of search indexes next time the "
"[command]``rhn-search`` service is started.  This command produces only "
"debug messages, it does not produce error messages.  On the container host, "
"enter:"
msgstr "ກຳນົດເວລາການສ້າງດັດຊະນີການຄົ້ນຫາ (search indexes) ໃໝ່ໃນຄັ້ງຕໍ່ໄປທີ່ບໍລິການ [command]``rhn-search`` ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ຄຳສັ່ງນີ້ຈະສະແດງພຽງແຕ່ຂໍ້ຄວາມ debug ເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ມັນຈະບໍ່ສະແດງຂໍ້ຄວາມຜິດພາດ. ໃນ host ຄອນເທນເນີ, ໃຫ້ໃສ່:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:90
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgrctl exec -ti -- rhn-search cleanindex\n"
msgstr "mgrctl exec -ti -- rhn-search cleanindex\n"

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Channel Management"
msgstr "ການຈັດການຊ່ອງທາງ (Channel Management)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:2
msgid "Channels are a method of grouping software packages."
msgstr "ຊ່ອງທາງ (Channels) ແມ່ນວິທີການຈັດກຸ່ມແພັກເກັດຊອບແວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:3
msgid ""
"In {productname}, channels are grouped into base and child channels, with "
"base channels grouped by operating system type, version, and architecture, "
"and child channels being compatible with their related base channel.  When a "
"client has been assigned to a base channel, it is only possible for that "
"system to install the related child channels.  Organizing channels in this "
"way ensures that only compatible packages are installed on each system."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname}, ຊ່ອງທາງຈະຖືກຈັດກຸ່ມເປັນຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກ (base) ແລະ ຊ່ອງທາງຍ່ອຍ (child), ໂດຍຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກຈະຖືກຈັດກຸ່ມຕາມປະເພດລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ, ເວີຊັນ ແລະ ສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳ, ແລະ ຊ່ອງທາງຍ່ອຍຈະເຂົ້າກັນໄດ້ກັບຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ. ເມື່ອເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍຖືກກຳນົດໃຫ້ຢູ່ກັບຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກໃດໜຶ່ງ, ລະບົບນັ້ນຈະສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງໄດ້ສະເພາະຊ່ອງທາງຍ່ອຍທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ການຈັດລະບຽບຊ່ອງທາງໃນແບບນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ໝັ້ນໃຈໄດ້ວ່າຈະມີພຽງແພັກເກັດທີ່ເຂົ້າກັນໄດ້ເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງໃນແຕ່ລະລະບົບ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Software channels use repositories to provide packages.  The channels mirror "
"the repositories in {productname}, and the package names and other data are "
"stored in the {productname} database.  You can have any number of "
"repositories associated with a channel.  The software from those "
"repositories can then be installed on clients by subscribing the client to "
"the appropriate channel."
msgstr "ຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວໃຊ້ຄັງເກັບຊອບແວ (repositories) ເພື່ອໃຫ້ບໍລິການແພັກເກັດ. ຊ່ອງທາງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະຈຳລອງ (mirror) ຄັງເກັບຊອບແວໃນ {productname}, ແລະ ຊື່ແພັກເກັດລວມທັງຂໍ້ມູນອື່ນໆ ແມ່ນຖືກເກັບໄວ້ໃນຖານຂໍ້ມູນຂອງ {productname}. ເຈົ້າສາມາດມີຄັງເກັບຊອບແວຈຳນວນເທົ່າໃດກໍໄດ້ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບຊ່ອງທາງໜຶ່ງ. ຊອບແວຈາກຄັງເກັບເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນສາມາດຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງໃນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍໄດ້ໂດຍການໃຫ້ເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍນັ້ນສະໝັກ (subscribe) ນຳໃຊ້ຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ເໝາະສົມ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:5
msgid ""
"Clients can only be assigned to one base channel.  The client can then "
"install or update packages from the repositories associated with that base "
"channel and any of its child channels."
msgstr "ເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍສາມາດຖືກກຳນົດໃຫ້ຢູ່ກັບຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກໄດ້ພຽງອັນດຽວເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ຈາກນັ້ນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍຈະສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງ ຫຼື ອັບເດດແພັກເກັດຈາກຄັງເກັບຊອບແວທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກນັ້ນ ແລະ ຊ່ອງທາງຍ່ອຍຕ່າງໆ ຂອງມັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:6
msgid ""
"{productname} provides a number of vendor channels, which provide you "
"everything you need to run {productname}.  {productname} Administrators and "
"Channel Administrators have channel management authority, which gives them "
"the ability to create and manage their own custom channels.  If you want to "
"use your own packages in your environment, you can create custom channels.  "
"Custom channels can be used as a base channel, or you can associate them "
"with a vendor base channel."
msgstr "{productname} ໃຫ້ບໍລິການຊ່ອງທາງຈາກຜູ້ຜະລິດ (vendor channels) ຫຼາຍອັນ, ເຊິ່ງໃຫ້ທຸກສິ່ງທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການເພື່ອລັນ {productname}. ຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບ {productname} ແລະ ຜູ້ດູແລຊ່ອງທາງມີອຳນາດໃນການຈັດການຊ່ອງທາງ, ເຊິ່ງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ພວກເຂົາສາມາດສ້າງ ແລະ ຈັດການຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ກຳນົດເອງໄດ້. ຫາກເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ແພັກເກັດຂອງຕົນເອງໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຂອງເຈົ້າ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດສ້າງຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ (custom channels). ຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ກຳນົດເອງສາມາດໃຊ້ເປັນຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກ ຫຼື ເຈົ້າສາມາດເຊື່ອມໂຍງພວກມັນກັບຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກຂອງຜູ້ຜະລິດກໍໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:7
msgid ""
"For more on creating custom channels, see "
"xref:administration:custom-channels.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການສ້າງຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ, ເບິ່ງ xref:administration:custom-channels.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "Channel Administration"
msgstr "ການດູແລຈັດການຊ່ອງທາງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:9
msgid ""
"By default, any user can subscribe channels to a system.  You can implement "
"restrictions on the channel using the {webui}."
msgstr "ໂດຍປົກກະຕິ, ຜູ້ໃຊ້ໃດກໍສາມາດສະໝັກນຳໃຊ້ຊ່ອງທາງເຂົ້າກັບລະບົບໄດ້. ເຈົ້າສາມາດກຳນົດການຈຳກັດໃນຊ່ອງທາງໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ {webui}."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Restricting Subscriber Access to a Channel"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຈຳກັດການເຂົ້າເຖິງການສະໝັກນຳໃຊ້ຊ່ອງທາງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:11
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Software[Channel List], and "
"select the channel to edit."
msgstr "ໃນ {webui} ຂອງ {productname}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Software[Channel List], ແລະ ເລືອກຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ຕ້ອງການແກ້ໄຂ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:12
msgid ""
"Locate the [guimenu]``Per-User Subscription Restrictions`` section and check "
"[guimenu]``Only selected users within your organization may subscribe to "
"this channel``.  Click btn:[Update] to save the changes."
msgstr "ຄົ້ນຫາສ່ວນ [guimenu]``Per-User Subscription Restrictions`` ແລະ ໝາຍຕິກທີ່ [guimenu]``Only selected users within your organization may subscribe to this channel``. ຄລິກ btn:[Update] ເພື່ອບັນທຶກການປ່ຽນແປງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:13
msgid ""
"Navigate to the [guimenu]``Subscribers`` tab and select or deselect users as "
"required."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ແຖບ [guimenu]``Subscribers`` ແລະ ເລືອກ ຫຼື ຍົກເລີກການເລືອກຜູ້ໃຊ້ຕາມຄວາມຕ້ອງການ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "Delete Channels"
msgstr "ລຶບຊ່ອງທາງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:15
msgid "You can delete vendor software channels from the command prompt."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າສາມາດລຶບຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວຂອງຜູ້ຜະລິດໄດ້ຈາກຄຳສັ່ງຄອມມານ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Deleting Vendor Channels"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການລຶບຊ່ອງທາງຂອງຜູ້ຜະລິດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:17
msgid ""
"On the {productname} Server, at the command prompt, as root, list the "
"available vendor channels, and make a note of the channel you want to "
"delete:"
msgstr "ທີ່ເຊີເວີ {productname}, ທີ່ຄຳສັ່ງຄອມມານ, ໃນຖານະ root, ໃຫ້ສະແດງລາຍຊື່ຊ່ອງທາງຂອງຜູ້ຜະລິດທີ່ມີຢູ່, ແລະ ຈົດຊື່ຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການລຶບໄວ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgr-sync list channels\n"
msgstr "mgr-sync list channels\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:19
msgid "Delete the channel:"
msgstr "ລຶບຊ່ອງທາງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid "spacewalk-remove-channel -c <channel-name>\n"
msgstr "spacewalk-remove-channel -c <channel-name>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:21
msgid ""
"For more information about deleting channels manually, see "
"xref:removing-channels.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການລຶບຊ່ອງທາງດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ, ເບິ່ງ xref:removing-channels.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:22
msgid ""
"For information about deleting custom channels, see "
"xref:administration:custom-channels.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບການລຶບຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ, ເບິ່ງ xref:administration:custom-channels.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Confidential Computing"
msgstr "ການປະມວນຜົນແບບປິດລັບ (Confidential Computing)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:2
msgid ""
"{CoCo} is a technology which allows protection of data in use by using "
"hardware-based Trusted Execution Environment (TEE), the type of environments "
"that provide increased level of security for data integrity, data "
"confidentiality, and code integrity."
msgstr "{CoCo} ແມ່ນເຕັກໂນໂລຊີທີ່ຊ່ວຍປົກປ້ອງຂໍ້ມູນໃນຂະນະທີ່ກຳລັງໃຊ້ງານ ໂດຍການໃຊ້ສະພາບແວດລ້ອມການເຮັດວຽກທີ່ໜ້າເຊື່ອຖືທີ່ອີງໃສ່ຮາດແວ (TEE), ເຊິ່ງເປັນປະເພດຂອງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທີ່ໃຫ້ລະດັບຄວາມປອດໄພທີ່ເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນສຳລັບຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງຂອງຂໍ້ມູນ, ຄວາມປິດລັບຂອງຂໍ້ມູນ ແລະ ຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງຂອງໂຄ້ດ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "{CoCo} with {productname}"
msgstr "{CoCo} ກັບ {productname}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:4
msgid ""
"The trustworthiness of the TEE is checked with the attestation process.  "
"{productname} can be used as an attestation server for the systems "
"registered to it.  It generates a report page for the systems which run in "
"this mode.  These systems need to be attested and checked on regular base.  "
"The history of the past checks is also stored and available per request."
msgstr "ຄວາມໜ້າເຊື່ອຖືຂອງ TEE ແມ່ນຖືກກວດສອບດ້ວຍຂະບວນການຢັ້ງຢືນ (attestation). {productname} ສາມາດໃຊ້ເປັນເຊີເວີຢັ້ງຢືນສຳລັບລະບົບຕ່າງໆ ທີ່ລົງທະບຽນໄວ້ກັບມັນ. ມັນຈະສ້າງໜ້າລາຍງານສຳລັບລະບົບທີ່ລັນໃນໂໝດນີ້. ລະບົບເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການຢັ້ງຢືນ ແລະ ກວດສອບຢ່າງເປັນປະຈຳ. ປະຫວັດການກວດສອບທີ່ຜ່ານມາແມ່ນຖືກເກັບໄວ້ ແລະ ສາມາດເບິ່ງໄດ້ຕາມການຮ້ອງຂໍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:5
msgid ""
"{CoCo} Attestation depends on the used hardware and environment where the "
"attested systems are running on."
msgstr "ການຢັ້ງຢືນ {CoCo} ຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບຮາດແວ ແລະ ສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທີ່ລະບົບທີ່ຖືກຢັ້ງຢືນນັ້ນກຳລັງລັນຢູ່."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:6
msgid "{CoCo} Attestation is only available on x86_64 architecture."
msgstr "ການຢັ້ງຢືນ {CoCo} ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ສະເພາະໃນສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳ x86_64 ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:7
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:15
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:140
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Requirements"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ກຳນົດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:8
msgid "{CoCo} can be set up in an environment with the following characteristics:"
msgstr "{CoCo} ສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງໄດ້ໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທີ່ມີຄຸນລັກສະນະດັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Attested system (virtual machine) is SLES15 SP6 and bootstrapped to "
"{productname}"
msgstr "ລະບົບທີ່ຖືກຢັ້ງຢືນ (virtual machine) ແມ່ນ SLES15 SP6 ແລະ ໄດ້ຮັບການຕິດຕັ້ງເບື້ອງຕົ້ນ (bootstrapped) ເຂົ້າກັບ {productname}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:10
msgid ""
"Hardware must have [literal]``AMD EPYC Milan CPU`` or [literal]``AMD EPYC "
"Genoa CPU``"
msgstr "ຮາດແວຕ້ອງມີ [literal]``AMD EPYC Milan CPU`` ຫຼື [literal]``AMD EPYC Genoa CPU``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:11
msgid "BIOS must be configured to allow {CoCo} attestation"
msgstr "BIOS ຕ້ອງຖືກກຳນົດຄ່າເພື່ອອະນຸຍາດການຢັ້ງຢືນ {CoCo}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:12
msgid ""
"Host OS and the virtualization software (KVM and libvirt) must support "
"{CoCo}."
msgstr "ລະບົບປະຕິບັດການໂຮສ (Host OS) ແລະ ຊອບແວເວີຊົວໄລເຊຊັນ (KVM ແລະ libvirt) ຕ້ອງຮອງຮັບ {CoCo}."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:13
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:280
#, no-wrap
msgid "Limitations"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ຈຳກັດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:14
msgid "SLES15 SP6 has {CoCo} attestation as technology preview."
msgstr "SLES15 SP6 ມີການຢັ້ງຢືນ {CoCo} ໃນຮູບແບບການທົດລອງເຕັກໂນໂລຊີ (technology preview)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:15
msgid "{productname} has {CoCo} attestation as technology preview."
msgstr "{productname} ມີການຢັ້ງຢືນ {CoCo} ໃນຮູບແບບການທົດລອງເຕັກໂນໂລຊີ (technology preview)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:16
msgid ""
"Secure boot is attested.  However, currently KVM secure boot and SNP Guest "
"are not working together."
msgstr "Secure boot ໄດ້ຮັບການຢັ້ງຢືນ. ຢ່າງໃດກໍຕາມ, ໃນປັດຈຸບັນ KVM secure boot ແລະ SNP Guest ຍັງບໍ່ສາມາດເຮັດວຽກຮ່ວມກັນໄດ້."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use {CoCo} in {productname}"
msgstr "ໃຊ້ {CoCo} ໃນ {productname}"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:18
msgid ""
"For the exact steps for setting up and configuring {CoCo} on your host, "
"refer to the OS Vendor documentation."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂັ້ນຕອນທີ່ແນ່ນອນໃນການຕິດຕັ້ງ ແລະ ກຳນົດຄ່າ {CoCo} ໃນໂຮສຂອງເຈົ້າ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງເອກະສານຈາກຜູ້ຜະລິດ OS."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Procedure: Enabling Attestation Container During the {productname} "
"Installation"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການເປີດໃຊ້ຄອນເທນເນີຢັ້ງຢືນໃນລະຫວ່າງການຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:20
msgid ""
"The attestation container is enabled during the installation of "
"{productname} with [literal]``mgradm install podman``."
msgstr "ຄອນເທນເນີຢັ້ງຢືນຈະຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ໃນລະຫວ່າງການຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} ດ້ວຍ [literal]``mgradm install podman``."

#. I need full path to this file.
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:21
msgid "Add the following to file [literal]``mgradm.yaml``."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມສິ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ໃສ່ໃນໄຟລ໌ [literal]``mgradm.yaml``."

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"coco:\n"
"    replicas: 1\n"
msgstr ""
"coco:\n"
"    replicas: 1\n"

#.  (PLACEHOLDER): In the future instead of number 1, it should be possible to allow more then one container replica.
#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:23
#: modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:27
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Procedure: Enabling Attestation Container After the {productname} "
"Installation"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການເປີດໃຊ້ຄອນເທນເນີຢັ້ງຢືນຫຼັງຈາກການຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:24
msgid ""
"To enable the attestation container after the installation, use the command "
"line parameter [literal]``mgradm``."
msgstr "ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ຄອນເທນເນີຢັ້ງຢືນຫຼັງຈາກການຕິດຕັ້ງ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ພາຣາມິເຕີຄຳສັ່ງຄອມມານ [literal]``mgradm``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:25
msgid "Run the command"
msgstr "ລັນຄຳສັ່ງ"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm scale uyuni-server-attestation --replicas 1\n"
msgstr "mgradm scale uyuni-server-attestation --replicas 1\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:28
msgid "To disable the already enabled attestation container, run the command:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອປິດການໃຊ້ງານຄອນເທນເນີຢັ້ງຢືນທີ່ເປີດຢູ່ແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ລັນຄຳສັ່ງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm scale uyuni-server-attestation --replicas 0\n"
msgstr "mgradm scale uyuni-server-attestation --replicas 0\n"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:30
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Enabling Attestation"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການເປີດໃຊ້ການຢັ້ງຢືນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:31
msgid ""
"For the selected system, go to tab menu:Audit[Confidential Computing > "
"Settings]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບລະບົບທີ່ເລືອກ, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ແຖບເມນູ: Audit[Confidential Computing > Settings]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:32
msgid "Enable the attestation by selecting the toggle button."
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ການຢັ້ງຢືນໂດຍການເລືອກປຸ່ມສະຫຼັບ (toggle button)."

#. . (PLACEHOLDER) Enable the automatic attestaion at reboot by selecting the toggle button [literal]``Execution``.
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:33
msgid ""
"In the field [literal]``Environment Type`` select the correct option from "
"the drop-down list."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [literal]``Environment Type`` ໃຫ້ເລືອກຕົວເລືອກທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງຈາກລາຍການ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:34
msgid "Click button btn:[Save] to save the changes."
msgstr "ຄລິກປຸ່ມ btn:[Save] ເພື່ອບັນທຶກການປ່ຽນແປງ."

#. type: Target for macro image
#: modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:35
#, no-wrap
msgid "attestation1-v2.png"
msgstr "attestation1-v2.png"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:36
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Scheduling New Attestation"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການກຳນົດເວລາການຢັ້ງຢືນໃໝ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:37
#: modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:44
msgid ""
"For the selected system, go to tab menu:Audit[Confidential Computing > List "
"Attestations]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບລະບົບທີ່ເລືອກ, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ແຖບເມນູ: Audit[Confidential Computing > List Attestations]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:38
msgid "Click btn:[Schedule Attestation].  The new form opens."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Schedule Attestation]. ແບບຟອມໃໝ່ຈະຖືກເປີດຂຶ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:39
msgid ""
"In the field [literal]``Earliest`` select the time of running the "
"attestation."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [literal]``Earliest`` ໃຫ້ເລືອກເວລາທີ່ຈະລັນການຢັ້ງຢືນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:40
msgid ""
"If needed, add the newly created attestation to the action chain by "
"selecting [literal]``Add to`` option."
msgstr "ຫາກຈຳເປັນ, ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມການຢັ້ງຢືນທີ່ສ້າງໃໝ່ເຂົ້າໃນລຳດັບການດຳເນີນການ (action chain) ໂດຍການເລືອກຕົວເລືອກ [literal]``Add to``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:41
msgid ""
"Click button btn:[Schedule] to save and schedule the new attestation "
"execution."
msgstr "ຄລິກປຸ່ມ btn:[Schedule] ເພື່ອບັນທຶກ ແລະ ກຳນົດເວລາການຢັ້ງຢືນໃໝ່."

#. type: Target for macro image
#: modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:42
#, no-wrap
msgid "attestation2-v2.png"
msgstr "attestation2-v2.png"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:43
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Viewing Attestation Reports from System Details"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການເບິ່ງລາຍງານການຢັ້ງຢືນຈາກລາຍລະອຽດຂອງລະບົບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:45
#: modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:57
msgid "Find and select the report you want to view."
msgstr "ຄົ້ນຫາ ແລະ ເລືອກລາຍງານທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການເບິ່ງ."

#. type: Target for macro image
#: modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:46
#, no-wrap
msgid "attestation3-v2.png"
msgstr "attestation3-v2.png"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:47
msgid ""
"After clicking the selected attestation report tab [literal]``Overview`` "
"will open."
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກຄລິກແຖບລາຍງານການຢັ້ງຢືນທີ່ເລືອກແລ້ວ, ສ່ວນ [literal]``Overview`` ຈະຖືກເປີດຂຶ້ນ."

#. type: Target for macro image
#: modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:48
#, no-wrap
msgid "attestation4-v2.png"
msgstr "attestation4-v2.png"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:49
msgid "Move to the next tab [literal]``SEV-SNP``."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ແຖບຖັດໄປ [literal]``SEV-SNP``."

#. type: Target for macro image
#: modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:50
#, no-wrap
msgid "attestation5-v2.png"
msgstr "attestation5-v2.png"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:51
msgid "Finally, move to the next tab [literal]``Secure Boot``."
msgstr "ສຸດທ້າຍ, ໄປທີ່ແຖບຖັດໄປ [literal]``Secure Boot``."

#. type: Target for macro image
#: modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:52
#, no-wrap
