#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:258
msgid ""
"There are two ways to build or get an image using the {webui}.  Either "
"select menu:Images[Build], or click the build icon in the "
"menu:Images[Profiles] list."
msgstr "ມີສອງວິທີໃນການສ້າງ ຫຼື ຮັບເອົາອິເມຈໂດຍໃຊ້ {webui}. ໂດຍການເລືອກເມນູ: Images[Build], ຫຼື ຄລິກທີ່ໄອຄອນການສ້າງໃນລາຍການເມນູ: Images[Profiles]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:262
msgid ""
"Add a different tag name if you want a version other than the default "
"``latest`` (applies only to containers)."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມຊື່ແທັກອື່ນ ຖ້າເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການເວີຊັນທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ``latest`` (ໃຊ້ໄດ້ກັບຄອນເທນເນີເທົ່ານັ້ນ)."

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:263
msgid "Select the [guimenu]``Image Profile`` and a [guimenu]``Build Host``."
msgstr "ເລືອກ [guimenu]``Image Profile`` ແລະ [guimenu]``Build Host``."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:264
msgid ""
"A [guimenu]``Profile Summary`` is displayed to the right of the build "
"fields.  When you have selected a build profile, detailed information about "
"the selected profile is shown here."
msgstr "[guimenu]``Profile Summary`` ຈະສະແດງຢູ່ທາງຂວາຂອງຊ່ອງຂໍ້ມູນການສ້າງ. ເມື່ອເຈົ້າເລືອກໂປຣໄຟລ໌ການສ້າງແລ້ວ, ຂໍ້ມູນລະອຽດກ່ຽວກັບໂປຣໄຟລ໌ທີ່ເລືອກຈະສະແດງຢູ່ບ່ອນນີ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:265
msgid "To schedule a build, click the btn:[Build] button."
msgstr "ເພື່ອຕັ້ງເວລາການສ້າງ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກທີ່ປຸ່ມ btn:[Build]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:266
msgid ""
"The build server cannot run any form of automounter during the image "
"building process.  If applicable, ensure that you do not have your Gnome "
"session running as root.  If an automounter is running, the image build "
"finishes successfully, but the checksum of the image is different and causes "
"a failure."
msgstr "ເຊີເວີການສ້າງບໍ່ສາມາດເປີດໃຊ້ລະບົບຕິດຕັ້ງອັດຕະໂນມັດ (automounter) ໃນລະຫວ່າງຂະບວນການສ້າງອິເມຈ. ຖ້າມີການໃຊ້ງານ, ໃຫ້ກວດເບິ່ງວ່າເຈົ້າບໍ່ໄດ້ເປີດໃຊ້ Gnome session ໃນນາມ root. ຖ້າ automounter ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກ, ການສ້າງອິເມຈອາດຈະສຳເລັດ ແຕ່ຄ່າ checksum ຂອງອິເມຈຈະແຕກຕ່າງໄປ ແລະ ເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດຄວາມຜິດພາດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:267
msgid ""
"After the image is successfully built, the inspection phase begins.  During "
"the inspection phase {susemgr} collects information about the image:"
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກສ້າງອິເມຈສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ຂັ້ນຕອນການກວດສອບຈະເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ໃນລະຫວ່າງຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້ {susemgr} ຈະເກັບກຳຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບອິເມຈ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:268
msgid "List of packages installed in the image"
msgstr "ລາຍການແພັກເກດທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງຢູ່ໃນອິເມຈ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:269
msgid "Checksum of the image"
msgstr "Checksum ຂອງອິເມຈ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:270
msgid "Image type and other image details"
msgstr "ປະເພດຂອງອິເມຈ ແລະ ລາຍລະອຽດອື່ນໆ"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:271
msgid ""
"If the built image type is `PXE`, a {salt} pillar is also generated.  Image "
"pillars are stored in the database and the {salt} subsystem can access "
"details about the generated image.  Details include where the image files "
"are located and provided, image checksums, information needed for network "
"boot, and more."
msgstr "ຖ້າປະເພດອິເມຈທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນແມ່ນ `PXE`, {salt} pillar ກໍຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນນຳ. Image pillars ຈະຖືກເກັບໄວ້ໃນຖານຂໍ້ມູນ ແລະ ລະບົບຍ່ອຍ {salt} ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງລາຍລະອຽດກ່ຽວກັບອິເມຈທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນໄດ້. ລາຍລະອຽດລວມມີບ່ອນເກັບໄຟລ໌ອິເມຈ, checksum ຂອງອິເມຈ, ຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບການບູດຜ່ານເຄືອຂ່າຍ ແລະ ອື່ນໆ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:272
msgid "The generated pillar is available to all connected clients."
msgstr "Pillar ທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນຈະສາມາດໃຊ້ງານໄດ້ກັບທຸກ clients ທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຢູ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:274
msgid ""
"Building an image requires several dependent steps.  When the build fails, "
"investigating {salt} states results and build log can help identify the "
"source of the failure.  You can carry out these checks when the build fails:"
msgstr "ການສ້າງອິເມຈຕ້ອງຜ່ານຫຼາຍຂັ້ນຕອນທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັນ. ເມື່ອການສ້າງລົ້ມເຫຼວ, ການກວດສອບຜົນຂອງ {salt} states ແລະ ບັນທຶກການສ້າງ (build log) ສາມາດຊ່ວຍລະບຸສາເຫດຂອງຄວາມຜິດພາດໄດ້. ເຈົ້າສາມາດກວດສອບສິ່ງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໄດ້ເມື່ອການສ້າງລົ້ມເຫຼວ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:275
msgid "The build host can access the build sources"
msgstr "ເຄື່ອງທີ່ໃຊ້ສ້າງ (build host) ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນການສ້າງໄດ້"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:276
msgid ""
"There is enough disk space for the image on both the build host and the "
"{productname} server"
msgstr "ມີພື້ນທີ່ວ່າງໃນດິສກ໌ພຽງພໍສຳລັບອິເມຈ ທັງໃນເຄື່ອງທີ່ໃຊ້ສ້າງ ແລະ ເຊີເວີ {productname}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:277
msgid "The activation key has the correct channels associated with it"
msgstr "Activation key ມີຊ່ອງທາງ (channels) ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງເຊື່ອມໂຍງຢູ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:278
msgid "The build sources used are valid"
msgstr "ແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນການສ້າງທີ່ໃຊ້ແມ່ນຖືກຕ້ອງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:279
msgid ""
"The RPM package with the {productname} public certificate is up to date and "
"available at "
"`/usr/share/susemanager/salt/images/rhn-org-trusted-ssl-cert-osimage-1.0-1.noarch.rpm`.  "
"For more on how to refresh a public certificate RPM, see "
"<<at.images.kiwi.buildhost>>."
msgstr "ແພັກເກດ RPM ທີ່ມີໃບຢັ້ງຢືນສາທາລະນະຂອງ {productname} ແມ່ນເປັນເວີຊັນຫຼ້າສຸດ ແລະ ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຢູ່ທີ່ `/usr/share/susemanager/salt/images/rhn-org-trusted-ssl-cert-osimage-1.0-1.noarch.rpm`. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບວິທີການອັບເດດໃບຢັ້ງຢືນສາທາລະນະ RPM, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ <<at.images.kiwi.buildhost>>."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:281
msgid "The section contains some known issues when working with images."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ບັນຈຸບັນຫາທີ່ພົບເລື້ອຍບາງຢ່າງເມື່ອເຮັດວຽກກັບອິເມຈ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:282
msgid ""
"HTTPS certificates used to access the HTTP sources or git repositories "
"should be deployed to the client by a custom state file, or configured "
"manually."
msgstr "ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ HTTPS ທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອເຂົ້າເຖິງແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນ HTTP ຫຼື git repositories ຄວນຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງໄປຍັງໄຄລເອັນໂດຍໃຊ້ໄຟລ໌ state ທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ ຫຼື ຕັ້ງຄ່າດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:283
msgid "Importing Kiwi-based images is not supported."
msgstr "ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບການນຳເຂົ້າອິເມຈທີ່ອີງໃສ່ Kiwi."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:284
#, no-wrap
msgid "List of built images"
msgstr "ລາຍການອິເມຈທີ່ສ້າງແລ້ວ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:285
msgid ""
"To list available built images select menu:Images[Image List].  A list of "
"all images is displayed."
msgstr "ເພື່ອເບິ່ງລາຍການອິເມຈທີ່ສ້າງແລ້ວໃຫ້ເລືອກເມນູ: Images[Image List]. ລາຍການອິເມຈທັງໝົດຈະຖືກສະແດງຂຶ້ນ."

#. type: Target for macro image
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:286
#, no-wrap
msgid "images_list_images.png"
msgstr "images_list_images.png"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:287
msgid ""
"Displayed data about images includes an image [guimenu]``Name``, its "
"[guimenu]``Version``, [guimenu]``Revision``, and the build "
"[guimenu]``Status``.  You can also see the image update status with a "
"listing of possible patch and package updates that are available for the "
"image."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ສະແດງກ່ຽວກັບອິເມຈລວມມີ [guimenu]``Name``, [guimenu]``Version``, [guimenu]``Revision``, ແລະ [guimenu]``Status`` ການສ້າງ. ເຈົ້າຍັງສາມາດເບິ່ງສະຖານະການອັບເດດອິເມຈ ພ້ອມກັບລາຍການແພັດ ແລະ ແພັກເກດອັບເດດທີ່ມີໃຫ້ສຳລັບອິເມຈນັ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:288
msgid ""
"For OS Images, the [guimenu]``Name`` and [guimenu]``Version`` fields "
"originate from Kiwi sources and are updated at the end of successful build.  "
"During building or after failed build these fields show a temporary name "
"based on profile name."
msgstr "ສຳລັບ OS Images, ຊ່ອງຂໍ້ມູນ [guimenu]``Name`` ແລະ [guimenu]``Version`` ແມ່ນມາຈາກແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນ Kiwi ແລະ ຈະຖືກອັບເດດເມື່ອການສ້າງສຳເລັດ. ໃນລະຫວ່າງການສ້າງ ຫຼື ຫຼັງຈາກການສ້າງລົ້ມເຫຼວ, ຊ່ອງຂໍ້ມູນເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະສະແດງຊື່ຊົ່ວຄາວທີ່ອີງຕາມຊື່ໂປຣໄຟລ໌."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:289
msgid ""
"[guimenu]``Revision`` is automatically increased after each successful "
"build. For OS Images, multiple revisions can co-exist in the store."
msgstr "[guimenu]``Revision`` ຈະຖືກເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດຫຼັງຈາກການສ້າງສຳເລັດແຕ່ລະຄັ້ງ. ສຳລັບ OS Images, ສາມາດມີຫຼາຍ revision ຢູ່ຮ່ວມກັນໃນບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:290
msgid ""
"For Container Images the store holds only the latest revision.  Information "
"about previous revisions (packages, patches, etc.) are preserved and it is "
"possible to list them with the [guimenu]``Show obsolete`` checkbox."
msgstr "ສຳລັບ Container Images, ບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນຈະເກັບສະເພາະ revision ຫຼ້າສຸດເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບ revision ກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້ (ແພັກເກດ, ແພັດ, ແລະ ອື່ນໆ) ຈະຖືກຮັກສາໄວ້ ແລະ ສາມາດເບິ່ງລາຍການໄດ້ໂດຍການເລືອກຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Show obsolete``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:291
msgid ""
"Clicking the btn:[Details] button on an image provides a detailed view.  The "
"detailed view includes an exact list of relevant patches, list of all "
"packages installed within the image and a build log."
msgstr "ການຄລິກປຸ່ມ btn:[Details] ໃນອິເມຈຈະສະແດງລາຍລະອຽດ. ມຸມມອງລະອຽດຈະລວມມີລາຍການແພັດທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ, ລາຍການແພັກເກດທັງໝົດທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງໃນອິເມຈ ແລະ ບັນທຶກການສ້າງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:292
msgid ""
"Clicking the btn:[Delete] button deletes the image from the list.  It also "
"deletes the associated pillar, files from OS Image Store and obsolete "
"revisions."
msgstr "ການຄລິກປຸ່ມ btn:[Delete] ຈະລຶບອິເມຈອອກຈາກລາຍການ. ມັນຍັງຈະລຶບ pillar ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ, ໄຟລ໌ຈາກ OS Image Store ແລະ revision ທີ່ເກົ່າແລ້ວອອກນຳ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:293
msgid ""
"The patch and the package list is only available if the inspect state after "
"a build was successful."
msgstr "ລາຍການແພັດ ແລະ ແພັກເກດຈະມີໃຫ້ເບິ່ງກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອຂັ້ນຕອນການກວດສອບ (inspect state) ຫຼັງການສ້າງສຳເລັດເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Infrastructure maintenance tasks"
msgstr "ວຽກງານການບຳລຸງຮັກສາໂຄງລ່າງພື້ນຖານ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:2
msgid ""
"If you work with scheduled downtime periods, you might find it difficult to "
"remember all the things that you need to do before, during, and after that "
"critical downtime of the {productname} Server.  {productname} Server related "
"systems such as Inter-Server Synchronization Slave Servers or {productname} "
"Proxies are also affected and have to be considered."
msgstr "ຖ້າເຈົ້າເຮັດວຽກກັບຊ່ວງເວລາຢຸດພັກລະບົບທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້, ເຈົ້າອາດຈະຈື່ທຸກຢ່າງທີ່ຕ້ອງເຮັດກ່ອນ, ໃນລະຫວ່າງ ແລະ ຫຼັງການຢຸດພັກລະບົບທີ່ສຳຄັນຂອງເຊີເວີ {productname} ໄດ້ຍາກ. ລະບົບທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບເຊີເວີ {productname} ເຊັ່ນ Inter-Server Synchronization Slave Servers ຫຼື {productname} Proxies ກໍໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບ ແລະ ຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການພິຈາລະນາເຊັ່ນກັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:3
msgid ""
"{suse} recommends you always keep your {productname} infrastructure "
"updated.  That includes servers, proxies, and build hosts.  If you do not "
"keep the {productname} Server updated, you might not be able to update some "
"parts of your environment when you need to."
msgstr "{suse} ແນະນຳໃຫ້ເຈົ້າອັບເດດໂຄງລ່າງພື້ນຖານ {productname} ຢູ່ສະເໝີ. ເຊິ່ງລວມເຖິງເຊີເວີ, ພຣັອກຊີ (proxies), ແລະ ເຄື່ອງທີ່ໃຊ້ສ້າງ (build hosts). ຖ້າເຈົ້າບໍ່ອັບເດດເຊີເວີ {productname}, ເຈົ້າອາດຈະບໍ່ສາມາດອັບເດດບາງສ່ວນຂອງລະບົບໃນເວລາທີ່ຈຳເປັນໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:4
msgid ""
"This section contains a checklist for your downtime period, with links to "
"further information on performing each of the steps."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ບັນຈຸລາຍການສິ່ງທີ່ຕ້ອງກວດສອບ (checklist) ສຳລັບຊ່ວງເວລາຢຸດພັກລະບົບຂອງທ່ານ, ພ້ອມກັບລິ້ງໄປຫາຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມໃນການປະຕິບັດແຕ່ລະຂັ້ນຕອນ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Server"
msgstr "ເຊີເວີ"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Server checks"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການກວດສອບເຊີເວີ"

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:7
msgid "Apply the latest updates."
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງການອັບເດດຫຼ້າສຸດ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:8
msgid "Upgrade to the latest service pack, if required."
msgstr "ອັບເກຣດເປັນ service pack ຫຼ້າສຸດ ຖ້າຈຳເປັນ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Run [command]``podman ps`` and check whether all required services are up "
"and running."
msgstr "ລັນຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``podman ps`` ແລະ ກວດສອບວ່າການບໍລິການທີ່ຈຳເປັນທັງໝົດເປີດໃຊ້ງານຢູ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:10
msgid "On {sles} {bci-suma}, you can install updates using a package manager:"
msgstr "ໃນ {sles} {bci-suma}, ເຈົ້າສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງການອັບເດດໂດຍໃຊ້ຕົວຈັດການແພັກເກດ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:11
msgid ""
"For information on using {yast}, see "
"{sles-base-os-documentation}/cha-onlineupdate-you.html."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບການໃຊ້ {yast}, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ {sles-base-os-documentation}/cha-onlineupdate-you.html."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:12
msgid ""
"For information on using zypper, see "
"{sles-base-os-documentation}/cha-sw-cl.html#sec-zypper."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບການໃຊ້ zypper, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ {sles-base-os-documentation}/cha-sw-cl.html#sec-zypper."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:13
msgid ""
"On {sl-micro} {microversion}, you can install updates using the "
"[command]``transactional-update`` command.  For information on using "
"[command]``transactional-update``, see "
"https://documentation.suse.com/sle-micro/5.5/html/SLE-Micro-all/cha-upgrade-preparation-slemicro.html#sec-update-slemicro-update."
msgstr "ໃນ {sl-micro} {microversion}, ເຈົ້າສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງການອັບເດດໂດຍໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``transactional-update``. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບການໃຊ້ [command]``transactional-update``, ເບິ່ງ https://documentation.suse.com/sle-micro/5.5/html/SLE-Micro-all/cha-upgrade-preparation-slemicro.html#sec-update-slemicro-update."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:14
msgid ""
"By default, several update channels are configured and enabled for the "
"{productname} Server.  New and updated packages become available "
"automatically."
msgstr "ຕາມຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ຊ່ອງທາງການອັບເດດຫຼາຍຊ່ອງທາງຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າ ແລະ ເປີດໃຊ້ງານສຳລັບເຊີເວີ {productname}. ແພັກເກດໃໝ່ ແລະ ທີ່ອັບເດດແລ້ວຈະມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:15
msgid ""
"To keep {susemgr} up to date, either connect it directly to {scclongform} or "
"use {rmtool} (RMT).  You can use RMT as a local installation source for "
"disconnected environments."
msgstr "ເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ {susemgr} ເປັນເວີຊັນໃໝ່ຢູ່ສະເໝີ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໂດຍກົງກັບ {scclongform} ຫຼື ໃຊ້ {rmtool} (RMT). ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ RMT ເປັນແຫຼ່ງຕິດຕັ້ງພາຍໃນສຳລັບສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ອິນເຕີເນັດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:16
msgid ""
"You can check that the update channels are available on your system with "
"this command:"
msgstr "ເຈົ້າສາມາດກວດສອບວ່າຊ່ອງທາງການອັບເດດມີຢູ່ໃນລະບົບຂອງເຈົ້າຫຼືບໍ່ ດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "zypper lr\n"
msgstr "zypper lr\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:18
msgid "The output looks similar to this:"
msgstr "ຜົນທີ່ສະແດງຈະຄ້າຍຄືກັບແບບນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
