"Name                                                   | Enabled | GPG Check "
"| Refresh\n"
"-------------------------------------------------------+---------+-----------+--------\n"
"SLE-Module-Basesystem15-SP6-Pool                       | Yes     | (r ) Yes  "
"| No\n"
"SLE-Module-Basesystem15-SP6-Updates                    | Yes     | (r ) Yes  "
"| Yes\n"
"SLE-Module-Containers15-SP6-Pool                       | Yes     | (r ) Yes  "
"| No\n"
"SLE-Module-Containers15-SP6-Updates                    | Yes     | (r ) Yes  "
"| Yes\n"
"SLE-Module-Python3-15-SP6-Pool                         | Yes     | (r ) Yes  "
"| No\n"
"SLE-Module-Python3-15-SP6-Updates                      | Yes     | (r ) Yes  "
"| Yes\n"
"SLE-Product-SLES15-SP6-Pool                            | Yes     | (r ) Yes  "
"| No\n"
