"Every salt_queue value has a label named `queue` with the queue number as "
"value."
msgstr "ທຸກຄ່າ salt_queue ຈະມີປ້າຍຊື່ (label) ຊື່ວ່າ `queue` ພ້ອມກັບເລກລຳດັບຄິວເປັນຄ່າ."

#. type: Block title
