#. type: Title ===
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:135
#, no-wrap
msgid "Monitoring Managed Systems"
msgstr "ການຕິດຕາມລະບົບທີ່ຖືກຈັດການ (Monitoring Managed Systems)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:136
msgid ""
"Prometheus metrics exporters can be installed and configured on Salt clients "
"using formulas.  The packages are available from the {productname} client "
"tools channels, and can be enabled and configured directly in the "
"{productname} {webui}."
msgstr "Prometheus metrics exporters ສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງ ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າໃນລູກຂ່າຍ Salt ໂດຍໃຊ້ formulas ໄດ້. ແພັກເກັດເຫຼົ່ານີ້ມີໃຫ້ໃນຊ່ອງທາງ client tools ຂອງ {productname}, ແລະ ສາມາດເປີດໃຊ້ງານ ພ້ອມທັງຕັ້ງຄ່າໄດ້ໂດຍກົງໃນ {productname} {webui}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:137
msgid "These exporters can be installed on managed systems:"
msgstr "Exporters ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງໃນລະບົບທີ່ຖືກຈັດການໄດ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:142
msgid "Apache exporter: [systemitem]``golang-github-lusitaniae-apache_exporter``."
msgstr "Apache exporter: [systemitem]``golang-github-lusitaniae-apache_exporter``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:143
msgid "See https://github.com/Lusitaniae/apache_exporter."
msgstr "ເບິ່ງ https://github.com/Lusitaniae/apache_exporter."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:144
msgid ""
"On {sle-micro}, only the Node exporter and the Blackbox exporter are "
"available."
msgstr "ໃນ {sle-micro}, ມີພຽງແຕ່ Node exporter ແລະ Blackbox exporter ເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:145
msgid ""
"When you have the exporters installed and configured, you can start using "
"Prometheus to collect metrics from the monitored systems.  If you have "
"configured your monitoring server with the {webui}, metrics collection "
"happens automatically."
msgstr "ເມື່ອເຈົ້າຕິດຕັ້ງ ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າ exporters ແລ້ວ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດເລີ່ມໃຊ້ Prometheus ເພື່ອເກັບກຳຕົວຊີ້ວັດຈາກລະບົບທີ່ຖືກຕິດຕາມໄດ້. ຖ້າເຈົ້າໄດ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າເຊີເວີຕິດຕາມຜ່ານ {webui}, ການເກັບກຳຕົວຊີ້ວັດຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:146
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Configuring Prometheus Exporters on a Client"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ Prometheus Exporters ໃນລູກຂ່າຍ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:147
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, open the details page of the client to be "
"monitored, and navigate to the menu:Formulas[] tab."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ເປີດໜ້າລາຍລະອຽດຂອງໄຄລເອັນທີ່ຕ້ອງການຕິດຕາມ, ແລະ ໄປທີ່ແຖບ ເມນູ: Formulas[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:148
msgid ""
"Check the [guimenu]``Enabled`` checkbox on the ``Prometheus Exporters`` "
"formula."
msgstr "ເລືອກຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Enabled`` ໃນ formula ຂອງ ``Prometheus Exporters``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:150
msgid "Navigate to the menu:Formulas[Prometheus Exporters] tab."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ແຖບ ເມນູ: Formulas[Prometheus Exporters]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:151
msgid ""
"Select the exporters you want to enable and customize arguments according to "
"your needs."
msgstr "ເລືອກ exporters ທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການເປີດໃຊ້ ແລະ ປັບແຕ່ງອາກິວເມນຕາມຄວາມຕ້ອງການ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:152
msgid ""
"The [guimenu]``Address`` field accepts either a port number preceded by a "
"colon (``:9100``), or a fully resolvable address (``example:9100``)."
msgstr "ຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Address`` ຮອງຮັບທັງເລກພອດທີ່ນຳໜ້າດ້ວຍຈ້ຳສອງເມັດ (``:9100``), ຫຼື ທີ່ຢູ່ທີ່ລະບຸຊື່ໄດ້ຢ່າງສົມບູນ (``example:9100``)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:154
msgid "Apply the highstate."
msgstr "ນຳໃຊ້ highstate."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:155
msgid ""
"Monitoring formulas can also be configured for System Groups, by applying "
"the same configuration used for individual systems inside the corresponding "
"group."
msgstr "Formulas ການຕິດຕາມຍັງສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າສຳລັບກຸ່ມລະບົບ (System Groups) ໄດ້, ໂດຍການນຳໃຊ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າດຽວກັນກັບທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນແຕ່ລະລະບົບພາຍໃນກຸ່ມນັ້ນ."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:157
#, no-wrap
msgid "Change Grafana Password"
msgstr "ປ່ຽນລະຫັດຜ່ານ Grafana"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:158
msgid ""
"To change the Grafana password follow the steps described in the Grafana "
"documentation:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອປ່ຽນລະຫັດຜ່ານ Grafana ໃຫ້ປະຕິບັດຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນທີ່ອະທິບາຍໄວ້ໃນເອກະສານຂອງ Grafana:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:159
msgid "https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/latest/administration/user-management/user-preferences/#change-your-grafana-password"
msgstr "https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/latest/administration/user-management/user-preferences/#change-your-grafana-password"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:160
msgid ""
"In case you have lost the Grafana administrator password you can reset it as "
"[literal]``root`` with the following command:"
msgstr "ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ເຈົ້າເສຍລະຫັດຜ່ານຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບ Grafana, ເຈົ້າສາມາດຣີເຊັດມັນໄດ້ໃນນາມ [literal]``root`` ດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:161
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"grafana-cli --configOverrides cfg:default.paths.data=/var/lib/grafana "
"--homepath /usr/share/grafana admin reset-admin-password <new_password>\n"
msgstr "grafana-cli --configOverrides cfg:default.paths.data=/var/lib/grafana --homepath /usr/share/grafana admin reset-admin-password <ລະຫັດຜ່ານໃໝ່>\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:162
#, no-wrap
msgid "Network Boundaries"
msgstr "ຂອບເຂດເຄືອຂ່າຍ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:163
msgid ""
"Prometheus fetches metrics using a pull mechanism, so the server must be "
"able to establish TCP connections to monitored clients.  By default, "
"Prometheus uses these ports:"
msgstr "Prometheus ດຶງຂໍ້ມູນ metrics ໂດຍໃຊ້ກົນໄກການດຶງ (pull mechanism), ດັ່ງນັ້ນ ເຊີເວີຕ້ອງສາມາດ ສ້າງການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ TCP ໄປຫາຄລາຍແອນ (client) ທີ່ຖືກຕິດຕາມໄດ້. ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, Prometheus ໃຊ້ພອດເຫຼົ່ານີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:164
msgid "Node exporter: 9100"
msgstr "Node exporter: 9100"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:165
msgid "PostgreSQL exporter: 9187"
msgstr "PostgreSQL exporter: 9187"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:166
msgid "Apache exporter: 9117"
msgstr "Apache exporter: 9117"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:167
msgid ""
"Additionally, if you are running the alert manager on a different host than "
"where you run Prometheus, you also need to open port 9093.  The alert "
"manager is part of Prometheus solution.  It handles alerts sent by client "
"applications such as the Prometheus server instance.  For more information "
"about the alert manager, see "
"https://prometheus.io/docs/alerting/latest/alertmanager/."
msgstr "ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ, ຖ້າທ່ານກຳລັງເປີດໃຊ້ຕົວຈັດການການແຈ້ງເຕືອນ (alert manager) ຢູ່ໃນໂຮສ (host) ອື່ນ ທີ່ຕ່າງຈາກບ່ອນທີ່ທ່ານເປີດໃຊ້ Prometheus, ທ່ານຍັງຕ້ອງເປີດພອດ 9093. ຕົວຈັດການການແຈ້ງເຕືອນ ແມ່ນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງໂຊລູຊັນ Prometheus. ມັນຈັດການກັບການແຈ້ງເຕືອນທີ່ສົ່ງມາຈາກແອັບພລິເຄຊັນຄລາຍແອນ ເຊັ່ນ instance ຂອງເຊີເວີ Prometheus. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບຕົວຈັດການການແຈ້ງເຕືອນ, ເບິ່ງ https://prometheus.io/docs/alerting/latest/alertmanager/."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:168
msgid ""
"For clients installed on cloud instances, you can add the required ports to "
"a security group that has access to the monitoring server."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຄລາຍແອນທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງຢູ່ໃນ cloud instances, ທ່ານສາມາດເພີ່ມພອດທີ່ຈຳເປັນເຂົ້າໃນ ກຸ່ມຄວາມປອດໄພ (security group) ທີ່ມີສິດເຂົ້າເຖິງເຊີເວີການຕິດຕາມໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:169
msgid ""
"Alternatively, you can deploy a Prometheus instance in the exporters' local "
"network, and configure federation.  This allows the main monitoring server "
"to scrape the time series from the local Prometheus instance.  If you use "
"this method, you only need to open the Prometheus API port, which is 9090."
msgstr "ອີກທາງເລືອກໜຶ່ງ, ທ່ານສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງ instance ຂອງ Prometheus ໃນເຄືອຂ່າຍທ້ອງຖິ່ນຂອງ exporters, ແລະກຳນົດຄ່າ federation. ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຊີເວີການຕິດຕາມຫຼັກສາມາດເກັບກຳຂໍ້ມູນ (scrape) time series ຈາກ instance ຂອງ Prometheus ທ້ອງຖິ່ນໄດ້. ຖ້າທ່ານໃຊ້ວິທີນີ້, ທ່ານພຽງແຕ່ຕ້ອງເປີດພອດ Prometheus API, ເຊິ່ງແມ່ນ 9090."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:170
msgid ""
"For more information on Prometheus federation, see "
"https://prometheus.io/docs/prometheus/latest/federation/."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ Prometheus federation, ເບິ່ງ https://prometheus.io/docs/prometheus/latest/federation/."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:171
msgid ""
"You can also proxy requests through the network boundary.  Tools like "
"PushProx deploy a proxy and a client on both sides of the network barrier "
"and allow Prometheus to work across network topologies such as NAT."
msgstr "ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດສົ່ງຄຳຮ້ອງຂໍຜ່ານຕົວແທນ (proxy) ຜ່ານຂອບເຂດເຄືອຂ່າຍໄດ້. ເຄື່ອງມືເຊັ່ນ PushProx ຈະຕິດຕັ້ງ proxy ແລະ ຄລາຍແອນ ໄວ້ທັງສອງດ້ານຂອງສິ່ງກີດຂວາງເຄືອຂ່າຍ ແລະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ Prometheus ສາມາດເຮັດວຽກຂ້າມ topology ຂອງເຄືອຂ່າຍ ເຊັ່ນ NAT ໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:172
msgid ""
"For more information on PushProx, see "
"https://github.com/RobustPerception/PushProx."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ PushProx, ເບິ່ງ https://github.com/RobustPerception/PushProx."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:173
#, no-wrap
msgid "Reverse Proxy Setup"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ Reverse Proxy"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:174
msgid ""
"Prometheus fetches metrics using a pull mechanism, so the server must be "
"able to establish TCP connections to each exporter on the monitored "
"clients.  To simplify your firewall configuration, you can use reverse proxy "
"for your exporters to expose all metrics on a single port."
msgstr "Prometheus ດຶງຂໍ້ມູນ metrics ໂດຍໃຊ້ກົນໄກການດຶງ (pull mechanism), ດັ່ງນັ້ນ ເຊີເວີຕ້ອງສາມາດ ສ້າງການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ TCP ໄປຫາແຕ່ລະ exporter ໃນຄລາຍແອນທີ່ຖືກຕິດຕາມ. ເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ firewall ຂອງທ່ານງ່າຍຂຶ້ນ, ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ reverse proxy ສຳລັບ exporters ຂອງທ່ານເພື່ອ ສະແດງ metrics ທັງໝົດຜ່ານພອດດຽວ."

#.  Probably a diagram here. --LKB 2020-08-11
#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:175
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Installing Prometheus Exporters with Reverse Proxy"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕິດຕັ້ງ Prometheus Exporters ດ້ວຍ Reverse Proxy"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:176
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, open the details page of the system to be "
"monitored, and navigate to the [guimenu]``Formulas`` tab."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໃຫ້ເປີດໜ້າລາຍລະອຽດຂອງລະບົບທີ່ຈະຖືກຕິດຕາມ, ແລ້ວໄປທີ່ ແທັບ [guimenu]``Formulas``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:177
msgid ""
"Check the [guimenu]``Prometheus Exporters`` checkbox to enable the exporters "
"formula, and click btn:[Save]."
msgstr "ໝາຍຕິກໃສ່ຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Prometheus Exporters`` ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ສູດ (formula) ຂອງ exporters, ແລ້ວກົດ btn:[Save]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:178
msgid "Navigate to the ``Prometheus Exporters`` tab in the top menu."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ແທັບ ``Prometheus Exporters`` ໃນເມນູດ້ານເທິງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:179
msgid ""
"Check the [guimenu]``Enable reverse proxy`` option, and enter a valid "
"reverse proxy port number."
msgstr "ໝາຍຕິກເອົາຕົວເລືອກ [guimenu]``Enable reverse proxy``, ແລ້ວປ້ອນໝາຍເລກພອດ reverse proxy ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:180
msgid "For example, ``9999``."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ, ``9999``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:181
msgid "Customize the other exporters according to your needs."
msgstr "ປັບແຕ່ງ exporters ອື່ນໆ ຕາມຄວາມຕ້ອງການຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:186
msgid ""
"Prometheus server and Prometheus node exporter offer a built-in mechanism to "
"secure their endpoints with TLS encryption and authentication.  "
"{productname} {webui} simplifies the configuration of all involved "
"components. The TLS certificates have to be provided and deployed by the "
"user.  {productname} offers enabling the following security model:"
msgstr "ເຊີເວີ Prometheus ແລະ Prometheus node exporter ມີກົນໄກໃນຕົວເພື່ອຮັກສາຄວາມປອດໄພ ຈຸດເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ (endpoints) ດ້ວຍການເຂົ້າລະຫັດ TLS ແລະການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ. {productname} {webui} ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າທຸກອົງປະກອບທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງງ່າຍຂຶ້ນ. ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ TLS ຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການສະໜອງ ແລະຕິດຕັ້ງໂດຍຜູ້ໃຊ້. {productname} ຮອງຮັບການເປີດໃຊ້ຮູບແບບຄວາມປອດໄພດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:187
msgid "Node exporter: TLS encryption and client certificate based authentication"
msgstr "Node exporter: ການເຂົ້າລະຫັດ TLS ແລະການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນໂດຍໃຊ້ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນຄລາຍແອນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:188
msgid "Prometheus: TLS encryption and basic authentication"
msgstr "Prometheus: ການເຂົ້າລະຫັດ TLS ແລະການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນແບບພື້ນຖານ (basic authentication)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:189
msgid ""
"For more information about configuring all available options, see "
"xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າຕົວເລືອກທັງໝົດທີ່ມີ, ເບິ່ງ xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:190
#, no-wrap
msgid "Generating TLS certificates"
msgstr "ການສ້າງໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ TLS"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:191
msgid ""
"By default, {productname} does not provide any certificates for securing "
"monitoring configuration.  For providing security, you can generate or "
"import custom certificates, self-signed or signed by a third party "
"certificate authority (CA)."
msgstr "ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, {productname} ບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຫ້ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນໃດໆ ສຳລັບການຮັກສາຄວາມປອດໄພຂອງ ການຕັ້ງຄ່າການຕິດຕາມ. ເພື່ອຄວາມປອດໄພ, ທ່ານສາມາດສ້າງ ຫຼື ນຳເຂົ້າໃບຢັ້ງຢືນທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ, ບໍ່ວ່າຈະເປັນແບບເຊັນດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ (self-signed) ຫຼື ເຊັນໂດຍຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການອອກໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ (CA)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:192
msgid ""
"This section demonstrates how to generate client/server certificates for "
"Prometheus and Node exporter minions self-signed with {productname} CA."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ສະແດງວິທີການສ້າງໃບຢັ້ງຢືນຄລາຍແອນ/ເຊີເວີ ສຳລັບ Prometheus ແລະ Node exporter minions ແບບເຊັນດ້ວຍຕົນເອງດ້ວຍ {productname} CA."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:193
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating server/client TLS certificate"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ TLS ຂອງເຊີເວີ/ຄລາຍແອນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:194
msgid "On the {productname} Server, at the command prompt, run following command:"
msgstr "ຢູ່ເທິງ {productname} Server, ໃນໜ້າຈໍຄຳສັ່ງ (command prompt), ໃຫ້ລັນຄຳສັ່ງດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:195
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"rhn-ssl-tool --gen-server --dir=\"/root/ssl-build\" "
"--set-country=\"COUNTRY\" \\\n"
"--set-state=\"STATE\" --set-city=\"CITY\" --set-org=\"ORGANIZATION\" \\\n"
"--set-org-unit=\"ORGANIZATION UNIT\" --set-email=\"name@example.com\" \\\n"
"--set-hostname=\"minion.example.com\" --set-cname=\"minion.example.com\" "
"--no-rpm\n"
msgstr ""
"rhn-ssl-tool --gen-server --dir=\"/root/ssl-build\" --set-country=\"COUNTRY\" \\\n"
"--set-state=\"STATE\" --set-city=\"CITY\" --set-org=\"ORGANIZATION\" \\\n"
"--set-org-unit=\"ORGANIZATION UNIT\" --set-email=\"name@example.com\" \\\n"
"--set-hostname=\"minion.example.com\" --set-cname=\"minion.example.com\" --no-rpm\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:196
msgid ""
"Ensure that the [systemitem]``set-cname`` parameter is the fully qualified "
"domain name (FQDN) of your Salt client.  You can use the "
"[systemitem]``set-cname`` parameter multiple times if you require multiple "
"aliases."
msgstr "ກວດສອບໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າພາຣາມິເຕີ [systemitem]``set-cname`` ແມ່ນຊື່ໂດເມນເຕັມ (FQDN) ຂອງ Salt client ຂອງທ່ານ. ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ພາຣາມິເຕີ [systemitem]``set-cname`` ຫຼາຍຄັ້ງໄດ້ ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການຊື່ອ້າງອີງ (aliases) ຫຼາຍຊື່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:197
msgid ""
"Copy ``server.crt`` and ``server.key`` files to the Salt minion and provide "
"read access for ``prometheus`` user."
msgstr "ສຳເນົາໄຟລ໌ ``server.crt`` ແລະ ``server.key`` ໄປຍັງ Salt minion ແລະ ກຳນົດສິດການອ່ານໃຫ້ກັບຜູ້ໃຊ້ ``prometheus``."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "System Security with OpenSCAP"
msgstr "ຄວາມປອດໄພຂອງລະບົບດ້ວຍ OpenSCAP"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:2
msgid ""
"{productname} uses OpenSCAP to audit clients.  It allows you to schedule and "
"view compliance scans for any client."
msgstr "{productname} ໃຊ້ OpenSCAP ເພື່ອກວດສອບຄລາຍແອນ. ມັນຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດກຳນົດເວລາ ແລະເບິ່ງການສະແກນຄວາມສອດຄ່ອງ (compliance scans) ສຳລັບຄລາຍແອນໃດໆ ກໍໄດ້."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "About SCAP"
msgstr "ກ່ຽວກັບ SCAP"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:4
msgid ""
"The Security Content Automation Protocol (SCAP) is a synthesis of "
"interoperable specifications derived from community ideas.  It is a line of "
"specifications maintained by the National Institute of Standards and "
"Technology (NIST) for maintaining system security for enterprise systems."
msgstr "Security Content Automation Protocol (SCAP) ແມ່ນການລວບລວມຂໍ້ກຳນົດທາງເຕັກນິກ ທີ່ສາມາດເຮັດວຽກຮ່ວມກັນໄດ້ ເຊິ່ງໄດ້ມາຈາກແນວຄວາມຄິດຂອງຊຸມຊົນ. ມັນແມ່ນຊຸດຂອງຂໍ້ກຳນົດ ທີ່ຖືກຄຸ້ມຄອງໂດຍສະຖາບັນມາດຕະຖານ ແລະ ເຕັກໂນໂລຊີແຫ່ງຊາດ (NIST) ເພື່ອຮັກສາ ຄວາມປອດໄພຂອງລະບົບສຳລັບລະບົບວິສາຫະກິດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:5
msgid ""
"SCAP was created to provide a standardized approach to maintaining system "
"security, and the standards that are used continually change to meet the "
"needs of the community and enterprise businesses.  New specifications are "
"governed by NIST's SCAP Release cycle to provide a consistent and repeatable "
"revision work flow.  For more information, see:"
msgstr "SCAP ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນເພື່ອສະໜອງແນວທາງມາດຕະຖານໃນການຮັກສາຄວາມປອດໄພຂອງລະບົບ, ແລະ ມາດຕະຖານທີ່ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ແມ່ນມີການປ່ຽນແປງຢ່າງຕໍ່ເນື່ອງເພື່ອຕອບສະໜອງຄວາມຕ້ອງການຂອງຊຸມຊົນ ແລະ ທຸລະກິດວິສາຫະກິດ. ຂໍ້ກຳນົດໃໝ່ແມ່ນຖືກກຳນົດໂດຍຮອບວຽນການປ່ອຍ SCAP ຂອງ NIST ເພື່ອໃຫ້ມີຂັ້ນຕອນການປັບປຸງທີ່ສອດຄ່ອງ ແລະ ສາມາດເຮັດຊ້ຳໄດ້. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:6
msgid "https://csrc.nist.gov/projects/security-content-automation-protocol"
msgstr "https://csrc.nist.gov/projects/security-content-automation-protocol"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:7
msgid "https://www.open-scap.org/features/standards/"
msgstr "https://www.open-scap.org/features/standards/"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:8
msgid "https://ncp.nist.gov/repository?scap"
msgstr "https://ncp.nist.gov/repository?scap"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:9
msgid ""
"{productname} uses OpenSCAP to implement the SCAP specifications.  OpenSCAP "
"is an auditing tool that utilizes the Extensible Configuration Checklist "
"Description Format (XCCDF).  XCCDF is a standard way of expressing checklist "
"content and defines security checklists.  It also combines with other "
"specifications such as Common Platform Enumeration (CPE), Common "
"Configuration Enumeration (CCE), and Open Vulnerability and Assessment "
"Language (OVAL), to create a SCAP-expressed checklist that can be processed "
"by SCAP-validated products."
msgstr "{productname} ໃຊ້ OpenSCAP ເພື່ອປະຕິບັດຕາມຂໍ້ກຳນົດຂອງ SCAP. OpenSCAP ແມ່ນເຄື່ອງມື ການກວດສອບທີ່ໃຊ້ Extensible Configuration Checklist Description Format (XCCDF). XCCDF ແມ່ນວິທີການມາດຕະຖານໃນການສະແດງເນື້ອຫາຂອງ checklist ແລະກຳນົດ checklists ຄວາມປອດໄພ. ມັນຍັງລວມເຂົ້າກັບຂໍ້ກຳນົດອື່ນໆ ເຊັ່ນ Common Platform Enumeration (CPE), Common Configuration Enumeration (CCE), ແລະ Open Vulnerability and Assessment Language (OVAL), ເພື່ອສ້າງ checklist ຕາມຮູບແບບ SCAP ທີ່ສາມາດ ປະມວນຜົນໄດ້ໂດຍຜະລິດຕະພັນທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບການຢັ້ງຢືນ SCAP."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:10
msgid ""
"OpenSCAP verifies the presence of patches by using content produced by the "
"{suse} Security Team.  OpenSCAP checks system security configuration "
"settings and examines systems for signs of compromise by using rules based "
"on standards and specifications.  For more information about the {suse} "
"Security Team, see https://www.suse.com/support/security."
msgstr "OpenSCAP ກວດສອບການມີຢູ່ຂອງແພັດ (patches) ໂດຍໃຊ້ເນື້ອຫາທີ່ຜະລິດໂດຍທີມງານຄວາມປອດໄພ ຂອງ {suse}. OpenSCAP ກວດສອບການຕັ້ງຄ່າຄວາມປອດໄພຂອງລະບົບ ແລະກວດສອບລະບົບ ເພື່ອຫາຮ່ອງຮອຍການຖືກບຸກລຸກ ໂດຍໃຊ້ກົດເກນທີ່ອີງໃສ່ມາດຕະຖານ ແລະຂໍ້ກຳນົດ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນ ເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບທີມງານຄວາມປອດໄພຂອງ {suse}, ເບິ່ງ https://www.suse.com/support/security."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prepare clients for an SCAP scan"
msgstr "ກຽມຄລາຍແອນສຳລັບການສະແກນ SCAP"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:12
msgid "Before you begin, you need to prepare your client systems for SCAP scanning."
msgstr "ກ່ອນທີ່ທ່ານຈະເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງກຽມລະບົບຄລາຍແອນຂອງທ່ານສຳລັບການສະແກນ SCAP."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:13
msgid ""
"OpenSCAP auditing is not available on Salt clients that use the SSH contact "
"method."
msgstr "ການກວດສອບ OpenSCAP ບໍ່ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໃນຄລາຍແອນ Salt ທີ່ໃຊ້ວິທີການຕິດຕໍ່ແບບ SSH."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:14
msgid ""
"Scanning clients can consume a lot of memory and compute power on the client "
"being scanned.  For {redhat} clients, ensure you have at least 2{nbsp}GB of "
"RAM available on each client to be scanned."
msgstr "ການສະແກນຄລາຍແອນອາດຈະໃຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ ແລະ ພະລັງການປະມວນຜົນຫຼາຍໃນຄລາຍແອນ ທີ່ຖືກສະແກນ. ສຳລັບຄລາຍແອນ {redhat}, ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າທ່ານມີ RAM ຢ່າງໜ້ອຍ 2{nbsp}GB ໃນແຕ່ລະຄລາຍແອນທີ່ຈະຖືກສະແກນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:15
msgid ""
"Install the OpenSCAP scanner and the SCAP Security Guide (content) packages "
"on the client before you begin.  Depending on the operating system, these "
"packages are included either on the base operating system, or in the "
"{productname} Client Tools."
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງ OpenSCAP scanner ແລະ ແພັກເກດ SCAP Security Guide (ເນື້ອຫາ) ໃສ່ໃນ ຄລາຍແອນກ່ອນທີ່ທ່ານຈະເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ຂຶ້ນກັບລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ, ແພັກເກດເຫຼົ່ານີ້ອາດຈະ ລວມຢູ່ໃນລະບົບປະຕິບັດການພື້ນຖານ ຫຼື ຢູ່ໃນ {productname} Client Tools."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:16
msgid "The table below lists the packages you need:"
msgstr "ຕາຕະລາງຂ້າງລຸ່ມນີ້ສະແດງລາຍຊື່ແພັກເກດທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການ:"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "OpenSCAP packages"
msgstr "ແພັກເກດ OpenSCAP"

#. type: Table
#: modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Operating system | Scanner | Content\n"
"| SLES | openscap-utils | scap-security-guide\n"
"| openSUSE | openscap-utils | scap-security-guide\n"
"| RHEL | openscap-utils | scap-security-guide-redhat\n"
"| CentOS | openscap-utils | scap-security-guide-redhat\n"
"| Oracle Linux | openscap-utils | scap-security-guide-redhat\n"
"| Ubuntu | libopenscap8 | scap-security-guide-ubuntu\n"
"| Debian | libopenscap8 | scap-security-guide-debian\n"
msgstr ""
"| ລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ | Scanner | ເນື້ອຫາ\n"
"| SLES | openscap-utils | scap-security-guide\n"
"| openSUSE | openscap-utils | scap-security-guide\n"
"| RHEL | openscap-utils | scap-security-guide-redhat\n"
"| CentOS | openscap-utils | scap-security-guide-redhat\n"
"| Oracle Linux | openscap-utils | scap-security-guide-redhat\n"
"| Ubuntu | libopenscap8 | scap-security-guide-ubuntu\n"
"| Debian | libopenscap8 | scap-security-guide-debian\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:19
msgid ""
"RHEL 7 and compatible systems provide a [package]``scap-security-guide`` "
"package, which contains outdated contents.  You are advised to use the "
"[package]``scap-security-guide-redhat`` package you will find in the "
"{productname} Client Tools."
msgstr "RHEL 7 ແລະ ລະບົບທີ່ເຂົ້າກັນໄດ້ຈະໃຫ້ແພັກເກດ [package]``scap-security-guide``, ເຊິ່ງມີເນື້ອຫາທີ່ລ້າສະໄໝ. ຂໍແນະນຳໃຫ້ທ່ານໃຊ້ແພັກເກດ [package]``scap-security-guide-redhat`` ເຊິ່ງທ່ານສາມາດຊອກຫາໄດ້ໃນ {productname} Client Tools."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:20
msgid ""
"{suse} provides the [package]``scap-security-guide`` package for different "
"openscap profiles.  In the current version of "
"[package]``scap-security-guide``, {suse} supports the following profiles:"
msgstr "{suse} ໃຫ້ແພັກເກດ [package]``scap-security-guide`` ສຳລັບໂປຣໄຟລ໌ openscap ຕ່າງໆ. ໃນເວີຊັນປັດຈຸບັນຂອງ [package]``scap-security-guide``, {suse} ຮອງຮັບໂປຣໄຟລ໌ດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:21
msgid "DISA STIG profile for {sles} 12 and 15"
msgstr "ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ DISA STIG ສຳລັບ {sles} 12 ແລະ 15"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:22
msgid "ANSSI-BP-028 profile for {sles} 12 and 15"
msgstr "ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ ANSSI-BP-028 ສຳລັບ {sles} 12 ແລະ 15"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:23
msgid "PCI-DSS profile for {sles} 12 and 15"
msgstr "ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ PCI-DSS ສຳລັບ {sles} 12 ແລະ 15"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:24
msgid "HIPAA profile for {sles} 15"
msgstr "ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ HIPAA ສຳລັບ {sles} 15"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:25
msgid "Hardening for Public Cloud Image of {sles} for SAP Applications 15"
msgstr "Hardening ສຳລັບ Public Cloud Image ຂອງ {sles} ສຳລັບ SAP Applications 15"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:26
msgid "Public Cloud Hardening for {sle} 15"
msgstr "Public Cloud Hardening ສຳລັບ {sle} 15"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:27
msgid "Standard System Security profile for SLE 12 and 15"
msgstr "ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ Standard System Security ສຳລັບ SLE 12 ແລະ 15"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:28
msgid ""
"For Non-{suse} operating systems the included profiles are community "
"supplied.  They are not officially supported by {suse}."
msgstr "ສຳລັບລະບົບປະຕິບັດການທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນ {suse}, ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ທີ່ລວມຢູ່ນັ້ນແມ່ນຖືກສະໜອງໂດຍຊຸມຊົນ. ພວກມັນບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບການສະໜັບສະໜູນຢ່າງເປັນທາງການໂດຍ {suse}."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid "OpenSCAP content files"
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ເນື້ອຫາ OpenSCAP"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:30
msgid ""
"OpenSCAP uses SCAP content files to define test rules.  These content files "
"are created based on the XCCDF or OVAL standards.  In addition to the SCAP "
"Security Guide, you can download publicly available content files and "
"customize it to your requirements.  You can install the SCAP Security Guide "
"package for default content file templates.  Alternatively, if you are "
"familiar with XCCDF or OVAL, you can create your own content files."
msgstr "OpenSCAP ໃຊ້ໄຟລ໌ເນື້ອຫາ SCAP ເພື່ອກຳນົດກົດເກນການທົດສອບ. ໄຟລ໌ເນື້ອຫາເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນ ໂດຍອີງໃສ່ມາດຕະຖານ XCCDF ຫຼື OVAL. ນອກຈາກ SCAP Security Guide ແລ້ວ, ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດ ດາວໂຫຼດໄຟລ໌ເນື້ອຫາທີ່ມີໃຫ້ສາທາລະນະ ແລະ ປັບແຕ່ງໃຫ້ແທດເໝາະກັບຄວາມຕ້ອງການຂອງທ່ານໄດ້. ທ່ານສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດ SCAP Security Guide ສຳລັບເທັມເພລດໄຟລ໌ເນື້ອຫາເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ຫຼືຖ້າທ່ານຄຸ້ນເຄີຍກັບ XCCDF ຫຼື OVAL, ທ່ານກໍສາມາດສ້າງໄຟລ໌ເນື້ອຫາຂອງທ່ານເອງໄດ້."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:31
msgid ""
"We recommend you use templates to create your SCAP content files.  If you "
"create and use your own custom content files, you do so at your own risk.  "
"If your system becomes damaged through the use of custom content files, you "
"might not be supported by {suse}."
msgstr "ພວກເຮົາແນະນຳໃຫ້ທ່ານໃຊ້ເທັມເພລດເພື່ອສ້າງໄຟລ໌ເນື້ອຫາ SCAP ຂອງທ່ານ. ຖ້າທ່ານສ້າງ ແລະ ໃຊ້ໄຟລ໌ເນື້ອຫາທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງຮັບຜິດຊອບຄວາມສ່ຽງນັ້ນດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ. ຖ້າລະບົບຂອງທ່ານໄດ້ຮັບຄວາມເສຍຫາຍຈາກການໃຊ້ໄຟລ໌ເນື້ອຫາທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ, ທ່ານອາດຈະ ບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບການສະໜັບສະໜູນຈາກ {suse}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:32
msgid ""
"When you have created your content files, you need to transfer the file to "
"the client.  You can do this in the same way as you move any other file, "
"using physical storage media, or across a network with Salt (for example, "
"https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/ref/cli/salt-cp.html[salt-cp] or the "
"https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/ref/file_server/index.html[Salt File "
"Server]), [command]``ftp`` or [command]``scp``."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານສ້າງໄຟລ໌ເນື້ອຫາຂອງທ່ານແລ້ວ, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໂອນໄຟລ໌ໄປຫາຄລາຍແອນ. ທ່ານສາມາດເຮັດສິ່ງນີ້ໄດ້ໃນວິທີດຽວກັນກັບການຍ້າຍໄຟລ໌ອື່ນໆ, ໂດຍການໃຊ້ສື່ເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ ຫຼື ຜ່ານເຄືອຂ່າຍດ້ວຍ Salt (ຕົວຢ່າງ: https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/ref/cli/salt-cp.html[salt-cp] ຫຼື https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/ref/file_server/index.html[Salt File Server]), ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``ftp`` ຫຼື [command]``scp``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:33
msgid ""
"We recommend that you create a package to distribute content files to "
"clients that you are managing with {productname}.  Packages can be signed "
"and verified to ensure their integrity.  For more information, see "
"xref:administration:custom-channels.adoc[]."
msgstr "ພວກເຮົາແນະນຳໃຫ້ທ່ານສ້າງແພັກເກດເພື່ອແຈກຢາຍໄຟລ໌ເນື້ອຫາໃຫ້ກັບຄລາຍແອນທີ່ທ່ານກຳລັງ ຄຸ້ມຄອງດ້ວຍ {productname}. ແພັກເກດສາມາດຖືກເຊັນ ແລະ ກວດສອບເພື່ອຮັບປະກັນ ຄວາມສົມບູນຂອງມັນ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງ xref:administration:custom-channels.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:34
#, no-wrap
msgid "Find OpenSCAP profiles"
msgstr "ຄົ້ນຫາໂປຣໄຟລ໌ OpenSCAP"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:35
msgid ""
"Different operating systems make available different OpenSCAP content files "
"and profiles. One content file may contain more than one profile."
msgstr "ລະບົບປະຕິບັດການທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນຈະມີໄຟລ໌ເນື້ອຫາ ແລະ ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ OpenSCAP ທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນ. ໄຟລ໌ເນື້ອຫາດຽວອາດຈະມີຫຼາຍກວ່າໜຶ່ງໂປຣໄຟລ໌."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:36
msgid ""
"On RPM-based operating systems, use this command to determine the location "
"of the available SCAP files:"
msgstr "ໃນລະບົບປະຕິບັດການທີ່ອີງໃສ່ RPM, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງນີ້ເພື່ອລະບຸຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງໄຟລ໌ SCAP ທີ່ມີຢູ່:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:37
#, no-wrap
msgid "rpm -ql <scap-security-guide-package-name-from-table>\n"
msgstr "rpm -ql <scap-security-guide-package-name-from-table>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:38
msgid ""
"On DEB-based operating systems, use this command to determine the location "
"of the available SCAP files:"
msgstr "ໃນລະບົບປະຕິບັດການທີ່ອີງໃສ່ DEB, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງນີ້ເພື່ອລະບຸຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງໄຟລ໌ SCAP ທີ່ມີຢູ່:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:39
#, no-wrap
msgid "dpkg -L <scap-security-guide-package-name-from-table>\n"
msgstr "dpkg -L <scap-security-guide-package-name-from-table>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:40
msgid ""
"When you have identified one SCAP content file that suits your needs, list "
"profiles available on the client:"
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານລະບຸໄຟລ໌ເນື້ອຫາ SCAP ທີ່ເໝາະສົມກັບຄວາມຕ້ອງການຂອງທ່ານໄດ້ແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ສະແດງລາຍຊື່ ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນຄລາຍແອນ:"

