#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:90
msgid ""
"Install the [package]``scap-security-guide`` package on all your target "
"systems.  For more information, see "
"xref:administration:ansible-setup-control-node.adoc[]."
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດ [package]``scap-security-guide`` ໃນທຸກລະບົບເປົ້າໝາຍຂອງທ່ານ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງ xref:administration:ansible-setup-control-node.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:91
msgid ""
"Packages, channels and scripts are different for each operating system and "
"distribution.  Examples are listed in the <<scripts-for-os-types>> section."
msgstr "ແພັກເກດ, ຊ່ອງທາງ (channels) ແລະ ສະຄຣິບ ແມ່ນແຕກຕ່າງກັນສຳລັບແຕ່ລະລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ ແລະ ດີສທຣິບິວຊັນ (distribution). ຕົວຢ່າງແມ່ນໄດ້ສະແດງໄວ້ໃນພາກສ່ວນ <<scripts-for-os-types>>."

#. type: Title ====
#: modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:92
#, no-wrap
