"[option]``--list-fields-info`` and the report name.  This shows the "
"description and list of possible fields in the report."
msgstr "ສໍາລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບລາຍງານແຕ່ລະອັນ, ໃຫ້ລັນຄໍາສັ່ງ [command]``spacewalk-report`` ພ້ອມກັບຕົວເລືອກ [option]``--info`` ຫຼື [option]``--list-fields-info`` ແລະ ຕາມດ້ວຍຊື່ລາຍງານ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະສະແດງລາຍລະອຽດ ແລະ ລາຍຊື່ຟິວ (field) ຕ່າງໆທີ່ເປັນໄປໄດ້ໃນລາຍງານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/reports.adoc:33
msgid ""
"For further information on program invocation and options, see the "
"[literal]``spacewalk-report(8)`` man page as well as the [option]``--help`` "
"parameter of the [command]``spacewalk-report`` command."
msgstr "ສໍາລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ໂປຣແກຣມ ແລະ ຕົວເລືອກຕ່າງໆ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ໜ້າ man page ຂອງ [literal]``spacewalk-report(8)`` ລວມທັງພາຣາມິເຕີ [option]``--help`` ຂອງຄໍາສັ່ງ [command]``spacewalk-report``."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Disk Space Management"
msgstr "ການຈັດການພື້ນທີ່ວ່າງໃນດິດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Running out of disk space can have a severe impact on the {productname} "
"database and file structure which, in some cases, is not recoverable."
msgstr "ການທີ່ພື້ນທີ່ດິດເຕັມສາມາດສົ່ງຜົນກະທົບຮ້າຍແຮງຕໍ່ຖານຂໍ້ມູນ ແລະ ໂຄງສ້າງໄຟລ໌ຂອງ {productname} ເຊິ່ງໃນບາງກໍລະນີອາດຈະບໍ່ສາມາດກູ້ຄືນໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:3
msgid ""
"{productname} monitors some directories for free disk space.  You can modify "
"which directories are monitored, and the warnings that are created.  All "
"settings are configured in the [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`` configuration "
"file."
msgstr "{productname} ຈະຕິດຕາມບາງໄດເຣັກທໍຣີເພື່ອເບິ່ງພື້ນທີ່ວ່າງ. ທ່ານສາມາດແກ້ໄຂໄດເຣັກທໍຣີທີ່ຈະຕິດຕາມ ແລະ ການແຈ້ງເຕືອນທີ່ຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນ. ການຕັ້ງຄ່າທັງໝົດແມ່ນຢູ່ໃນໄຟລ໌ [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:4
msgid ""
"When the available space in one of the monitored directories falls below a "
"warning threshold, a message is sent to the configured email address and a "
"notification is shown at the top of the sign-in page."
msgstr "ເມື່ອພື້ນທີ່ວ່າງໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີທີ່ຕິດຕາມຫຼຸດລົງຕໍ່າກວ່າເກນແຈ້ງເຕືອນ, ຂໍ້ຄວາມຈະຖືກສົ່ງໄປຫາອີເມລທີ່ຕັ້ງຄ່າໄວ້ ແລະ ຈະມີການແຈ້ງເຕືອນສະແດງຢູ່ທາງເທິງຂອງໜ້າເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Monitored Directories"
msgstr "ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີທີ່ຖືກຕິດຕາມ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:6
msgid "By default, {productname} monitors these directories:"
msgstr "ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, {productname} ຈະຕິດຕາມໄດເຣັກທໍຣີເຫຼົ່ານີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:7
msgid "[path]``/var/lib/pgsql``"
msgstr "[path]``/var/lib/pgsql``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:8
msgid "[path]``/var/spacewalk``"
msgstr "[path]``/var/spacewalk``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:9
msgid "[path]``/var/cache``"
msgstr "[path]``/var/cache``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:10
msgid "[path]``/srv``"
msgstr "[path]``/srv``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:11
msgid ""
"You can change which directories are monitored with the "
"[systemitem]``spacecheck_dirs`` parameter.  You can specify multiple "
"directories by separating them with a space."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດປ່ຽນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີທີ່ຈະຕິດຕາມໄດ້ດ້ວຍພາຣາມິເຕີ [systemitem]``spacecheck_dirs``. ທ່ານສາມາດກໍານົດໄດ້ຫຼາຍໄດເຣັກທໍຣີໂດຍການແຍກດ້ວຍຍະຫວ່າງ."

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "spacecheck_dirs = /var/lib/pgsql /var/spacewalk /var/cache /srv\n"
msgstr "spacecheck_dirs = /var/lib/pgsql /var/spacewalk /var/cache /srv\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:14
msgid ""
"For more information about volumes, see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:container-management/persistent-container-volumes.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສໍາລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ ໂວນລຸມ (volumes), ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:installation-and-upgrade:container-management/persistent-container-volumes.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "Thresholds"
msgstr "ເກນການແຈ້ງເຕືອນ (Thresholds)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:16
msgid ""
"By default, {productname} creates a warning when a monitored directory has "
"less than 10% of total space available.  A critical alert is created when a "
"monitored directory falls below 5% space available."
msgstr "ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, {productname} ຈະສ້າງການແຈ້ງເຕືອນເມື່ອໄດເຣັກທໍຣີທີ່ຕິດຕາມມີພື້ນທີ່ວ່າງໜ້ອຍກວ່າ 10% ຂອງພື້ນທີ່ທັງໝົດ. ແລະ ຈະມີການແຈ້ງເຕືອນຂັ້ນວິກິດເມື່ອພື້ນທີ່ວ່າງຫຼຸດລົງຕໍ່າກວ່າ 5%."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:17
msgid ""
"You can change these alert thresholds with the "
"[systemitem]``spacecheck_free_alert`` and "
"[systemitem]``spacecheck_free_critical`` parameters."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດປ່ຽນເກນການແຈ້ງເຕືອນເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໄດ້ດ້ວຍພາຣາມິເຕີ [systemitem]``spacecheck_free_alert`` ແລະ [systemitem]``spacecheck_free_critical``."

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"spacecheck_free_alert = 10\n"
"spacecheck_free_critical = 5\n"
msgstr ""
"spacecheck_free_alert = 10\n"
"spacecheck_free_critical = 5\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid "Shut Down Services"
msgstr "ການປິດການບໍລິການ (Shut Down Services)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:21
msgid ""
"By default, {productname} shuts down the spacewalk services when the "
"critical alert threshold is reached."
msgstr "ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, {productname} ຈະປິດການບໍລິການ spacewalk ເມື່ອພື້ນທີ່ວ່າງຫຼຸດລົງຮອດເກນການແຈ້ງເຕືອນຂັ້ນວິກິດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:22
msgid ""
"You can change this behavior with the [systemitem]``spacecheck_shutdown`` "
"parameter.  A value of ``true`` enables the shut down feature.  Any other "
"value disables it."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດປ່ຽນພຶດຕິກໍານີ້ໄດ້ດ້ວຍພາຣາມິເຕີ [systemitem]``spacecheck_shutdown``. ຄ່າ ``true`` ຈະເປີດໃຊ້ຟີເຈີປິດລະບົບ. ຄ່າອື່ນໆຈະເປັນການປິດໃຊ້ງານ."

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "spacecheck_shutdown = true\n"
msgstr "spacecheck_shutdown = true\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "Disable Space Checking"
msgstr "ປິດການກວດສອບພື້ນທີ່ວ່າງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:26
msgid ""
"The space checking tool is enabled by default.  You can disable it entirely "
"with these commands:"
msgstr "ເຄື່ອງມືກວດສອບພື້ນທີ່ວ່າງຈະຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ທ່ານສາມາດປິດການໃຊ້ງານມັນໄດ້ທັງໝົດດ້ວຍຄໍາສັ່ງເຫຼົ່ານີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:27
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"systemctl stop spacewalk-diskcheck.timer\n"
"systemctl disable spacewalk-diskcheck.timer\n"
msgstr ""
"systemctl stop spacewalk-diskcheck.timer\n"
"systemctl disable spacewalk-diskcheck.timer\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:28
msgid ""
"Disabling the [literal]``spacewalk-diskcheck.timer`` will stop periodic "
"email alerts if the alert threshold is reached, but the warning notification "
"will still appear at the top of the sign-in page."
msgstr "ການປິດໃຊ້ງານ [literal]``spacewalk-diskcheck.timer`` ຈະຢຸດການແຈ້ງເຕືອນທາງອີເມລເປັນໄລຍະເມື່ອຮອດເກນ, ແຕ່ການແຈ້ງເຕືອນຈະຍັງຄົງປາກົດຢູ່ທາງເທິງຂອງໜ້າເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-hsts.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "HTTP Strict Transport Security"
msgstr "HTTP Strict Transport Security (HSTS)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-hsts.adoc:2
msgid ""
"HTTP Strict Transport Security "
"(https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTTP/Headers/Strict-Transport-Security[HSTS]) "
"is a policy mechanism that helps to protect websites against "
"man-in-the-middle attacks such as protocol downgrade attacks and cookie "
"hijacking."
msgstr "HTTP Strict Transport Security (HSTS) ແມ່ນກົນໄກນະໂຍບາຍທີ່ຊ່ວຍປ້ອງກັນເວັບໄຊທ໌ຈາກການໂຈມຕີແບບ man-in-the-middle ເຊັ່ນ: ການໂຈມຕີແບບ protocol downgrade ແລະ ການຈີ້ຄຸກກີ້ (cookie hijacking)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-hsts.adoc:3
msgid "{productname} allows enabling HSTS, to enable it for a {productname} Server:"
msgstr "{productname} ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເປີດໃຊ້ HSTS. ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ງານສຳລັບ {productname} Server:"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-hsts.adoc:4
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-hsts.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-hsts.adoc:5
msgid "Create new configuration file:"
msgstr "ສ້າງໄຟລ໌ກຳນົດຄ່າໃໝ່:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-hsts.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgrctl exec -- echo 'Header always set Strict-Transport-Security "
"\"max-age=63072000; includeSubDomains\"' "
">/etc/apache2/conf.d/zz-spacewalk-www-hsts.conf\n"
msgstr "mgrctl exec -- echo 'Header always set Strict-Transport-Security \"max-age=63072000; includeSubDomains\"' >/etc/apache2/conf.d/zz-spacewalk-www-hsts.conf\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-hsts.adoc:7
msgid "Restart Apache with:"
msgstr "ຣີສະຕາດ Apache ດ້ວຍຄໍາສັ່ງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-hsts.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgrctl exec -- systemctl restart apache2\n"
msgstr "mgrctl exec -- systemctl restart apache2\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-hsts.adoc:9
msgid "To enable it for {productname} Proxies:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ງານສຳລັບ {productname} Proxies:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-hsts.adoc:11
msgid "Create new configuration file, for example `/etc/uyuni/custom-httpd.conf`."
msgstr "ສ້າງໄຟລ໌ກຳນົດຄ່າໃໝ່, ຕົວຢ່າງ `/etc/uyuni/custom-httpd.conf`."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-hsts.adoc:12
msgid "Add line:"
msgstr "ເພີ່ມບັນທັດ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-hsts.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" `Header always set Strict-Transport-Security \"max-age=63072000; "
"includeSubDomains`.\n"
msgstr " `Header always set Strict-Transport-Security \"max-age=63072000; includeSubDomains`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-hsts.adoc:14
msgid "Run command:"
msgstr "ລັນຄຳສັ່ງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-hsts.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgrpxy install podman --tuning-httpd /etc/uyuni/custom-httpd.conf "
"config.tar.gz\n"
msgstr "mgrpxy install podman --tuning-httpd /etc/uyuni/custom-httpd.conf config.tar.gz\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-hsts.adoc:16
msgid ""
"When naming the new config file [literal]``<filename>.conf``, make sure it "
"is loaded at the right time.  For example, to override something defined in "
"[literal]``spacewalk-www.conf`` the new file needs to be alphabetically "
"after this file.  For more information about how Apache loads files, see "
"https://httpd.apache.org/docs."
msgstr "ເມື່ອຕັ້ງຊື່ໄຟລ໌ຄອນຟິກໃໝ່ [literal]``<ຊື່ໄຟລ໌>.conf``, ໃຫ້ໝັ້ນໃຈວ່າມັນຖືກໂຫຼດໃນເວລາທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ເພື່ອທັບຊ້ອນ (override) ຄ່າທີ່ກໍານົດໃນ [literal]``spacewalk-www.conf``, ໄຟລ໌ໃໝ່ຈະຕ້ອງມີຊື່ທີ່ລຽງຕາມຕົວອັກສອນຫຼັງຈາກໄຟລ໌ນັ້ນ. ສໍາລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການໂຫຼດໄຟລ໌ຂອງ Apache, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ https://httpd.apache.org/docs."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-hsts.adoc:17
msgid "[IMPORTANT]"
msgstr "[ສຳຄັນ]"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-hsts.adoc:18
msgid ""
"When HSTS is enabled while using the default SSL certificate generated by "
"{productname} or a self-signed certificate, browsers will refuse to connect "
"with HTTPS unless the CA used to sign such certificates is trusted by the "
"browser.  If you are using the SSL certificate generated by {productname}, "
"you can trust it by importing the file located at "
"`http://<SERVER-HOSTNAME>/pub/RHN-ORG-TRUSTED-SSL-CERT` to the browsers of "
"all users."
msgstr "ເມື່ອ HSTS ຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ໃນຂະນະທີ່ໃຊ້ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ SSL ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ສ້າງໂດຍ {productname} ຫຼື ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນທີ່ເຊັນເອງ, ບຣາວເຊີຈະປະຕິເສດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ດ້ວຍ HTTPS ເວັ້ນເສຍແຕ່ວ່າ CA ທີ່ໃຊ້ເຊັນໃບຢັ້ງຢືນນັ້ນຈະຖືກເຊື່ອຖືໂດຍບຣາວເຊີ. ຫາກທ່ານໃຊ້ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ SSL ທີ່ສ້າງໂດຍ {productname}, ທ່ານສາມາດເຮັດໃຫ້ມັນຖືກເຊື່ອຖືໄດ້ໂດຍການນໍາເຂົ້າໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຢູ່ `http://<SERVER-HOSTNAME>/pub/RHN-ORG-TRUSTED-SSL-CERT` ເຂົ້າໃນບຣາວເຊີຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້ທຸກຄົນ."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Import SSL Certificates"
msgstr "ນໍາເຂົ້າໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ SSL"

#. By default, {productname} uses a self-signed certificate.
#. For additional security, you can import a custom certificate, signed by a third party certificate authority (CA).
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:2
msgid ""
"This section covers how to configure SSL certificate for new {productname} "
"installation, and how to replace existing certificates."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ກວມເອົາວິທີການຕັ້ງຄ່າໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ SSL ສໍາລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} ໃໝ່ ແລະ ວິທີການປ່ຽນໃບຢັ້ງຢືນທີ່ມີຢູ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:3
msgid "Before you begin, ensure you have:"
msgstr "ກ່ອນທີ່ທ່ານຈະເລີ່ມ, ໃຫ້ໝັ້ນໃຈວ່າທ່ານມີ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:4
msgid ""
"A certificate authority (CA) SSL public certificate.  If you are using a CA "
"chain, all intermediate CAs must also be available."
msgstr "ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນສາທາລະນະ (public certificate) ຂອງ SSL ຈາກຕົວແທນອອກໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ (CA). ຫາກທ່ານໃຊ້ CA chain, intermediate CAs ທັງໝົດກໍຕ້ອງມີພ້ອມເຊັ່ນກັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:5
msgid "An SSL server private key"
msgstr "ຄີສ່ວນຕົວ (private key) ຂອງ SSL server"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:6
msgid "An SSL server certificate"
msgstr "ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ (certificate) ຂອງ SSL server"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:7
msgid "All files must be in PEM format."
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ທັງໝົດຕ້ອງຢູ່ໃນຮູບແບບ PEM."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:8
msgid ""
"The hostname of the SSL server certificate must match the fully qualified "
"hostname of the machine you deploy them on.  You can set the hostnames in "
"the [literal]``X509v3 Subject Alternative Name`` section of the "
"certificate.  You can also list multiple hostnames if your environment "
"requires it.  Supported Key types are [literal]``RSA`` and [literal]``EC`` "
"(Elliptic Curve)."
msgstr "Hostname ຂອງໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ SSL server ຕ້ອງກົງກັບ FQDN ຂອງເຄື່ອງທີ່ທ່ານຕິດຕັ້ງ. ທ່ານສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າ hostnames ໃນສ່ວນ [literal]``X509v3 Subject Alternative Name`` ຂອງໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ. ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດລະບຸຫຼາຍ hostname ໄດ້ຫາກລະບົບຂອງທ່ານຕ້ອງການ. ປະເພດຄີທີ່ຮອງຮັບແມ່ນ [literal]``RSA`` ແລະ [literal]``EC`` (Elliptic Curve)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Third-party authorities commonly use intermediate CAs to sign requested "
"server certificates.  In this case, all CAs in the chain are required to be "
"available.  If there is no extra parameter or option available to specify "
"intermediate CAs, take care that all CAs (Root CA and intermediate CAs) are "
"stored in one file."
msgstr "ຜູ້ອອກໃບຢັ້ງຢືນພາຍນອກມັກຈະໃຊ້ CA ລະດັບກາງເພື່ອເຊັນໃບຢັ້ງຢືນເຊີບເວີທີ່ຮ້ອງຂໍ. ໃນກໍລະນີນີ້, CA ທັງໝົດໃນຕ່ອງໂສ້ (chain) ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້. ຫາກບໍ່ມີພາລາມິເຕີ ຫຼື ຕົວເລືອກເສີມເພື່ອລະບຸ CA ລະດັບກາງ, ໃຫ້ກວດສອບວ່າ CA ທັງໝົດ (Root CA ແລະ CA ລະດັບກາງ) ໄດ້ຖືກເກັບໄວ້ໃນໄຟລ໌ດຽວກັນ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "Import Certificates for New Installations"
msgstr "ນໍາເຂົ້າໃບຢັ້ງຢືນສໍາລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງໃໝ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:11
msgid ""
"By default, {productname} uses a self-signed certificate.  After you have "
"completed the initial setup, you can replace the default certificate with an "
"imported certificate."
msgstr "ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, {productname} ຈະໃຊ້ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນທີ່ເຊັນເອງ. ຫຼັງຈາກທີ່ເຈົ້າສຳເລັດການຕັ້ງຄ່າເບື້ອງຕົ້ນແລ້ວ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດປ່ຽນແທນໃບຢັ້ງຢືນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນດ້ວຍໃບຢັ້ງຢືນທີ່ນຳເຂົ້າ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Import Certificates on a New {productname} Server"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການນຳເຂົ້າໃບຢັ້ງຢືນໃນ {productname} Server ໃໝ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:13
msgid ""
"Deploy the {productname} Server according to the instructions in "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-suma.adoc[].  "
"Make sure to pass the correct files as parameters to [literal]``mgradm "
"install podman``.  The parameters are:"
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} Server ຕາມຄຳແນະນຳໃນ xref:installation-and-upgrade:container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-suma.adoc[]. ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໄດ້ສົ່ງໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງເປັນພາລາມິເຕີໃຫ້ກັບ [literal]``mgradm install podman``. ພາລາມິເຕີຕ່າງໆຄື:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"3rd Party SSL Certificate Flags:\n"
"      --ssl-ca-intermediate strings   Intermediate CA certificate path\n"
"      --ssl-ca-root string            Root CA certificate path\n"
"      --ssl-server-cert string        Server certificate path\n"
"      --ssl-server-key string         Server key path\n"
msgstr ""
"3rd Party SSL Certificate Flags:\n"
"      --ssl-ca-intermediate strings   Intermediate CA certificate path\n"
"      --ssl-ca-root string            Root CA certificate path\n"
"      --ssl-server-cert string        Server certificate path\n"
"      --ssl-server-key string         Server key path\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:15
msgid ""
"Intermediate CAs can either be available in the file which is specified with "
"`--ssl-ca-root` or specified as extra options with `--ssl-ca-intermediate`.  "
"The `--ssl-ca-intermediate` option can be specified multiple times."
msgstr "CA ລະດັບກາງສາມາດມີຢູ່ໃນໄຟລ໌ທີ່ລະບຸດ້ວຍ `--ssl-ca-root` ຫຼື ລະບຸເປັນຕົວເລືອກເສີມດ້ວຍ `--ssl-ca-intermediate`. ຕົວເລືອກ `--ssl-ca-intermediate` ສາມາດລະບຸໄດ້ຫຼາຍຄັ້ງ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "Import Certificates for New Proxy Installations"
msgstr "ນຳເຂົ້າໃບຢັ້ງຢືນສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງ Proxy ໃໝ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:17
msgid ""
"By default, {productname} Proxy uses a self-signed certificate.  After you "
"have completed the initial setup, you can replace the default certificate "
"with an imported certificate."
msgstr "ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, {productname} Proxy ຈະໃຊ້ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນທີ່ເຊັນເອງ. ຫຼັງຈາກທີ່ເຈົ້າສຳເລັດການຕັ້ງຄ່າເບື້ອງຕົ້ນແລ້ວ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດປ່ຽນແທນໃບຢັ້ງຢືນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນດ້ວຍໃບຢັ້ງຢືນທີ່ນຳເຂົ້າ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Import Certificates on a New {productname} Proxy"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການນຳເຂົ້າໃບຢັ້ງຢືນໃນ {productname} Proxy ໃໝ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:19
msgid ""
"Install the {productname} Proxy according to the instructions in "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:container-deployment/suma/proxy-deployment-suma.adoc[]."
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} Proxy ຕາມຄຳແນະນຳໃນ xref:installation-and-upgrade:container-deployment/suma/proxy-deployment-suma.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:20
msgid "Follow the prompts to complete setup."
msgstr "ປະຕິບັດຕາມຄໍາແນະນໍາເພື່ອສໍາເລັດການຕິດຕັ້ງ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:21
msgid ""
"Use the same certificate authority (CA) to sign all server certificates for "
"servers and proxies.  Certificates signed with different CAs do not match."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຜູ້ອອກໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ (CA) ດຽວກັນເພື່ອເຊັນໃບຢັ້ງຢືນເຊີບເວີທັງໝົດສຳລັບທັງເຊີບເວີ ແລະ ພຣັອກຊີ. ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນທີ່ເຊັນດ້ວຍ CA ຕ່າງກັນຈະບໍ່ເຂົ້າກັນ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid "Replace Certificates"
msgstr "ປ່ຽນແທນໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:23
msgid ""
"You can replace active certificates on your {productname} installation with "
"a new certificate.  To replace the certificates, you can replace the "
"installed CA certificate with the new CA, and then update the database."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າສາມາດປ່ຽນແທນໃບຢັ້ງຢືນທີ່ກຳລັງໃຊ້ງານຢູ່ໃນ {productname} ດ້ວຍໃບຢັ້ງຢືນໃໝ່. ໃນການປ່ຽນແທນໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດປ່ຽນໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ CA ທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງໄວ້ດ້ວຍ CA ໃໝ່, ແລ້ວອັບເດດຖານຂໍ້ມູນ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Replacing All Existing Certificates"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການປ່ຽນແທນໃບຢັ້ງຢືນທີ່ມີຢູ່ທັງໝົດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:25
msgid ""
"On the {productname} container host, at the command prompt, temporarily copy "
"the certificate files to the container:"
msgstr "ຢູ່ທີ່ {productname} container host, ທີ່ command prompt, ໃຫ້ກັອບປີ້ໄຟລ໌ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນໄປໄວ້ໃນຄອນເທນເນີຊົ່ວຄາວ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"for f in <Root_CA_Certificate> <Server_Cert_File> <Server_Key_File>; do\n"
"  mgrctl cp $f server:/tmp\n"
"done\n"
msgstr ""
"for f in <Root_CA_Certificate> <Server_Cert_File> <Server_Key_File>; do\n"
"  mgrctl cp $f server:/tmp\n"
"done\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:27
msgid ""
"On the {productname} container host, call the following command to run "
"[command]``mgr-ssl-cert-setup`` inside the container providing certificates "
"as parameters:"
msgstr "ຢູ່ທີ່ {productname} container host, ໃຫ້ຮ້ອງໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ເພື່ອລັນ [command]``mgr-ssl-cert-setup`` ພາຍໃນຄອນເທນເນີ ໂດຍສົ່ງໃບຢັ້ງຢືນເປັນພາລາມິເຕີ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgrctl exec -ti -- mgr-ssl-cert-setup "
"--root-ca-file=/tmp/<Root_CA_Certificate> \\\n"
"  --server-cert-file=/tmp/<Server_Cert_File> "
"--server-key-file=/tmp/<Server_Key_File>\n"
msgstr ""
"mgrctl exec -ti -- mgr-ssl-cert-setup --root-ca-file=/tmp/<Root_CA_Certificate> \\\n"
"  --server-cert-file=/tmp/<Server_Cert_File> --server-key-file=/tmp/<Server_Key_File>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:29
msgid "Remove the temporarily copied files from the container:"
msgstr "ລຶບໄຟລ໌ທີ່ກັອບປີ້ໄວ້ຊົ່ວຄາວອອກຈາກຄອນເທນເນີ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:30
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgrctl exec -ti -- rm /tmp/<Root_CA_Certificate> /tmp/<Server_Cert_File> "
"\\\n"
"  /tmp/<Server_Key_File>\n"
"mgradm restart\n"
msgstr ""
"mgrctl exec -ti -- rm /tmp/<Root_CA_Certificate> /tmp/<Server_Cert_File> \\\n"
"  /tmp/<Server_Key_File>\n"
"mgradm restart\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:31
msgid ""
"Intermediate CAs can either be available in the file which is specified with "
"`--root-ca-file` or specified as extra options with "
"`--intermediate-ca-file`.  The `--intermediate-ca-file` option can be "
"specified multiple times.  The [command]``mgr-ssl-cert-setup`` command tests "
"if provided files are valid and suitable for the requested use case.  The "
"command then copies or deploys the files to all the places where they are "
"needed."
msgstr "CA ລະດັບກາງສາມາດມີຢູ່ໃນໄຟລ໌ທີ່ລະບຸດ້ວຍ `--root-ca-file` ຫຼື ລະບຸເປັນຕົວເລືອກເສີມດ້ວຍ `--intermediate-ca-file`. ຕົວເລືອກ `--intermediate-ca-file` ສາມາດລະບຸໄດ້ຫຼາຍຄັ້ງ. ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``mgr-ssl-cert-setup`` ຈະທົດສອບວ່າໄຟລ໌ທີ່ໃຫ້ມານັ້ນຖືກຕ້ອງ ແລະ ເໝາະສົມກັບກໍລະນີການໃຊ້ງານທີ່ຮ້ອງຂໍຫຼືບໍ່. ຈາກນັ້ນຄຳສັ່ງຈະກັອບປີ້ ຫຼື ຕິດຕັ້ງໄຟລ໌ໄປຍັງທຸກບ່ອນທີ່ຈຳເປັນ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:32
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Restarting the Server"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການເລີ່ມເຊີບເວີໃໝ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:33
msgid "On the container host, restart the server to pick up the changes:"
msgstr "ໃນ container host, ໃຫ້ຣີສະຕາດເຊີເວີເພື່ອໃຫ້ການປ່ຽນແປງມີຜົນ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:35
msgid ""
"If you are using a proxy, you need to generate a server certificate RPM for "
"each proxy, using their hostnames and cnames.  Generate a new configuration "
"tarball and deploy it."
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານໃຊ້ພຣັອກຊີ, ທ່ານຈໍາເປັນຕ້ອງສ້າງ server certificate RPM ສໍາລັບແຕ່ລະພຣັອກຊີ ໂດຍໃຊ້ hostname ແລະ cname ຂອງພວກມັນ. ສ້າງ configuration tarball ໃໝ່ ແລະ ຕິດຕັ້ງມັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:36
msgid ""
"For more information, see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:container-deployment/suma/proxy-deployment-suma.adoc#_generate_proxy_configuration[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:installation-and-upgrade:container-deployment/suma/proxy-deployment-suma.adoc#_generate_proxy_configuration[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:37
msgid ""
"For more information, see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc#proxy-setup-containers-generate-config[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:installation-and-upgrade:container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc#proxy-setup-containers-generate-config[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:38
msgid ""
"If the Root CA was changed, it needs to get deployed to all the clients "
"connected to {productname}."
msgstr "ຫາກ Root CA ຖືກປ່ຽນແປງ, ມັນຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງໄປຍັງໄຄເອັນທັງໝົດທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບ {productname}."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:39
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Deploying the Root CA on Clients"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕິດຕັ້ງ Root CA ໃນໄຄເອັນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:40
msgid "In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[Overview]."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Systems[Overview]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:41
msgid "Check all your clients to add them to the system set manager."
msgstr "ເລືອກ client ທັງໝົດຂອງທ່ານເພື່ອເພີ່ມພວກເຂົາເຂົ້າໃນ system set manager."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:42
msgid "Navigate to menu:Systems[System Set Manager > Overview]."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Systems[System Set Manager > Overview]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:43
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``States`` field, click btn:[Apply] to apply the system "
"states."
msgstr "ໃນຟິວ [guimenu]``States``, ໃຫ້ຄລິກທີ່ປຸ່ມ [Apply] ເພື່ອນໍາໃຊ້ system states."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:44
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Highstate`` page, click btn:[Apply Highstate] to propagate "
"the changes to the clients."
msgstr "ໃນໜ້າ [guimenu]``Highstate``, ໃຫ້ຄລິກທີ່ປຸ່ມ [Apply Highstate] ເພື່ອສົ່ງການປ່ຽນແປງໄປຍັງ clients."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-selfsigned.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Self-Signed SSL Certificates"
msgstr "ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ SSL ທີ່ເຊັນດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ (Self-Signed)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-selfsigned.adoc:2
msgid ""
"By default, {productname} uses a self-signed certificate.  In this case, the "
"certificate is created and signed by {productname}.  This method does not "
"use an independent certificate authority to guarantee that the details of "
"the certificate are correct.  Third-party CAs perform checks to ensure that "
"the information contained in the certificate is correct."
msgstr "ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, {productname} ຈະໃຊ້ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນທີ່ເຊັນເອງ. ໃນກໍລະນີນີ້, ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນຈະຖືກສ້າງ ແລະ ເຊັນໂດຍ {productname}. ວິທີນີ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້ຕົວແທນອອກໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ (CA) ພາຍນອກເພື່ອຮັບປະກັນຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງ. CA ພາຍນອກຈະມີການກວດສອບເພື່ອໃຫ້ໝັ້ນໃຈວ່າຂໍ້ມູນໃນໃບຢັ້ງຢືນນັ້ນຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-selfsigned.adoc:3
msgid ""
"For more information on third-party CAs, see "
"xref:administration:ssl-certs-imported.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສໍາລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ CA ພາຍນອກ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:administration:ssl-certs-imported.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-selfsigned.adoc:4
msgid ""
"For more information on replacing certificates, see "
"xref:administration:ssl-certs-imported.adoc#ssl-certs-import-replace[]."
msgstr "ສໍາລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການປ່ຽນໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:administration:ssl-certs-imported.adoc#ssl-certs-import-replace[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-selfsigned.adoc:5
msgid ""
"This section covers how to create or re-create your self-signed certificates "
"on new or existing installation."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ກວມເອົາວິທີການສ້າງ ຫຼື ສ້າງໃໝ່ ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນທີ່ເຊັນເອງຂອງທ່ານໃນການຕິດຕັ້ງໃໝ່ ຫຼື ທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-selfsigned.adoc:6
msgid ""
"The hostname of the SSL keys and certificates must match the fully qualified "
"hostname of the machine you deploy them on."
msgstr "Hostname ຂອງ SSL keys ແລະ certificates ຕ້ອງກົງກັບ FQDN ຂອງເຄື່ອງທີ່ທ່ານຕິດຕັ້ງ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-selfsigned.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "Re-Create Existing Server Certificates"
msgstr "ສ້າງໃບຢັ້ງຢືນເຊີເວີທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃໝ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-selfsigned.adoc:8
msgid ""
"If your existing certificates have expired or stopped working for any "
"reason, you can generate a new server certificate from the existing CA."
msgstr "ຫາກໃບຢັ້ງຢືນທີ່ມີຢູ່ຂອງທ່ານໝົດອາຍຸ ຫຼື ຢຸດເຮັດວຽກຍ້ອນເຫດຜົນໃດໜຶ່ງ, ທ່ານສາມາດສ້າງໃບຢັ້ງຢືນເຊີເວີໃໝ່ຈາກ CA ທີ່ມີຢູ່ໄດ້."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-selfsigned.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Re-Creating an Existing Server Certificate"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງໃບຢັ້ງຢືນເຊີເວີທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃໝ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-selfsigned.adoc:10
msgid ""
"On the {productname} container host, at the command prompt, regenerate the "
"server certificate:"
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} container host, ໃຫ້ສ້າງໃບຢັ້ງຢືນເຊີເວີໃໝ່ດ້ວຍຄໍາສັ່ງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-selfsigned.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgrctl exec -ti -- 'rhn-ssl-tool --gen-server --dir=\"/root/ssl-build\" "
"--set-country=\"COUNTRY\" \\\n"
"--set-state=\"STATE\" --set-city=\"CITY\" --set-org=\"ORGANIZATION\" \\\n"
"--set-org-unit=\"ORGANIZATION UNIT\" --set-email=\"name@example.com\" \\\n"
"--set-hostname=\"susemanager.example.com\" --set-cname=\"example.com\"'\n"
msgstr ""
"mgrctl exec -ti -- 'rhn-ssl-tool --gen-server --dir=\"/root/ssl-build\" --set-country=\"COUNTRY\" \\\n"
"--set-state=\"STATE\" --set-city=\"CITY\" --set-org=\"ORGANIZATION\" \\\n"
"--set-org-unit=\"ORGANIZATION UNIT\" --set-email=\"name@example.com\" \\\n"
"--set-hostname=\"susemanager.example.com\" --set-cname=\"example.com\"'\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-selfsigned.adoc:12
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-selfsigned.adoc:24
msgid ""
"Ensure that the [systemitem]``set-cname`` parameter is the fully qualified "
"domain name of your {productname} Server.  You can use the "
"[systemitem]``set-cname`` parameter multiple times if you require multiple "
"aliases."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ໝັ້ນໃຈວ່າພາຣາມິເຕີ [systemitem]``set-cname`` ແມ່ນ FQDN ຂອງ {productname} Server ຂອງທ່ານ. ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ພາຣາມິເຕີ [systemitem]``set-cname`` ຫຼາຍຄັ້ງຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງການນາມແຝງ (aliases) ຫຼາຍອັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-selfsigned.adoc:13
msgid ""
"The private key and the server certificate can be found inside the server "
"container in the directory [path]``/root/ssl-build/susemanager/`` as "
"`server.key` and `server.crt`.  The name of the last directory depends on "
"the hostname used with `--set-hostname` option."
msgstr "Private key ແລະ ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນເຊີເວີສາມາດພົບໄດ້ພາຍໃນ server container ໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ [path]``/root/ssl-build/susemanager/`` ໃນຊື່ `server.key` ແລະ `server.crt`. ຊື່ຂອງໄດເຣັກທໍຣີສຸດທ້າຍຈະຂຶ້ນກັບ hostname ທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນຕົວເລືອກ `--set-hostname`."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-selfsigned.adoc:14
msgid ""
"Deploy or import the new certificate and key with the "
"[command]``mgr-ssl-cert-setup`` tool.  For more information about importing "
"the just generated certificate, see "
"xref:administration:ssl-certs-imported.adoc#ssl-certs-import-replace[]."
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງ ຫຼື ນຳເຂົ້າໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ ແລະ ກະແຈໃໝ່ດ້ວຍເຄື່ອງມື [command]``mgr-ssl-cert-setup``. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການນຳເຂົ້າໃບຢັ້ງຢືນທີ່ຫາກໍສ້າງຂຶ້ນ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:administration:ssl-certs-imported.adoc#ssl-certs-import-replace[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-selfsigned.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create a new CA and Server Certificates"
msgstr "ສ້າງ CA ແລະ ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນເຊີເວີໃໝ່"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-selfsigned.adoc:16
msgid ""
"Be careful when you need to replace the Root CA.  It is possible to break "
"the trust chain between the server and clients.  If that happens, you need "
"an administrative user to log in to every client and deploy the CA directly."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ລະວັງເມື່ອທ່ານຕ້ອງການປ່ຽນ Root CA. ມັນອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ trust chain ລະຫວ່າງເຊີເວີ ແລະ client ຂາດອອກຈາກກັນ. ຫາກເກີດເຫດການນັ້ນ, ທ່ານຈໍາເປັນຕ້ອງໃຫ້ຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ client ທຸກເຄື່ອງເພື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງ CA ໂດຍກົງ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-selfsigned.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating New Certificates"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງໃບຢັ້ງຢືນໃໝ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-selfsigned.adoc:18
msgid ""
"On the {productname} container host, at the command prompt, move the old "
"certificate directory to a new location:"
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} container host, ໃຫ້ຍ້າຍໄດເຣັກທໍຣີໃບຢັ້ງຢືນເກົ່າໄປບ່ອນໃໝ່:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-selfsigned.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgrctl exec -- mv /root/ssl-build /root/old-ssl-build\n"
msgstr "mgrctl exec -- mv /root/ssl-build /root/old-ssl-build\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-selfsigned.adoc:20
msgid "Generate a new CA certificate:"
msgstr "ສ້າງໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ CA ໃໝ່:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-selfsigned.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgrctl exec -ti -- 'rhn-ssl-tool --gen-ca --dir=\"/root/ssl-build\" "
"--set-country=\"COUNTRY\" \\\n"
"--set-state=\"STATE\" --set-city=\"CITY\" --set-org=\"ORGANIZATION\" \\\n"
"--set-org-unit=\"ORGANIZATION UNIT\" --set-common-name=\"SUSE Manager CA "
"Certificate\" \\\n"
"--set-email=\"name@example.com\"'\n"
msgstr ""
"mgrctl exec -ti -- 'rhn-ssl-tool --gen-ca --dir=\"/root/ssl-build\" --set-country=\"COUNTRY\" \\\n"
"--set-state=\"STATE\" --set-city=\"CITY\" --set-org=\"ORGANIZATION\" \\\n"
"--set-org-unit=\"ORGANIZATION UNIT\" --set-common-name=\"SUSE Manager CA Certificate\" \\\n"
"--set-email=\"name@example.com\"'\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-selfsigned.adoc:22
msgid "Generate a new server certificate:"
msgstr "ສ້າງໃບຢັ້ງຢືນເຊີເວີໃໝ່:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-selfsigned.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgrctl exec -ti -- 'rhn-ssl-tool --gen-server --dir=\"/root/ssl-build\" "
"--set-country=\"COUNTRY\" \\\n"
"--set-state=\"STATE\" --set-city=\"CITY\" --set-org=\"ORGANIZATION\" \\\n"
"--set-org-unit=\"ORGANIZATION UNIT\" --set-email=\"name@example.com\" \\\n"
"--set-hostname=\"susemanager.example.top\" --set-cname=\"example.com\"'\n"
msgstr ""
"mgrctl exec -ti -- 'rhn-ssl-tool --gen-server --dir=\"/root/ssl-build\" --set-country=\"COUNTRY\" \\\n"
"--set-state=\"STATE\" --set-city=\"CITY\" --set-org=\"ORGANIZATION\" \\\n"
"--set-org-unit=\"ORGANIZATION UNIT\" --set-email=\"name@example.com\" \\\n"
"--set-hostname=\"susemanager.example.top\" --set-cname=\"example.com\"'\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-selfsigned.adoc:25
msgid ""
"You need to generate a server certificate also for each proxy, using their "
"hostnames and cnames."
msgstr "ທ່ານຈໍາເປັນຕ້ອງສ້າງໃບຢັ້ງຢືນເຊີເວີສໍາລັບແຕ່ລະພຣັອກຊີເຊັ່ນກັນ ໂດຍໃຊ້ hostname ແລະ cname ຂອງພວກມັນ."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "SSL Certificates"
msgstr "ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ SSL"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs.adoc:2
msgid ""
"{productname} uses SSL certificates to ensure that clients are registered to "
"the correct server."
msgstr "{productname} ໃຊ້ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ SSL ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໝັ້ນໃຈວ່າ client ໄດ້ລົງທະບຽນກັບເຊີເວີທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Every client that uses SSL to register to the {productname} Server checks "
"that it is connecting to the right server by validating against a server "
"certificate.  This process is called an SSL handshake."
msgstr "client ທຸກເຄື່ອງທີ່ໃຊ້ SSL ເພື່ອລົງທະບຽນກັບ {productname} Server ຈະກວດສອບວ່າມັນກໍາລັງເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບເຊີເວີທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງໂດຍການກວດສອບກັບໃບຢັ້ງຢືນເຊີເວີ. ຂະບວນການນີ້ເອີ້ນວ່າ SSL handshake."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs.adoc:4
msgid ""
"During the SSL handshake, the client checks that the hostname in the server "
"certificate matches what it expects.  The client also needs to check if the "
"server certificate is trusted."
msgstr "ໃນລະຫວ່າງ SSL handshake, client ຈະກວດສອບວ່າ hostname ໃນໃບຢັ້ງຢືນເຊີເວີກົງກັບທີ່ມັນຄາດໄວ້ຫຼືບໍ່. client ຍັງຕ້ອງກວດສອບວ່າມັນເຊື່ອຖືໃບຢັ້ງຢືນເຊີເວີນັ້ນຫຼືບໍ່."

#. Every {productname} Server that uses SSL requires an SSL server certificate.
#. Provide the path to the server certificate using the ``SERVER_CERT`` environment variable during setup, or with the ``--from-server-cert`` option of the [command]``rhn-ssl-tool`` command.
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs.adoc:5
msgid ""
"Certificate authorities (CAs) are certificates that are used to sign other "
"certificates.  All certificates must be signed by a certificate authority "
"(CA) in order for them to be considered valid, and for clients to be able to "
"successfully match against them."
msgstr "Certificate authorities (CAs) ແມ່ນໃບຢັ້ງຢືນທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອເຊັນໃບຢັ້ງຢືນອື່ນໆ. ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນທັງໝົດຕ້ອງຖືກເຊັນໂດຍ CA ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຖືວ່າຖືກຕ້ອງ ແລະ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ client ສາມາດກວດສອບໄດ້ຢ່າງສໍາເລັດຜົນ."

#. When an organization signs its own certificate, the certificate is considered self-signed.
#. A self-signed certificate is straight-forward to set up, and does not cost any money, but they are considered less secure.
#. If you are using a self-signed certificate, you have a root CA that is signed with itself.
#. When you look at the details of a root CA, you can see that the subject has the same value as the issuer.
#. Provide the path to your root CA certificate using the ``CA_CERT`` environment variable during setup, or with the ``--ca-cert`` option of the [command]``rhn-ssl-tool`` command.
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs.adoc:6
msgid ""
"In order for SSL authentication to work correctly, the client must trust the "
"root CA.  This means that the root CA must be installed on every client."
msgstr "ເພື່ອໃຫ້ການກວດສອບສິດ SSL ເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ, client ຈະຕ້ອງເຊື່ອຖື root CA. ນັ້ນໝາຍຄວາມວ່າ root CA ຈະຕ້ອງຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງຢູ່ໃນ client ທຸກເຄື່ອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs.adoc:7
msgid ""
"The default method of SSL authentication is for {productname} to use "
"self-signed certificates.  In this case, {productname} has generated all the "
"certificates, and the root CA has signed the server certificate directly."
msgstr "ວິທີການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງການກວດສອບສິດ SSL ແມ່ນ {productname} ຈະໃຊ້ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນທີ່ເຊັນເອງ. ໃນກໍລະນີນີ້, {productname} ຈະສ້າງໃບຢັ້ງຢືນທັງໝົດ ແລະ root CA ຈະເຊັນໃບຢັ້ງຢືນເຊີເວີໂດຍກົງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs.adoc:8
msgid ""
"An alternative method is to use an intermediate CA.  In this case, the root "
"CA signs the intermediate CA.  The intermediate CA can then sign any number "
"of other intermediate CAs, and the final one signs the server certificate.  "
"This is referred to as a chained certificate."
msgstr "ອີກວິທີໜຶ່ງແມ່ນການໃຊ້ intermediate CA. ໃນກໍລະນີນີ້, root CA ຈະເຊັນ intermediate CA. ຈາກນັ້ນ intermediate CA ສາມາດເຊັນ intermediate CAs ອື່ນໆໄດ້ຫຼາຍຂັ້ນ ແລະ ອັນສຸດທ້າຍຈະເປັນຜູ້ເຊັນໃບຢັ້ງຢືນເຊີເວີ. ສິ່ງນີ້ເອີ້ນວ່າ chained certificate."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs.adoc:9
msgid ""
"If you are using intermediate CAs in a chained certificate, the root CA is "
"installed on the client, and the server certificate is installed on the "
"server.  During the SSL handshake, clients must be able to verify the entire "
"chain of intermediate certificates between the root CA and the server "
"certificate, so they must be able to access all the intermediate "
"certificates."
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານໃຊ້ intermediate CAs ໃນ chained certificate, root CA ຈະຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງໃນ client ແລະ ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນເຊີເວີຈະຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງໃນເຊີເວີ. ໃນລະຫວ່າງ SSL handshake, client ຕ້ອງສາມາດກວດສອບ chain ທັງໝົດຂອງໃບຢັ້ງຢືນລະຫວ່າງ root CA ແລະ ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນເຊີເວີ ດັ່ງນັ້ນພວກມັນຕ້ອງສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງ intermediate certificates ທັງໝົດໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs.adoc:10
msgid ""
"There are two main ways of achieving this.  In older versions of "
"{productname}, by default, all the intermediate CAs are installed on the "
"client.  However, you could also configure your services on the server to "
"provide them to the client.  In this case, during the SSL handshake, the "
"server presents the server certificate as well as all the intermediate CAs.  "
"This mechanism is used now as the default configuration."
msgstr "ມີສອງວິທີຫຼັກໃນການເຮັດສິ່ງນີ້. ໃນ {productname} ເວີຊັນເກົ່າ, intermediate CAs ທັງໝົດຈະຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງໃນ client ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ທ່ານສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າການບໍລິການໃນເຊີເວີເພື່ອສົ່ງພວກມັນໃຫ້ client ໄດ້. ໃນກໍລະນີນີ້, ໃນລະຫວ່າງ SSL handshake, ເຊີເວີຈະສະແດງທັງໃບຢັ້ງຢືນເຊີເວີ ແລະ intermediate CAs ທັງໝົດ. ກົນໄກນີ້ແມ່ນການຕັ້ງຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃນປະຈຸບັນ."

#. Whichever method you choose, you must ensure that the ``CA_CERT`` environment variable points to the root CA, and all intermediate CAs.
#. It should not contain the server certificate.
#. The server certificate must be defined at the ``SERVER_CERT`` environment variable.
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs.adoc:11
msgid ""
"By default, {productname} uses a self-signed certificate without "
"intermediate CAs.  For additional security, you can arrange a third party CA "
"to sign your certificates.  Third party CAs perform checks to ensure that "
"the information contained in the certificate is correct.  They usually "
"charge an annual fee for this service.  Using a third party CA makes "
"certificates harder to spoof, and provides additional protection for your "
"installation.  If you have certificates signed by a third party CA, you can "
"import them to your {productname} installation."
msgstr "ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, {productname} ໃຊ້ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນທີ່ເຊັນເອງໂດຍບໍ່ມີ intermediate CA. ເພື່ອຄວາມປອດໄພເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ທ່ານສາມາດໃຫ້ CA ພາຍນອກເຊັນໃບຢັ້ງຢືນຂອງທ່ານ. CA ພາຍນອກຈະກວດສອບຂໍ້ມູນໃນໃບຢັ້ງຢືນວ່າມັນຖືກຕ້ອງ. ປົກກະຕິພວກເຂົາຈະເກັບຄ່າທໍານຽມລາຍປີ. ການໃຊ້ CA ພາຍນອກເຮັດໃຫ້ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນຖືກປອມແປງໄດ້ຍາກຂຶ້ນ ແລະ ຊ່ວຍປົກປ້ອງລະບົບຂອງທ່ານໄດ້ດີຂຶ້ນ. ຫາກທ່ານມີໃບຢັ້ງຢືນທີ່ເຊັນໂດຍ CA ພາຍນອກ, ທ່ານສາມາດນໍາເຂົ້າມັນເຂົ້າໃນ {productname} ໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs.adoc:12
msgid "This manual describe the use of SSL certificates in two steps:"
msgstr "ຄູ່ມືນີ້ອະທິບາຍການໃຊ້ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ SSL ໃນສອງຂັ້ນຕອນ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs.adoc:13
msgid "How to create a self-signed certificate with {productname} tools"
msgstr "ວິທີສ້າງໃບຢັ້ງຢືນທີ່ເຊັນເອງດ້ວຍເຄື່ອງມືຂອງ {productname}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs.adoc:14
msgid "How to deploy a certificate on {productname} Server or Proxy"
msgstr "ວິທີຕິດຕັ້ງໃບຢັ້ງຢືນໃນ {productname} Server ຫຼື Proxy"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs.adoc:15
msgid ""
"In case the certificates are provided by a third party instance like an own "
"or external PKI, step 1 can be skipped."
msgstr "ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນຖືກຈັດຫາໂດຍພາຍນອກ ເຊັ່ນ PKI ຂອງຕົນເອງ ຫຼື ພາຍນອກ, ທ່ານສາມາດຂ້າມຂັ້ນຕອນທີ 1 ໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs.adoc:16
msgid ""
"For more information about creating self-signed certificates, see "
"xref:administration:ssl-certs-selfsigned.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສໍາລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການສ້າງໃບຢັ້ງຢືນທີ່ເຊັນເອງ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:administration:ssl-certs-selfsigned.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs.adoc:17
msgid ""
"For more information about importing certificates, see "
"xref:administration:ssl-certs-imported.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສໍາລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການນໍາເຂົ້າໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:administration:ssl-certs-imported.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/subscription-matching.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Subscription Matching"
msgstr "ການຈັບຄູ່ການສະໝັກໃຊ້ (Subscription Matching)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/subscription-matching.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Your {suse} products require subscriptions, which are managed by the "
"{scclongform} ({scc}).  {productname} runs a nightly report checking the "
"subscription status of all your registered clients against your {scc} "
"account.  The report gives you information about which clients consume which "
"subscriptions, how many subscriptions you have remaining and available to "
"use, and which clients do not have a current subscription."
msgstr "ຜະລິດຕະພັນ {suse} ຂອງທ່ານຕ້ອງການການສະໝັກໃຊ້ (subscriptions), ເຊິ່ງຈັດການໂດຍ {scclongform} ({scc}). {productname} ຈະລັນລາຍງານທຸກໆຄືນເພື່ອທໍາການກວດສອບສະຖານະການສະໝັກໃຊ້ຂອງ client ທັງໝົດທີ່ລົງທະບຽນໄວ້ກັບບັນຊີ {scc} ຂອງທ່ານ. ລາຍງານຈະໃຫ້ຂໍ້ມູນວ່າ client ໃດໃຊ້ການສະໝັກໃຊ້ອັນໃດ, ທ່ານຍັງມີການສະໝັກໃຊ້ເຫຼືອເທົ່າໃດ ແລະ ສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ອີກເທົ່າໃດ, ລວມທັງ client ໃດທີ່ຍັງບໍ່ມີການສະໝັກໃຊ້ໃນປະຈຸບັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/subscription-matching.adoc:3
msgid "Navigate to menu:Audit[Subscription Matching] to see the report."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Audit[Subscription Matching] ເພື່ອເບິ່ງລາຍງານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/subscription-matching.adoc:4
msgid ""
"The [guimenu]``Subscriptions Report`` tab gives information about current "
"and expiring subscriptions."
msgstr "ແຖບ [guimenu]``Subscriptions Report`` ຈະໃຫ້ຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບການສະໝັກໃຊ້ໃນປະຈຸບັນ ແລະ ທີ່ກໍາລັງຈະໝົດອາຍຸ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/subscription-matching.adoc:5
msgid ""
"The [guimenu]``Unmatched Products Report`` tab gives a list of clients that "
"do not have a current subscription.  This includes clients that could not be "
"matched, or that are not currently registered with {productname}.  The "
"report includes product names and the number of systems that remain "
"unmatched."
msgstr "ແຖບ [guimenu]``Unmatched Products Report`` ຈະສະແດງລາຍຊື່ client ທີ່ບໍ່ມີການສະໝັກໃຊ້ໃນປະຈຸບັນ. ສິ່ງນີ້ລວມເຖິງ client ທີ່ບໍ່ສາມາດຈັບຄູ່ໄດ້ ຫຼື ທີ່ຍັງບໍ່ໄດ້ລົງທະບຽນກັບ {productname}. ລາຍງານຈະລວມເຖິງຊື່ຜະລິດຕະພັນ ແລະ ຈໍານວນລະົບບທີ່ຍັງບໍ່ທັນໄດ້ຮັບການຈັບຄູ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/subscription-matching.adoc:6
msgid ""
"The [guimenu]``Pins`` tab allows you to associate individual clients to the "
"relevant subscription.  This is especially useful if the subscription "
"manager is not automatically associating clients to subscriptions "
"successfully."
msgstr "ແຖບ [guimenu]``Pins`` ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດເຊື່ອມໂຍງ client ແຕ່ລະເຄື່ອງເຂົ້າກັບການສະໝັກໃຊ້ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ. ສິ່ງນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດຫຼາຍຫາກຕົວຈັດການການສະໝັກໃຊ້ບໍ່ສາມາດຈັບຄູ່ client ເຂົ້າກັບການສະໝັກໃຊ້ໄດ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/subscription-matching.adoc:7
msgid ""
"The [guimenu]``Messages`` tab shows all the messages generated by "
"subscription matcher during the matching process.  They provide information "
"to help understand the results and to improve the matching."
msgstr "ແຖບ [guimenu]``Messages`` ຈະສະແດງຂໍ້ຄວາມທັງໝົດທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍ subscription matcher ໃນລະຫວ່າງຂະບວນການຈັບຄູ່. ພວກມັນໃຫ້ຂໍ້ມູນເພື່ອຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຂົ້າໃຈຜົນລັດ ແລະ ເພື່ອປັບປຸງການຈັບຄູ່ໃຫ້ດີຂຶ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/subscription-matching.adoc:8
msgid ""
"You can also download the reports in .csv format, or access them from that "
"command prompt in the [path]``/var/lib/spacewalk/subscription-matcher/`` "
"directory."
msgstr "ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດດາວໂຫຼດລາຍງານໃນຮູບແບບ .csv ຫຼື ເຂົ້າເຖິງພວກມັນຈາກ command prompt ໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ [path]``/var/lib/spacewalk/subscription-matcher/``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/subscription-matching.adoc:9
msgid ""
"By default, the subscription matcher runs daily, at midnight.  To change "
"this, navigate to menu:Admin[Task Schedules] and click "
"``gatherer-matcher-default``.  Change the schedule as required, and click "
"btn:[Update Schedule]."
msgstr "ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, subscription matcher ຈະລັນທຸກມື້ໃນເວລາທ່ຽງຄືນ. ເພື່ອປ່ຽນແປງສິ່ງນີ້, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Admin[Task Schedules] ແລະ ຄລິກທີ່ ``gatherer-matcher-default``. ປ່ຽນຕາຕະລາງເວລາຕາມຄວາມຕ້ອງການ ແລະ ຄລິກທີ່ [Update Schedule]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/subscription-matching.adoc:10
msgid ""
"Because the report can only match current clients with current "
"subscriptions, you might find that the matches change over time.  The same "
"client does not always match the same subscription.  This can be due to new "
"clients being registered or unregistered, or because of the addition or "
"expiration of subscriptions."
msgstr "ເນື່ອງຈາກລາຍງານສາມາດຈັບຄູ່ client ໃນປະຈຸບັນກັບການສະໝັກໃຊ້ໃນປະຈຸບັນເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ທ່ານອາດຈະພົບວ່າການຈັບຄູ່ມີການປ່ຽນແປງຕາມເວລາ. client ເຄື່ອງເດີມອາດຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ຈັບຄູ່ກັບການສະໝັກໃຊ້ອັນເດີມສະເໝີໄປ. ສິ່ງນີ້ອາດເກີດຈາກການທີ່ມີ client ໃໝ່ລົງທະບຽນ ຫຼື ຍົກເລີກການລົງທະບຽນ, ຫຼື ຍ້ອນການເພີ່ມ ຫຼື ການໝົດອາຍຸຂອງການສະໝັກໃຊ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/subscription-matching.adoc:11
msgid ""
"The subscription matcher automatically attempts to reduce the number of "
"unmatched products, limited by the terms and conditions of the subscriptions "
"in your account.  However, if you have incomplete hardware information, "
"unknown virtual machine host assignments, or clients running in unknown "
"public clouds, the matcher might show that you do not have enough "
"subscriptions available.  Always ensure you have complete data about your "
"clients included in {productname}, to help ensure accuracy."
msgstr "subscription matcher ຈະພະຍາຍາມຫຼຸດຈໍານວນຜະລິດຕະພັນທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບການຈັບຄູ່ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ ພາຍໃຕ້ເງື່ອນໄຂຂອງການສະໝັກໃຊ້ໃນບັນຊີຂອງທ່ານ. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ຫາກທ່ານມີຂໍ້ມູນຮາດແວບໍ່ຄົບຖ້ວນ, ບໍ່ຮູ້ການມອບໝາຍ host ຂອງ virtual machine, ຫຼື client ລັນຢູ່ໃນ public cloud ທີ່ບໍ່ຮູ້ຈັກ, ຕົວຈັບຄູ່ອາດຈະສະແດງວ່າທ່ານມີການສະໝັກໃຊ້ບໍ່ພຽງພໍ. ໃຫ້ໝັ້ນໃຈສະເໝີວ່າທ່ານມີຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຄົບຖ້ວນກ່ຽວກັບ client ຂອງທ່ານໃນ {productname} ເພື່ອຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ການຈັບຄູ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/subscription-matching.adoc:12
msgid ""
"The subscription matcher does not always match clients and subscriptions "
"accurately.  It is not intended to be a replacement for auditing."
msgstr "subscription matcher ອາດຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ຈັບຄູ່ client ແລະ ການສະໝັກໃຊ້ໄດ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ 100%. ມັນບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກອອກແບບມາເພື່ອໃຊ້ແທນການກວດສອບ (auditing)."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/subscription-matching.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "Pin Clients to Subscriptions"
msgstr "ປັກໝຸດ client ເຂົ້າກັບການສະໝັກໃຊ້ (Pin Clients)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/subscription-matching.adoc:14
msgid ""
"If the subscription matcher is not automatically matching a particular "
"client with the correct subscription, you can manually pin them.  When you "
"have created a pin, the subscription matcher favors matching a specific "
"subscription with a given system or group of systems."
msgstr "ຫາກ subscription matcher ບໍ່ໄດ້ຈັບຄູ່ client ໃດໜຶ່ງກັບການສະໝັກໃຊ້ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ, ທ່ານສາມາດປັກໝຸດ (pin) ພວກເຂົາດ້ວຍຕົນເອງໄດ້. ເມື່ອທ່ານສ້າງ pin ແລ້ວ, subscription matcher ຈະໃຫ້ຄວາມສໍາຄັນໃນການຈັບຄູ່ການສະໝັກໃຊ້ສະເພາະເຂົ້າກັບລະບົບ ຫຼື ກຸ່ມລະບົບທີ່ກໍານົດໄວ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/subscription-matching.adoc:15
msgid ""
"However, the matcher does not always respect a pin.  It depends on the "
"subscription being available, and whether or not the subscription can be "
"applied to the client.  Additionally, pins are ignored if they result in a "
"match that violates the terms and conditions of the subscription, or if the "
"matcher detects a more accurate match if the pin is ignored."
msgstr "ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ຕົວຈັບຄູ່ອາດຈະບໍ່ປະຕິບັດຕາມ pin ສະເໝີໄປ. ມັນຂຶ້ນກັບວ່າມີການສະໝັກໃຊ້ນັ້ນຢູ່ຫຼືບໍ່ ແລະ ການສະໝັກໃຊ້ນັ້ນສາມາດໃຊ້ກັບ client ໄດ້ຫຼືບໍ່. ນອກຈາກນີ້, pin ຈະຖືກລະເລີຍຫາກຜົນການຈັບຄູ່ລະເມີດເງື່ອນໄຂຂອງການສະໝັກໃຊ້, ຫຼື ຫາກຕົວຈັບຄູ່ກວດພົບການຈັບຄູ່ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງກວ່າຫາກລະເລີຍ pin ນັ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/subscription-matching.adoc:16
msgid "To add a new pin, click btn:[Add a Pin], and select the client to pin."
msgstr "ເພື່ອເພີ່ມ pin ໃໝ່, ໃຫ້ຄລິກທີ່ [Add a Pin], ແລະ ເລືອກ client ທີ່ຕ້ອງການປັກໝຸດ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/subscription-matching.adoc:17
msgid ""
"We do not recommend using pinning regularly, or for a large number of "
"clients.  The subscription matcher tool is generally accurate enough for "
"most installations."
msgstr "ພວກເຮົາບໍ່ແນະນໍາໃຫ້ໃຊ້ການປັກໝຸດເປັນປະຈໍາ ຫຼື ໃຊ້ກັບ client ຈໍານວນຫຼາຍ. ເຄື່ອງມື subscription matcher ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວແມ່ນມີຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງພຽງພໍສໍາລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງສ່ວນໃຫຍ່."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Task Schedules"
msgstr "ຕາຕະລາງວຽກ (Task Schedules)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:2
msgid "All predefined task bunches are listed under menu:Admin[Task Schedules]."
msgstr "ກຸ່ມວຽກທີ່ກໍານົດໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າທັງໝົດຈະຖືກສະແດງພາຍໃຕ້ເມນູ: Admin[Task Schedules]."

#. type: Target for macro image
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "admin_task_schedules.png"
msgstr "admin_task_schedules.png"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Click menu:{productname} Schedules[Schedule name] to open the menu:Schedule "
"Name[Basic Schedule Details].  You can disable it or change its frequency."
msgstr "ຄລິກທີ່ເມນູ: {productname} Schedules[ຊື່ຕາຕະລາງ] ເພື່ອເປີດເມນູ: ຊື່ຕາຕະລາງ[Basic Schedule Details]. ທ່ານສາມາດປິດການໃຊ້ງານ ຫຼື ປ່ຽນຄວາມຖີ່ຂອງມັນໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:5
msgid "Click btn:[Edit Schedule] to update the schedule with your settings."
msgstr "ຄລິກທີ່ [Edit Schedule] ເພື່ອອັບເດດຕາຕະລາງຕາມການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:6
msgid ""
"Click btn:[Disable Schedule] in the upper right-hand corner to disable a "
"schedule."
msgstr "ຄລິກທີ່ [Disable Schedule] ຢູ່ມຸມຂວາເທິງເພື່ອປິດການໃຊ້ງານຕາຕະລາງ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:7
msgid ""
"Only disable a schedule if you are absolutely certain this is necessary as "
"they are essential for {productname} to work properly."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ປິດການໃຊ້ງານຕາຕະລາງກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອທ່ານໝັ້ນໃຈແທ້ໆວ່າມັນຈໍາເປັນ ເພາະວຽກເຫຼົ່ານີ້ມີຄວາມສໍາຄັນຫຼາຍຕໍ່ການເຮັດວຽກຂອງ {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:8
msgid ""
"When a task is disabled, it is still shown in the list.  When you click "
"menu:{productname} Schedules[Schedule name] you can activate the job again "
"by clicking btn:[Activate Schedule]."
msgstr "ເມື່ອວຽກຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານ, ມັນຈະຍັງປາກົດຢູ່ໃນລາຍຊື່. ເມື່ອທ່ານຄລິກເມນູ: {productname} Schedules[ຊື່ຕາຕະລາງ], ທ່ານສາມາດເປີດໃຊ້ງານວຽກນັ້ນຄືນໃໝ່ໄດ້ໂດຍການຄລິກທີ່ [Activate Schedule]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:9
msgid ""
"If you click a bunch name, a list of runs of that bunch type and their "
"status is displayed."
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານຄລິກທີ່ຊື່ກຸ່ມວຽກ, ລາຍຊື່ການເຮັດວຽກຂອງກຸ່ມວຽກນັ້ນ ແລະ ສະຖານະຂອງມັນຈະຖືກສະແດງອອກມາ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:10
msgid ""
"Clicking the start time links takes you back to the menu:Schedule Name[Basic "
"Schedule Details]."
msgstr "ການຄລິກທີ່ລິ້ງເວລາເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ຈະພາທ່ານກັບໄປທີ່ເມນູ: ຊື່ຕາຕະລາງ[Basic Schedule Details]."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "Predefined task bunches"
msgstr "ກຸ່ມວຽກທີ່ກໍານົດໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:12
msgid ""
"The following predefined task bunches are scheduled by default and can be "
"configured:"
msgstr "ກຸ່ມວຽກທີ່ກໍານົດໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ຖືກຕັ້ງຕາຕະລາງໄວ້ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ແລະ ສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າໄດ້:"

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:auto-errata-default[]"
msgstr "ເມນູ: auto-errata-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:14
msgid "Schedules auto errata updates as necessary."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຕາຕະລາງການອັບເດດ errata ອັດຕະໂນມັດຕາມຄວາມຈໍາເປັນ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:channel-repodata-default[]"
msgstr "ເມນູ: channel-repodata-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:16
msgid "(Re)generates repository metadata files."
msgstr "ສ້າງ (ໃໝ່) ໄຟລ໌ metadata ຂອງ repository."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:cleanup-data-default[]"
msgstr "ເມນູ: cleanup-data-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:18
msgid ""
"Cleans up stale package change log and monitoring time series data from the "
"database."
msgstr "ລຶບຂໍ້ມູນ package change log ທີ່ເກົ່າແລ້ວ ແລະ ຂໍ້ມູນ monitoring time series ອອກຈາກຖານຂໍ້ມູນ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:clear-taskologs-default[]"
msgstr "ເມນູ: clear-taskologs-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:20
msgid ""
"Clears task engine (taskomatic) history data older than a specified number "
"of days, depending on the job type, from the database."
msgstr "ລຶບຂໍ້ມູນປະຫວັດຂອງ task engine (taskomatic) ທີ່ເກົ່າກວ່າຈໍານວນມື້ທີ່ກໍານົດໄວ້ ອອກຈາກຖານຂໍ້ມູນ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:cobbler-sync-default[]"
msgstr "ເມນູ: cobbler-sync-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:22
msgid ""
"Synchronizes distribution and profile data from {productname} to {cobbler}.  "
"For more information about autoinstallation powered by {cobbler}, see "
"xref:client-configuration:autoinst-intro.adoc[]."
msgstr "ຊິງໂຄຣໄນຊ໌ (Synchronize) ຂໍ້ມູນ distribution ແລະ profile ຈາກ {productname} ໄປຫາ {cobbler}."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:compare-configs-default[]"
msgstr "ເມນູ: compare-configs-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:24
msgid ""
"Compares configuration files as stored in configuration channels with the "
"files stored on all configuration-enabled servers.  To review comparisons, "
"click menu:Systems[] tab and select the system of interest.  Go to "
"menu:Configuration[Compare Files].  For more information, see "
"xref:reference:systems/system-details/sd-configuration.adoc#sd-config-compare-files[]."
msgstr "ປຽບທຽບໄຟລ໌ຄອນຟິກທີ່ເກັບໄວ້ໃນ configuration channels ກັບໄຟລ໌ທີ່ເກັບໄວ້ໃນເຊີເວີທັງໝົດທີ່ເປີດໃຊ້ຄອນຟິກ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:cve-server-channels-default[]"
msgstr "ເມນູ: cve-server-channels-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:26
msgid ""
"Updates internal pre-computed CVE data that is used to display results on "
"the menu:Audit[CVE Audit] page.  Search results in the menu:Audit[CVE Audit] "
"page are updated to the last run of this schedule.  For more information, "
"see xref:reference:audit/audit-cve-audit.adoc[]."
msgstr "ອັບເດດຂໍ້ມູນ CVE ພາຍໃນທີ່ໃຊ້ສໍາລັບສະແດງຜົນໃນໜ້າ Audit[CVE Audit]."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:27
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:daily-status-default[]"
msgstr "ເມນູ: daily-status-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:28
msgid ""
"Sends daily report e-mails to relevant addresses.  For more information "
"about configuring notifications for specific users, see "
"xref:reference:users/user-details.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງອີເມລລາຍງານປະຈໍາວັນໄປຫາທີ່ຢູ່ອີເມລທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:errata-cache-default[]"
msgstr "ເມນູ: errata-cache-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:30
msgid ""
"Updates internal patch cache database tables, which are used to look up "
"packages that need updates for each server.  Also, this sends notification "
"emails to users that might be interested in certain patches.  For more "
"information about patches, see xref:reference:patches/patches-menu.adoc[]."
msgstr "ອັບເດດຕາຕະລາງຖານຂໍ້ມູນ patch cache ພາຍໃນ ເຊິ່ງໃຊ້ສໍາລັບຊອກຫາແພັກເກດທີ່ຕ້ອງອັບເດດ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:31
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:errata-queue-default[]"
msgstr "ເມນູ: errata-queue-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:32
msgid ""
"Queues automatic updates (patches) for servers that are configured to "
"receive them."
msgstr "ຈັດຄິວການອັບເດດອັດຕະໂນມັດ (ແພັດຊ໌) ສໍາລັບເຊີເວີທີ່ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ຮັບພວກມັນ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:33
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:gatherer-matcher-default[]"
msgstr "ເມນູ: gatherer-matcher-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:34
msgid ""
"Gather virtual host data by running Virtual Host Gatherer configured in "
"Virtual Host Managers.  After updated data are available, the Subscription "
"Matcher job is run."
msgstr "ເກັບກໍາຂໍ້ມູນ virtual host ແລະ ຈາກນັ້ນລັນວຽກ Subscription Matcher."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:35
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:kickstart-cleanup-default[]"
msgstr "ເມນູ: kickstart-cleanup-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:36
msgid "Cleans up stale {kickstart} session data."
msgstr "ລຶບຂໍ້ມູນເຊດຊັນ {kickstart} ທີ່ເກົ່າແລ້ວ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:37
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:kickstartfile-sync-default[]"
msgstr "ເມນູ: kickstartfile-sync-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:38
msgid ""
"Generates {cobbler} files corresponding to {kickstart} profiles created by "
"the configuration wizard."
msgstr "ສ້າງໄຟລ໌ {cobbler} ທີ່ກົງກັບ {kickstart} profiles."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:39
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:mgr-forward-registration-default[]"
msgstr "ເມນູ: mgr-forward-registration-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:40
msgid ""
"Synchronizes client registration data with {scclongform}.  By default, new, "
"changed, or deleted client data are forwarded.  To disable synchronization "
"set in [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``, run:"
msgstr "ຊິງໂຄຣໄນຊ໌ຂໍ້ມູນການລົງທະບຽນ client ກັບ {scclongform}."

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:41
#, no-wrap
msgid "server.susemanager.forward_registration = 0\n"
msgstr "server.susemanager.forward_registration = 0\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:42
msgid ""
"Disabling data synchronizing with {scc} will lead to reduced visibility of "
"your managed clients between RMT, SMT, {productname} and {scc}-directly "
"registered clients.  By synchronizing data, you ensure a uniform view of all "
"registered clients.  "
"https://suselinux.fra1.qualtrics.com/jfe/form/SV_0ooNnrY0rYuQScS[Help us "
"improve our services by sharing your reason for opting out]"
msgstr "ການປິດການຊິງໂຄຣໄນຂໍ້ມູນກັບ {scc} ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ການເບິ່ງເຫັນໄຄເອັນທີ່ຢູ່ພາຍໃຕ້ການຈັດການຫຼຸດລົງລະຫວ່າງ RMT, SMT, {productname} ແລະ {scc}."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:43
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:mgr-sync-refresh-default[]"
msgstr "ເມນູ: mgr-sync-refresh-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:44
msgid ""
"Synchronizes with {scclongform} (``mgr-sync-refresh``).  By default, all "
"custom channels are also synchronized as part of this task.  For more "
"information about custom channel synchronization, see "
"xref:administration:custom-channels.adoc#_custom_channel_synchronization[]."
msgstr "ຊິງໂຄຣໄນຊ໌ກັບ {scclongform} (``mgr-sync-refresh``)."

#.  menu:minion-action-chain-cleanup-default[]::
#.  Cleans up outdated action chain data.
#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:45
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:minion-action-cleanup-default[]"
msgstr "ເມນູ: minion-action-cleanup-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:46
msgid ""
"Deletes stale client action data from the file system.  First it tries to "
"complete any possibly unfinished actions by looking up the corresponding "
"results stored in the {salt} job cache.  An unfinished action can occur if "
"the server has missed the results of the action.  For successfully completed "
"actions it removes artifacts such as executed script files."
msgstr "ລຶບຂໍ້ມູນການກະທໍາຂອງ client ທີ່ເກົ່າແລ້ວອອກຈາກລະບົບໄຟລ໌."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:47
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:minion-checkin-default[]"
msgstr "ເມນູ: minion-checkin-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:48
msgid "Performs a regular check-in on clients."
msgstr "ທໍາການ check-in ປົກກະຕິໃນ client."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:49
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:notifications-cleanup-default[]"
msgstr "ເມນູ: notifications-cleanup-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:50
msgid "Cleans up expired notification messages."
msgstr "ລຶບຂໍ້ຄວາມແຈ້ງເຕືອນທີ່ໝົດອາຍຸ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:51
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:oval-data-sync-default[]"
msgstr "ເມນູ: oval-data-sync-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:52
msgid "Generate OVAL data required to increase the accuracy of CVE audit queries."
msgstr "ສ້າງຂໍ້ມູນ OVAL ທີ່ຈໍາເປັນເພື່ອເພີ່ມຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງຂອງການກວດສອບ CVE."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:53
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:package-cleanup-default[]"
msgstr "ເມນູ: package-cleanup-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:54
msgid "Deletes stale package files from the file system."
msgstr "ລຶບໄຟລ໌ແພັກເກດທີ່ເກົ່າແລ້ວອອກຈາກລະບົບໄຟລ໌."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:55
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:reboot-action-cleanup-default[]"
msgstr "ເມນູ: reboot-action-cleanup-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:56
msgid ""
"Any reboot actions pending for more than six hours are marked as failed and "
"associated data is cleaned up from the database.  For more information on "
"scheduling reboot actions, see "
"xref:reference:systems/system-details/sd-provisioning.adoc#sd-power-management[]."
msgstr "ການຣີບູດທີ່ຄ້າງເກີນ 6 ຊົ່ວໂມງຈະຖືກໝາຍວ່າຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ ແລະ ຂໍ້ມູນຈະຖືກລຶບອອກ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:57
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:sandbox-cleanup-default[]"
msgstr "ເມນູ: sandbox-cleanup-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:58
msgid ""
"Cleans up Sandbox configuration files and channels that are older than the "
"__sandbox_lifetime__ configuration parameter (3 days by default).  Sandbox "
"files are those imported from systems or files under development.  For more "
"information, see "
"xref:reference:systems/system-details/sd-configuration.adoc#sd-config-add-files[]."
msgstr "ລຶບໄຟລ໌ຄອນຟິກ ແລະ ຊ່ອງທາງໃນ Sandbox ທີ່ເກົ່າແລ້ວ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:59
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:session-cleanup-default[]"
msgstr "ເມນູ: session-cleanup-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:60
msgid ""
"Cleans up stale Web interface sessions, typically data that is temporarily "
"stored when a user logs in and then closes the browser before logging out."
msgstr "ລຶບ Web interface sessions ທີ່ເກົ່າແລ້ວ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:61
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:ssh-service-default[]"
msgstr "ເມນູ: ssh-service-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:62
msgid ""
"Prompts clients to check in with {productname} via SSH if they are "
"configured with a `SSH Push` contact method.  Also resume action chains "
"after a reboot."
msgstr "ແຈ້ງເຕືອນໃຫ້ client ທໍາການ check-in ຜ່ານ SSH."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:63
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:system-overview-update-queue-default[]"
msgstr "ເມນູ: system-overview-update-queue-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:64
msgid "Update the systems overview data."
msgstr "ອັບເດດຂໍ້ມູນພາບລວມຂອງລະບົບ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:65
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:system-profile-refresh-default[]"
msgstr "ເມນູ: system-profile-refresh-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:66
msgid ""
"Runs a hardware refresh on all systems.  This happens only monthly and can "
"increase load on the {productname} Server.  The job uses "
"xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-rate-limiting.adoc[Salt Rate Limiting].  "
"For tuning the batch size, see "
"xref:specialized-guides:large-deployments/tuning.adoc#java-salt-batch-size[]."
msgstr "ຣີເຟຣຊຂໍ້ມູນຮາດແວໃນທຸກລະບົບ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:67
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:token-cleanup-default[]"
msgstr "ເມນູ: token-cleanup-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:68
msgid ""
"Deletes expired repository tokens that are used by {salt} clients to "
"download packages and metadata."
msgstr "ລຶບ repository tokens ທີ່ໝົດອາຍຸ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:69
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:update-payg-default[]"
msgstr "ເມນູ: update-payg-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:70
msgid "Collects authentication data from configured {payg} cloud instances."
msgstr "ເກັບກໍາຂໍ້ມູນການກວດສອບສິດຈາກ {payg} cloud instances ທີ່ຕັ້ງຄ່າໄວ້."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:71
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:update-reporting-default[]"
msgstr "ເມນູ: update-reporting-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:72
msgid "Updates the local Reporting Database."
msgstr "ອັບເດດ Reporting Database ພາຍໃນເຄື່ອງ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:73
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:update-reporting-hub-default[]"
msgstr "ເມນູ: update-reporting-hub-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:74
msgid ""
"Collects all reporting data from peripheral {productname} Server and update "
"the Hub Reporting Database."
msgstr "ເກັບກໍາຂໍ້ມູນລາຍງານຈາກ peripheral Server ແລະ ອັບເດດ Hub Reporting Database."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:75
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:update-system-overview-default[]"
msgstr "ເມນູ: update-system-overview-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:76
msgid "Regularly ensure the systems overview data are up to date."
msgstr "ກວດສອບໃຫ້ໝັ້ນໃຈວ່າຂໍ້ມູນພາບລວມຂອງລະບົບຖືກອັບເດດຢູ່ສະເໝີ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:77
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:uuid-cleanup-default[]"
msgstr "ເມນູ: uuid-cleanup-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:78
msgid "Cleans up outdated UUID records."
msgstr "ລຶບຂໍ້ມູນ UUID ທີ່ໝົດອາຍຸ."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/third-party-channels.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Third-party Channels"
msgstr "ຊ່ອງທາງຈາກພາຍນອກ (Third-party Channels)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/third-party-channels.adoc:2
msgid ""
"{productname} includes the ability to synchronize the content of optional "
"third-party repositories with some of the products that can be managed by "
"it."
msgstr "{productname} ສາມາດຊິງໂຄຣໄນຊ໌ເນື້ອໃນຈາກ third-party repositories ທີ່ເປັນທາງເລືອກ ເຂົ້າກັບຜະລິດຕະພັນທີ່ມັນຈັດການ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/third-party-channels.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Some third-party GPG keys are included by default in the {productname} "
"database, and some are not.  For third-party keys that are not included, the "
"relevant keys need to be imported when choosing to synchronize such "
"third-party repositories."
msgstr "ຄີ GPG ຈາກພາຍນອກບາງອັນຖືກລວມໄວ້ໃນຖານຂໍ້ມູນ {productname} ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ແຕ່ບາງອັນກໍບໍ່ມີ. ສໍາລັບຄີທີ່ບໍ່ມີ, ທ່ານຈໍາເປັນຕ້ອງນໍາເຂົ້າພວກມັນກ່ອນທີ່ຈະຊິງໂຄຣໄນຊ໌ repository ນັ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/third-party-channels.adoc:4
msgid ""
"To import a GPG key, use the following command syntax, executing the command "
"on the {productname} host server:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອທໍາການນໍາເຂົ້າຄີ GPG, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຮູບແບບຄໍາສັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ໃນ {productname} host server:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/third-party-channels.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm gpg add <path-to-gpg-key-file-or-URL>\n"
msgstr "mgradm gpg add <path-to-gpg-key-file-or-URL>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/third-party-channels.adoc:6
msgid "Example: Adding a GPG key from a file:"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: ການເພີ່ມຄີ GPG ຈາກໄຟລ໌:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/third-party-channels.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm gpg add repomd.xml.key\n"
msgstr "mgradm gpg add repomd.xml.key\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/third-party-channels.adoc:8
msgid "Example: Adding a GPG key from a remote repository using a URL:"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: ການເພີ່ມຄີ GPG ຈາກ URL ຂອງ repository ພາຍນອກ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/third-party-channels.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgradm gpg add "
"https://<3rd-party-domain>/path/to/repository/repodata/repomd.xml.key\n"
msgstr "mgradm gpg add https://<3rd-party-domain>/path/to/repository/repodata/repomd.xml.key\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/third-party-channels.adoc:10
msgid ""
"To list the keys currently held in the {productname} GPG database, run the "
"following command:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອເບິ່ງລາຍຊື່ຄີທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນຖານຂໍ້ມູນ GPG ຂອງ {productname}, ໃຫ້ລັນຄໍາສັ່ງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/third-party-channels.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgrctl exec -ti -- gpg --homedir /var/lib/spacewalk/gpgdir --list-keys\n"
msgstr "mgrctl exec -ti -- gpg --homedir /var/lib/spacewalk/gpgdir --list-keys\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/third-party-channels.adoc:12
msgid ""
"When installing a package on the client, you may also need to trust the GPG "
"key on the client itself.  This requires that the GPG key is also available "
"there."
msgstr "ເມື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດໃນ client, ທ່ານອາດຈະຕ້ອງໃຫ້ client ເຊື່ອຖືຄີ GPG ນັ້ນດ້ວຍ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ມີຄີ GPG ຢູ່ໃນເຄື່ອງ client ເຊັ່ນກັນ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/third-party-channels.adoc:13
msgid "For more information see: xref:client-configuration:gpg-keys.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມເບິ່ງທີ່: xref:client-configuration:gpg-keys.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-autoinstallation.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Autoinstallation"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາການຕິດຕັ້ງອັດຕະໂນມັດ (Autoinstallation)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-autoinstallation.adoc:2
msgid ""
"If you use the plain {salt} (salt-minion) implementation for communication, "
"you on your own must make sure that all the needed software (software "
"packages) is properly available in configured client channels.  It is not "
"recommended to use this implementation together with {productname}."
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານໃຊ້ {salt} (salt-minion) ແບບທໍາມະດາ, ທ່ານຈະຕ້ອງກວດສອບເອງວ່າຊອບແວທີ່ຈໍາເປັນທັງໝົດມີພ້ອມຢູ່ໃນ client channels ທີ່ຕັ້ງຄ່າໄວ້. ບໍ່ແນະນໍາໃຫ້ໃຊ້ວິທີນີ້ຮ່ວມກັບ {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-autoinstallation.adoc:3
msgid ""
"With the default {salt} bundle (venv-salt-minion) implementation you only "
"need a client tools channel as a child channel that is compatible with your "
"client base channel.  All required packages will be part of the {salt} "
"bundle."
msgstr "ຫາກໃຊ້ {salt} bundle (venv-salt-minion) ທີ່ເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງການພຽງແຕ່ client tools channel ທີ່ເຂົ້າກັນໄດ້ກັບ base channel ຂອງທ່ານ. ແພັກເກດທີ່ຈໍາເປັນທັງໝົດຈະລວມຢູ່ໃນ {salt} bundle ແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-autoinstallation.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Check that the client tools software channel related to the base channel in "
"your autoinstallation profile is available to your organization and your "
"user."
msgstr "ກວດສອບວ່າ client tools software channel ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບ base channel ໃນ autoinstallation profile ຂອງທ່ານນັ້ນ ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ໂດຍອົງກອນ ແລະ ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-autoinstallation.adoc:5
msgid ""
"Check that the tools channel is available to your {productname} as a child "
"channel."
msgstr "ກວດສອບວ່າ tools channel ນັ້ນມີຢູ່ໃນ {productname} ເປັນ child channel ແລ້ວຫຼືບໍ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-autoinstallation.adoc:6
msgid ""
"Only if using the plain {salt} (salt-minion) implementation, also check that "
"the required packages and any dependencies are available in the associated "
"channels."
msgstr "ສະເພາະກໍລະນີທີ່ໃຊ້ {salt} (salt-minion) ແບບທໍາມະດາ, ໃຫ້ກວດສອບວ່າແພັກເກດທີ່ຈໍາເປັນ ແລະ dependencies ຕ່າງໆມີພ້ອມຢູ່ໃນຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-bootstrap-repo-for-eol-products.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Bootstrap Repository for End-of-Life Products"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາ Bootstrap Repository ສໍາລັບຜະລິດຕະພັນທີ່ໝົດອາຍຸ (End-of-Life)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-bootstrap-repo-for-eol-products.adoc:2
msgid ""
"When supported products are synchronized, bootstrap repositories are "
"automatically created and regenerated on the {productname} Server.  When a "
"product reaches end-of-life and becomes unsupported, bootstrap repositories "
"must be created manually if you want to continue using the product."
msgstr "ເມື່ອຜະລິດຕະພັນທີ່ຍັງຮອງຮັບຖືກຊິງໂຄຣໄນຊ໌, bootstrap repositories ຈະຖືກສ້າງ ແລະ ສ້າງໃໝ່ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ແຕ່ເມື່ອຜະລິດຕະພັນໝົດອາຍຸ (end-of-life) ແລະ ບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບການສະໜັບສະໜູນແລ້ວ, ທ່ານຈະຕ້ອງສ້າງ bootstrap repositories ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງຫາກຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ງານຕໍ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-bootstrap-repo-for-eol-products.adoc:3
msgid ""
"For more information about bootstrap repositories, see "
"xref:client-configuration:bootstrap-repository.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສໍາລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ bootstrap repositories, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:bootstrap-repository.adoc[]."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-bootstrap-repo-for-eol-products.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating Bootstrap Repositories for End-Of-Life Products"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງ Bootstrap Repositories ສໍາລັບຜະລິດຕະພັນທີ່ໝົດອາຍຸ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-bootstrap-repo-for-eol-products.adoc:5
msgid ""
"At the command prompt of the {productname} container host, as root, enter "
"the server container:"
msgstr "ທີ່ command prompt ຂອງ {productname} container host, ໃນຖານະ root, ໃຫ້ເຂົ້າສູ່ server container:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-bootstrap-repo-for-eol-products.adoc:8
msgid ""
"List the available unsupported bootstrap repositories with the "
"[option]``--force`` option, for example:"
msgstr "ສະແດງລາຍຊື່ bootstrap repositories ທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບການສະໜັບສະໜູນທີ່ມີຢູ່ ດ້ວຍຕົວເລືອກ [option]``--force``, ຕົວຢ່າງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-bootstrap-repo-for-eol-products.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgr-create-bootstrap-repo --list --force\n"
"1. SLE-12-SP2-x86_64\n"
"2. SLE-12-SP3-x86_64\n"
msgstr ""
"mgr-create-bootstrap-repo --list --force\n"
"1. SLE-12-SP2-x86_64\n"
"2. SLE-12-SP3-x86_64\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-bootstrap-repo-for-eol-products.adoc:10
msgid ""
"Create the bootstrap repository by using the appropriate repository name as "
"the product label:"
msgstr "ສ້າງ bootstrap repository ໂດຍໃຊ້ຊື່ repository ທີ່ເໝາະສົມເປັນ product label:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-bootstrap-repo-for-eol-products.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgr-create-bootstrap-repo --create SLE-12-SP2-x86_64 --force\n"
msgstr "mgr-create-bootstrap-repo --create SLE-12-SP2-x86_64 --force\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-bootstrap-repo-for-eol-products.adoc:12
msgid ""
"If you do not want to create bootstrap repositories manually, you can check "
"whether LTSS is available for the product and bootstrap repository you need."
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານບໍ່ຕ້ອງການສ້າງ bootstrap repositories ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ, ທ່ານສາມາດກວດສອບວ່າ LTSS ມີໃຫ້ບໍລິການສໍາລັບຜະລິດຕະພັນ ແລະ bootstrap repository ທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການຫຼືບໍ່."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-cloned-salt-clients.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Clients Cloned Salt Clients"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາ Client ທີ່ຖືກຄັດລອກ (Cloned Salt Clients)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-cloned-salt-clients.adoc:2
msgid ""
"If you have used your hypervisor clone utility, and attempted to register "
"the cloned Salt client, you might get this error:"
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມື clone ຂອງ hypervisor ແລະ ພະຍາຍາມລົງທະບຽນ Salt client ທີ່ຖືກ clone ມານັ້ນ, ທ່ານອາດຈະພົບຂໍ້ຜິດພາດນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-cloned-salt-clients.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "We're sorry, but the system could not be found.\n"
msgstr "ຂໍອະໄພ, ແຕ່ບໍ່ພົບລະບົບດັ່ງກ່າວ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-cloned-salt-clients.adoc:4
msgid ""
"This is caused by the new, cloned, system having the same machine ID as an "
"existing, registered, system.  You can adjust this manually to correct the "
"error and register the cloned system successfully."
msgstr "ສິ່ງນີ້ເກີດຈາກການທີ່ລະບົບໃໝ່ທີ່ຖືກ clone ມານັ້ນ ມີ machine ID ອັນດຽວກັນກັບລະບົບທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ. ທ່ານສາມາດປັບແຕ່ງສິ່ງນີ້ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ ແລະ ລົງທະບຽນລະບົບທີ່ clone ມາໄດ້ຢ່າງສໍາເລັດຜົນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-cloned-salt-clients.adoc:5
msgid ""
"For more information and instructions, see "
"xref:administration:troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສໍາລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ ແລະ ຄໍາແນະນໍາ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:administration:troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-container-full-disk.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Container with Full Disk Event"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາ Container ເມື່ອພື້ນທີ່ດິດເຕັມ"

#
#
#
#. PUT THIS COMMENT AT THE TOP OF TROUBLESHOOTING SECTIONS
#. Troubleshooting format:
#. One sentence each:
#. Cause: What created the problem?
#. Consequence: What does the user see when this happens?
#. Fix: What can the user do to fix this problem?
#. Result: What happens after the user has completed the fix?
#. If more detailed instructions are required, put them in a "Resolving" procedure:
#. .Procedure: Resolving Widget Wobbles
#. . First step
#. . Another step
#. . Last step
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-container-full-disk.adoc:2
msgid ""
"In case a dedicated disk mounted as a persistent storage medium of a "
"container runs out of storage space, an emergency action is needed."
msgstr "ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ດິດທີ່ຕິດພັນ (mount) ເປັນບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນແບບຖາວອນຂອງ container ເຕັມ, ຈໍາເປັນຕ້ອງມີການດໍາເນີນການສຸກເສີນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-container-full-disk.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Proceed as follows to solve the problem with resizing the storage medium.  "
"Run all listed commands as [literal]``root`` on the container host."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ປະຕິບັດດັ່ງນີ້ເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາໂດຍການຂະຫຍາຍຂະໜາດບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ. ລັນຄໍາສັ່ງທັງໝົດໃນຖານະ [literal]``root`` ໃນ container host."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-container-full-disk.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Resize Storage Medium"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຂະຫຍາຍຂະໜາດບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-container-full-disk.adoc:5
msgid ""
"Increase the disk size.  Actions to take depend on the installation "
"scenario."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມຂະໜາດດິດ. ວິທີການຈະຂຶ້ນກັບຮູບແບບການຕິດຕັ້ງຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-container-full-disk.adoc:6
msgid ""
"If the disk is partitioned (for example, there is a [path]``/dev/vdb1`` for "
"disk [path]``/dev/vdb``), run the following commands:"
msgstr "ຫາກດິດມີການແບ່ງພາທິຊັນ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: ມີ [path]``/dev/vdb1`` ສໍາລັບດິດ [path]``/dev/vdb``), ໃຫ້ລັນຄໍາສັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-container-full-disk.adoc:7
msgid "Run the following commands:"
msgstr "ລັນຄໍາສັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-container-full-disk.adoc:8
msgid "[command]``parted /dev/vdb``"
msgstr "[command]``parted /dev/vdb``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-container-full-disk.adoc:9
msgid "[literal]``(parted)`` [command]``print``"
msgstr "[literal]``(parted)`` [command]``print``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-container-full-disk.adoc:10
msgid ""
"[literal]``(parted)`` [command]``resizepart NUMBER 100%`` where "
"[literal]``NUMBER`` is the partition number shown by [command]``print`` "
"command (for example, [literal]``1`` if [literal]``/dev/vdb1``)"
msgstr "[literal]``(parted)`` [command]``resizepart NUMBER 100%`` ໂດຍທີ່ [literal]``NUMBER`` ແມ່ນໝາຍເລກພາທິຊັນທີ່ສະແດງໂດຍຄໍາສັ່ງ [command]``print``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-container-full-disk.adoc:11
msgid "[literal]``(parted)`` [command]``quit``"
msgstr "[literal]``(parted)`` [command]``quit``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-container-full-disk.adoc:12
msgid "Resize the filesystem.  For example, for an XFS filesystem, run the command:"
msgstr "ຂະຫຍາຍຂະໜາດ filesystem. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ສໍາລັບ XFS filesystem, ໃຫ້ລັນຄໍາສັ່ງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-container-full-disk.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "xfs_growfs /dev/vdb1\n"
msgstr "xfs_growfs /dev/vdb1\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-container-full-disk.adoc:14
msgid ""
"After completing the procedure, an XFS filesystem should be using all space "
"available on the disk."
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກສໍາເລັດຂັ້ນຕອນ, XFS filesystem ຄວນຈະສາມາດໃຊ້ພື້ນທີ່ທັງໝົດທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນດິດໄດ້."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-corruptrepo.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Corrupt Repositories"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາ Repository ເສຍຫາຍ"

#
#
#
#. PUT THIS COMMENT AT THE TOP OF TROUBLESHOOTING SECTIONS
#. Troubleshooting format:
#. One sentence each:
#. Cause: What created the problem?
#. Consequence: What does the user see when this happens?
#. Fix: What can the user do to fix this problem?
#. Result: What happens after the user has completed the fix?
#. If more detailed instructions are required, put them in a "Resolving" procedure:
#. .Procedure: Resolving Widget Wobbles
#. . First step
#. . Another step
#. . Last step
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-corruptrepo.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The information in the repository metadata files can become corrupt or out "
"of date.  This can create problems with updating clients.  You can fix this "
"by removing the files and regenerating it.  With an new repository data "
"file, updates should operate as expected."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນໃນໄຟລ໌ metadata ຂອງ repository ອາດຈະເສຍຫາຍ ຫຼື ເກົ່າເກີນໄປ. ສິ່ງນີ້ສາມາດສ້າງບັນຫາໃນການອັບເດດ client. ທ່ານສາມາດແກ້ໄຂໄດ້ໂດຍການລຶບໄຟລ໌ນັ້ນອອກ ແລະ ສ້າງໃໝ່."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-corruptrepo.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Resolving Corrupt Repository Data"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການແກ້ໄຂຂໍ້ມູນ Repository ທີ່ເສຍຫາຍ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-corruptrepo.adoc:4
msgid "Remove all files from [path]``/var/cache/rhn/repodata/<channel-label>``."
msgstr "ລຶບໄຟລ໌ທັງໝົດອອກຈາກ [path]``/var/cache/rhn/repodata/<ຊື່ແຊນເນລ>``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-corruptrepo.adoc:5
msgid ""
"If you do not know the channel label, you can find it in the {productname} "
"{webui}, by navigating to menu:Software[Channels > Channel Label]."
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານບໍ່ຮູ້ຊື່ແຊນເນລ (channel label), ທ່ານສາມາດພົບມັນໄດ້ໃນ {productname} {webui} ໂດຍໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Software[Channels > Channel Label]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-corruptrepo.adoc:6
msgid ""
"On the container host, from the command line, execute the following command "
"to regenerate the file in the container:"
msgstr "ໃນ container host, ໃຫ້ລັນຄໍາສັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ເພື່ອສ້າງໄຟລ໌ໃໝ່ໃນ container:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-corruptrepo.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgrctl exec -ti -- spacecmd softwarechannel_regenerateyumcache "
"<channel-label>\n"
msgstr "mgrctl exec -ti -- spacecmd softwarechannel_regenerateyumcache <ຊື່ແຊນເນລ>\n"

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-custom-channel.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Custom Channel with Conflicting Packages"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາ Custom Channel ທີ່ມີແພັກເກດຂັດແຍ່ງກັນ"

#
#
#
#. PUT THIS COMMENT AT THE TOP OF TROUBLESHOOTING SECTIONS
#. Troubleshooting format:
#. One sentence each:
#. Cause: What created the problem?
#. Consequence: What does the user see when this happens?
#. Fix: What can the user do to fix this problem?
#. Result: What happens after the user has completed the fix?
#. If more detailed instructions are required, put them in a "Resolving" procedure:
#. .Procedure: Resolving Widget Wobbles
#. . First step
#. . Another step
#. . Last step
#. Cause: Conflicting packages in custom channel
#. Consequence: Creating bootstrap repo can fail
#. Fix: Separate trees from each other
#. Result: Clean and functional boostrap repo will be created
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-custom-channel.adoc:2
msgid ""
"When setting up a custom channel with conflicting packages features such as "
"creating a bootstrap repository can result in undefined behavior and make "
"registering clients fail."
msgstr "ເມື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າ custom channel ທີ່ມີແພັກເກດຂັດແຍ່ງກັນ, ການເຮັດວຽກບາງຢ່າງເຊັ່ນການສ້າງ bootstrap repository ອາດຈະເຮັດວຽກຜິດພາດ ແລະ ເຮັດໃຫ້ການລົງທະບຽນ client ລົ້ມເຫຼວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-custom-channel.adoc:3
msgid ""
"For example, conflicting packages with higher version numbers could be "
"included into the bootstrap repository.  Such packages (for example, "
"[package]``python3-zmq`` or [package]``zeromq``) may corrupt the creation of "
"the bootstrap repository or cause issues during bootstrap of the client."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: ແພັກເກດທີ່ຂັດແຍ່ງກັນທີ່ມີເວີຊັນສູງກວ່າອາດຈະຖືກລວມເຂົ້າໃນ bootstrap repository. ແພັກເກດເຫຼົ່ານີ້ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ການສ້າງ bootstrap repository ເສຍຫາຍ ຫຼື ເກີດບັນຫາລະຫວ່າງການ bootstrap client."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-custom-channel.adoc:4
msgid ""
"When the custom channel (for example, an EPEL channel) is added below the "
"parent vendor channel, issues with conflicting packages cannot be solved "
"directly.  The way how to solve this is to separate the custom channel from "
"the vendor channel.  The custom channel needs to be created in a separate "
"tree.  In case that the custom channel needs to be delivered as a child, "
"such environment can be created using Content Lifecycle Management (CLM).  "
"Sources in a CLM project can be added there from different trees.  Using "
"such an approach, the custom channel stays below the parent within the built "
"environment.  However, the vendor channel tree stays without the custom "
"channel and the bootstrap repository.  Then registering clients works "
"correctly."
msgstr "ເມື່ອຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: ຊ່ອງທາງ EPEL) ຖືກເພີ່ມໄວ້ກ້ອງຊ່ອງທາງຜູ້ຜະລິດຫຼັກ (parent vendor channel), ບັນຫາເລື່ອງແພັກເກດຂັດແຍ້ງກັນຈະບໍ່ສາມາດແກ້ໄຂໄດ້ໂດຍກົງ. ວິທີແກ້ໄຂແມ່ນການແຍກຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ກຳນົດເອງອອກຈາກຊ່ອງທາງຜູ້ຜະລິດ. ຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ກຳນົດເອງຕ້ອງຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໃນໂຄງສ້າງຕົ້ນໄມ້ (tree) ທີ່ແຍກຕ່າງຫາກ. ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ກຳນົດເອງຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຖືກສົ່ງມອບເປັນຊ່ອງທາງຍ່ອຍ, ສະພາບແວດລ້ອມດັ່ງກ່າວສາມາດສ້າງຂຶ້ນໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ Content Lifecycle Management (CLM). ແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນໃນໂປຣເຈັກ CLM ສາມາດເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໄປຈາກຕົ້ນໄມ້ທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນໄດ້. ການໃຊ້ວິທີນີ້ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ກຳນົດເອງຍັງຄົງຢູ່ກ້ອງຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກພາຍໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນ. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ຕົ້ນໄມ້ຊ່ອງທາງຜູ້ຜະລິດຈະຍັງຄົງຢູ່ໂດຍບໍ່ມີຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ ແລະ ຄັງເກັບ bootstrap. ຈາກນັ້ນການລົງທະບຽນລູກຂ່າຍຈະເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-custom-channel.adoc:5
msgid ""
"When the custom channel with the conflicting packages (salt, zeromq, and so "
"on) is created as a child channel, following steps can help to avoid the "
"issue:"
msgstr "ເມື່ອ custom channel ທີ່ມີແພັກເກດຂັດແຍ່ງກັນຖືກສ້າງເປັນ child channel, ຂັ້ນຕອນຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ສາມາດຊ່ວຍຫຼີກເວັ້ນບັນຫາໄດ້:"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-custom-channel.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Avoiding Conflicting Packages in Custom Channels"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຫຼີກເວັ້ນແພັກເກດທີ່ຂັດແຍ່ງກັນໃນ Custom Channels"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-custom-channel.adoc:7
msgid ""
"Remove the custom channel as a child channel from parent channel.  For more "
"information, see "
"xref:administration:custom-channels.adoc#_manage_custom_channels[]."
msgstr "ຖອນ custom channel ອອກຈາກການເປັນ child channel ຂອງ parent channel."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-custom-channel.adoc:8
msgid ""
"Create the custom channel in a separate tree.  For more information, see "
"xref:administration:custom-channels.adoc#_creating_custom_channels_and_repositories[]."
msgstr "ສ້າງ custom channel ໃນ tree ທີ່ແຍກຕ່າງຫາກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-custom-channel.adoc:9
msgid ""
"To get the custom channel as a child channel within Content Lifecycle "
"Management (CLM):"
msgstr "ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ custom channel ເປັນ child channel ພາຍໃນ Content Lifecycle Management (CLM):"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-custom-channel.adoc:10
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Content Lifecycle[], and "
"click btn:[Create Project].  Enter [guimenu]``Name`` and [guimenu]``Label``."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Content Lifecycle[], ແລະ ຄລິກທີ່ [Create Project]. ປ້ອນ [guimenu]``Name`` ແລະ [guimenu]``Label``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-custom-channel.adoc:11
msgid ""
"Attach Source to the project.  Use the needed vendor channels and the custom "
"channel.  (sharing example using CentOS8)"
msgstr "ເພີ່ມ Source ເຂົ້າໃນໂປຣເຈັກ. ໃຊ້ vendor channels ທີ່ຈໍາເປັນ ແລະ custom channel."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-custom-channel.adoc:12
msgid "Add environment into the Project.  For example, use CentOS8."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ (environment) ເຂົ້າໃນໂປຣເຈັກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-custom-channel.adoc:13
msgid ""
"To build the environment click the btn:[Build] button.  This creates an "
"environment with vendor and custom channels that can be associated with an "
"activation key and used to bootstrap the client."
msgstr "ຄລິກທີ່ປຸ່ມ [Build] ເພື່ອສ້າງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-custom-channel.adoc:14
msgid ""
"Important note: In the CLM project, it is recommend to add a filter, which "
"excludes the problematic or conflicting packages.  Otherwise the conflicting "
"packages with higher version numbers would be installed during the update of "
"the client.  For more information about filtering, see "
"xref:administration:content-lifecycle-examples.adoc#exclude-higher-kernel-version[]."
msgstr "ໝາຍເຫດສໍາຄັນ: ໃນໂປຣເຈັກ CLM, ແນະນໍາໃຫ້ເພີ່ມຕົວຕອງ (filter) ເພື່ອຍົກເວັ້ນແພັກເກດທີ່ມີບັນຫາ ຫຼື ຂັດແຍ່ງກັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-custom-channel.adoc:15
msgid ""
"To get the latest patches into the CLM environment (with vendor and custom "
"channel), click the btn:[Build] button in the project.  This is needed to "
"re-built the environment."
msgstr "ເພື່ອຮັບແພັດຊ໌ຫຼ້າສຸດເຂົ້າໃນ CLM environment, ໃຫ້ຄລິກທີ່ປຸ່ມ [Build] ໃນໂປຣເຈັກເພື່ອສ້າງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມໃໝ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-custom-channel.adoc:16
msgid ""
"For more information about CLM, see "
"xref:administration:content-lifecycle.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສໍາລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ CLM, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:administration:content-lifecycle.adoc[]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-custom-channel.adoc:17
msgid ""
"Using the Extra Packages for Enterprise Linux (EPEL) directly on {rhel} "
"clients (or compatible: {sll}, {centos}, {oracle}, etc.) will install the "
"{salt} packages from EPEL, which miss some features available in the "
"{productname}-provided {salt} packages.  This is especially important "
"because it will result in a bootstrap repository containing the non-SUSE "
"{salt} packages.  Therefore, this is an unsupported scenario."
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ EPEL ໂດຍກົງໃນ client ອາດຈະຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດ {salt} ຈາກ EPEL ເຊິ່ງຂາດບາງຟີເຈີທີ່ມີໃນ {productname}. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ bootstrap repository ມີແພັກເກດ {salt} ທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນຂອງ SUSE, ເຊິ່ງເປັນຮູບແບບທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບການສະໜັບສະໜູນ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-custom-channel.adoc:18
msgid ""
"If you need to enable the EPEL repository, make sure you filter out the "
"{salt} packages from EPEL in advance (for example, by removing the {salt} "
"packages in menu:Software[Manage > Channels > EPEL > Packages]."
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານຈໍາເປັນຕ້ອງເປີດໃຊ້ EPEL repository, ໃຫ້ໝັ້ນໃຈວ່າທ່ານໄດ້ຕອງແພັກເກດ {salt} ຈາກ EPEL ອອກກ່ອນລ່ວງໜ້າ."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-delclients.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Registering Deleted Clients"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາການລົງທະບຽນ Client ທີ່ຖືກລຶບໄປແລ້ວ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-delclients.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Sometimes a new registration of a deleted (unregistered) client might not be "
"possible.  To solve this issue, some Salt cache files should be deleted on "
"the {productname} Server (Salt master) before trying to re-register again:"
msgstr "ບາງຄັ້ງການລົງທະບຽນໃໝ່ຂອງ client ທີ່ຖືກລຶບໄປແລ້ວອາດຈະເຮັດບໍ່ໄດ້. ເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂບັນຫານີ້, ຄວນລຶບໄຟລ໌ Salt cache ບາງອັນໃນ {productname} Server (Salt master) ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະລອງລົງທະບຽນໃໝ່:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-delclients.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"rm /var/cache/salt/master/thin/version\n"
"rm /var/cache/salt/master/thin/thin.tgz\n"
msgstr ""
"rm /var/cache/salt/master/thin/version\n"
"rm /var/cache/salt/master/thin/thin.tgz\n"

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-disabling-fqdns-grain.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Disabling the FQDNS grain"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາໂດຍການປິດ FQDNS grain"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-disabling-fqdns-grain.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The FQDNS grain returns the list of all the fully qualified DNS services in "
"the system.  Collecting this information is usually a fast process, but if "
"the DNS settings have been misconfigured, it could take a much longer time.  "
"In some cases, the client could become unresponsive, or crash."
msgstr "FQDNS grain ຈະສົ່ງຄືນລາຍຊື່ DNS services ທັງໝົດໃນລະບົບ. ຫາກການຕັ້ງຄ່າ DNS ຜິດພາດ, ມັນອາດຈະໃຊ້ເວລາດົນຫຼາຍ ແລະ ເຮັດໃຫ້ client ບໍ່ຕອບສະໜອງ ຫຼື ຄ້າງໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-disabling-fqdns-grain.adoc:3
msgid ""
"To prevent this problem, you can disable the FQDNS grain with a Salt flag.  "
"If you disable the grain, you can use a network module to provide FQDNS "
"services, without the risk of the client becoming unresponsive."
msgstr "ເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນບັນຫານີ້, ທ່ານສາມາດປິດ FQDNS grain ດ້ວຍ Salt flag. ຫາກທ່ານປິດມັນ, ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ network module ເພື່ອໃຫ້ບໍລິການ FQDNS ແທນ ໂດຍບໍ່ມີຄວາມສ່ຽງທີ່ client ຈະຄ້າງ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-disabling-fqdns-grain.adoc:4
msgid ""
"This only applies to older Salt clients.  If you registered your Salt client "
"recently, the FQDNS grain is disabled by default."
msgstr "ສິ່ງນີ້ໃຊ້ກັບ Salt clients ເວີຊັນເກົ່າເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ຫາກທ່ານຫາລົງທະບຽນ Salt client ເມື່ອບໍ່ດົນມານີ້, FQDNS grain ຈະຖືກປິດໄວ້ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-disabling-fqdns-grain.adoc:5
msgid ""
"On the {productname} Server, at the command prompt, use this command to "
"disable the FQDNS grain:"
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} Server, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄໍາສັ່ງນີ້ເພື່ອປິດ FQDNS grain:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-disabling-fqdns-grain.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt '*' state.sls util.mgr_disable_fqdns_grain\n"
msgstr "salt '*' state.sls util.mgr_disable_fqdns_grain\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-disabling-fqdns-grain.adoc:7
msgid ""
"This command restarts each client and generate Salt events that the server "
"needs to process.  If you have a large number of clients, you can execute "
"the command in batch mode instead:"
msgstr "ຄໍາສັ່ງນີ້ຈະຣີສະຕາດ client ແຕ່ລະເຄື່ອງ. ຫາກທ່ານມີ client ຈໍານວນຫຼາຍ, ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ batch mode ແທນໄດ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-disabling-fqdns-grain.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt --batch-size 50 '*' state.sls util.mgr_disable_fqdns_grain\n"
msgstr "salt --batch-size 50 '*' state.sls util.mgr_disable_fqdns_grain\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-disabling-fqdns-grain.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Wait for the batch command to finish executing.  Do not interrupt the "
"process with kbd:[Ctrl+C]."
msgstr "ລໍຖ້າໃຫ້ຄໍາສັ່ງ batch ເຮັດວຽກໃຫ້ສໍາເລັດ. ຢ່າຂັດຈັງຫວະຂະບວນການດ້ວຍ [Ctrl+C]."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-diskspace.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Disk Space"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາເນື້ອທີ່ວ່າງໃນດິດ"

#
#
#
#. PUT THIS COMMENT AT THE TOP OF TROUBLESHOOTING SECTIONS
#. Troubleshooting format:
#. One sentence each:
#. Cause: What created the problem?
#. Consequence: What does the user see when this happens?
#. Fix: What can the user do to fix this problem?
#. Result: What happens after the user has completed the fix?
#. If more detailed instructions are required, put them in a "Resolving" procedure:
#. .Procedure: Resolving Widget Wobbles
#. . First step
#. . Another step
#. . Last step
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-diskspace.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Running out of disk space can have a severe impact on the {productname} "
"database and file structure which, in most cases, is not recoverable.  "
"{productname} monitors free space in specific directories, and has "
"configurable alerts.  For more on space management, see "
"xref:administration:space-management.adoc[]."
msgstr "ການທີ່ເນື້ອທີ່ວ່າງໃນດິດໝົດ ສາມາດສົ່ງຜົນກະທົບຢ່າງຮ້າຍແຮງຕໍ່ຖານຂໍ້ມູນ ແລະ ໂຄງສ້າງໄຟລ໌ຂອງ {productname} ເຊິ່ງໃນຫຼາຍໆກໍລະນີ ແມ່ນບໍ່ສາມາດກູ້ຄືນໄດ້. {productname} ຈະຕິດຕາມເນື້ອທີ່ວ່າງໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີສະເພາະຕ່າງໆ ແລະ ມີການແຈ້ງເຕືອນທີ່ສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າໄດ້. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການຈັດການເນື້ອທີ່, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:administration:space-management.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-diskspace.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Generally, container volumes share space with the host filesystem.  When the "
"[systemitem]``btrfs`` filesystem becomes full, it can prevent you from "
"deleting files.  To resolve this, you can add a small amount of storage "
"temporarily to the filesystem using the [command]``btrfs device add`` "
"command.  This will allow you to delete files to gain space for further "
"filesystem maintenance.  When done with the maintenance, you can remove the "
"temporary storage with [command]``btrfs device delete``.  For more "
"information about this topic, see "
"https://www.suse.com/support/kb/doc/?id=000018779."
msgstr "ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວ, ວໍລຸມຂອງຄອນເທນເນີຈະໃຊ້ເນື້ອທີ່ຮ່ວມກັບລະບົບໄຟລ໌ຂອງໂຮສ. ເມື່ອລະບົບໄຟລ໌ [systemitem]``btrfs`` ເຕັມ, ມັນອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ທ່ານບໍ່ສາມາດລຶບໄຟລ໌ໄດ້. ເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂບັນຫານີ້, ທ່ານສາມາດເພີ່ມພື້ນທີ່ຈັດເກັບຂໍ້ມູນຈຳນວນເລັກນ້ອຍ ຊົ່ວຄາວເຂົ້າໃນລະບົບໄຟລ໌ໂດຍໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``btrfs device add``. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດລຶບໄຟລ໌ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ເນື້ອທີ່ຄືນມາສຳລັບການບຳລຸງຮັກສາລະບົບໄຟລ໌ຕໍ່ໄປ. ເມື່ອສຳເລັດການບຳລຸງຮັກສາແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດຖອນການຕິດຕັ້ງ ພື້ນທີ່ຈັດເກັບຊົ່ວຄາວໄດ້ດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``btrfs device delete``. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບເລື່ອງນີ້, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ https://www.suse.com/support/kb/doc/?id=000018779."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-diskspace.adoc:4
msgid "You can recover disk space by removing unused software channels."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດກູ້ຄືນເນື້ອທີ່ດິດໄດ້ໂດຍການລຶບຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວ (software channels) ທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້ງານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-diskspace.adoc:5
msgid ""
"For instructions on how to delete vendor channels, see "
"xref:administration:channel-management.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຄຳແນະນຳກ່ຽວກັບວິທີການລຶບຊ່ອງທາງຂອງຜູ້ຜະລິດ (vendor channels), ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:administration:channel-management.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-diskspace.adoc:6
msgid ""
"For instructions on how to delete custom channels, see "
"xref:administration:custom-channels.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຄຳແນະນຳກ່ຽວກັບວິທີການລຶບຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ (custom channels), ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:administration:custom-channels.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-diskspace.adoc:7
msgid ""
"You can also check how often your custom channels are synchronized.  For "
"instructions on how deal with custom channel synchronization, see "
"xref:administration:custom-channels.adoc#_custom_channel_synchronization[]."
msgstr "ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດກວດສອບເບິ່ງວ່າຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ກຳນົດເອງຂອງທ່ານມີການຊິງໂຄຣໄນ (synchronize) ເລື້ອຍປານໃດ. ສຳລັບຄຳແນະນຳກ່ຽວກັບວິທີການຈັດການກັບການຊິງໂຄຣໄນຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:administration:custom-channels.adoc#_custom_channel_synchronization[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-diskspace.adoc:8
msgid ""
"You can also recover disk space by cleaning up unused activation keys, "
"content lifecycle projects, and client registrations.  You can also remove "
"redundant database entries:"
msgstr "ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດກູ້ຄືນເນື້ອທີ່ດິດໄດ້ໂດຍການລຶບຄີເປີດໃຊ້ງານ (activation keys) ທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້, ໂຄງການວົງຈອນເນື້ອຫາ (content lifecycle projects), ແລະ ການລົງທະບຽນຂອງໄຄລເອັນ (client registrations). ນອກຈາກນັ້ນທ່ານຍັງສາມາດລຶບລາຍການຖານຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຊ້ຳຊ້ອນໄດ້:"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-diskspace.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Resolving Redundant Database Entries"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການແກ້ໄຂລາຍການຖານຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຊ້ຳຊ້ອນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-diskspace.adoc:10
msgid ""
"Use the [command]``spacewalk-data-fsck`` command to list any redundant "
"database entries."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``spacewalk-data-fsck`` ເພື່ອສະແດງລາຍຊື່ຖານຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຊ້ຳຊ້ອນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-diskspace.adoc:11
msgid "Use the [command]``spacewalk-data-fsck --remove`` command to delete them."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``spacewalk-data-fsck --remove`` ເພື່ອລຶບລາຍການເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-firewalls.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Firewalls"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາໄຟວໍ"

#
#
#
#
#
#
#
#
#. PUT THIS COMMENT AT THE TOP OF TROUBLESHOOTING SECTIONS
#. Troubleshooting format:
#. One sentence each:
#. Cause: What created the problem?
#. Consequence: What does the user see when this happens?
#. Fix: What can the user do to fix this problem?
#. Result: What happens after the user has completed the fix?
#. If more detailed instructions are required, put them in a "Resolving" procedure:
#. .Procedure: Resolving Widget Wobbles
#. . First step
#. . Another step
#. . Last step
#. Cause: User firewall is set to block outgoing traffic by dropping the packet request. During sync with {scc}, SUMA waits for an answer on each URL until it times out, eventually causing the entire refresh of the product list to timeout. Applies only to third party (non-SUSE) products, as sync with {scc} needs to access locations other than {scc} to verify if the if the download location is valid.
#. Consequence: The sync to {scc} fails, and the third party products are not shown in the product list.
#. Fix: Configure the firewall to reject requests from SUMA instead of drop (preferred), or configure a firewall on the server (if no ability to change firewall settings)
#. Result: Sync to {scc} is either able to reach the URLs required, or rejects the request so that the request fails rather than times out.
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-firewalls.adoc:2
msgid ""
"If you are using a firewall that blocks outgoing traffic, it can either "
"``REJECT`` or ``DROP`` network requests.  If it is set to ``DROP`` then you "
"might find that synchronizing with the {scclongform} times out."
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານກຳລັງໃຊ້ໄຟວໍທີ່ປິດກັ້ນການຮັບສົ່ງຂໍ້ມູນຂາອອກ, ມັນອາດຈະເຮັດການ ``REJECT`` ຫຼື ``DROP`` ການຮ້ອງຂໍຜ່ານເຄືອຂ່າຍ. ຫາກມັນຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າເປັນ ``DROP`` ທ່ານອາດຈະພົບວ່າການຊິງໂຄຣໄນກັບ {scclongform} ເກີດການໝົດເວລາ (timeout)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-firewalls.adoc:3
msgid ""
"This occurs because the synchronization process needs to access third-party "
"repositories that provide packages for non-{suse} clients, and not just the "
"{scclongform}.  When the {productname} Server attempts to reach these "
"repositories to check that they are valid, the firewall drops the requests, "
"and the synchronization continues to wait for the response until it times "
"out."
msgstr "ສິ່ງນີ້ເກີດຂຶ້ນເນື່ອງຈາກຂະບວນການຊິງໂຄຣໄນຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເຂົ້າເຖິງບ່ອນເກັບຊອບແວ (repositories) ຂອງພາກສ່ວນທີສາມ ທີ່ໃຫ້ບໍລິການແພັກເກັດສຳລັບໄຄລເອັນທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນ {suse}, ແລະ ບໍ່ແມ່ນພຽງແຕ່ {scclongform} ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ເມື່ອເຊີເວີ {productname} ພະຍາຍາມເຂົ້າເຖິງບ່ອນເກັບເຫຼົ່ານີ້ເພື່ອຊວດສອບຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງ, ໄຟວໍຈະ drop ການຮ້ອງຂໍ, ແລະ ການຊິງໂຄຣໄນຈະລໍຖ້າການຕອບກັບຈົນກວ່າຈະໝົດເວລາ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-firewalls.adoc:4
msgid ""
"If this occurs, the synchronization takes a long time before it fails, and "
"your non-{suse} products are not shown in the product list."
msgstr "ຫາກສິ່ງນີ້ເກີດຂຶ້ນ, ການຊິງໂຄຣໄນຈະໃຊ້ເວລາດົນກ່ອນທີ່ຈະລົ້ມເຫຼວ, ແລະ ຜະລິດຕະພັນທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນ {suse} ຂອງທ່ານຈະບໍ່ສະແດງຢູ່ໃນລາຍຊື່ຜະລິດຕະພັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-firewalls.adoc:5
msgid "You can fix this problem in several different ways."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດແກ້ໄຂບັນຫານີ້ໄດ້ຫຼາຍວິທີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-firewalls.adoc:6
msgid ""
"The simplest method is to configure your firewall to allow access to the "
"URLs required by non-{suse} repositories.  This allows the synchronization "
"process to reach the URLs and complete successfully."
msgstr "ວິທີທີ່ງ່າຍທີ່ສຸດແມ່ນການຕັ້ງຄ່າໄຟວໍຂອງທ່ານໃຫ້ອະນຸຍາດເຂົ້າເຖິງ URL ທີ່ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບບ່ອນເກັບຊອບແວທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນ {suse}. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ຂະບວນການຊິງໂຄຣໄນເຂົ້າເຖິງ URL ແລະ ສຳເລັດໄດ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-firewalls.adoc:7
msgid ""
"If allowing external traffic is not possible, configure your firewall to "
"``REJECT`` requests from {productname} instead of ``DROP``.  This rejects "
"requests to third-party URLs, so that the synchronization fails early rather "
"than times out, and the products are not shown in the list."
msgstr "ຫາກບໍ່ສາມາດອະນຸຍາດການຮັບສົ່ງຂໍ້ມູນພາຍນອກໄດ້, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າໄຟວໍຂອງທ່ານເປັນ ``REJECT`` ການຮ້ອງຂໍຈາກ {productname} ແທນການ ``DROP``. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະປະຕິເສດການຮ້ອງຂໍໄປຍັງ URL ຂອງພາກສ່ວນທີສາມ, ເຮັດໃຫ້ການຊິງໂຄຣໄນລົ້ມເຫຼວໃນທັນທີແທນທີ່ຈະລໍຖ້າຈົນໝົດເວລາ, ແລະ ຜະລິດຕະພັນຈະບໍ່ສະແດງໃນລາຍຊື່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-firewalls.adoc:8
msgid ""
"If you do not have configuration access to the firewall, you can consider "
"setting up a separate firewall on the {productname} Server instead."
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານບໍ່ມີສິດເຂົ້າເຖິງການຕັ້ງຄ່າໄຟວໍ, ທ່ານອາດຈະພິຈາລະນາຕິດຕັ້ງໄຟວໍແຍກຕ່າງຫາກຢູ່ໃນເຊີເວີ {productname} ແທນ."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Troubleshooting high sync times between {productname} Server and Proxy over "
"WAN connections"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາການໃຊ້ເວລາຊິງໂຄຣໄນດົນ ລະຫວ່າງເຊີເວີ {productname} ແລະ ພຣັອກຊີ (Proxy) ຜ່ານການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ WAN"

#
#
#
#
#. PUT THIS COMMENT AT THE TOP OF TROUBLESHOOTING SECTIONS
#. Troubleshooting format:
#. One sentence each:
#. Cause: What created the problem?
#. Consequence: What does the user see when this happens?
#. Fix: What can the user do to fix this problem?
#. Result: What happens after the user has completed the fix?
#. If more detailed instructions are required, put them in a "Resolving" procedure.
#. .Procedure: Resolving Widget Wobbles
#. . First step
#. . Another step
#. . Last step
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Depending on what changes are executed in the WebUI or via an API call to "
"distribution or system settings, [command]``cobbler sync`` command may be "
"required to transfer files from {productname} Server to {productname} Proxy "
"systems.  To accomplish this, {cobbler} uses a list of proxies specified in "
"[literal]``/etc/cobbler/settings``."
msgstr "ຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບການປ່ຽນແປງທີ່ດຳເນີນການໃນ WebUI ຫຼື ຜ່ານການເອີ້ນ API ໄປຍັງການຕັ້ງຄ່າລະບົບ ຫຼື ການແຈກຈ່າຍ, ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``cobbler sync`` ອາດຈະຈຳເປັນເພື່ອໂອນຍ້າຍໄຟລ໌ຈາກເຊີເວີ {productname} ໄປຍັງ ລະບົບ {productname} Proxy. ເພື່ອເຮັດສິ່ງນີ້, {cobbler} ຈະໃຊ້ລາຍຊື່ພຣັອກຊີທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ໃນ [literal]``/etc/cobbler/settings``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Due to its design, [command]``cobbler sync`` is not able to sync only the "
"changed or recently added files."
msgstr "ເນື່ອງຈາກການອອກແບບຂອງມັນ, [command]``cobbler sync`` ບໍ່ສາມາດຊິງໂຄຣໄນສະເພາະໄຟລ໌ທີ່ປ່ຽນແປງ ຫຼື ໄຟລ໌ທີ່ເພີ່ມເຂົ້າມາໃໝ່ໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Instead, executing [command]``cobbler sync`` triggers a full sync of the "
"[literal]``/srv/tftpboot`` directory to all specified proxies configured in "
"[literal]``/etc/cobbler/settings``.  It is also influenced by the latency of "
"the WAN connection between the involved systems."
msgstr "ແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນແນວນັ້ນ, ການລັນຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``cobbler sync`` ຈະເປັນການກະຕຸ້ນການຊິງໂຄຣໄນແບບເຕັມຮູບແບບ ຂອງໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ [literal]``/srv/tftpboot`` ໄປຍັງພຣັອກຊີທັງໝົດທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ໃນ [literal]``/etc/cobbler/settings``. ນອກຈາກນີ້ ມັນຍັງໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບຈາກຄວາມຊັກຊ້າ (latency) ຂອງການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ WAN ລະຫວ່າງລະບົບທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:5
msgid ""
"The process of syncing may take a considerable amount of time to finish "
"according to the logs in [literal]``/var/log/cobbler/``."
msgstr "ຂະບວນການຊິງໂຄຣໄນອາດຈະໃຊ້ເວລາຂ້ອນຂ້າງດົນຈົນກວ່າຈະສຳເລັດ ໂດຍອີງຕາມລັອກ (logs) ໃນ [literal]``/var/log/cobbler/``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:6
msgid "For example, it started at:"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ, ມັນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນເມື່ອ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Thu Jun  3 14:47:35 2021 - DEBUG | running python triggers from "
"/var/lib/cobbler/triggers/task/sync/pre/*\n"
"Thu Jun  3 14:47:35 2021 - DEBUG | running shell triggers from "
"/var/lib/cobbler/triggers/task/sync/pre/*\n"
msgstr ""
"Thu Jun  3 14:47:35 2021 - DEBUG | running python triggers from /var/lib/cobbler/triggers/task/sync/pre/*\n"
"Thu Jun  3 14:47:35 2021 - DEBUG | running shell triggers from /var/lib/cobbler/triggers/task/sync/pre/*\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:8
msgid "and ended at:"
msgstr "ແລະ ສິ້ນສຸດເມື່ອ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Thu Jun  3 15:18:49 2021 - DEBUG | running shell triggers from "
"/var/lib/cobbler/triggers/task/sync/post/*\n"
"Thu Jun  3 15:18:49 2021 - DEBUG | shell triggers finished successfully\n"
msgstr ""
"Thu Jun  3 15:18:49 2021 - DEBUG | running shell triggers from /var/lib/cobbler/triggers/task/sync/post/*\n"
"Thu Jun  3 15:18:49 2021 - DEBUG | shell triggers finished successfully\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:10
msgid ""
"The transfer amount was roughly 1.8 GB.  The transfer took almost 30 "
"minutes."
msgstr "ປະລິມານການໂອນຍ້າຍແມ່ນປະມານ 1.8 GB. ການໂອນຍ້າຍໃຊ້ເວລາເກືອບ 30 ນາທີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:11
msgid ""
"By comparison, copying a single big file of the same size as "
"[literal]``/srv/tftboot`` completes within several minutes."
msgstr "ເມື່ອປຽບທຽບແລ້ວ, ການກັອບປີ້ໄຟລ໌ໃຫຍ່ໄຟລ໌ດຽວທີ່ມີຂະໜາດເທົ່າກັບ [literal]``/srv/tftboot`` ຈະສຳເລັດພາຍໃນເວລາບໍ່ເທົ່າໃດນາທີ."

#. == Resolution and analysis
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:12
msgid ""
"Switching to an [literal]``rsync``-based approach to copy files between "
"{productname} Server and Proxy may help to reduce the transfer and wait "
"times."
msgstr "ການປ່ຽນໄປໃຊ້ວິທີການທີ່ອີງໃສ່ [literal]``rsync`` ເພື່ອກັອບປີ້ໄຟລ໌ລະຫວ່າງເຊີເວີ {productname} ແລະ ພຣັອກຊີ ອາດຈະຊ່ວຍຫຼຸດເວລາການໂອນຍ້າຍ ແລະ ເວລາລໍຖ້າລົງໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:13
msgid ""
"A script to accomplish this task is available for download at "
"https://suse.my.salesforce.com/sfc/p/1i000000gLOd/a/1i000000ll5B/B2AmvIJN2_JsAyjTQzCVP_x5ioVgd0bYN9X9NpMugS8."
msgstr "ສະຄຣິບ (script) ເພື່ອເຮັດວຽກນີ້ແມ່ນມີໃຫ້ດາວໂຫຼດຢູ່ທີ່ https://suse.my.salesforce.com/sfc/p/1i000000gLOd/a/1i000000ll5B/B2AmvIJN2_JsAyjTQzCVP_x5ioVgd0bYN9X9NpMugS8."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:14
msgid ""
"The script does not accept command line options.  Before running the script, "
"you need to manually edit it and set correctly [literal]``SUMAHOSTNAME``, "
"[literal]``SUMAIP`` and [literal]``SUMAPROXY1`` variables for it to work "
"correctly."
msgstr "ສະຄຣິບນີ້ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບໂຕເລືອກຄອມມານໄລ. ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະລັນສະຄຣິບ, ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງແກ້ໄຂມັນດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າໂຕແປ [literal]``SUMAHOSTNAME``, [literal]``SUMAIP`` ແລະ [literal]``SUMAPROXY1`` ໃຫ້ຖືກຕ້ອງເພື່ອໃຫ້ມັນເຮັດວຽກໄດ້."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:15
msgid ""
"There is no support available for individual adjustments of the script.  The "
"script and the comments inside aim to provide an overview of the process and "
"steps to be taken into consideration.  If further help is required, contact "
"SUSE Consulting."
msgstr "ບໍ່ມີການຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອສຳລັບການປັບແຕ່ງສະຄຣິບເປັນລາຍບຸກຄົນ. ສະຄຣິບ ແລະ ຄຳອະທິບາຍພາຍໃນມີຈຸດປະສົງເພື່ອໃຫ້ ພາບລວມຂອງຂະບວນການ ແລະ ຂັ້ນຕອນທີ່ຄວນພິຈາລະນາ. ຫາກຕ້ອງການຄວາມຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ໃຫ້ຕິດຕໍ່ SUSE Consulting."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:16
msgid ""
"The proposed approach using the script is beneficial in the following "
"environment:"
msgstr "ວິທີການທີ່ນຳສະເໜີໂດຍການໃຊ້ສະຄຣິບນີ້ ແມ່ນມີປະໂຫຍດໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:17
msgid "{productname} Proxy systems are connected via a WAN connection;"
msgstr "ລະບົບ {productname} Proxy ທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຜ່ານການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ WAN;"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:18
msgid ""
"[literal]``/srv/tftboot`` contains a high number of files for distributions "
"and client PXE boot files, in total several thousand files;"
msgstr "[literal]``/srv/tftboot`` ມີໄຟລ໌ຈຳນວນຫຼາຍສຳລັບການແຈກຈ່າຍ ແລະ ໄຟລ໌ PXE boot ຂອງໄຄລເອັນ, ເຊິ່ງລວມທັງໝົດມີຫຼາຍພັນໄຟລ໌;"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:19
msgid ""
"Any proxy in [literal]``/etc/cobbler/settings`` has been disabled, otherwise "
"{productname} will continue to sync content to the proxies."
msgstr "ພຣັອກຊີໃດໆໃນ [literal]``/etc/cobbler/settings`` ຕ້ອງໄດ້ຖືກປິດການໃຊ້ງານ, ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ {productname} ຈະຍັງຄົງຊິງໂຄຣໄນເນື້ອຫາໄປຍັງພຣັອກຊີເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນຕໍ່ໄປ."

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"#proxies:\n"
"# - \"sumaproxy.sumaproxy.test\"\n"
"# - \"sumaproxy2.sumaproxy.test\"\n"
msgstr ""
"#proxies:\n"
"# - \"sumaproxy.sumaproxy.test\"\n"
"# - \"sumaproxy2.sumaproxy.test\"\n"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Analyzing New Sync Speed"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການວິເຄາະຄວາມໄວຂອງການຊິງໂຄຣໄນໃໝ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:22
msgid ""
"Take a dump of the TCP traffic between {productname} and the involved "
"systems."
msgstr "ເຮັດການດັກຈັບຂໍ້ມູນ (dump) ຂອງ TCP traffic ລະຫວ່າງ {productname} ແລະ ລະບົບທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:23
msgid "On {productname} Server:"
msgstr "ໃນເຊີເວີ {productname}:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "tcpdump -i ethX -s 200 host <ip-address-of-susemanagerproxy> and not ssh\n"
msgstr "tcpdump -i ethX -s 200 host <ip-address-of-susemanagerproxy> and not ssh\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:25
msgid "On {productname} Proxy:"
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} Proxy:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid "tcpdump -i ethX -s 200 host <ip-address-of-susemanager> and not ssh\n"
msgstr "tcpdump -i ethX -s 200 host <ip-address-of-susemanager> and not ssh\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:27
msgid ""
"This will only capture a package size of 200 which is sufficient to run an "
"analysis."
msgstr "ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະດັກຈັບແພັກເກັດຂະໜາດ 200 ເທົ່ານັ້ນ ເຊິ່ງພຽງພໍສຳລັບການວິເຄາະ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:28
msgid ""
"Adjust ethX to the respective network interface {productname} uses to "
"communicate with the proxy."
msgstr "ປັບ ethX ໃຫ້ເປັນ network interface ທີ່ {productname} ໃຊ້ເພື່ອສື່ສານກັບພຣັອກຊີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:29
msgid ""
"At last, ssh communication will not be captured to reduce the number of "
"packages even further."
msgstr "ສຸດທ້າຍ, ການສື່ສານຜ່ານ ssh ຈະບໍ່ຖືກດັກຈັບ ເພື່ອຫຼຸດຜ່ອນຈຳນວນແພັກເກັດໃຫ້ໜ້ອຍລົງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:30
msgid "Start a [command]``cobbler sync``."
msgstr "ເລີ່ມການລັນ [command]``cobbler sync``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:31
msgid ""
"To force a sync, delete the {cobbler} json cache file first and then issue "
"[command]``cobbler sync``:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອບັງຄັບໃຫ້ມີການຊິງໂຄຣໄນ, ໃຫ້ລຶບໄຟລ໌ json cache ຂອງ {cobbler} ກ່ອນ ແລ້ວຈຶ່ງລັນ [command]``cobbler sync``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:32
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"rm /var/lib/cobbler/pxe_cache.json\n"
"cobbler sync\n"
msgstr ""
"rm /var/lib/cobbler/pxe_cache.json\n"
"cobbler sync\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:33
msgid "When {command]``cobbler sync`` is finished, stop the TCPdumps."
msgstr "ເມື່ອ {command]``cobbler sync`` ສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ຢຸດການດັກຈັບ TCPdumps."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:34
msgid ""
"Open the TCPdumps using Wireshark, go to [guimenu]``Statistics > "
"Conversations`` and wait for the dump to be analyzed."
msgstr "ເປີດ TCPdumps ໂດຍໃຊ້ Wireshark, ໄປທີ່ [guimenu]``Statistics > Conversations`` ແລ້ວລໍຖ້າໃຫ້ການວິເຄາະຂໍ້ມູນສຳເລັດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:35
msgid ""
"Switch to the TCP tab.  The number shown on this tab gives the total number "
"of conversations captured between {productname} Server and {productname} "
"Proxy."
msgstr "ປ່ຽນໄປທີ່ແທັບ TCP. ຕົວເລກທີ່ສະແດງໃນແທັບນີ້ຄືຈຳນວນທັງໝົດຂອງການສົນທະນາ (conversations) ທີ່ດັກຈັບໄດ້ລະຫວ່າງເຊີເວີ {productname} ແລະ {productname} Proxy."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:36
msgid "Look for the column [guimenu]``Duration``."
msgstr "ເບິ່ງທີ່ຖັນ [guimenu]``Duration``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:37
msgid ""
"Start by sorting in ascending order to find out the minimal amount of time "
"it took to transfer a file."
msgstr "ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໂດຍການລຽງລຳດັບຈາກໜ້ອຍໄປຫາຫຼາຍ ເພື່ອເບິ່ງເວລາທີ່ໜ້ອຍທີ່ສຸດທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນການໂອນຍ້າຍໄຟລ໌."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:38
msgid ""
"Continue by sorting in descending order to find out the maximum values for "
"the big files, for example kernel and initrd transfers."
msgstr "ຈາກນັ້ນລຽງລຳດັບຈາກຫຼາຍໄປຫາໜ້ອຍ ເພື່ອເບິ່ງຄ່າສູງສຸດສຳລັບໄຟລ໌ຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່, ຕົວຢ່າງເຊັ່ນການໂອນຍ້າຍ kernel ແລະ initrd."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:39
msgid "Ignore ports 4505 and 4506 as these are used for Salt communication."
msgstr "ບໍ່ຕ້ອງສົນໃຈພອດ 4505 ແລະ 4506 ເພາະພອດເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການສື່ສານຂອງ Salt."

#. === Conclusion 
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:40
msgid ""
"Analysis of the TCPdumps showed the transfer of small files with a size of "
"approx. 1800 bytes from {productname} Server to Proxy took around 0.3 "
"seconds."
msgstr "ການວິເຄາະ TCPdumps ສະແດງໃຫ້ເຫັນວ່າການໂອນຍ້າຍໄຟລ໌ຂະໜາດນ້ອຍທີ່ມີຂະໜາດປະມານ 1800 bytes ຈາກເຊີເວີ {productname} ໄປຍັງ Proxy ໃຊ້ເວລາປະມານ 0.3 ວິນາທີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:41
msgid ""
"While there were not many big files, the high number of smaller files "
"resulted high number of established connections as new TCP connection is "
"created for every single transferred file."
msgstr "ເຖິງວ່າຈະບໍ່ມີໄຟລ໌ຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ຫຼາຍ, ແຕ່ຈຳນວນໄຟລ໌ຂະໜາດນ້ອຍທີ່ມີຫຼາຍ ເຮັດໃຫ້ມີການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ ທີ່ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນເປັນຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ ເນື່ອງຈາກການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ TCP ໃໝ່ຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນສຳລັບທຸກໆໄຟລ໌ທີ່ໂອນຍ້າຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:42
msgid ""
"Therefore, knowing the minimal amount of transfer time and a number of "
"connections needed (approx. 5000 in the example), gives an approximate "
"estimated time for the overall transfer time: 5000 * 0.3 / 60 = 25 minutes."
msgstr "ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ເມື່ອຮູ້ເວລາການໂອນຍ້າຍທີ່ໜ້ອຍທີ່ສຸດ ແລະ ຈຳນວນການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ທີ່ຈຳເປັນ (ປະມານ 5000 ໃນຕົວຢ່າງ), ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ສາມາດຄາດຄະເນເວລາທັງໝົດໄດ້ປະມານ: 5000 * 0.3 / 60 = 25 ນາທີ."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Renaming {productname} Server"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາການປ່ຽນຊື່ເຊີເວີ {productname}"

#
#
#
#
#. PUT THIS COMMENT AT THE TOP OF TROUBLESHOOTING SECTIONS
#. Troubleshooting format:
#. One sentence each:
#. Cause: What created the problem?
#. Consequence: What does the user see when this happens?
#. Fix: What can the user do to fix this problem?
#. Result: What happens after the user has completed the fix?
#. If more detailed instructions are required, put them in a "Resolving" procedure:
#. .Procedure: Resolving Widget Wobbles
#. . First step
#. . Another step
#. . Last step
#. Showing my working. --LKB 2020-06-22
#. Cause: Renaming the hostname
#. Consequence: Changes not picked up by db, clients and proxies
#. Fix: Use the [command]``spacewalk-hostname-rename`` script to update the settings in the PostgreSQL database and the internal structures of {productname}.
#. Result: Renaming is successfully propagated
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:2
msgid ""
"If you change the hostname of the {productname} Server locally, your "
"{productname} installation ceases to work properly.  This is because the "
"changes have not been made in the database, which prevents the changes from "
"propagating out your clients and any proxies."
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານປ່ຽນ hostname ຂອງເຊີເວີ {productname} ພາຍໃນລະບົບເອງ, ການຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} ຈະບໍ່ສາມາດເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ຕາມປົກກະຕິ. ນີ້ແມ່ນຍ້ອນວ່າການປ່ຽນແປງຍັງບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກບັນທຶກໃນຖານຂໍ້ມູນ, ເຊິ່ງເຮັດໃຫ້ການປ່ຽນແປງນັ້ນບໍ່ສາມາດສົ່ງໄປຍັງໄຄລເອັນ ແລະ ພຣັອກຊີຕ່າງໆໄດ້."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Rename Server"
msgstr "ປ່ຽນຊື່ເຊີເວີ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:4
msgid ""
"If you need to change the hostname of the {productname} Server, you can do "
"so using the [command]``spacewalk-hostname-rename`` script.  This script "
"updates the settings in the {postgresql} database and the internal "
"structures of {productname}."
msgstr "ຫາກເຈົ້າຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງປ່ຽນຊື່ໂຮສຂອງເຊີເວີ {productname}, ເຈົ້າສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ສະຄຣິບ [command]``spacewalk-hostname-rename``. ສະຄຣິບນີ້ຈະອັບເດດການຕັ້ງຄ່າໃນຖານຂໍ້ມູນ {postgresql} ແລະ ໂຄງສ້າງພາຍໃນຂອງ {productname}."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Server Configuration"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າເຊີເວີ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:6
msgid ""
"The [command]``spacewalk-hostname-rename`` script is part of the "
"[package]``spacewalk-utils`` package."
msgstr "ສະຄຣິບ [command]``spacewalk-hostname-rename`` ແມ່ນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງແພັກເກດ [package]``spacewalk-utils``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:7
msgid ""
"The only mandatory parameter for the script is the new fully qualified "
"domain name of the {productname} Server."
msgstr "ພະລາມິເຕີດຽວທີ່ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບສະຄຣິບນີ້ຄື ຊື່ໂດເມນເຕັມ (fully qualified domain name) ໃໝ່ຂອງເຊີເວີ {productname}."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Renaming {productname} Server"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການປ່ຽນຊື່ເຊີເວີ {productname}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Change the network settings of the server on the system level locally and "
"remotely at the DNS server."
msgstr "ປ່ຽນການຕັ້ງຄ່າເຄືອຂ່າຍຂອງເຊີເວີໃນລະດັບລະບົບທັງພາຍໃນ ແລະ ທີ່ DNS ເຊີເວີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:10
msgid ""
"You also need to provide configuration settings for reverse name "
"resolution.  Changing network settings is done in the same way as with "
"renaming any other system."
msgstr "ທ່ານຍັງຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຕັ້ງຄ່າສຳລັບ reverse name resolution. ການປ່ຽນການຕັ້ງຄ່າເຄືອຂ່າຍແມ່ນເຮັດໃນລັກສະນະດຽວກັນ ກັບການປ່ຽນຊື່ລະບົບອື່ນໆ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:11
msgid ""
"Reboot the {productname} Server to use the new network configuration and to "
"ensure the hostname has changed."
msgstr "ຣີບູດ (Reboot) ເຊີເວີ {productname} ເພື່ອໃຊ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າເຄືອຂ່າຍໃໝ່ ແລະ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າ hostname ປ່ຽນແປງແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:12
msgid ""
"On the container host, from the command line, execute the following command "
"to update the settings of the server:"
msgstr "ຢູ່ເທິງໂຮສຄອນເທນເນີ, ຈາກຄຳສັ່ງຄອມມານ, ໃຫ້ລັນຄຳສັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ເພື່ອອັບເດດການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງເຊີເວີ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgrctl exec -ti -- spacewalk-hostname-rename <NEW-FQDN>\n"
msgstr "mgrctl exec -ti -- spacewalk-hostname-rename <NEW-FQDN>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:14
msgid ""
"Be aware that this script refreshes the pillar data for all {salt} clients: "
"the time it takes to run depends on the number of registered clients."
msgstr "ຄວນຊາບວ່າສະຄຣິບນີ້ຈະຣີເຟຣຊຂໍ້ມູນ pillar ສຳລັບລູກຂ່າຍ {salt} ທັງໝົດ: ເວລາທີ່ໃຊ້ແມ່ນຂຶ້ນກັບຈຳນວນລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ລົງທະບຽນໄວ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:15
msgid ""
"In case third party SSL certificates are used on the {productname} server, "
"the server certificate and key need to be recreated with the new FQDN."
msgstr "ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ມີການໃຊ້ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ SSL ຂອງພາກສ່ວນທີສາມຢູ່ເທິງເຊີເວີ {productname}, ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນເຊີເວີ ແລະ ຄີ ຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການສ້າງໃໝ່ດ້ວຍ FQDN ໃໝ່."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Renaming {productname} Server with third party certificates"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການປ່ຽນຊື່ເຊີເວີ {productname} ທີ່ມີໃບຢັ້ງຢືນຂອງພາກສ່ວນທີສາມ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:17
msgid ""
"Copy the root certification authority certificate, the new server "
"certificate and key to the {productname} Server host."
msgstr "ສຳເນົາໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ root CA, ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນເຊີເວີໃໝ່ ແລະ ຄີ ໄປຍັງໂຮສເຊີເວີ {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:18
msgid ""
"Copy them to a temporary folder in the container using [command]``mgrctl "
"cp``."
msgstr "ສຳເນົາພວກມັນໄປໄວ້ໃນໂຟນເດີຊົ່ວຄາວໃນຄອນເທນເນີໂດຍໃຊ້ [command]``mgrctl cp``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:19
msgid ""
"Run [command]``spacewalk-hostname-rename`` with parameters to deploy the new "
"certificate."
msgstr "ລັນ [command]``spacewalk-hostname-rename`` ພ້ອມກັບພະລາມິເຕີເພື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງໃບຢັ້ງຢືນໃໝ່."

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgrctl exec mkdir /tmp/ssl\n"
"mgrctl cp ca.crt server:/tmp/ssl/ca.crt\n"
"mgrctl cp srv.crt server:/tmp/ssl/srv.crt\n"
"mgrctl cp srv.key server:/tmp/ssl/srv.key\n"
"mgrctl exec -ti -- spacewalk-hostname-rename <NEW-FQDN> "
"--ssl-ca-cert=/tmp/ssl/ca.crt --ssl-server-cert=/tmp/ssl/srv.crt and "
"--ssl-server-key=/tmp/ssl/srv.key \n"
"mgrctl exec rm -r /tmp/ssl\n"
msgstr ""
"mgrctl exec mkdir /tmp/ssl\n"
"mgrctl cp ca.crt server:/tmp/ssl/ca.crt\n"
"mgrctl cp srv.crt server:/tmp/ssl/srv.crt\n"
"mgrctl cp srv.key server:/tmp/ssl/srv.key\n"
"mgrctl exec -ti -- spacewalk-hostname-rename <NEW-FQDN> --ssl-ca-cert=/tmp/ssl/ca.crt --ssl-server-cert=/tmp/ssl/srv.crt and --ssl-server-key=/tmp/ssl/srv.key \n"
"mgrctl exec rm -r /tmp/ssl\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "Directly Managed Clients Reconfiguration"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າໃໝ່ສຳລັບລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ຈັດການໂດຍກົງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid "*Skip this procedure if clients are managed via a {productname} proxy.*\n"
msgstr "*ຂ້າມຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້ຫາກໄຄລເອັນຖືກຈັດການຜ່ານ {productname} Proxy.*\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:23
msgid ""
"With the following procedure, reconfigure directly managed clients to make "
"them aware of the new hostname and IP address."
msgstr "ດ້ວຍຂັ້ນຕອນຕໍ່ໄປນີ້, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າໄຄລເອັນທີ່ຈັດການໂດຍກົງໃໝ່ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ພວກມັນຮັບຮູ້ hostname ແລະ IP address ໃໝ່."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Reconfiguring Directly Managed Clients"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕັ້ງຄ່າໃໝ່ສຳລັບລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ຈັດການໂດຍກົງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:25
msgid ""
"On the every client, in the {salt} client configuration file, specify the "
"name of the new {salt} master ({productname} Server).  The filename is "
"[path]``/etc/venv-salt-minion/minion.d/susemanager.conf`` or, if you do not "
"use the {salt} bundle, [path]``/etc/salt-minion/minion.d/susemanager.conf``:"
msgstr "ໃນແຕ່ລະໄຄລເອັນ, ໃນໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງໄຄລເອັນ {salt}, ໃຫ້ລະບຸຊື່ຂອງ {salt} master ໃໝ່ ({productname} Server). ຊື່ໄຟລ໌ແມ່ນ [path]``/etc/venv-salt-minion/minion.d/susemanager.conf`` ຫຼື ຫາກທ່ານບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້ {salt} bundle, ແມ່ນ [path]``/etc/salt-minion/minion.d/susemanager.conf``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid "master: <new_hostname>\n"
msgstr "master: <new_hostname>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:27
msgid "On every client, restart {salt} service.  Either run:"
msgstr "ໃນທຸກໆໄຄລເອັນ, ໃຫ້ restart ບໍລິການ {salt}. ໂດຍລັນຄຳສັ່ງໃດໜຶ່ງ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:29
msgid "Or, if you do not use the {salt} bundle, run:"
msgstr "ຫຼື, ຫາກທ່ານບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້ {salt} bundle, ໃຫ້ລັນ:"

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:31
#, no-wrap
msgid "Client Connection with Applying High State"
msgstr "ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ລູກຂ່າຍດ້ວຍການນຳໃຊ້ High State"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:32
msgid ""
"Finally, to fully propagate the hostname to the {salt} client configuration, "
"apply the high state.  Applying the high state will update the hostname in "
"the repository URLs."
msgstr "ສຸດທ້າຍ, ເພື່ອສົ່ງ hostname ໄປຍັງການຕັ້ງຄ່າໄຄລເອັນ {salt} ຢ່າງສົມບູນ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ high state. ການໃຊ້ high state ຈະອັບເດດ hostname ໃນ URL ຂອງບ່ອນເກັບຊອບແວ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:33
#, no-wrap
msgid "Reconfigure Proxy"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າພຣັອກຊີໃໝ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:34
msgid ""
"Every proxy must be reconfigured.  The new server certificate and key must "
"be copied to the proxy.  For more information, see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:install-proxy.adoc[]."
msgstr "ທຸກໆພຣັອກຊີຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າໃໝ່. ຕ້ອງກັອບປີ້ certificate ແລະ key ຂອງເຊີເວີໃໝ່ໄປຍັງພຣັອກຊີ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:installation-and-upgrade:install-proxy.adoc[]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:35
msgid ""
"If you use PXE boot through a proxy, you must check the configuration "
"settings of the proxy.  If you use PXE boot through non-containerized "
"{productname} Proxy 4.3, [systemitem]``tftpsync`` needs to be reconfigured."
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານໃຊ້ PXE boot ຜ່ານພຣັອກຊີ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງກວດສອບການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງພຣັອກຊີ. ຫາກທ່ານໃຊ້ PXE boot ຜ່ານ {productname} Proxy 4.3 ທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນຄອນເທນເນີ, [systemitem]``tftpsync`` ຕ້ອງໄດ້ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໃໝ່."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:36
msgid "On the container host, execute:"
msgstr "ໃນ container host, ໃຫ້ລັນຄຳສັ່ງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:37
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgrctl exec -ti -- configure-tftpsync.sh\n"
msgstr "mgrctl exec -ti -- configure-tftpsync.sh\n"

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-inactiveclients.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Inactive clients"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາໄຄລເອັນທີ່ບໍ່ມີການເຄື່ອນໄຫວ (Inactive clients)"

#
#
#
#. PUT THIS COMMENT AT THE TOP OF TROUBLESHOOTING SECTIONS
#. Troubleshooting format:
#. One sentence each:
#. Cause: What created the problem?
#. Consequence: What does the user see when this happens?
#. Fix: What can the user do to fix this problem?
#. Result: What happens after the user has completed the fix?
#. If more detailed instructions are required, put them in a "Resolving" procedure:
#. .Procedure: Resolving Widget Wobbles
#. . First step
#. . Another step
#. . Last step
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-inactiveclients.adoc:2
msgid ""
"A Taskomatic job periodically pings clients to ensure they are connected.  "
"Clients are considered inactive if they have not responded to a Taskomatic "
"check in for 24 hours or more.  To see a list of inactive clients in the "
"{webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[System List > Inactive]."
msgstr "ວຽກຂອງ Taskomatic ຈະທຳການ ping ຫາໄຄລເອັນເປັນໄລຍະໆ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າພວກມັນຍັງເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຢູ່. ໄຄລເອັນຈະຖືກຖືວ່າບໍ່ມີການເຄື່ອນໄຫວ ຫາກພວກມັນບໍ່ຕອບສະໜອງຕໍ່ການກວດສອບຂອງ Taskomatic ເປັນເວລາ 24 ຊົ່ວໂມງຂຶ້ນໄປ. ເພື່ອເບິ່ງລາຍຊື່ໄຄລເອັນທີ່ບໍ່ມີການເຄື່ອນໄຫວໃນ {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Systems [System List > Inactive]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-inactiveclients.adoc:3
msgid "Clients can become inactive for a number of reasons:"
msgstr "ໄຄລເອັນອາດຈະກາຍເປັນຜູ້ທີ່ບໍ່ມີການເຄື່ອນໄຫວໄດ້ຍ້ອນຫຼາຍສາເຫດ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-inactiveclients.adoc:4
msgid "The client is not entitled to any {productname} service."
msgstr "ໄຄລເອັນບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບສິດໃນການໃຊ້ບໍລິການໃດໆຂອງ {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-inactiveclients.adoc:5
msgid "The client is behind a firewall that does not allow HTTPS connections."
msgstr "ໄຄລເອັນຢູ່ເບື້ອງຫຼັງໄຟວໍທີ່ບໍ່ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ HTTPS."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-inactiveclients.adoc:6
msgid "The client is behind a proxy that is misconfigured."
msgstr "ໄຄລເອັນຢູ່ເບື້ອງຫຼັງພຣັອກຊີທີ່ມີການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ຜິດພາດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-inactiveclients.adoc:7
msgid ""
"The client is communicating with a different {productname} Server, or the "
"connection has been misconfigured."
msgstr "ໄຄລເອັນກຳລັງສື່ສານກັບເຊີເວີ {productname} ອື່ນ, ຫຼື ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ມີການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ຜິດພາດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-inactiveclients.adoc:8
msgid ""
"The client is not in a network that can communicate with the {productname} "
"Server."
msgstr "ໄຄລເອັນບໍ່ໄດ້ຢູ່ໃນເຄືອຂ່າຍທີ່ສາມາດສື່ສານກັບເຊີເວີ {productname} ໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-inactiveclients.adoc:9
msgid ""
"A firewall is blocking traffic between the client and the {productname} "
"Server."
msgstr "ມີໄຟວໍທີ່ປິດກັ້ນການຮັບສົ່ງຂໍ້ມູນລະຫວ່າງໄຄລເອັນ ແລະ ເຊີເວີ {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-inactiveclients.adoc:10
msgid "Taskomatic is misconfigured."
msgstr "Taskomatic ມີການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ຜິດພາດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-inactiveclients.adoc:11
msgid ""
"For more information about client connections to the server, see "
"xref:client-configuration:contact-methods-intro.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຂອງໄຄລເອັນຫາເຊີເວີ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:client-configuration:contact-methods-intro.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-inactiveclients.adoc:12
msgid ""
"For more information about configuring ports, see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:network-requirements.adoc#ports[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າພອດ (ports), ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:installation-and-upgrade:network-requirements.adoc#ports[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-inactiveclients.adoc:13
msgid ""
"For more information about troubleshooting firewalls, see "
"xref:administration:troubleshooting/tshoot-firewalls.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາໄຟວໍ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:administration:troubleshooting/tshoot-firewalls.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-intro.adoc:2
msgid ""
"This section contains some common problems you might encounter with "
"{productname}, and solutions to resolving them."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ປະກອບດ້ວຍບັນຫາທົ່ວໄປບາງຢ່າງທີ່ທ່ານອາດຈະພົບໃນ {productname}, ແລະ ວິທີການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-intro.adoc:3
msgid "Troubleshooting topics specific to Public Cloud are covered separately."
