#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-iss.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Inter-Server Synchronization"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາການຊິງໂຄຣໄນລະຫວ່າງເຊີເວີ (Inter-Server Synchronization)"

#
#
#
#. PUT THIS COMMENT AT THE TOP OF TROUBLESHOOTING SECTIONS
#. Troubleshooting format:
#. One sentence each:
#. Cause: What created the problem?
#. Consequence: What does the user see when this happens?
#. Fix: What can the user do to fix this problem?
#. Result: What happens after the user has completed the fix?
#. If more detailed instructions are required, put them in a "Resolving" procedure:
#. .Procedure: Resolving Widget Wobbles
#. . First step
#. . Another step
#. . Last step
#. Cause: Caches on the ISS slave and master can contain old or out-of-date entries.
#. Consequence: Synchronizing fails, with ``ERROR: Encountered IntegrityError``.
#. Fix: Delete the cache on the slave and the master
#. Result: Synchronization completes successfully.
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-iss.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Inter-server synchronization uses caches to manage the ISS Master and "
"Slaves.  These caches can be prone to bugs that create invalid entries.  In "
"this case, bugs can show up even after updating to a version that resolves "
"the bug, because the cache is still using invalid entries.  If you upgrade "
"to a new version of ISS, but are still experiencing problems, clear all the "
"caches to ensure you no longer have old entries creating a problem."
msgstr "ການຊິງໂຄຣໄນລະຫວ່າງເຊີເວີໃຊ້ cache ເພື່ອຈັດການ ISS Master ແລະ Slaves. cache ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ອາດຈະເກີດ bug ທີ່ສ້າງລາຍການທີ່ບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງຂຶ້ນມາ. ໃນກໍລະນີນີ້, bug ອາດຈະຍັງປາກົດຢູ່ເຖິງວ່າຈະອັບເດດເປັນເວີຊັນທີ່ແກ້ໄຂ bug ນັ້ນແລ້ວກໍຕາມ, ເພາະວ່າ cache ຍັງຄົງໃຊ້ລາຍການທີ່ບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງຢູ່. ຫາກທ່ານອັບເກຣດເປັນເວີຊັນໃໝ່ຂອງ ISS ແຕ່ຍັງພົບບັນຫາຢູ່, ໃຫ້ລ້າງ (clear) cache ທັງໝົດເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າບໍ່ມີລາຍການເກົ່າທີ່ສ້າງບັນຫາອີກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-iss.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Cache errors can lead to synchronization failing with a variety of errors, "
"but the error message will usually report something like this:"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ຜິດພາດຂອງແຄຊອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ການຊິງໂຄຣໄນຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວດ້ວຍຂໍ້ຜິດພາດທີ່ຫຼາກຫຼາຍ, ແຕ່ຂໍ້ຄວາມສະແດງຂໍ້ຜິດພາດປົກກະຕິແລ້ວຈະລາຍງານປະມານນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-iss.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"consider removing satellite-sync cache at /var/cache/rhn/satsync/* and "
"re-run satellite-sync with same options.\n"
msgstr "consider removing satellite-sync cache at /var/cache/rhn/satsync/* and re-run satellite-sync with same options.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-iss.adoc:5
msgid ""
"You can resolve this by deleting the cache on the ISS Master and the ISS "
"Slave, so that synchronization completes successfully."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດແກ້ໄຂສິ່ງນີ້ໄດ້ໂດຍການລຶບ cache ໃນ ISS Master ແລະ ISS Slave, ເພື່ອໃຫ້ການຊິງໂຄຣໄນສຳເລັດໄດ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-iss.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Resolving ISS Caching Errors"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການແກ້ໄຂຂໍ້ຜິດພາດຂອງ ISS Caching"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-iss.adoc:8
msgid ""
"On the ISS Master, at the command prompt, as root, delete the cache file for "
"the Master:"
msgstr "ໃນ ISS Master, ທີ່ command prompt, ໃນຖານະ root, ໃຫ້ລຶບໄຟລ໌ cache ສຳລັບ Master:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-iss.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "rm -rf /var/cache/rhn/xml-*\n"
msgstr "rm -rf /var/cache/rhn/xml-*\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-iss.adoc:10
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-iss.adoc:14
msgid "Restart the service:"
msgstr "Restart ບໍລິການ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-iss.adoc:11
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-iss.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "rcapache2 restart\n"
msgstr "rcapache2 restart\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-iss.adoc:12
msgid ""
"On the ISS Master, at the command prompt, as root, delete the cache file for "
"the Slave:"
msgstr "ໃນ ISS Master, ທີ່ command prompt, ໃນຖານະ root, ໃຫ້ລຶບໄຟລ໌ cache ສຳລັບ Slave:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-iss.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "rm -rf /var/cache/rhn/satsync/*\n"
msgstr "rm -rf /var/cache/rhn/satsync/*\n"

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-localcert.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Local Issuer Certificates"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາ Local Issuer Certificates"

#
#
#
#. PUT THIS COMMENT AT THE TOP OF TROUBLESHOOTING SECTIONS
#. Troubleshooting format:
#. One sentence each:
#. Cause: What created the problem?
#. Consequence: What does the user see when this happens?
#. Fix: What can the user do to fix this problem?
#. Result: What happens after the user has completed the fix?
#. If more detailed instructions are required, put them in a "Resolving" procedure:
#. .Procedure: Resolving Widget Wobbles
#. . First step
#. . Another step
#. . Last step
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-localcert.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Some older bootstrap scripts create a link to the local certificate in the "
"wrong place.  This results in zypper returning an ``Unrecognized error`` "
"about the local issuer certificate.  You can ensure that the link to the "
"local issuer certificate has been created correctly by checking the "
"[path]``/etc/ssl/certs/`` directory.  If you come across this problem, you "
"should consider updating your bootstrap scripts to ensure that zypper "
"operates as expected."
msgstr "ສະຄຣິບ bootstrap ເກົ່າບາງອັນສ້າງລິ້ງ (link) ໄປຫາ local certificate ໃນບ່ອນທີ່ຜິດ. ສິ່ງນີ້ເຮັດໃຫ້ zypper ສົ່ງຄືນຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ ``Unrecognized error`` ກ່ຽວກັບ local issuer certificate. ທ່ານສາມາດກວດສອບວ່າລິ້ງໄປຫາ local issuer certificate ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງຫຼືບໍ່ ໂດຍການກວດສອບ ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ [path]``/etc/ssl/certs/``. ຫາກທ່ານພົບບັນຫານີ້, ທ່ານຄວນພິຈາລະນາອັບເດດສະຄຣິບ bootstrap ຂອງທ່ານເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າ zypper ເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ຕາມທີ່ຄາດໄວ້."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-logintimeout.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Login Timeouts"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາການໝົດເວລາການເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ (Login Timeouts)"

#
#
#
#. PUT THIS COMMENT AT THE TOP OF TROUBLESHOOTING SECTIONS
#. Troubleshooting format:
#. One sentence each:
#. Cause: What created the problem?
#. Consequence: What does the user see when this happens?
#. Fix: What can the user do to fix this problem?
#. Result: What happens after the user has completed the fix?
#. If more detailed instructions are required, put them in a "Resolving" procedure:
#. .Procedure: Resolving Widget Wobbles
#. . First step
#. . Another step
#. . Last step
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-logintimeout.adoc:2
msgid ""
"By default, the {productname} {webui} requires users to log in again after "
"30{nbsp}minutes.  Depending on your environment, you might want to adjust "
"the login timeout value."
msgstr "ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, {webui} ຂອງ {productname} ຈະກຳນົດໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບໃໝ່ຫຼັງຈາກ 30 ນາທີ. ຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຂອງທ່ານ, ທ່ານອາດຈະຕ້ອງການປັບຄ່າເວລາໝົດເວລາການເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-logintimeout.adoc:3
msgid ""
"To adjust the value, you need to make the change in both [path]``rhn.conf`` "
"and [path]``web.xml``.  Ensure you set the value in seconds in "
"[path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``, and in minutes in [path]``web.xml``.  The two "
"values must equal the same amount of time."
msgstr "ເພື່ອປັບຄ່າ, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງປ່ຽນແປງທັງໃນ [path]``rhn.conf`` ແລະ [path]``web.xml``. ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າທ່ານຕັ້ງຄ່າເປັນວິນາທີໃນ [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``, ແລະ ເປັນນາທີໃນ [path]``web.xml``. ທັງສອງຄ່າຕ້ອງມີໄລຍະເວລາທີ່ເທົ່າກັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-logintimeout.adoc:4
msgid ""
"For example, to change the timeout value to one hour, set the value in "
"[path]``rhn.conf`` to 3600 seconds, and the value in [path]``web.xml`` to 60 "
"minutes."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ, ເພື່ອປ່ຽນຄ່າໝົດເວລາເປັນໜຶ່ງຊົ່ວໂມງ, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າໃນ [path]``rhn.conf`` ເປັນ 3600 ວິນາທີ, ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າໃນ [path]``web.xml`` ເປັນ 60 ນາທີ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-logintimeout.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Adjusting the {webui} Login Timeout Value"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການປັບຄ່າໝົດເວລາການເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບຂອງ {webui}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-logintimeout.adoc:6
msgid "On the container host, open a command line inside the server container:"
msgstr "ໃນ container host, ໃຫ້ເປີດ command line ພາຍໃນ server container:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-logintimeout.adoc:8
msgid ""
"Open [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`` and add or edit this line to include the "
"new timeout value in seconds:"
msgstr "ເປີດ [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`` ແລ້ວເພີ່ມ ຫຼື ແກ້ໄຂແຖວນີ້ເພື່ອລະບຸຄ່າໝົດເວລາໃໝ່ເປັນວິນາທີ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-logintimeout.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "web.session_database_lifetime = <Timeout_Value_in_Seconds>\n"
msgstr "web.session_database_lifetime = <Timeout_Value_in_Seconds>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-logintimeout.adoc:10
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-logintimeout.adoc:13
msgid "Save and close the file."
msgstr "ບັນທຶກ ແລະ ປິດໄຟລ໌."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-logintimeout.adoc:11
msgid ""
"Open [path]``/etc/tomcat/web.xml`` and add or edit this line to include the "
"new timeout value in minutes:"
msgstr "ເປີດ [path]``/etc/tomcat/web.xml`` ແລ້ວເພີ່ມ ຫຼື ແກ້ໄຂແຖວນີ້ເພື່ອລະບຸຄ່າໝົດເວລາໃໝ່ເປັນນາທີ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-logintimeout.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "<session-timeout>Timeout_Value_in_Minutes</session-timeout>\n"
msgstr "<session-timeout>Timeout_Value_in_Minutes</session-timeout>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-logintimeout.adoc:14
msgid "On the container host, restart the server to enforce the new configuration:"
msgstr "ໃນ container host, ໃຫ້ restart ເຊີເວີເພື່ອໃຫ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າໃໝ່ມີຜົນບັງຄັບໃຊ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-logintimeout.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "systemctl restart uyuni-server.service\n"
msgstr "systemctl restart uyuni-server.service\n"

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-mail.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Mail Configuration"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາການຕັ້ງຄ່າອີເມວ (Mail Configuration)"

#
#
#
#. PUT THIS COMMENT AT THE TOP OF TROUBLESHOOTING SECTIONS
#. Troubleshooting format:
#. One sentence each:
#. Cause: What created the problem?
#. Consequence: What does the user see when this happens?
#. Fix: What can the user do to fix this problem?
#. Result: What happens after the user has completed the fix?
#. If more detailed instructions are required, put them in a "Resolving" procedure:
#. .Procedure: Resolving Widget Wobbles
#. . First step
#. . Another step
#. . Last step
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-mail.adoc:2
msgid ""
"For secure mail communication, you can enable authentication, define "
"username and password, and enable [literal]``SSL`` or [literal]``STARTLS`` "
"in [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``:"
msgstr "ສຳລັບການສື່ສານອີເມວທີ່ປອດໄພ, ທ່ານສາມາດເປີດໃຊ້ການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ (authentication), ກຳນົດຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ ແລະ ລະຫັດຜ່ານ, ແລະ ເປີດໃຊ້ [literal]``SSL`` ຫຼື [literal]``STARTLS`` ໃນ [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-mail.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"java.smtp_server = string (default: localhost)\n"
"java.smtp_port = integer (default: 25)\n"
"java.smtp_auth = true/false (default: false)\n"
"java.smtp_ssl = true/false (default: false)\n"
"java.smtp_starttls = true/false (default: false)\n"
"java.smtp_user = string (default: null)\n"
"java.smtp_pass = string (default: null)\n"
msgstr ""
"java.smtp_server = string (default: localhost)\n"
"java.smtp_port = integer (default: 25)\n"
"java.smtp_auth = true/false (default: false)\n"
"java.smtp_ssl = true/false (default: false)\n"
"java.smtp_starttls = true/false (default: false)\n"
"java.smtp_user = string (default: null)\n"
"java.smtp_pass = string (default: null)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-mail.adoc:4
msgid ""
"To increase the connection timeout for SMTP server communication, the "
"following parameters can be set in [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອເພີ່ມເວລາໝົດເວລາການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ສຳລັບການສື່ສານກັບ SMTP ເຊີເວີ, ສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າພາຣາມີເຕີຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ໃນ [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-mail.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"java.smtp_timeout = integer (default: 5000)\n"
"java.smtp_connection_timeout = integer (default: 5000)\n"
"java.smtp_write_timeout = integer (default: 5000)\n"
msgstr ""
"java.smtp_timeout = integer (default: 5000)\n"
"java.smtp_connection_timeout = integer (default: 5000)\n"
"java.smtp_write_timeout = integer (default: 5000)\n"

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-mass-duplication-machine_id.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Mass Machine_id Duplication"
msgstr "ການຊ້ຳຊ້ອນຂອງ Machine_id ຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ"

#
#
#
#. PUT THIS COMMENT AT THE TOP OF TROUBLESHOOTING SECTIONS
#. Troubleshooting format:
#. One sentence each:
#. Cause: What created the problem?
#. Consequence: What does the user see when this happens?
#. Fix: What can the user do to fix this problem?
#. Result: What happens after the user has completed the fix?
#. If more detailed instructions are required, put them in a "Resolving" procedure:
#. .Procedure: Resolving Widget Wobbles
#. . First step
#. . Another step
#. . Last step
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-mass-duplication-machine_id.adoc:2
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:2
msgid ""
"If you are using {productname} to manage virtual machines, you might find it "
"useful to create clones of your VMs.  A clone is a VM that uses a primary "
"disk that is an exact copy of an existing disk."
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານໃຊ້ {productname} ເພື່ອຈັດການເວີຊວລແມັກຊີນ (VMs), ທ່ານອາດຈະເຫັນວ່າມັນມີປະໂຫຍດໃນການ ສ້າງຄລອນ (clones) ຂອງ VM ຂອງທ່ານ. ຄລອນແມ່ນ VM ທີ່ໃຊ້ດິດຫຼັກ (primary disk) ທີ່ເປັນການ ສຳເນົາທີ່ຄືກັນທຸກປະການຈາກດິດທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-mass-duplication-machine_id.adoc:3
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:3
msgid ""
"While cloning VMs can save you a lot of time, the duplicated identifying "
"information on the disk can sometimes cause problems."
msgstr "ເຖິງວ່າການຄລອນ VM ຈະຊ່ວຍປະຢັດເວລາໄດ້ຫຼາຍ, ແຕ່ຂໍ້ມູນລະບຸຕົວຕົນທີ່ຊ້ຳກັນໃນດິດບາງຄັ້ງອາດຈະສ້າງບັນຫາໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-mass-duplication-machine_id.adoc:4
msgid ""
"If you try to register two machine where one is the clone of the other, you "
"probably want {productname} to register them as two separate clients.  "
"However, if the machine ID in both the original client and the clone is the "
"same, {productname} registers both clients as one system, and the data is "
"overwritten one the second machine is registered."
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານພະຍາຍາມລົງທະບຽນສອງເຄື່ອງທີ່ເຄື່ອງໜຶ່ງເປັນຄລອນຂອງອີກເຄື່ອງໜຶ່ງ, ທ່ານອາດຈະຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ {productname} ລົງທະບຽນພວກມັນເປັນສອງໄຄລເອັນທີ່ແຍກກັນ. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ຫາກ machine ID ໃນທັງໄຄລເອັນຕົ້ນສະບັບ ແລະ ໄຄລເອັນທີ່ຄລອນມານັ້ນຄືກັນ, {productname} ຈະລົງທະບຽນທັງສອງເປັນລະບົບດຽວກັນ, ແລະ ຂໍ້ມູນຈະຖືກຂຽນທັບເມື່ອເຄື່ອງທີສອງຖືກລົງທະບຽນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-mass-duplication-machine_id.adoc:5
msgid ""
"This can be resolved by changing the machine ID of the clone, so that "
"{productname} recognizes them as two different clients.  For more "
"information and instructions on how to change machine ID, see "
"xref:administration:troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc[]."
msgstr "ບັນຫານີ້ສາມາດແກ້ໄຂໄດ້ໂດຍການປ່ຽນ machine ID ຂອງເຄື່ອງທີ່ຄລອນມາ, ເພື່ອໃຫ້ {productname} ຮັບຮູ້ວ່າພວກມັນເປັນສອງໄຄລເອັນທີ່ຕ່າງກັນ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ ແລະ ຄຳແນະນຳກ່ຽວກັບວິທີການປ່ຽນ machine ID, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:administration:troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-mass-duplication-machine_id.adoc:6
msgid ""
"However, in some situations, it is neither feasible nor practical to change "
"the machine ID on all systems, as this could disrupt other applications that "
"depend on the existing machine IDs. In those cases, a option is available "
"where a fake machine ID is generated to be used in the context of "
"{productname}."
msgstr "ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ໃນບາງສະຖານະການ, ມັນອາດຈະບໍ່ສະດວກ ຫຼື ບໍ່ສາມາດປ່ຽນ machine ID ໃນທຸກລະບົບໄດ້, ເນື່ອງຈາກມັນອາດຈະລົບກວນແອັບພລິເຄຊັນອື່ນໆທີ່ຂຶ້ນກັບ machine ID ທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ. ໃນກໍລະນີເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນ, ມີຕົວເລືອກທີ່ຈະສ້າງ machine ID ປອມຂຶ້ນມາເພື່ອໃຊ້ໃນບໍລິບົດຂອງ {productname}."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-mass-duplication-machine_id.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Generating machine ID for {productname} at registration time"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງ machine ID ສຳລັບ {productname} ໃນເວລາລົງທະບຽນ"

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-mass-duplication-machine_id.adoc:8
msgid ""
"Create a Bootstrap script (skip this step if you already have it)  For more "
"information, see xref:client-configuration:registration-bootstrap.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສ້າງສະຄຣິບ Bootstrap (ຂ້າມຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້ຫາກທ່ານມີມັນແລ້ວ) ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:client-configuration:registration-bootstrap.adoc[]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-mass-duplication-machine_id.adoc:9
msgid "Open the file and change the parameter:"
msgstr "ເປີດໄຟລ໌ ແລະ ປ່ຽນພາຣາມີເຕີ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-mass-duplication-machine_id.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "GENERATE_OWN_MACHINEID=1\n"
msgstr "GENERATE_OWN_MACHINEID=1\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-mass-duplication-machine_id.adoc:11
msgid "Start using your bootstrap strict, and machine ID will not collide anymore."
msgstr "ເລີ່ມໃຊ້ສະຄຣິບ bootstrap ຂອງທ່ານ, ແລະ machine ID ຈະບໍ່ຊ້ຳກັນອີກຕໍ່ໄປ."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-mounting-tmp-with-noexec.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Mounting /tmp with noexec"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາການເມົາທ໌ (Mounting) /tmp ດ້ວຍ noexec"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-mounting-tmp-with-noexec.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Salt runs remote commands from [path]``/tmp`` on the client's file system.  "
"Therefore you must not mount [path]``/tmp`` with the [option]``noexec`` "
"option.  The other way to solve this issue is to override temporary "
"directory path with the [literal]``TMPDIR`` environment variable specified "
"for the Salt service to make it pointing to the directory with no "
"[option]``noexec`` option set.  It is recommended to use systemd drop-in "
"configuration file "
"[path]``/etc/systemd/system/venv-salt-minion.service.d/10-TMPDIR.conf`` if "
"Salt Bundle is used, or "
"[path]``/etc/systemd/system/salt-minion.service.d/10-TMPDIR.conf`` if "
"[package]``salt-minion`` is used on the client.  The example of the drop-in "
"configuration file content:"
msgstr "Salt ຈະລັນຄຳສັ່ງທາງໄກຈາກ [path]``/tmp`` ໃນລະບົບໄຟລ໌ຂອງໄຄລເອັນ. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງບໍ່ ເມົາທ໌ [path]``/tmp`` ດ້ວຍຕົວເລືອກ [option]``noexec``. ອີກວິທີໜຶ່ງໃນການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫານີ້ຄື ການກຳນົດເສັ້ນທາງໄດເຣັກທໍຣີຊົ່ວຄາວໃໝ່ດ້ວຍຕົວປ່ຽນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ [literal]``TMPDIR`` ທີ່ລະບຸ ສຳລັບບໍລິການ Salt ເພື່ອໃຫ້ມັນຊີ້ໄປຫາໄດເຣັກທໍຣີທີ່ບໍ່ມີການຕັ້ງຄ່າ [option]``noexec``. ຂໍແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ systemd drop-in [path]``/etc/systemd/system/venv-salt-minion.service.d/10-TMPDIR.conf`` ຫາກໃຊ້ Salt Bundle, ຫຼື [path]``/etc/systemd/system/salt-minion.service.d/10-TMPDIR.conf`` ຫາກໃຊ້ [package]``salt-minion`` ໃນໄຄລເອັນ. ຕົວຢ່າງຂອງເນື້ອຫາໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ drop-in:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-mounting-tmp-with-noexec.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[Service]\n"
"Environment=TMPDIR=/var/tmp\n"
msgstr ""
"[Service]\n"
"Environment=TMPDIR=/var/tmp\n"

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-mounting-vartmp-with-noexec.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Mounting /var/tmp with noexec"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາການເມົາທ໌ /var/tmp ດ້ວຍ noexec"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-mounting-vartmp-with-noexec.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Salt SSH is using [path]``/var/tmp`` to deploy Salt Bundle to and execute "
"Salt commands on the client with the bundled Python.  Therefore you must not "
"mount [path]``/var/tmp`` with the [option]``noexec`` option.  It is not "
"possible to bootstrap the clients, which have [path]``/var/tmp`` mounted "
"with [option]``noexec`` option, with the {webui} because the bootstrap "
"process is using Salt SSH to reach a client."
msgstr "Salt SSH ໃຊ້ [path]``/var/tmp`` ເພື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງ Salt Bundle ແລະ ລັນຄຳສັ່ງ Salt ໃນໄຄລເອັນ ດ້ວຍ Python ທີ່ມານຳກັນ. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງບໍ່ເມົາທ໌ [path]``/var/tmp`` ດ້ວຍຕົວເລືອກ [option]``noexec``. ມັນບໍ່ສາມາດ bootstrap ໄຄລເອັນທີ່ມີການເມົາທ໌ [path]``/var/tmp`` ດ້ວຍຕົວເລືອກ [option]``noexec`` ຜ່ານ {webui} ໄດ້ ເພາະຂະບວນການ bootstrap ໃຊ້ Salt SSH ເພື່ອເຂົ້າເຖິງໄຄລເອັນ."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-not-enough-disk-space.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Not Enough Disk Space"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາເນື້ອທີ່ດິດບໍ່ພຽງພໍ"

#
#
#
#
#
#. PUT THIS COMMENT AT THE TOP OF TROUBLESHOOTING SECTIONS
#. Troubleshooting format:
#. One sentence each:
#. Cause: What created the problem?
#. Consequence: What does the user see when this happens?
#. Fix: What can the user do to fix this problem?
#. Result: What happens after the user has completed the fix?
#. If more detailed instructions are required, put them in a "Resolving" procedure:
#. .Procedure: Resolving Widget Wobbles
#. . First step
#. . Another step
#. . Last step
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-not-enough-disk-space.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Check the available disk space before you begin migration.  We recommend "
"locating [path]``/var/spacewalk`` and [path]``/var/lib/pgsql`` on separate "
"XFS file systems."
msgstr "ກວດສອບເນື້ອທີ່ດິດທີ່ວ່າງກ່ອນທີ່ທ່ານຈະເລີ່ມການຍ້າຍ (migration). ພວກເຮົາແນະນຳໃຫ້ວາງ [path]``/var/spacewalk`` ແລະ [path]``/var/lib/pgsql`` ໄວ້ໃນລະບົບໄຟລ໌ XFS ທີ່ແຍກກັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-not-enough-disk-space.adoc:3
msgid ""
"When you are setting up a separate file system, edit [path]``/etc/fstab`` "
"and remove the [path]``/var/lib/pqsql`` subvolume.  Reboot the server to "
"pick up the changes."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານກຳລັງຕັ້ງຄ່າລະບົບໄຟລ໌ແຍກຕ່າງຫາກ, ໃຫ້ແກ້ໄຂ [path]``/etc/fstab`` ແລະ ລຶບ [path]``/var/lib/pqsql`` subvolume ອອກ. ຣີບູດ (Reboot) ເຊີເວີເພື່ອໃຫ້ການປ່ຽນແປງມີຜົນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-not-enough-disk-space.adoc:4
msgid ""
"To get more information about an upgrade problem, check the migration log "
"file.  The log file is located at [path]``/var/log/rhn/migration.log`` on "
"the system you are upgrading."
msgstr "ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບບັນຫາການອັບເກຣດ, ໃຫ້ກວດສອບໄຟລ໌ migration log. ໄຟລ໌ລັອກຕັ້ງຢູ່ທີ່ [path]``/var/log/rhn/migration.log`` ໃນລະບົບທີ່ທ່ານກຳລັງອັບເກຣດ."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-notifications.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Notifications"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາການແຈ້ງເຕືອນ (Notifications)"

#
#
#
#. PUT THIS COMMENT AT THE TOP OF TROUBLESHOOTING SECTIONS
#. Troubleshooting format:
#. One sentence each:
#. Cause: What created the problem?
#. Consequence: What does the user see when this happens?
#. Fix: What can the user do to fix this problem?
#. Result: What happens after the user has completed the fix?
#. If more detailed instructions are required, put them in a "Resolving" procedure:
#. .Procedure: Resolving Widget Wobbles
#. . First step
#. . Another step
#. . Last step
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-notifications.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The default lifetime of notification messages is 30 days, after which "
"messages are deleted from the database, regardless of read status.  To "
"change this value, add or edit this line in [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``:"
msgstr "ອາຍຸການເກັບຮັກສາຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມແຈ້ງເຕືອນແມ່ນ 30 ວັນ, ຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນຂໍ້ຄວາມຈະຖືກລຶບ ອອກຈາກຖານຂໍ້ມູນ ບໍ່ວ່າຈະຖືກອ່ານແລ້ວຫຼືບໍ່ກໍຕາມ. ເພື່ອປ່ຽນຄ່ານີ້, ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມ ຫຼື ແກ້ໄຂແຖວນີ້ໃນ [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-notifications.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "java.notifications_lifetime = 30\n"
msgstr "java.notifications_lifetime = 30\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-notifications.adoc:4
msgid ""
"To enable or disable a notification type, add or edit a line as follows in "
"[path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອເປີດ ຫຼື ປິດປະເພດການແຈ້ງເຕືອນ, ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມ ຫຼື ແກ້ໄຂແຖວໃນ [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`` ດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-notifications.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"java.notifications_type_disabled = OnboardingFailed,ChannelSyncFailed,\\\n"
"  ChannelSyncFinished,CreateBootstrapRepoFailed,StateApplyFailed,\\\n"
"  PaygAuthenticationUpdateFailed,EndOfLifePeriod,SubscriptionWarning\n"
msgstr ""
"java.notifications_type_disabled = OnboardingFailed,ChannelSyncFailed,\\\n"
"  ChannelSyncFinished,CreateBootstrapRepoFailed,StateApplyFailed,\\\n"
"  PaygAuthenticationUpdateFailed,EndOfLifePeriod,SubscriptionWarning\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-notifications.adoc:6
msgid ""
"For default settings and configuration options, see the "
"[path]``usr/share/rhn/config-defaults/rhn_java.conf`` template file."
msgstr "ສຳລັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ແລະ ຕົວເລືອກການຕັ້ງຄ່າຕ່າງໆ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ໄຟລ໌ເທັມເພລດ [path]``usr/share/rhn/config-defaults/rhn_java.conf``."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-oes-repos-enablement.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting OES repositories enablement"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາການເປີດໃຊ້ບ່ອນເກັບຊອບແວ (repositories) ຂອງ OES"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-oes-repos-enablement.adoc:2
msgid ""
"To enable Open Enterprise Server (OES) on {productname} Server, follow the "
"procedure described."
msgstr "ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ Open Enterprise Server (OES) ໃນເຊີເວີ {productname}, ໃຫ້ເຮັດຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນທີ່ໄດ້ອະທິບາຍໄວ້."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-oes-repos-enablement.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Enabling OES repositories"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການເປີດໃຊ້ບ່ອນເກັບຊອບແວ OES"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-oes-repos-enablement.adoc:4
msgid "Ensure you have mirror credentials from Microfocus with access to OES."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າທ່ານມີຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວ (credentials) ສຳລັບ mirror ຈາກ Microfocus ທີ່ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງ OES ໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-oes-repos-enablement.adoc:5
msgid "Log in to {productname} Server."
msgstr "ເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ (Log in) ຫາເຊີເວີ {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-oes-repos-enablement.adoc:6
msgid "Go to [guimenu]``Admin > Setup Wizard > Organization Credentials``."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ [guimenu]``Admin > Setup Wizard > Organization Credentials``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-oes-repos-enablement.adoc:7
msgid "Make sure you already have SUSE credentials for {productname}."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າທ່ານມີຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວ SUSE ສຳລັບ {productname} ແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-oes-repos-enablement.adoc:8
msgid "Select option for adding new and type in Microfocus credentials."
msgstr "ເລືອກຕົວເລືອກເພື່ອເພີ່ມໃໝ່ ແລະ ປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວຂອງ Microfocus ເຂົ້າໄປ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-oes-repos-enablement.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Go to [guimenu]``Admin > Setup Wizard > Organization Credentials`` and wait "
"for the refresh operation to complete."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ [guimenu]``Admin > Setup Wizard > Organization Credentials`` ແລະ ລໍຖ້າໃຫ້ການຣີເຟຣຊສຳເລັດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-oes-repos-enablement.adoc:10
msgid ""
"OES should be visible on the refreshed product list.  You can now enable it "
"like any other products."
msgstr "OES ຄວນຈະປາກົດຢູ່ໃນລາຍຊື່ຜະລິດຕະພັນທີ່ຣີເຟຣຊແລ້ວ. ຕອນນີ້ທ່ານສາມາດເປີດໃຊ້ງານມັນໄດ້ຄືກັບຜະລິດຕະພັນອື່ນໆ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-oes-repos-enablement.adoc:11
msgid ""
"For more information about OES, see "
"https://www.microfocus.com/documentation/open-enterprise-server/."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ OES, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ https://www.microfocus.com/documentation/open-enterprise-server/."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-packages.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Package Inconsistencies"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາຄວາມບໍ່ສອດຄ່ອງກັນຂອງແພັກເກັດ (Package Inconsistencies)"

#
#
#
#. PUT THIS COMMENT AT THE TOP OF TROUBLESHOOTING SECTIONS
#. Troubleshooting format:
#. One sentence each:
#. Cause: What created the problem?
#. Consequence: What does the user see when this happens?
#. Fix: What can the user do to fix this problem?
#. Result: What happens after the user has completed the fix?
#. If more detailed instructions are required, put them in a "Resolving" procedure:
#. .Procedure: Resolving Widget Wobbles
#. . First step
#. . Another step
#. . Last step
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-packages.adoc:2
msgid ""
"When packages on a client are locked, {productname} Server may not be able "
"to correctly determine the set of applicable patches.  When this occurs, "
"package updates are available in the {webui}, but do not appear on the "
"client, and attempts to update the client fail.  Check package locks and "
"exclude lists to determine if packages are locked or excluded on the client."
msgstr "ເມື່ອແພັກເກັດໃນໄຄລເອັນຖືກລັອກ (locked), ເຊີເວີ {productname} ອາດຈະບໍ່ສາມາດກຳນົດ ຊຸດຂອງແພັດ (patches) ທີ່ເໝາະສົມໄດ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ. ເມື່ອສິ່ງນີ້ເກີດຂຶ້ນ, ການອັບເດດແພັກເກັດ ຈະປາກົດຢູ່ໃນ {webui}, ແຕ່ຈະບໍ່ປາກົດຢູ່ໃນໄຄລເອັນ, ແລະ ການພະຍາຍາມອັບເດດໄຄລເອັນຈະລົ້ມເຫຼວ. ໃຫ້ກວດສອບການລັອກແພັກເກັດ ແລະ ລາຍຊື່ທີ່ຍົກເວັ້ນ (exclude lists) ເພື່ອກວດເບິ່ງວ່າແພັກເກັດ ຖືກລັອກ ຫຼື ຖືກຍົກເວັ້ນໃນໄຄລເອັນຫຼືບໍ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-packages.adoc:3
msgid ""
"On the client, check package locks and exclude lists to determine if "
"packages are locked or excluded:"
msgstr "ໃນໄຄລເອັນ, ໃຫ້ກວດສອບການລັອກແພັກເກັດ ແລະ ລາຍຊື່ທີ່ຍົກເວັ້ນ ເພື່ອກວດເບິ່ງວ່າແພັກເກັດຖືກລັອກ ຫຼື ຖືກຍົກເວັ້ນ:"

#.  SUSE Liberty Linux not available at Uyuni for now
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-packages.adoc:4
msgid ""
"On an Expanded Support Platform, check [path]``/etc/yum.conf`` and search "
"for ``exclude=``."
msgstr "ໃນ Expanded Support Platform, ໃຫ້ກວດສອບ [path]``/etc/yum.conf`` ແລະ ຄົ້ນຫາ ``exclude=``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-packages.adoc:5
msgid "On {sle} and {opensuse}, use the [command]``zypper locks`` command."
msgstr "ໃນ {sle} ແລະ {opensuse}, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``zypper locks``."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-passing-grains-to-start-event.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Passing Grains to a Start Event"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາການສົ່ງ Grains ໄປຫາ Start Event"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-passing-grains-to-start-event.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Every time a Salt client starts, it passes the ``machine_id`` grain to "
"{productname}. {productname} uses this grain to determine if the client is "
"registered.  This process requires a synchronous Salt call. Synchronous Salt "
"calls block other processes, so if you have a lot of clients start at the "
"same time, the process could create significant delays."
msgstr "ທຸກໆຄັ້ງທີ່ໄຄລເອັນ Salt ເລີ່ມເຮັດວຽກ, ມັນຈະສົ່ງ grain ``machine_id`` ໄປຫາ {productname}. {productname} ໃຊ້ grain ນີ້ເພື່ອລະບຸວ່າໄຄລເອັນໄດ້ລົງທະບຽນແລ້ວຫຼືບໍ່. ຂະບວນການນີ້ ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີການເອີ້ນ Salt ແບບຊິງໂຄຣນັດ (synchronous). ການເອີ້ນ Salt ແບບຊິງໂຄຣນັດ ຈະປິດກັ້ນ (block) ຂະບວນການອື່ນໆ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນຫາກທ່ານມີໄຄລເອັນຈຳນວນຫຼາຍທີ່ເລີ່ມເຮັດວຽກ ພ້ອມໆກັນ, ຂະບວນການນີ້ອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດຄວາມຊັກຊ້າຢ່າງຫຼວງຫຼາຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-passing-grains-to-start-event.adoc:3
msgid ""
"To overcome this problem, a new feature has been introduced in Salt to avoid "
"making a separate synchronous Salt call."
msgstr "ເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂບັນຫານີ້, ຟີເຈີໃໝ່ໄດ້ຖືກນຳມາໃຊ້ໃນ Salt ເພື່ອຫຼີກເວັ້ນການເອີ້ນ Salt ແບບຊິງໂຄຣນັດແຍກຕ່າງຫາກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-passing-grains-to-start-event.adoc:4
msgid ""
"To use this feature, you can add a configuration parameter to the client "
"configuration, on clients that support it."
msgstr "ເພື່ອໃຊ້ຟີເຈີນີ້ນ, ທ່ານສາມາດເພີ່ມພາຣາມີເຕີການຕັ້ງຄ່າເຂົ້າໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າໄຄລເອັນ, ໃນໄຄລເອັນທີ່ຮອງຮັບ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-passing-grains-to-start-event.adoc:5
msgid ""
"To make this process easier, you can use the ``mgr_start_event_grains.sls`` "
"helper Salt state."
msgstr "ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຂະບວນການນີ້ງ່າຍຂຶ້ນ, ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ Salt state ຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອ ``mgr_start_event_grains.sls``."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-passing-grains-to-start-event.adoc:6
msgid ""
"This only applies to already registered clients.  If you registered your "
"Salt client recently, this config parameter is added by default."
msgstr "ສິ່ງນີ້ໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະກັບໄຄລເອັນທີ່ລົງທະບຽນແລ້ວເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ຫາກທ່ານຫາກໍລົງທະບຽນໄຄລເອັນ Salt ເມື່ອບໍ່ດົນມານີ້, ພາຣາມີເຕີການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກເພີ່ມໃຫ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-passing-grains-to-start-event.adoc:7
msgid ""
"On the {productname} Server, at the command prompt, use this command to "
"enable the ``start_event_grains`` configuration helper:"
msgstr "ໃນເຊີເວີ {productname}, ທີ່ command prompt, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງນີ້ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ງານຕົວຊ່ວຍ ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ ``start_event_grains``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-passing-grains-to-start-event.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt '*' state.sls util.mgr_start_event_grains\n"
msgstr "salt '*' state.sls util.mgr_start_event_grains\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-passing-grains-to-start-event.adoc:9
msgid ""
"This command adds the required configuration into the client's configuration "
"file, and applies it when the client is restarted.  If you have a large "
"number of clients, you can execute the command in batch mode instead:"
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງນີ້ຈະເພີ່ມການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ຈຳເປັນເຂົ້າໃນໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງໄຄລເອັນ, ແລະ ຈະມີຜົນເມື່ອ ໄຄລເອັນຖືກ restart. ຫາກທ່ານມີໄຄລເອັນຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ, ທ່ານສາມາດລັນຄຳສັ່ງໃນໂໝດ batch ແທນ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-passing-grains-to-start-event.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt --batch-size 50 '*' state.sls mgr_start_event_grains\n"
msgstr "salt --batch-size 50 '*' state.sls mgr_start_event_grains\n"

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-proxy-connections-and-fqdns.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Proxy Connections and FQDN"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ພຣັອກຊີ ແລະ FQDN"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-proxy-connections-and-fqdns.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Sometimes clients connected through a proxy appear in the {webui}, but do "
"not show that they are connected through a proxy.  This can occur if you are "
"not using the fully qualified domain name (FQDN) to connect, and the proxy "
"is not known to {productname}."
msgstr "ບາງຄັ້ງໄຄລເອັນທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຜ່ານພຣັອກຊີຈະປາກົດຢູ່ໃນ {webui}, ແຕ່ບໍ່ສະແດງວ່າພວກມັນ ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຜ່ານພຣັອກຊີ. ສິ່ງນີ້ອາດຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນຫາກທ່ານບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້ fully qualified domain name (FQDN) ໃນການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່, ແລະ ພຣັອກຊີບໍ່ເປັນທີ່ຮູ້ຈັກສຳລັບ {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-proxy-connections-and-fqdns.adoc:3
msgid ""
"To correct this behavior, specify additional FQDNs as grains in the client "
"configuration file on the proxy:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂພຶດຕິກຳນີ້, ໃຫ້ລະບຸ FQDN ເພີ່ມເຕີມເປັນ grains ໃນໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າໄຄລເອັນຢູ່ໃນພຣັອກຊີ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-proxy-connections-and-fqdns.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"grains:\n"
"  susemanager:\n"
"    custom_fqdns:\n"
"      - name.one\n"
"      - name.two\n"
msgstr ""
"grains:\n"
"  susemanager:\n"
"    custom_fqdns:\n"
"      - name.one\n"
"      - name.two\n"

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-reg-from-webui-fails-no-errors.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Registration from {webui} fails and does not show any errors"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາການລົງທະບຽນຈາກ {webui} ລົ້ມເຫຼວ ແລະ ບໍ່ສະແດງຂໍ້ຜິດພາດໃດໆ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-reg-from-webui-fails-no-errors.adoc:2
msgid ""
"For the initial registration from the {webui}, all Salt clients are using "
"Salt SSH."
msgstr "ສຳລັບການລົງທະບຽນຄັ້ງທຳອິດຈາກ {webui}, ໄຄລເອັນ Salt ທັງໝົດແມ່ນໃຊ້ Salt SSH."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-reg-from-webui-fails-no-errors.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Because of its nature, Salt SSH clients do not report errors back to the "
"server."
msgstr "ເນື່ອງຈາກທຳມະຊາດຂອງມັນ, ໄຄລເອັນ Salt SSH ຈະບໍ່ລາຍງານຂໍ້ຜິດພາດກັບຄືນຫາເຊີເວີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-reg-from-webui-fails-no-errors.adoc:4
msgid ""
"However, the Salt SSH clients store a log locally at "
"[path]``/var/log/salt-ssh.log`` that can be inspected for errors."
msgstr "ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ໄຄລເອັນ Salt SSH ຈະເກັບລັອກໄວ້ພາຍໃນເຄື່ອງທີ່ [path]``/var/log/salt-ssh.log`` ເຊິ່ງສາມາດກວດສອບຂໍ້ຜິດພາດໄດ້."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Registering Cloned Clients"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາການລົງທະບຽນໄຄລເອັນທີ່ຄລອນມາ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:4
msgid ""
"If you have a client that is already registered, you create a clone of that "
"client, and then try and register the clone, you probably want {productname} "
"to register them as two separate clients.  However, if the machine ID in "
"both the original client and the clone is the same, {productname} registers "
"both clients as one system, and the existing client data is overwritten with "
"that of the clone."
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານມີໄຄລເອັນທີ່ລົງທະບຽນແລ້ວ, ແລະ ທ່ານສ້າງຄລອນຂອງໄຄລເອັນນັ້ນ, ຈາກນັ້ນພະຍາຍາມ ລົງທະບຽນເຄື່ອງທີ່ຄລອນມາ, ທ່ານອາດຈະຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ {productname} ລົງທະບຽນພວກມັນ ເປັນສອງໄຄລເອັນທີ່ແຍກກັນ. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ຫາກ machine ID ໃນທັງໄຄລເອັນຕົ້ນສະບັບ ແລະ ໄຄລເອັນທີ່ຄລອນມານັ້ນຄືກັນ, {productname} ຈະລົງທະບຽນທັງສອງເປັນລະບົບດຽວກັນ, ແລະ ຂໍ້ມູນໄຄລເອັນທີ່ມີຢູ່ຈະຖືກຂຽນທັບດ້ວຍຂໍ້ມູນຂອງເຄື່ອງທີ່ຄລອນມາ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:5
msgid ""
"This can be resolved by changing the machine ID of the clone, so that "
"{productname} recognizes them as two different clients."
msgstr "ບັນຫານີ້ສາມາດແກ້ໄຂໄດ້ໂດຍການປ່ຽນ machine ID ຂອງເຄື່ອງທີ່ຄລອນມາ, ເພື່ອໃຫ້ {productname} ຮັບຮູ້ວ່າພວກມັນເປັນສອງໄຄລເອັນທີ່ຕ່າງກັນ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:6
msgid ""
"Each step of this procedure is performed on the cloned client.  This "
"procedure does not manipulate the original client, which remains registered "
"to {productname}."
msgstr "ແຕ່ລະຂັ້ນຕອນຂອງຂະບວນການນີ້ແມ່ນດຳເນີນການໃນໄຄລເອັນທີ່ຄລອນມາ. ຂະບວນການນີ້ ຈະບໍ່ໄປຈັດການຫຍັງກັບໄຄລເອັນຕົ້ນສະບັບ, ເຊິ່ງຍັງຄົງລົງທະບຽນກັບ {productname} ຄືເກົ່າ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Resolving Duplicate Machine IDs in Cloned Salt Clients"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການແກ້ໄຂ machine ID ທີ່ຊ້ຳກັນໃນໄຄລເອັນ Salt ທີ່ຄລອນມາ"

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "*Initial System Configuration*\n"
msgstr "*ການຕັ້ງຄ່າລະບົບເບື້ອງຕົ້ນ*\n"

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:9
msgid "On the cloned machine, change the hostname and IP addresses."
msgstr "ໃນເຄື່ອງທີ່ຄລອນມາ, ໃຫ້ປ່ຽນ hostname ແລະ IP addresses."

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:10
msgid ""
"Make sure [path]``/etc/hosts`` contains the changes you made and the correct "
"host entries."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າ [path]``/etc/hosts`` ມີຂໍ້ມູນການປ່ຽນແປງທີ່ທ່ານໄດ້ເຮັດ ແລະ ມີຂໍ້ມູນ host ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "*Resolving Duplicate Machine IDs*\n"
msgstr "*ການແກ້ໄຂ machine ID ທີ່ຊ້ຳກັນ*\n"

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:12
msgid "_For distributions that support systemd:_"
msgstr "_ສຳລັບການແຈກຈ່າຍ (distributions) ທີ່ຮອງຮັບ systemd:_"

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:13
msgid ""
"If your machines have the same machine ID, as root, delete the files on each "
"duplicated client and re-create it:"
msgstr "ຫາກເຄື່ອງຂອງທ່ານມີ machine ID ດຽວກັນ, ໃນຖານະ root, ໃຫ້ລຶບໄຟລ໌ໃນແຕ່ລະໄຄລເອັນທີ່ຊ້ຳກັນ ແລະ ສ້າງມັນຂຶ້ນໃໝ່:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"rm /etc/machine-id\n"
"rm /var/lib/dbus/machine-id\n"
"rm /var/lib/zypp/AnonymousUniqueId\n"
"dbus-uuidgen --ensure\n"
"systemd-machine-id-setup\n"
msgstr ""
"rm /etc/machine-id\n"
"rm /var/lib/dbus/machine-id\n"
"rm /var/lib/zypp/AnonymousUniqueId\n"
"dbus-uuidgen --ensure\n"
"systemd-machine-id-setup\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:15
msgid ""
"If the cloned machine also has a folder in [path]``/var/log/journal/`` it "
"needs to be renamed accordingly to the new machine ID. If names do not "
"match, [command]``journalctl`` could not retrieve any log and "
"[command]``podman logs`` would not show anything."
msgstr "ຫາກເຄື່ອງທີ່ຄລອນມາມີໂຟນເດີໃນ [path]``/var/log/journal/`` ມັນຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໄດ້ປ່ຽນຊື່ ໃຫ້ກົງກັບ machine ID ໃໝ່. ຫາກຊື່ບໍ່ກົງກັນ, [command]``journalctl`` ຈະບໍ່ສາມາດ ດຶງລັອກໃດໆອອກມາໄດ້ ແລະ [command]``podman logs`` ກໍຈະບໍ່ສະແດງຫຍັງເລີຍ."

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "mv /var/log/journal/* /var/log/journal/$(cat /etc/machine-id)\n"
msgstr "mv /var/log/journal/* /var/log/journal/$(cat /etc/machine-id)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:17
msgid "_For distributions that do not support systemd:_"
msgstr "_ສຳລັບການແຈກຈ່າຍທີ່ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບ systemd:_"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:18
msgid "As root, generate a machine ID from dbus:"
msgstr "ໃນຖານະ root, ໃຫ້ສ້າງ machine ID ຈາກ dbus:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"rm /var/lib/dbus/machine-id\n"
"rm /var/lib/zypp/AnonymousUniqueId\n"
"dbus-uuidgen --ensure\n"
msgstr ""
"rm /var/lib/dbus/machine-id\n"
"rm /var/lib/zypp/AnonymousUniqueId\n"
"dbus-uuidgen --ensure\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:20
msgid ""
"If you are cloning a {rhel} 8.10 server that will later be liberated to "
"{sll}, you must perform extra steps to fix the kernel configuration files."
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານກຳລັງຄລອນເຊີເວີ {rhel} 8.10 ທີ່ຈະຖືກຍ້າຍ (liberated) ໄປຫາ {sll} ໃນພາຍຫຼັງ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງດຳເນີນຂັ້ນຕອນເພີ່ມເຕີມເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ kernel."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:21
msgid ""
"{rhel} uses the machine ID to generate kernel entries in "
"[path]``/boot/loader/entries``.  Not performing these steps will result in a "
"mix of old and new kernel entries after the liberation, as {sll} kernels "
"will create new entries instead of replacing the old ones."
msgstr "{rhel} ໃຊ້ machine ID ເພື່ອສ້າງລາຍການ kernel ໃນ [path]``/boot/loader/entries``. ຫາກບໍ່ດຳເນີນຂັ້ນຕອນເຫຼົ່ານີ້ ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດການປະປົນກັນລະຫວ່າງລາຍການ kernel ເກົ່າ ແລະ ໃໝ່ ຫຼັງຈາກການຍ້າຍ, ເນື່ອງຈາກ kernel ຂອງ {sll} ຈະສ້າງລາຍການໃໝ່ແທນທີ່ຈະປ່ຽນແທນລາຍການເກົ່າ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:22
msgid "After changing the machine ID and before liberating, run:"
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກປ່ຽນ machine ID ແລະ ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະທຳການຍ້າຍ (liberating), ໃຫ້ລັນ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"sudo rm -rf /boot/loader/entries/\n"
"sudo for ver in $(rpm -q kernel --qf '%{VERSION}-%{RELEASE}.%{ARCH}\\n'); do "
"echo \"Reinstalling kernel $ver...\"; sudo kernel-install add $ver "
"/lib/modules/$ver; done\n"
"sudo grub2-mkconfig -o /boot/efi/EFI/redhat/grub.cfg\n"
msgstr ""
"sudo rm -rf /boot/loader/entries/\n"
"sudo for ver in $(rpm -q kernel --qf '%{VERSION}-%{RELEASE}.%{ARCH}\\n'); do echo \"Reinstalling kernel $ver...\"; sudo kernel-install add $ver /lib/modules/$ver; done\n"
"sudo grub2-mkconfig -o /boot/efi/EFI/redhat/grub.cfg\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:24
msgid ""
"For more information and example on liberating {rhel} 8.10 server, see "
"xref:common-workflows:workflow-liberate-rhel-with-secureboot.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ ແລະ ຕົວຢ່າງກ່ຽວກັບການຍ້າຍເຊີເວີ {rhel} 8.10, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:common-workflows:workflow-liberate-rhel-with-secureboot.adoc[]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "*Reconfiguring {salt} Clients*\n"
msgstr "*ການຕັ້ງຄ່າໄຄລເອັນ {salt} ໃໝ່*\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:26
msgid ""
"If your clients still have the same Salt client ID, delete the "
"[path]``minion_id`` file on each client (FQDN is used when it is regenerated "
"on client restart)."
msgstr "ຫາກໄຄລເອັນຂອງທ່ານຍັງມີ Salt client ID ອັນດຽວກັນ, ໃຫ້ລຶບໄຟລ໌ [path]``minion_id`` ໃນແຕ່ລະໄຄລເອັນ (FQDN ຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ເມື່ອມັນຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໃໝ່ຕອນ restart ໄຄລເອັນ)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:27
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:32
msgid "For Salt Minion clients:"
msgstr "ສຳລັບໄຄລເອັນ Salt Minion:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"rm /etc/salt/minion_id\n"
"rm -rf /etc/salt/pki\n"
msgstr ""
"rm /etc/salt/minion_id\n"
"rm -rf /etc/salt/pki\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:29
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:34
msgid "For Salt Bundle clients:"
msgstr "ສຳລັບໄຄລເອັນ Salt Bundle:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:30
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"rm /etc/venv-salt-minion/minion_id\n"
"rm -rf /etc/venv-salt-minion/pki\n"
msgstr ""
"rm /etc/venv-salt-minion/minion_id\n"
"rm -rf /etc/venv-salt-minion/pki\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:31
msgid ""
"Delete accepted keys from the onboarding page and the system profile from "
"{productname}, and restart the client with."
msgstr "ລຶບ keys ທີ່ຖືກຕອບຮັບແລ້ວອອກຈາກໜ້າ onboarding ແລະ ລຶບ system profile ອອກຈາກ {productname}, ຈາກນັ້ນໃຫ້ restart ໄຄລເອັນດ້ວຍ."

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:33
#, no-wrap
msgid "service salt-minion restart\n"
msgstr "service salt-minion restart\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:35
#, no-wrap
msgid "service venv-salt-minion restart\n"
msgstr "service venv-salt-minion restart\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:36
msgid ""
"Re-register the clients.  Each client now has a different "
"[path]``/etc/machine-id`` and should be correctly displayed on the "
"[guimenu]``System Overview`` page."
msgstr "ລົງທະບຽນໄຄລເອັນໃໝ່. ຕອນນີ້ແຕ່ລະໄຄລເອັນຈະມີ [path]``/etc/machine-id`` ທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນ ແລະ ຄວນຈະສະແດງຜົນຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງໃນໜ້າ [guimenu]``System Overview``."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-remote-root-on-micro.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Remote root login on {sl-micro}"
msgstr "ການເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ root ຈາກທາງໄກ (Remote root login) ໃນ {sl-micro}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-remote-root-on-micro.adoc:2
msgid ""
"For enhanced security, new installations of {sl-micro} 6.1 and later do not "
"allow password-based remote root login anymore, which also affects server "
"and proxy container hosts running on {sl-micro} and managed {sl-micro} "
"clients.  Also {sle-micro} 5.5 clients with password-based remote root login "
"which will when be migrated to 6.1/6.2 will suddenly lose this access and "
"must be newly configured.  For more information, see SL Micro Release Notes "
"6.1 "
"(https://www.suse.com/releasenotes/x86_64/SL-Micro/6.1/index.html#jsc-SMO-405)."
msgstr "ເພື່ອຄວາມປອດໄພທີ່ເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນ, ການຕິດຕັ້ງໃໝ່ຂອງ {sl-micro} 6.1 ແລະ ລຸ້ນຕໍ່ໆໄປຈະບໍ່ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເຂົ້າລະບົບ root ທາງໄກດ້ວຍລະຫັດຜ່ານອີກຕໍ່ໄປ, ເຊິ່ງຈະສົ່ງຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ເຊີເວີ ແລະ proxy container hosts ທີ່ລັນໃນ {sl-micro} ລວມທັງເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ {sl-micro} ທີ່ຖືກຈັດການ. ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ ເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ {sle-micro} 5.5 ທີ່ໃຊ້ການເຂົ້າລະບົບ root ທາງໄກດ້ວຍລະຫັດຜ່ານ ເມື່ອຖືກຍ້າຍລະບົບໄປເປັນ 6.1/6.2 ຈະສູນເສຍການເຂົ້າເຖິງນີ້ທັນທີ ແລະ ຕ້ອງໄດ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າໃໝ່. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງ SL Micro Release Notes 6.1."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-remote-root-on-micro.adoc:3
msgid ""
"While deploying components of {productname} such as a {productname} Proxy, "
"by default, password-based remote root login is required.  You can enable "
"password-based remote root login with the following steps."
msgstr "ໃນຂະນະທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງອົງປະກອບຂອງ {productname} ເຊັ່ນ {productname} Proxy, ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວ ຈະຕ້ອງມີການເຂົ້າລະບົບ root ທາງໄກດ້ວຍລະຫັດຜ່ານ. ທ່ານສາມາດເປີດໃຊ້ງານມັນໄດ້ດ້ວຍຂັ້ນຕອນດັ່ງນີ້."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-remote-root-on-micro.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Enable SSH root login with a password on {sl-micro}"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ເປີດໃຊ້ງານການເຂົ້າລະບົບ root ຜ່ານ SSH ດ້ວຍລະຫັດຜ່ານໃນ {sl-micro}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-remote-root-on-micro.adoc:5
msgid "On the container host, start a transactional shell:"
msgstr "ໃນ container host, ໃຫ້ເລີ່ມ transactional shell:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-remote-root-on-micro.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "transactional-update shell\n"
msgstr "transactional-update shell\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-remote-root-on-micro.adoc:7
msgid "In [path]``/usr/etc/ssh/sshd_config`` file, set:"
msgstr "ໃນໄຟລ໌ [path]``/usr/etc/ssh/sshd_config``, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າ:"

#.  FIXME: or better /etc/ssh/sshd_config.d/sshd.conf? (e.g., see server migration
#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-remote-root-on-micro.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "PermitRootLogin yes\n"
msgstr "PermitRootLogin yes\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-remote-root-on-micro.adoc:9
msgid "Leave the shell with [command]``exit`` to save the new configuration."
msgstr "ອອກຈາກ shell ດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``exit`` ເພື່ອບັນທຶກການຕັ້ງຄ່າໃໝ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-remote-root-on-micro.adoc:10
msgid "Reboot the container host to activate the new configuartion:"
msgstr "ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ container host ໃໝ່ເພື່ອໃຫ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າໃໝ່ມີຜົນ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-remote-root-on-micro.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "transactional-update reboot\n"
msgstr "transactional-update reboot\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-remote-root-on-micro.adoc:12
msgid ""
"For more information about [command]``transactional-update``, see "
"https://documentation.suse.com/sle-micro/6.1/html/Micro-transactional-updates/."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ [command]``transactional-update``, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ https://documentation.suse.com/sle-micro/6.1/html/Micro-transactional-updates/."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-rh-cdn-channel-and-multiple-certs.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Red Hat CDN Channel and Multiple Certificates"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາຊ່ອງທາງ Red Hat CDN ແລະ ການມີຫຼາຍ Certificates"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-rh-cdn-channel-and-multiple-certs.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The {redhat} content delivery network (CDN) channels sometimes provide "
"multiple certificates, but the {productname} {webui} can only import a "
"single certificate.  If CDN presents a certificate that is different to the "
"one the {productname} {webui} knows about, validation fails and permission "
"to access the repository is denied, even though the certificate is "
"accurate.  The error message received is:"
msgstr "ຊ່ອງທາງ content delivery network (CDN) ຂອງ {redhat} ບາງຄັ້ງໃຫ້ຫຼາຍ certificates, ແຕ່ {webui} ຂອງ {productname} ສາມາດນຳເຂົ້າໄດ້ພຽງ certificate ດຽວເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ຫາກ CDN ສະແດງ certificate ທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງຈາກອັນທີ່ {webui} ຮູ້ຈັກ, ການກວດສອບຈະລົ້ມເຫຼວ ແລະ ສິດການເຂົ້າເຖິງບ່ອນເກັບຊອບແວຈະຖືກປະຕິເສດ, ເຖິງວ່າ certificate ນັ້ນຈະຖືກຕ້ອງກໍຕາມ. ຂໍ້ຄວາມສະແດງຂໍ້ຜິດພາດທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບແມ່ນ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-rh-cdn-channel-and-multiple-certs.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[error]\n"
"Repository '<repo_name>' is invalid.\n"
"<repo.pem> Valid metadata not found at specified URL\n"
"History:\n"
" - [|] Error trying to read from '<repo.pem>'\n"
" - Permission to access '<repo.pem>' denied.\n"
"Please check if the URIs defined for this repository are pointing to a valid "
"repository.\n"
"Skipping repository '<repo_nam' because of the above error.\n"
"Could not refresh the repositories because of errors.\n"
"HH:MM:SS RepoMDError: Cannot access repository. Maybe repository GPG keys "
"are not imported\n"
msgstr ""
"[error]\n"
"Repository '<repo_name>' is invalid.\n"
"<repo.pem> Valid metadata not found at specified URL\n"
"History:\n"
" - [|] Error trying to read from '<repo.pem>'\n"
" - Permission to access '<repo.pem>' denied.\n"
"Please check if the URIs defined for this repository are pointing to a valid repository.\n"
"Skipping repository '<repo_nam' because of the above error.\n"
"Could not refresh the repositories because of errors.\n"
"HH:MM:SS RepoMDError: Cannot access repository. Maybe repository GPG keys are not imported\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-rh-cdn-channel-and-multiple-certs.adoc:4
msgid ""
"To resolve this issue, merge all valid certificates into a single ``.pem`` "
"file, and rebuild the certificates for use by {productname}:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂບັນຫານີ້, ໃຫ້ລວມ (merge) certificates ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງທັງໝົດເຂົ້າເປັນໄຟລ໌ ``.pem`` ດຽວ, ແລະ ສ້າງ certificates ຄືນໃໝ່ເພື່ອໃຊ້ກັບ {productname}:"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-rh-cdn-channel-and-multiple-certs.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Resolving Multiple {redhat} CDN Certificates"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາການມີຫຼາຍ Red Hat CDN Certificates"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-rh-cdn-channel-and-multiple-certs.adoc:6
msgid ""
"On the {redhat} client, at the command prompt, as root, gather all current "
"certificates from ``/etc/pki/entitlement/`` in a single ``rh-cert.pem`` "
"file:"
msgstr "ໃນໄຄລເອັນ {redhat}, ທີ່ command prompt, ໃນຖານະ root, ໃຫ້ລວບລວມ certificates ທັງໝົດ ຈາກ ``/etc/pki/entitlement/`` ເຂົ້າໃນໄຟລ໌ ``rh-cert.pem`` ພຽງໄຟລ໌ດຽວ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-rh-cdn-channel-and-multiple-certs.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"cat 866705146090697087.pem 3539668047766796506.pem "
"redhat-entitlement-authority.pem > rh-cert.pem\n"
msgstr "cat 866705146090697087.pem 3539668047766796506.pem redhat-entitlement-authority.pem > rh-cert.pem\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-rh-cdn-channel-and-multiple-certs.adoc:8
msgid ""
"Gather all current keys from ``/etc/pki/entitlement/`` in a single "
"``rh-key.pem`` file:"
msgstr "ລວບລວມ keys ທັງໝົດຈາກ ``/etc/pki/entitlement/`` ເຂົ້າໃນໄຟລ໌ ``rh-key.pem`` ພຽງໄຟລ໌ດຽວ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-rh-cdn-channel-and-multiple-certs.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "cat 866705146090697087-key.pem 3539668047766796506-key.pem > rh-key.pem\n"
msgstr "cat 866705146090697087-key.pem 3539668047766796506-key.pem > rh-key.pem\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-rh-cdn-channel-and-multiple-certs.adoc:10
msgid ""
"You can now import the new certificates to the {productname} Server, using "
"the instructions in xref:client-configuration:clients-rh-cdn.adoc[]."
msgstr "ຕອນນີ້ທ່ານສາມາດນຳເຂົ້າ certificates ໃໝ່ໄປຍັງເຊີເວີ {productname} ໂດຍໃຊ້ຄຳແນະນຳໃນ xref:client-configuration:clients-rh-cdn.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-rpctimeout.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting RPC Connection Timeouts"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາການໝົດເວລາການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ RPC (RPC Connection Timeouts)"

#
#
#
#. PUT THIS COMMENT AT THE TOP OF TROUBLESHOOTING SECTIONS
#. Troubleshooting format:
#. One sentence each:
#. Cause: What created the problem?
#. Consequence: What does the user see when this happens?
#. Fix: What can the user do to fix this problem?
#. Result: What happens after the user has completed the fix?
#. If more detailed instructions are required, put them in a "Resolving" procedure:
#. .Procedure: Resolving Widget Wobbles
#. . First step
#. . Another step
#. . Last step
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-rpctimeout.adoc:2
msgid ""
"RPC connections can sometimes time out due to slow networks or a network "
"link going down.  This results in package downloads or batch jobs hanging or "
"taking longer than expected.  You can adjust the maximum time that an RPC "
"connection can take by editing the configuration file.  While this does not "
"resolve networking problems, it does cause a process to fail rather than "
"hang."
msgstr "ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ RPC ບາງຄັ້ງອາດຈະໝົດເວລາເນື່ອງຈາກເຄືອຂ່າຍຊ້າ ຫຼື ສາຍເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ເຄືອຂ່າຍຫຼຸດ. ສິ່ງນີ້ເຮັດໃຫ້ການດາວໂຫຼດແພັກເກັດ ຫຼື ວຽກແບບ batch ຄ້າງ ຫຼື ໃຊ້ເວລາດົນກວ່າທີ່ຄາດໄວ້. ທ່ານສາມາດປັບເວລາສູງສຸດທີ່ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ RPC ຈະໃຊ້ໄດ້ໂດຍການແກ້ໄຂໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ. ເຖິງວ່າສິ່ງນີ້ຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາເຄືອຂ່າຍ, ແຕ່ມັນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ຂະບວນການນັ້ນລົ້ມເຫຼວແທນທີ່ຈະຄ້າງຢູ່."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-rpctimeout.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Resolving RPC connection timeouts"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການແກ້ໄຂການໝົດເວລາການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ RPC"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-rpctimeout.adoc:4
msgid ""
"On the {productname} Server, open the [filename]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`` file "
"and set a maximum timeout value (in seconds):"
msgstr "ໃນເຊີເວີ {productname}, ໃຫ້ເປີດໄຟລ໌ [filename]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`` ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າເວລາໝົດເວລາສູງສຸດ (ເປັນວິນາທີ):"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-rpctimeout.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "server.timeout =`number`\n"
msgstr "server.timeout =`number`\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-rpctimeout.adoc:6
msgid ""
"On the {productname} Proxy, open the [filename]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`` file "
"and set a maximum timeout value (in seconds):"
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} Proxy, ໃຫ້ເປີດໄຟລ໌ [filename]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`` ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າເວລາໝົດສູງສຸດ (ເປັນວິນາທີ):"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-rpctimeout.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "proxy.timeout =`number`\n"
msgstr "proxy.timeout =`number`\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-rpctimeout.adoc:8
msgid ""
"On a {sles} client that uses zypper, open the "
"[filename]``/etc/zypp/zypp.conf`` file and set a maximum timeout value (in "
"seconds):"
msgstr "ໃນໄຄລເອັນ {sles} ທີ່ໃຊ້ zypper, ໃຫ້ເປີດໄຟລ໌ [filename]``/etc/zypp/zypp.conf`` ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າເວລາໝົດເວລາສູງສຸດ (ເປັນວິນາທີ):"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-rpctimeout.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"## Valid values:  [0,3600]\n"
"## Default value: 180\n"
"download.transfer_timeout = 180\n"
msgstr ""
"## Valid values:  [0,3600]\n"
"## Default value: 180\n"
"download.transfer_timeout = 180\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-rpctimeout.adoc:10
msgid ""
"On a {rhel} client that uses yum, open the [filename]``/etc/yum.conf`` file "
"and set a maximum timeout value (in seconds):"
msgstr "ໃນໄຄລເອັນ {rhel} ທີ່ໃຊ້ yum, ໃຫ້ເປີດໄຟລ໌ [filename]``/etc/yum.conf`` ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າເວລາໝົດເວລາສູງສຸດ (ເປັນວິນາທີ):"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-rpctimeout.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "timeout =`number`\n"
msgstr "timeout =`number`\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-rpctimeout.adoc:12
msgid ""
"If you limit RPC timeouts to less than `180` seconds, you risk aborting "
"perfectly normal operations."
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານຈຳກັດເວລາໝົດເວລາ RPC ໃຫ້ໜ້ອຍກວ່າ `180` ວິນາທີ, ທ່ານອາດຈະສ່ຽງຕໍ່ການເຮັດໃຫ້ການດຳເນີນງານທີ່ປົກກະຕິຖືກຍົກເລີກ."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-salt-clients-down-and-dns.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Salt clients shown as down and DNS settings"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາໄຄລເອັນ Salt ທີ່ສະແດງສະຖານະວ່າ down ແລະ ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ DNS"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-salt-clients-down-and-dns.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Even if the Salt client is running, actions such as package refresh or apply "
"states can be marked as failed with the message:"
msgstr "ເຖິງວ່າໄຄລເອັນ Salt ຈະເຮັດວຽກຢູ່, ແຕ່ການດຳເນີນການຕ່າງໆ ເຊັ່ນ ການຣີເຟຣຊແພັກເກັດ ຫຼື ການໃຊ້ states ອາດຈະຖືກໝາຍວ່າລົ້ມເຫຼວດ້ວຍຂໍ້ຄວາມ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-salt-clients-down-and-dns.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Minion is down or could not be contacted.\n"
msgstr "Minion is down or could not be contacted.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-salt-clients-down-and-dns.adoc:4
msgid ""
"In this case try rescheduling the action.  If rescheduling succeeds, the "
"cause of the problem can be a wrong DNS configuration."
msgstr "ໃນກໍລະນີນີ້ ໃຫ້ລອງຕັ້ງກຳນົດການດຳເນີນການໃໝ່. ຫາກການຕັ້ງກຳນົດການໃໝ່ສຳເລັດ, ສາເຫດຂອງບັນຫາອາດມາຈາກການຕັ້ງຄ່າ DNS ທີ່ຜິດພາດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-salt-clients-down-and-dns.adoc:6
msgid ""
"When the Salt client is restarted, or in case the grains are refreshed, the "
"client calculates its FQDN grains, and it is unresponsive until the grains "
"are proceeded.  When a scheduled action on {productname} Server is going to "
"be executed, {productname} Server performs a ``test.ping`` to the client "
"before the actual action to ensure the client is actually running and the "
"action can be triggered."
msgstr "ເມື່ອໄຄລເອັນ Salt ຖືກ restart, ຫຼື ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ມີການຣີເຟຣຊ grains, ໄຄລເອັນຈະຄຳນວນ FQDN grains ຂອງມັນ, ແລະ ມັນຈະບໍ່ຕອບສະໜອງຈົນກວ່າ grains ຈະຖືກປະມວນຜົນສຳເລັດ. ເມື່ອກຳນົດການດຳເນີນການໃນເຊີເວີ {productname} ຈະຖືກລັນ, ເຊີເວີ {productname} ຈະທຳການ ``test.ping`` ໄປຫາໄຄລເອັນກ່ອນການດຳເນີນການຕົວຈິງ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າ ໄຄລເອັນກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ ແລະ ສາມາດເລີ່ມການດຳເນີນການໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-salt-clients-down-and-dns.adoc:7
msgid ""
"By default, {productname} Server waits for 5 seconds to get the response "
"from ``test.ping`` command.  If the response is not received within 5 "
"seconds, then the action is set to fail with the message that the client is "
"down or could not be contacted."
msgstr "ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ເຊີເວີ {productname} ຈະລໍຖ້າ 5 ວິນາທີເພື່ອຮັບການຕອບກັບຈາກຄຳສັ່ງ ``test.ping``. ຫາກບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບການຕອບກັບພາຍໃນ 5 ວິນາທີ, ການດຳເນີນການຈະຖືກກຳນົດໃຫ້ລົ້ມເຫຼວດ້ວຍຂໍ້ຄວາມ ທີ່ລະບຸວ່າໄຄລເອັນ down ຫຼື ບໍ່ສາມາດຕິດຕໍ່ໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-salt-clients-down-and-dns.adoc:8
msgid ""
"To correct this, fix the DNS resolution on the client, so the client does "
"not get stuck for 5 seconds while solving its FQDN."
msgstr "ເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂສິ່ງນີ້, ໃຫ້ແກ້ໄຂ DNS resolution ໃນໄຄລເອັນ, ເພື່ອບໍ່ໃຫ້ໄຄລເອັນຄ້າງເປັນເວລາ 5 ວິນາທີ ໃນຂະນະທີ່ພະຍາຍາມຄົ້ນຫາ FQDN ຂອງມັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-salt-clients-down-and-dns.adoc:9
msgid ""
"If this is not possible, try to increase the value for "
"``java.salt_presence_ping_timeout`` in the ``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`` file on the "
"{productname} Server to a value higher than 4."
msgstr "ຫາກບໍ່ສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້, ໃຫ້ລອງເພີ່ມຄ່າສຳລັບ ``java.salt_presence_ping_timeout`` ໃນໄຟລ໌ ``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`` ຢູ່ໃນເຊີເວີ {productname} ໃຫ້ມີຄ່າສູງກວ່າ 4."

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-salt-clients-down-and-dns.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgrctl term\n"
"vim /etc/rhn/rhn.conf\n"
"java.salt_presence_ping_timeout = 6\n"
msgstr ""
"mgrctl term\n"
"vim /etc/rhn/rhn.conf\n"
"java.salt_presence_ping_timeout = 6\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-salt-clients-down-and-dns.adoc:12
msgid "After that, run:"
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນ, ໃຫ້ລັນ:"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-salt-clients-down-and-dns.adoc:14
msgid ""
"Increasing this value will cause {productname} Server to take longer to "
"check if a minion is unreachable or unresponsive, causing the {productname} "
"Server to be slower or less responsive overall."
msgstr "ການເພີ່ມຄ່ານີ້ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເຊີເວີ {productname} ໃຊ້ເວລາດົນຂຶ້ນໃນການກວດສອບວ່າ minion ບໍ່ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ ຫຼື ບໍ່ຕອບສະໜອງ, ເຊິ່ງຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເຊີເວີ {productname} ຊ້າລົງ ຫຼື ມີການຕອບສະໜອງໜ້ອຍລົງໃນພາບລວມ."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-schema-upgrade-fails.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Schema Upgrade Fails"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາເມື່ອການອັບເກຣດ Schema ລົ້ມເຫຼວ"

#
#
#
#
#
#. PUT THIS COMMENT AT THE TOP OF TROUBLESHOOTING SECTIONS
#. Troubleshooting format:
#. One sentence each:
#. Cause: What created the problem?
#. Consequence: What does the user see when this happens?
#. Fix: What can the user do to fix this problem?
#. Result: What happens after the user has completed the fix?
#. If more detailed instructions are required, put them in a "Resolving" procedure:
#. .Procedure: Resolving Widget Wobbles
#. . First step
#. . Another step
#. . Last step
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-schema-upgrade-fails.adoc:2
msgid ""
"If the schema upgrade fails, the database version check and all the other "
"spacewalk services do not start.  Run [command]``mgradm start`` on the "
"container host for more information and hints how to proceed."
msgstr "ຫາກການອັບເກຣດ schema ລົ້ມເຫຼວ, ການກວດສອບເວີຊັນຖານຂໍ້ມູນ ແລະ ບໍລິການອື່ນໆທັງໝົດ ຈະບໍ່ເລີ່ມເຮັດວຽກ. ໃຫ້ລັນ [command]``mgradm start`` ໃນ container host ເພື່ອເບິ່ງຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ ແລະ ຄຳແນະນຳກ່ຽວກັບວິທີການດຳເນີນການຕໍ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-schema-upgrade-fails.adoc:4
msgid "You can also run the version check directly in the container:"
msgstr "ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດລັນການກວດສອບເວີຊັນໄດ້ໂດຍກົງໃນຄອນເທນເນີ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-schema-upgrade-fails.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "systemctl status uyuni-check-database.service\n"
msgstr "systemctl status uyuni-check-database.service\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-schema-upgrade-fails.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "journalctl -u uyuni-check-database.service\n"
msgstr "journalctl -u uyuni-check-database.service\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-schema-upgrade-fails.adoc:8
msgid ""
"These commands print debug information if you do not want to run the more "
"general [command]``mgradm`` command."
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະສະແດງຂໍ້ມູນ debug ຫາກທ່ານບໍ່ຕ້ອງການລັນຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``mgradm`` ທີ່ມີລັກສະນະທົ່ວໄປກວ່າ."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Synchronization"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາການຊິງໂຄຣໄນ (Synchronization)"

#
#
#
#. PUT THIS COMMENT AT THE TOP OF TROUBLESHOOTING SECTIONS
#. Troubleshooting format:
#. One sentence each:
#. Cause: What created the problem?
#. Consequence: What does the user see when this happens?
#. Fix: What can the user do to fix this problem?
#. Result: What happens after the user has completed the fix?
#. If more detailed instructions are required, put them in a "Resolving" procedure:
#. .Procedure: Resolving Widget Wobbles
#. . First step
#. . Another step
#. . Last step
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Synchronization can fail for a number of reasons.  To get more information "
"about a connection problem, run this command:"
msgstr "ການຊິງໂຄຣໄນສາມາດລົ້ມເຫຼວໄດ້ດ້ວຍຫຼາຍສາເຫດ. ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບບັນຫາການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່, ໃຫ້ລັນຄຳສັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"export URLGRABBER_DEBUG=DEBUG\n"
"spacewalk-repo-sync -c <channelname> <options> > "
"/var/log/spacewalk-repo-sync-$(date +%F-%R).log 2>&1\n"
msgstr ""
"export URLGRABBER_DEBUG=DEBUG\n"
"spacewalk-repo-sync -c <channelname> <options> > /var/log/spacewalk-repo-sync-$(date +%F-%R).log 2>&1\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:4
msgid "You can also check logs created by Zypper at [path]``/var/log/zypper.log``"
msgstr "ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດກວດສອບລັອກທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍ Zypper ໄດ້ທີ່ [path]``/var/log/zypper.log``"

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "GPG Key Mismatch"
msgstr "GPG Key ບໍ່ກົງກັນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:6
msgid ""
"{productname} does not automatically trust third party GPG keys.  If package "
"synchronization fails, it could be because of an untrusted GPG key.  You can "
"find out if this is the case by opening [path]``/var/log/rhn/reposync`` and "
"looking for an error like this:"
msgstr "{productname} ຈະບໍ່ເຊື່ອຖື GPG keys ຂອງພາກສ່ວນທີສາມໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ຫາກການຊິງໂຄຣໄນແພັກເກັດ ລົ້ມເຫຼວ, ມັນອາດຈະເປັນຍ້ອນ GPG key ທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບຄວາມເຊື່ອຖື. ທ່ານສາມາດກວດສອບວ່າມັນເປັນກໍລະນີນີ້ນຫຼືບໍ່ ໂດຍການເປີດ [path]``/var/log/rhn/reposync`` ແລະ ຊອກຫາຂໍ້ຜິດພາດໃນລັກສະນະນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"['/usr/bin/spacewalk-repo-sync', '--channel', 'sle-12-sp1-ga-desktop-\n"
"nvidia-driver-x86_64', '--type', 'yum', '--non-interactive']\n"
"RepoMDError: Cannot access repository. Maybe repository GPG keys are not "
"imported\n"
msgstr ""
"['/usr/bin/spacewalk-repo-sync', '--channel', 'sle-12-sp1-ga-desktop-\n"
"nvidia-driver-x86_64', '--type', 'yum', '--non-interactive']\n"
"RepoMDError: Cannot access repository. Maybe repository GPG keys are not imported\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:8
msgid ""
"To resolve the problem, you need to import the GPG key to {productname}.  "
"For more on importing GPG keys, see "
"xref:administration:repo-metadata.adoc[]."
msgstr "ເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາ, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງນຳເຂົ້າ GPG key ໄປຍັງ {productname}. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການນຳເຂົ້າ GPG keys, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:administration:repo-metadata.adoc[]."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "GPG Key Removal from [literal]``spacewalk-repo-sync``"
msgstr "ການລຶບ GPG Key ອອກຈາກ [literal]``spacewalk-repo-sync``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:10
msgid ""
"When a GPG key for repository has been manually imported using "
"[literal]``spacewalk-repo-sync``, and this key is no longer needed (for "
"example if the key was compromised, or was used for testing purposes only), "
"it can be removed from the zypper RPM database used by "
"[literal]``spacewalk-repo-sync`` with the following command:"
msgstr "ເມື່ອ GPG key ສຳລັບຄັງເກັບຊອບແວຖືກນຳເຂົ້າດ້ວຍຕົນເອງໂດຍໃຊ້ [literal]``spacewalk-repo-sync``, ແລະ ຄີນັ້ນບໍ່ຈຳເປັນອີກຕໍ່ໄປ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: ຖ້າຄີຖືກເຈາະຂໍ້ມູນ, ຫຼື ຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອຈຸດປະສົງໃນການທົດສອບເທົ່ານັ້ນ), ມັນສາມາດຖືກລຶບອອກຈາກຖານຂໍ້ມູນ zypper RPM ທີ່ໃຊ້ໂດຍ [literal]``spacewalk-repo-sync`` ດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "rpm --dbpath=/var/lib/spacewalk/reposync/root/var/lib/rpm/ -e gpg-pubkey-*\n"
msgstr "rpm --dbpath=/var/lib/spacewalk/reposync/root/var/lib/rpm/ -e gpg-pubkey-*\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:12
msgid "where [literal]``gpg-pubkey-*`` is the name of the GPG key to be removed."
msgstr "ໂດຍທີ່ [literal]``gpg-pubkey-*`` ແມ່ນຊື່ຂອງ GPG key ທີ່ຈະຖືກລຶບອອກ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "Renewing GPG Key"
msgstr "ການຕໍ່ອາຍຸ GPG Key"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:14
msgid ""
"If you want to renew a GPG key, first remove the old key, and then generate "
"and import a new one."
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງການຕໍ່ອາຍຸ GPG key, ໃຫ້ລຶບ key ເກົ່າອອກກ່ອນ, ຈາກນັ້ນຈຶ່ງສ້າງ ແລະ ນຳເຂົ້າ key ໃໝ່."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "Checksum Mismatch"
msgstr "Checksum ບໍ່ກົງກັນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:16
msgid ""
"If a checksum has failed, you might see an error like this in the "
"[path]``/var/log/rhn/reposync/*.log`` log file:"
msgstr "ຫາກ checksum ລົ້ມເຫຼວ, ທ່ານອາດຈະເຫັນຂໍ້ຜິດພາດແບບນີ້ໃນໄຟລ໌ລັອກ [path]``/var/log/rhn/reposync/*.log``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Repo Sync Errors: (50, u'checksums did not match\n"
"326a904c2fbd7a0e20033c87fc84ebba6b24d937 vs\n"
"afd8c60d7908b2b0e2d95ad0b333920aea9892eb', 'Invalid information uploaded\n"
"to the server')\n"
"The package microcode_ctl-1.17-102.57.62.1.x86_64 which is referenced by\n"
"patch microcode_ctl-8413 was not found in the database. This patch has\n"
"been skipped.\n"
msgstr ""
"Repo Sync Errors: (50, u'checksums did not match\n"
"326a904c2fbd7a0e20033c87fc84ebba6b24d937 vs\n"
"afd8c60d7908b2b0e2d95ad0b333920aea9892eb', 'Invalid information uploaded\n"
"to the server')\n"
"The package microcode_ctl-1.17-102.57.62.1.x86_64 which is referenced by\n"
"patch microcode_ctl-8413 was not found in the database. This patch has\n"
"been skipped.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:18
msgid ""
"You can resolve this error by running the synchronization from the command "
"prompt with the [command]``-Y`` option:"
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດແກ້ໄຂຂໍ້ຜິດພາດນີ້ໄດ້ໂດຍການລັນການຊິງໂຄຣໄນຈາກ command prompt ດ້ວຍຕົວເລືອກ [command]``-Y``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "spacewalk-repo-sync --channel <channelname> -Y\n"
msgstr "spacewalk-repo-sync --channel <channelname> -Y\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:20
msgid ""
"This option verifies the repository data before the synchronization, rather "
"than relying on locally cached checksums."
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ຈະກວດສອບຂໍ້ມູນບ່ອນເກັບຊອບແວກ່ອນການຊິງໂຄຣໄນ, ແທນທີ່ຈະອີງໃສ່ checksums ທີ່ຖືກ cache ໄວ້ພາຍໃນເຄື່ອງ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "Connection Timeout"
msgstr "ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໝົດເວລາ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:22
msgid "If the download times out with the following error:"
msgstr "ຫາກການດາວໂຫຼດໝົດເວລາດ້ວຍຂໍ້ຜິດພາດຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"28, 'Operation too slow. Less than 1000 bytes/sec transferred the last 300 "
"seconds\n"
msgstr "28, 'Operation too slow. Less than 1000 bytes/sec transferred the last 300 seconds\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:24
msgid ""
"You can resolve this error by specifying [literal]``reposync_timeout`` and "
"[literal]``reposync_minrate`` configuration values in "
"[path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``.  By default, when less than 1000 bytes per "
"second are transferred in 300 secs, the download is aborted.  You can adjust "
"the number of bytes per second with [literal]``reposync_minrate``, and the "
"number of seconds to wait with [literal]``reposync_timeout``."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດແກ້ໄຂຂໍ້ຜິດພາດນີ້ໄດ້ໂດຍການລະບຸຄ່າການຕັ້ງຄ່າ [literal]``reposync_timeout`` ແລະ [literal]``reposync_minrate`` ໃນ [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``. ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ເມື່ອມີການໂອນຍ້າຍຂໍ້ມູນໜ້ອຍກວ່າ 1000 bytes ຕໍ່ວິນາທີ ເປັນເວລາ 300 ວິນາທີ, ການດາວໂຫຼດຈະຖືກຍົກເລີກ. ທ່ານສາມາດປັບຈຳນວນ bytes ຕໍ່ວິນາທີໄດ້ດ້ວຍ [literal]``reposync_minrate``, ແລະ ປັບຈຳນວນວິນາທີທີ່ຕ້ອງການລໍຖ້າໄດ້ດ້ວຍ [literal]``reposync_timeout``."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "Manually Trusting the Key During reposync"
msgstr "ການໃຫ້ຄວາມເຊື່ອຖື key ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງໃນລະຫວ່າງການ reposync"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:26
msgid ""
"It is possible that in some cases when [command]``reposync`` is run, you may "
"need to accept the GPG key manually.  For example:"
msgstr "ມັນເປັນໄປໄດ້ວ່າໃນບາງກໍລະນີເມື່ອລັນ [command]``reposync``, ທ່ານອາດຈະຕ້ອງຍອມຮັບ GPG key ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ. ຕົວຢ່າງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:27
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# spacewalk-repo-sync -c nvidia-compute-sle-15-x86_64-we-sp3\n"
"17:07:40 ======================================\n"
"17:07:40 | Channel: nvidia-compute-sle-15-x86_64-we-sp3\n"
"17:07:40 ======================================\n"
"17:07:40 Sync of channel started.\n"
"New repository or package signing key received:\n"
"  Repository:       nvidia-compute-sle-15-x86_64-we-sp3\n"
"  Key Fingerprint:  610C 7B14 E068 A878 070D A4E9 9CD0 A493 D42D 0685\n"
"  Key Name:         cudatools <cudatools@nvidia.com>\n"
