#: modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:69
msgid ""
"Translations in {uyuni} are provided by the community, and could be "
"incorrect or incomplete.  Where a translation is not available, the {webui} "
"defaults to English (``en_US``)."
msgstr "ການແປໃນ {uyuni} ແມ່ນໄດ້ຮັບການສະໜັບສະໜູນໂດຍຊຸມຊົນ, ແລະ ອາດຈະມີ ຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ ຫຼື ບໍ່ຄົບຖ້ວນ. ໃນບ່ອນທີ່ບໍ່ມີການແປ, {webui} ຈະກັບໄປ ໃຊ້ພາສາອັງກິດ (``en_US``) ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:70
#, no-wrap
msgid "User Default Interface Theme"
msgstr "ຮູບແບບໜ້າຈໍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້ (Theme)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:71
msgid ""
"By default, the {productname} {webui} uses the theme appropriate to the "
"product you have installed.  You can change the theme to reflect the {uyuni} "
"or {susemgr} colors.  The {susemgr} theme also has a dark option available."
msgstr "ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, {webui} ຂອງ {productname} ຈະໃຊ້ຮູບແບບ (theme) ທີ່ເໝາະສົມກັບ ຜະລິດຕະພັນທີ່ທ່ານໄດ້ຕິດຕັ້ງ. ທ່ານສາມາດປ່ຽນຮູບແບບເພື່ອໃຫ້ສະທ້ອນເຖິງສີຂອງ {uyuni} ຫຼື {susemgr}. ຮູບແບບຂອງ {susemgr} ຍັງມີຕົວເລືອກແບບມືດ (dark option) ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ງານນຳ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:72
msgid ""
"You can change the default theme in the ``rhn.conf`` configuration file.  To "
"change the default theme, open the [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`` file and add "
"or edit this line:"
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດປ່ຽນຮູບແບບເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໄດ້ໃນໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ ``rhn.conf``. ເພື່ອປ່ຽນຮູບແບບ ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ໃຫ້ເປີດໄຟລ໌ [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`` ແລະ ເພີ່ມ ຫຼື ແກ້ໄຂແຖວນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:73
#, no-wrap
msgid "web.theme_default = <THEME>\n"
msgstr "web.theme_default = <THEME>\n"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:74
#, no-wrap
msgid "Available WebUI Themes"
msgstr "ຮູບແບບ WebUI ທີ່ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້"

#. type: Table
#: modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:75
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Theme Name            | Colors    | Style\n"
"| ``susemanager-light`` | {susemgr} | Light\n"
"| ``susemanager-dark``  | {susemgr} | Dark\n"
"| ``uyuni``             | {uyuni}   | Light\n"
msgstr ""
"| ຊື່ຮູບແບບ | ສີສັນ | ສະໄຕລ໌\n"
"| ``susemanager-light`` | {susemgr} | ແບບແຈ້ງ\n"
"| ``susemanager-dark`` | {susemgr} | ແບບມືດ\n"
"| ``uyuni`` | {uyuni} | ແບບແຈ້ງ\n"

