#. type: Title ====
#: modules/administration/partials/image-mgmt-container-inspection.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Image Inspection"
msgstr "ການກວດສອບ Image"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/partials/image-mgmt-container-inspection.adoc:2
msgid ""
"A base container image (BCI) comes with all the software to run it, but "
"because BCIs are lightweight they may not come with all tools and libraries "
"you may need for inspection."
msgstr "base container image (BCI) ມາພ້ອມກັບຊອບແວທັງໝົດທີ່ຈຳເປັນໃນການລັນ, ແຕ່ເນື່ອງຈາກ BCIs ມີນ້ຳໜັກເບົາ ພວກມັນຈຶ່ງອາດຈະບໍ່ມີເຄື່ອງມື ແລະ ໄລບຣາຣີ (libraries) ທັງໝົດທີ່ທ່ານອາດຈະຕ້ອງການສຳລັບການກວດສອບ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/partials/image-mgmt-container-inspection.adoc:3
msgid "When inspecting a container image you can see an error message such as:"
msgstr "ເມື່ອກວດສອບ container image ທ່ານອາດຈະເຫັນຂໍ້ຄວາມສະແດງຂໍ້ຜິດພາດເຊັ່ນ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/partials/image-mgmt-container-inspection.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "libssl.so.1.1: cannot open shared object file: No such file or directory\n"
msgstr "libssl.so.1.1: cannot open shared object file: No such file or directory\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/partials/image-mgmt-container-inspection.adoc:5
msgid ""
"A BCI can be used in the other scenarios than with the container build host "
"and using the {salt} bundle for the inspection, but if you need inspection "
"to work you must add all needed software in advance."
msgstr "BCI ສາມາດຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໃນສະຖານະການອື່ນໆນອກເໜືອຈາກການໃຊ້ກັບ container build host ແລະ ການໃຊ້ {salt} bundle ສຳລັບການກວດສອບ, ແຕ່ຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ການກວດສອບ ເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ ທ່ານຕ້ອງເພີ່ມຊອບແວທີ່ຈຳເປັນທັງໝົດໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/partials/image-mgmt-container-inspection.adoc:6
msgid ""
"To avoid such issues you must add [systemitem]``libopenssl`` to the image "
"with [systemitem]``Dockerfile`` and rebuild the image."
msgstr "ເພື່ອຫຼີກເວັ້ນບັນຫາດັ່ງກ່າວ ທ່ານຕ້ອງເພີ່ມ [systemitem]``libopenssl`` ເຂົ້າໃນ image ດ້ວຍ [systemitem]``Dockerfile`` ແລະ ສ້າງ (rebuild) image ຄືນໃໝ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/partials/image-mgmt-container-inspection.adoc:7
msgid "The same can happen with [systemitem]``libexpat``."
msgstr "ສິ່ງດຽວກັນນີ້ກໍສາມາດເກີດຂຶ້ນກັບ [systemitem]``libexpat`` ໄດ້ຄືກັນ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/partials/install_scap_security_guide_package.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install the SCAP security guide package"
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກັດຄູ່ມືຄວາມປອດໄພ SCAP (SCAP security guide package)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/partials/install_scap_security_guide_package.adoc:2
msgid ""
"For executing remediations you need to install the SCAP security guide "
"package on the Ansible control node."
msgstr "ເພື່ອດຳເນີນການແກ້ໄຂ (remediations) ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກັດຄູ່ມືຄວາມປອດໄພ SCAP ໃນ Ansible control node."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/partials/install_scap_security_guide_package.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Installing the SCAP security guide package"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກັດຄູ່ມືຄວາມປອດໄພ SCAP"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/partials/install_scap_security_guide_package.adoc:4
msgid ""
"From menu:Systems[Overview], select the client.  Then click "
"menu:Software[Packages > Install]."
msgstr "ຈາກເມນູ: Systems [Overview], ເລືອກໄຄລເອັນ. ຈາກນັ້ນຄລິກ menu: Software [Packages > Install]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/partials/install_scap_security_guide_package.adoc:5
